            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 反诉独立性的体现" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原告起诉被告，被告反诉原告，诉讼中原告撤回本诉 → 本诉消灭，反诉继续审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E6%B6%88%E7%81%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="反诉不因本诉的消灭而消灭" _mubu_note="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%9B%A0%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%88%E7%81%AD%E8%80%8C%E6%B6%88%E7%81%AD%3C/span%3E"/>
            <outline text="当事人不到庭：原告经传票传唤无正当理由拒不到庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%BB%8F%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="本诉中：原告是原告 → 按撤诉处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%98%AF%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%8C%89%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="反诉中：原告是被告 → 缺席判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%98%AF%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%20%E2%86%92%20%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、诉的合并与分离" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%86%E7%A6%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="诉的合并" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：将两个或两个以上的诉合并到同一诉讼程序中审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%88%96%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="分类：主体合并和客体合并" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A2%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="1. 诉的主体合并" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="定义：将多个当事人合并到同一诉讼中审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="判断标准：只要原告或被告其中一方为两人以上，即构成诉的主体合并" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22underline%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22underline%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%A4%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="举例：共同诉讼、代表人诉讼、第三人参加诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BE%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 诉的客体合并" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A2%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="定义：将多个诉讼标的（实体法律关系）合并到同一诉讼程序中审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22underline%22%3E%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%20underline%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="分类：根据被合并的法律关系之间的牵连关系不同，分为三类：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E8%A2%AB%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B5%E8%BF%9E%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="1）单纯合并" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1%EF%BC%89%E5%8D%95%E7%BA%AF%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="被合并的多个法律关系之间没有任何牵连关系，完全是独立的诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E7%89%B5%E8%BF%9E%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E6%98%AF%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="特点：为提高诉讼效率合并审理，但必须分别审理、分别判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BA%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22underline%22%3E%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22underline%22%3E%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="【案例】张三起诉李四" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="同时提出三个诉讼请求，基于三个不同的法律关系：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="要求支付房屋租金1万（租赁合同关系）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E7%A7%9F%E9%87%911%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%88%E7%A7%9F%E8%B5%81%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="要求归还借款2万（借款合同关系）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE2%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%88%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="要求赔偿被狗咬伤的医疗费8000元（侵权法律关系）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E8%A2%AB%E7%8B%97%E5%92%AC%E4%BC%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E8%B4%B98000%E5%85%83%EF%BC%88%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2）预备合并" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2%EF%BC%89%E9%A2%84%E5%A4%87%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="核心：主打“备”字，备而不用，以备不时之需" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BB%E6%89%93%E2%80%9C%E5%A4%87%E2%80%9D%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%87%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E5%A4%87%E4%B8%8D%E6%97%B6%E4%B9%8B%E9%9C%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="定义：原告提出两个诉讼请求（主请求 + 预备请求）法院必须先审主请求，预备请求是否审理取决于主请求的审理结果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%BB%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%20+%20%E9%A2%84%E5%A4%87%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%85%88%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%BB%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A2%84%E5%A4%87%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%96%E5%86%B3%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%20underline%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="两种类型" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="类型一：预备请求的审理以主请求得到支持为前提" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E9%A2%84%E5%A4%87%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="比如，在离婚诉讼中" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%AF%94%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="① 主请求：解除婚姻关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%91%A0%20%E4%B8%BB%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="② 预备请求：分割夫妻共同财产" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%91%A1%20%E9%A2%84%E5%A4%87%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E5%A4%AB%E5%A6%BB%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="审理逻辑：判决离婚→审理分割财产；判决不准离婚→不审理分割财产" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E2%86%92%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%9B%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%86%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E2%86%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="类型二：预备请求的审理以主请求得不到支持为前提" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E9%A2%84%E5%A4%87%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%BE%97%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="【案例1】投资入股纠纷" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B1%E3%80%91%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E5%85%A5%E8%82%A1%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                    <outline text="主请求：确认对甲公司享有20%的股权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BB%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%8920%25%E7%9A%84%E8%82%A1%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                    <outline text="预备请求：如果不支持确认股权，请求返还100万投资款" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%A2%84%E5%A4%87%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%82%A1%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98100%E4%B8%87%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  </outline>
                  <outline text="【案例2】公司增资纠纷" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B2%E3%80%91%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%A2%9E%E8%B5%84%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                    <outline text="主请求：撤销公司增资决议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BB%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%A2%9E%E8%B5%84%E5%86%B3%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                    <outline text="预备请求：如果不支持撤销决议，请求确认对增资部分享有20%的优先认购权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%A2%84%E5%A4%87%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%86%B3%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%AF%B9%E5%A2%9E%E8%B5%84%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%8920%25%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%E8%AE%A4%E8%B4%AD%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  </outline>
                </outline>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3）重叠合并（选择合并）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3%EF%BC%89%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%EF%BC%88%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="定义：原告只想实现一个法律效果，但可以基于若干不同的法律关系实现该效果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%AA%E6%83%B3%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22underline%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%8B%A5%E5%B9%B2%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E8%AF%A5%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="特点：多个法律关系产生同一个法律效果，法院可择一 / 全部审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22underline%22%3E%E6%8B%A9%E4%B8%80%20/%20%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="【案例1】房屋返还纠纷" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B1%E3%80%91%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="张三起诉李四要求返还房屋，可基于：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="租赁合同关系（租赁期限届满）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A7%9F%E8%B5%81%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E7%A7%9F%E8%B5%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="or 所有权法律关系（所有权人有权要求返还原物）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3Eor%20%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E5%8E%9F%E7%89%A9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="【案例2】工程款追索纠纷" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B2%E3%80%91%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E6%AC%BE%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="甲公司起诉乙公司要求支付500万工程款，可基于：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98500%E4%B8%87%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="票据追索权（汇票被拒绝承兑）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%88%E6%B1%87%E7%A5%A8%E8%A2%AB%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E6%89%BF%E5%85%91%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="or 建设工程施工合同关系（付款义务未履行）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3Eor%20%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%BE%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E6%96%BD%E5%B7%A5%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%98%E6%AC%BE%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%9C%AA%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="诉的分离" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E7%A6%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：将原本合并审理的几个诉拆开，分别审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%AC%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E5%87%A0%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%89%E6%8B%86%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="适用情形：合并审理导致案件过于复杂，反而降低诉讼效率" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%BF%87%E4%BA%8E%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8D%E8%80%8C%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="效力：分离之前已经进行的诉讼行为，在分离之后依然有效，无需重新进行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%86%E7%A6%BB%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%8D%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E5%88%86%E7%A6%BB%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E4%BE%9D%E7%84%B6%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22underline%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="考点复盘" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E5%A4%8D%E7%9B%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 诉讼标的是争议的实体法律关系，与诉讼请求严格区分" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%A5%E6%A0%BC%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="2. 诉的分类只看原告诉讼请求：确认法律关系→确认之诉；要求履行义务→给付之诉；要求变更/消灭既存法律关系→形成之诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E5%8F%AA%E7%9C%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E2%86%92%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9B%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E2%86%92%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9B%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4/%E6%B6%88%E7%81%AD%E6%97%A2%E5%AD%98%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E2%86%92%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="3. 反诉是独立的诉，用“去掉原告起诉能否单独起诉”区分反诉与反驳" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E2%80%9C%E5%8E%BB%E6%8E%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%83%BD%E5%90%A6%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E2%80%9D%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="4. 诉的客体合并分三类：无牵连→单纯合并；有先后顺序→预备合并；同一效果多个依据→重叠合并" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A2%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%86%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E7%89%B5%E8%BF%9E%E2%86%92%E5%8D%95%E7%BA%AF%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E5%85%88%E5%90%8E%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%E2%86%92%E9%A2%84%E5%A4%87%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%E2%86%92%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题03 民事诉讼的基本原则与基本制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9803%20%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="考试定位：常以选择题形式考查，重点考查原则的适用情形与违反判断" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%9A%E5%B8%B8%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E9%A2%98%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E8%80%83%E6%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E8%80%83%E6%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%8E%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      <outline text="基本原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="逻辑记忆框架" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="按不同维度分类，避免死记硬背" _mubu_note="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8C%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E7%BB%B4%E5%BA%A6%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E6%AD%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%A1%AC%E8%83%8C%3C/span%3E">
          <outline text="1. 原被告关系角度：平等原则、辩论原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E8%A7%92%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%9A%E5%B9%B3%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E3%80%81%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 私权利主体角度：处分原则、诚信原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%A7%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E8%A7%92%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E3%80%81%E8%AF%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 法院公权力角度：检察监督原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%85%AC%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%E8%A7%92%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%9A%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 国际视野角度：同等原则、对等原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E8%A7%86%E9%87%8E%E8%A7%92%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E3%80%81%E5%AF%B9%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="5. 与时俱进角度：在线诉讼与线下诉讼具有同等效力原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E4%B8%8E%E6%97%B6%E4%BF%B1%E8%BF%9B%E8%A7%92%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="一、平等原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E5%B9%B3%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：民事诉讼中当事人的诉讼权利义务平等" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%B9%B3%E7%AD%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="⚠️ 注意：平等 ≠ 权利义务完全相同" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9A%A0%EF%B8%8F%20%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B9%B3%E7%AD%89%20%E2%89%A0%20%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="平等包括权利相同和权利相对应两个方面" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B9%B3%E7%AD%89%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%96%B9%E9%9D%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="1. 权利相同的情形：原被告均有权委托诉讼代理人、申请回避、提起上诉、举证质证、申请再审等" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%9D%87%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22underline%22%3E%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E3%80%81%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 权利相对应的情形" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原告享有起诉权 ↔ 被告享有答辩权、反诉权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%20%E2%86%94%20%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E6%9D%83%E3%80%81%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="原告享有选择管辖法院权 ↔ 被告享有管辖权异议权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9D%83%20%E2%86%94%20%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="辅助理解：平等原则是民事诉讼最基础的原则，直接源于民事主体地位平等的民法基本原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E5%B9%B3%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E6%98%AF%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9C%80%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%8E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%E5%B9%B3%E7%AD%89%E7%9A%84%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、同等原则与对等原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8E%E5%AF%B9%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="适用范围：仅适用于外国人、无国籍人、外国企业和组织（中国当事人绝对不适用）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E6%97%A0%E5%9B%BD%E7%B1%8D%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%92%8C%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="同等原则：外国人在中国进行民事诉讼，享有与中国当事人完全相同的诉讼权利，承担完全相同的诉讼义务（一视同仁，国民待遇）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%86%E5%90%8C%E4%BB%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%BD%E6%B0%91%E5%BE%85%E9%81%87%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="对等原则：外国法院对我国当事人的诉讼权利加以限制的，我国法院对该国当事人的诉讼权利实行同等限制（以其人之道还治其人之身，报复性限制）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E5%8A%A0%E4%BB%A5%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%A5%E5%9B%BD%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%9E%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%A5%E5%85%B6%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%81%93%E8%BF%98%E6%B2%BB%E5%85%B6%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E8%BA%AB%EF%BC%8C%E6%8A%A5%E5%A4%8D%E6%80%A7%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="✅ 考试秒杀技巧：题目中没有出现外国人名字（如汤姆、杰克、史密斯），绝对不选同等原则或对等原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7%EF%BC%9A%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E4%B8%AD%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8D%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%B1%A4%E5%A7%86%E3%80%81%E6%9D%B0%E5%85%8B%E3%80%81%E5%8F%B2%E5%AF%86%E6%96%AF%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%89%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E6%88%96%E5%AF%B9%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、处分原则 #必考" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22tag%22%3E#%E5%BF%85%E8%80%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：当事人有权在法律规定的范围内，自由处分自己的实体权利和程序权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%86%85%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="制度基础：民事诉讼解决的是私权利纠纷，应当充分尊重私权利主体的意思自治" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E7%A7%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%85%85%E5%88%86%E5%B0%8A%E9%87%8D%E7%A7%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E8%87%AA%E6%B2%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="处分权的范围：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 实体权利的处分：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="例：左宁欠我10万元，我起诉时只主张本金10万，主动放弃5000元利息" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E6%AC%A0%E6%88%9110%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E5%8F%AA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%9110%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%835000%E5%85%83%E5%88%A9%E6%81%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="例：诉讼中与对方达成和解协议，自愿放弃部分诉讼请求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 程序权利的处分：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="例：一审判决后，我服判不上诉，处分了自己的上诉权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E6%9C%8D%E5%88%A4%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E4%BA%86%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="例：不委托诉讼代理人，自行参加诉讼，处分了委托代理人的权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E4%BA%86%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="⚠️ 必考违反情形：法院的判决、裁定超出原告的诉讼请求范围，直接违反处分原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9A%A0%EF%B8%8F%20%E5%BF%85%E8%80%83%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%B6%85%E5%87%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="典型案例1：张三起诉李四要求归还借款本金10万元，法院判决李四归还本金10万+利息5000元（原告未主张利息，法院擅自判决，违反处分原则）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B1%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%9110%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%9110%E4%B8%87+%E5%88%A9%E6%81%AF5000%E5%85%83%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%AA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%88%A9%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%93%85%E8%87%AA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="典型案例2：张三起诉李四要求赔偿精神损害抚慰金5万元，法院认为当地经济水平较高，5万不足以弥补损失，判决赔偿8万元（原告只主张5万，法院多判3万，违反处分原则）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B2%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E6%8A%9A%E6%85%B0%E9%87%915%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%B0%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E%E6%B0%B4%E5%B9%B3%E8%BE%83%E9%AB%98%EF%BC%8C5%E4%B8%87%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%E4%BB%A5%E5%BC%A5%E8%A1%A5%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF8%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%AA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A05%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%A4%9A%E5%88%A43%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="法理基础：原告未提出的诉讼请求，视为其已经行使处分权予以放弃，法院不得主动干预和追加" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%AA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B6%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E5%B9%B2%E9%A2%84%E5%92%8C%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="四、辩论原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：人民法院审理民事案件时，当事人有权就案件事实和法律适用问题进行辩论" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E5%B0%B1%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%92%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="核心要点：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A6%81%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. ⚠️ 辩论主体：只有当事人享有辩论权，证人、鉴定人、勘验人、诉讼代理人等其他诉讼参与人没有辩论权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E2%9A%A0%EF%B8%8F%20%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%89%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="易错判断：证人出庭陈述证言并接受当事人询问，体现了辩论原则（❌，证人不是辩论主体，只是协助查明事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%E5%B9%B6%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%E4%BA%86%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E2%9D%8C%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E6%9F%A5%E6%98%8E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 辩论阶段：贯穿于整个诉讼程序的始终，不仅限于法庭辩论阶段（法庭调查中的举证、质证、陈述意见都是辩论的具体体现）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%9A%E8%B4%AF%E7%A9%BF%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%A7%8B%E7%BB%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%85%E9%99%90%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. ⚠️ 适用范围：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E2%9A%A0%EF%B8%8F%20%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="可以辩论：诉讼程序（一审普通程序、简易程序、二审程序、再审程序）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="不能辩论：非讼程序（特别程序、督促程序、公示催告程序）、执行程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="辅助理解：只有解决民事权利义务纠纷的诉讼程序才有争议，才有辩论的必要；非讼程序和执行程序不解决纠纷，没有辩论空间" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%89%8D%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E6%9C%89%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%EF%BC%9B%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%92%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="违反辩论原则的情形：法院非法剥夺当事人的辩论权，如禁止当事人陈述意见、禁止当事人质证、未经当事人辩论直接作出裁判等" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E5%89%A5%E5%A4%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E3%80%81%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%AD%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="五、诚信原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E8%AF%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：所有参与民事诉讼的主体都应当遵循诚实信用原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E9%83%BD%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E9%81%B5%E5%BE%AA%E8%AF%9A%E5%AE%9E%E4%BF%A1%E7%94%A8%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="制度定位：是对处分原则的必要约束（与民法体系形成对应）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="民法体系：自愿原则（核心） ↔ 公序良俗原则、诚信原则（约束）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%EF%BC%89%20%E2%86%94%20%E5%85%AC%E5%BA%8F%E8%89%AF%E4%BF%97%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E3%80%81%E8%AF%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="民诉体系：处分原则（核心） ↔ 诚信原则（约束）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%EF%BC%89%20%E2%86%94%20%E8%AF%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="约束对象：所有参与民事诉讼的主体，不仅限于当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%85%E9%99%90%E4%BA%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 当事人：不得滥用诉权、不得提起虚假诉讼、不得伪造证据、不得违反禁反言" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E6%BB%A5%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%99%9A%E5%81%87%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BC%AA%E9%80%A0%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E7%A6%81%E5%8F%8D%E8%A8%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 证人：应当如实作证，不得作伪证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%A6%82%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E4%BC%AA%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 鉴定人：应当客观公正提供鉴定意见，不得作虚假鉴定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E5%85%AC%E6%AD%A3%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E8%99%9A%E5%81%87%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 法院：应当诚实善意行使自由裁量权，不得滥用审判权、不得拖延诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%9A%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%AF%9A%E5%AE%9E%E5%96%84%E6%84%8F%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E8%A3%81%E9%87%8F%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E6%BB%A5%E7%94%A8%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%9D%83%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E6%8B%96%E5%BB%B6%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="六、检察监督原则（核心考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AD%E3%80%81%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：人民检察院作为国家法律监督机关，有权对民事诉讼活动实行法律监督" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E5%AF%B9%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E5%AE%9E%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="⚠️ 核心误区纠正：检察监督的对象不是所有诉讼参与人，而是人民法院行使的审判权和执行权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9A%A0%EF%B8%8F%20%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%AF%AF%E5%8C%BA%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%EF%BC%9A%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%92%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法理基础：法律监督的本质是“把公权力关进制度的笼子”，只监督国家公权力的行使" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E6%8A%8A%E5%85%AC%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%E5%85%B3%E8%BF%9B%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%BC%E5%AD%90%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%85%AC%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="绝对不接受检察监督的主体：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 社会组织：人民调解委员会、仲裁委员会（属于社会救济主体，不行使国家公权力）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%88%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%85%AC%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 私人主体：当事人、证人、鉴定人、诉讼代理人（不行使国家公权力）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%A7%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%85%AC%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="法定监督方式：只有两种" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 抗诉：仅指再审抗诉，即检察院对法院已经生效的判决、裁定、调解书认为确有错误的，向同级法院提出抗诉，启动再审程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E6%8C%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E7%A1%AE%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 检察建议：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="再审检察建议：建议法院对生效裁判自行启动再审" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%9A%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="其他检察建议：对法院或法官在诉讼中的其他违法行为提出纠正建议（如对执行中的不当行为提出检察建议）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%88%96%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%93%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="✅ 考试判断标准：某行为是否体现检察监督原则，同时满足两个要件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%9A%E6%9F%90%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 监督对象是法院行使的审判权或执行权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%9D%83%E6%88%96%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 监督方式是抗诉或检察建议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%98%AF%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%E6%88%96%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="典型真题解析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="检察机关的下列行为体现民事诉讼检察监督原则的有（AD）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%EF%BC%88AD%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="A. 检察院对法院执行活动中的不当行为发出检察建议（对象：法院执行权；方式：检察建议 ✅）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%93%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%88%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%9B%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%20%E2%9C%85%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="B. 检察院对某公司虚假诉讼的犯罪事实提起公诉（对象：公司；方式：公诉 ❌）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%9F%90%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%99%9A%E5%81%87%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E7%8A%AF%E7%BD%AA%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%9B%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%89%20%E2%9D%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="C. 检察院对污染环境的某公司提起检察公益诉讼（对象：公司；方式：公益诉讼 ❌）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E7%9A%84%E6%9F%90%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%88%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%9B%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%20%E2%9D%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="D. 检察院对侵害社会公共利益的生效调解书提起抗诉（对象：法院调解书；方式：抗诉 ✅）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%9B%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%20%E2%9C%85%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="七、在线诉讼与线下诉讼具有同等效力原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%83%E3%80%81%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="立法背景：适应互联网时代发展，降低当事人诉讼成本，提高诉讼效率" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%82%E5%BA%94%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E5%8F%91%E5%B1%95%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="核心规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 适用前提：必须经当事人同意，法院不得强制任何一方当事人进行在线诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 部分同意规则：一方当事人同意在线诉讼，另一方不同意的，谁同意对谁适用，不同意的一方进行线下诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%81%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%AF%B9%E8%B0%81%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="典型真题解析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="黄某通过网络购物购买雅贝公司生产的保温壶，因质量问题向法院起诉。法院受理后建议双方在线上平台交换证据，雅贝公司同意，黄某不同意。法院仍组织双方在线进行证据交换。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E8%B4%AD%E7%89%A9%E8%B4%AD%E4%B9%B0%E9%9B%85%E8%B4%9D%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E6%B8%A9%E5%A3%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8A%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E9%9B%85%E8%B4%9D%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BB%8D%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院做法：错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%9A%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="违反原则：在线诉讼与线下诉讼具有同等效力原则（未经黄某同意，不得强制其进行在线证据交换）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E5%85%B6%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="法律效力：在线进行的诉讼活动（如在线开庭、在线举证、在线调解）与线下诉讼活动具有完全同等的法律效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%81%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="考点复盘" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E5%A4%8D%E7%9B%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 平等原则：权利相同或相对应，不是完全相同" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%B9%B3%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E6%88%96%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 同等对等：仅适用于外国人，题目无外国人绝对不选" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%AF%B9%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E6%97%A0%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 处分原则：法院判决绝对不能超出原告的诉讼请求范围" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%B6%85%E5%87%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 辩论原则：主体是当事人，仅诉讼程序可辩论" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%85%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%8F%AF%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="5. 诚信原则：约束所有诉讼参与人，包括法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E8%AF%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="6. 检察监督：只监督法院的审判权和执行权，方式只有抗诉和检察建议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%92%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%E5%92%8C%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="7. 在线诉讼：必须经当事人同意，谁同意对谁适用" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%AF%B9%E8%B0%81%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="基本制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、民事诉讼基本制度总览" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E6%80%BB%E8%A7%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="四大基本制度：合议制（审判组织）、回避制度、公开审判制度、两审终审制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E5%A4%A7%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E3%80%81%E4%B8%A4%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="逻辑关系：审判组织是基础，回避是内部制约，两审终审是上级制约，公开审判是社会制约" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E6%98%AF%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E6%98%AF%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E5%88%B6%E7%BA%A6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%A4%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%B6%E7%BA%A6%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%98%AF%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%88%B6%E7%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、合议制" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="21年民诉法修改重点" _mubu_note="%3Cspan%3E21%E5%B9%B4%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E">
          <outline text="（一）法院的三种审判组织" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 独任庭：由审判员一人独任审理→对应独任制" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E2%86%92%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 合议庭：由审判员3人或审判员+人民陪审员3人组成→对应合议制" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%983%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98+%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%983%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E2%86%92%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 审判委员会：法院最高业务决策机构，负责对重大疑难案件进行讨论并作出决定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%86%B3%E7%AD%96%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%B4%9F%E8%B4%A3%E5%AF%B9%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E7%96%91%E9%9A%BE%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）独任制与合议制的适用范围" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E4%B8%8E%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="立法背景：解决基层法院“案多人少”的突出矛盾，通过扩大独任制适用提高诉讼效率" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E2%80%9C%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%B0%91%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E7%AA%81%E5%87%BA%E7%9F%9B%E7%9B%BE%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E6%89%A9%E5%A4%A7%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="核心立法考量：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E8%80%83%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 司法民主：人民陪审员参与审判的制度载体是合议制，盲目扩大独任制会压缩人民陪审员的参与空间" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E6%B0%91%E4%B8%BB%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E8%BD%BD%E4%BD%93%E6%98%AF%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B2%E7%9B%AE%E6%89%A9%E5%A4%A7%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E4%BC%9A%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 司法公信力：合议制判决的公信力高于独任制，独任制可能导致当事人上诉率、再审申请率上升，破坏两审终审制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%85%AC%E4%BF%A1%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E5%85%AC%E4%BF%A1%E5%8A%9B%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%8E%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%8E%87%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%87%EF%BC%8C%E7%A0%B4%E5%9D%8F%E4%B8%A4%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="1. 一审程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="简易程序：必须适用独任制（仅适用于基层法院及派出法庭审理的事实清楚、权利义务明确的简单民事案件）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%8A%E6%B4%BE%E5%87%BA%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%E3%80%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="普通程序：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="原则：合议制（由审判员组成或审判员与人民陪审员共同组成合议庭）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E6%88%96%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="例外（可适用独任制）：基层法院审理的基本事实清楚、权利义务关系明确的一审民事案件（两个“基”）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%E3%80%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E2%80%9C%E5%9F%BA%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="✅ 秒杀结论：中级人民法院审理的一审民事案件，绝对不能适用独任制（只能合议制）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 二审程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原则：合议制（只能由审判员组成合议庭，无人民陪审员参与）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="例外（可适用独任制）：需同时满足四个条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E9%9C%80%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 法院级别：仅中级人民法院审理的二审案件可以独任（高级人民法院及以上二审绝对不能独任）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%8A%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 一审基础：一审适用简易程序审结，或者不服一审不予受理、驳回起诉、管辖权异议三类程序性裁定提起上诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%81%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="3. 案件事实：事实清楚、权利义务关系明确" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%E3%80%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="4. 当事人同意：必须经双方当事人同意（核心要求，为了保证二审终审判决的公信力）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E5%85%AC%E4%BF%A1%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 其他程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="再审程序：必须适用合议制，绝对不能独任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="原来是一审终审的：按一审程序另行组成合议庭（可由审判员+人民陪审员组成）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E6%9D%A5%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%89%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98+%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="原来是二审终审或上级法院提审的：按二审程序另行组成合议庭（只能由审判员组成）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E6%9D%A5%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E6%88%96%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%89%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="特别程序：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="原则：独任制" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="例外：选民资格案件、重大疑难案件→合议制（只能由审判员组成，无人民陪审员）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%89%E6%B0%91%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%81%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E7%96%91%E9%9A%BE%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E2%86%92%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="督促程序（支付令程序）：独任制" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="公示催告程序：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="公示催告阶段：独任制" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%9A%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="除权判决阶段：合议制（只能由审判员组成）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）人民陪审员的参加范围（高频考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="✅ 核心结论：人民陪审员只参加适用一审程序审理的诉讼程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E5%8F%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="双重判断标准：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8C%E9%87%8D%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 审级要求：必须适用一审程序审理（包括一审普通程序、一审简易程序、按一审程序再审的案件）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%AE%A1%E7%BA%A7%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E6%8C%89%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 案件性质要求：必须是诉讼程序（解决民事权利义务纠纷的程序）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="❌ 绝对不能参加的情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="二审程序、按二审程序再审的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E6%8C%89%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="所有非讼程序（特别程序、督促程序、公示催告程序）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="执行程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）绝对不能适用独任制的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 涉及国家利益、社会公共利益的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 涉及群体性纠纷，可能影响社会稳定的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E7%BE%A4%E4%BD%93%E6%80%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E7%A8%B3%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 人民群众广泛关注或者其他社会影响较大的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E7%BE%A4%E4%BC%97%E5%B9%BF%E6%B3%9B%E5%85%B3%E6%B3%A8%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E8%BE%83%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 属于新类型或者疑难复杂的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%96%B0%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%96%91%E9%9A%BE%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="5. 法律规定应当组成合议庭的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="6. 其他不宜由审判员一人独任审理的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9C%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="辅助理解：影响大、疑难复杂的案件，法官不敢独任审理（判决书单独署名，责任全部由个人承担）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%A4%A7%E3%80%81%E7%96%91%E9%9A%BE%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E4%B8%8D%E6%95%A2%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E7%BD%B2%E5%90%8D%EF%BC%8C%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（五）独任制转合议制" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E8%BD%AC%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="转换情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 法院在审理过程中，发现案件不宜适用独任制" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 当事人对法院适用独任制提出异议，法院审查认为异议成立" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="转换文书：裁定书（裁定转为合议制）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%BD%AC%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（六）经典例题（老师讲义例1-例4）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AD%EF%BC%89%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E4%BE%8B%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88%E8%AE%B2%E4%B9%89%E4%BE%8B1-%E4%BE%8B4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 例1：某中院受理甲公司诉乙公司合同纠纷案，认为本案基本事实清楚、权利义务明确，由审判员张某独任审判→❌错误（中院一审只能合议制）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BE%8B1%EF%BC%9A%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%E3%80%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 例2：某区法院适用普通程序审理张某诉李某合同纠纷案，裁定驳回起诉，张某不服上诉。中院认为事实清楚、权利义务明确，经张某、李某同意后由审判员王某独任审理→✅正确（符合二审独任四个条件）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BE%8B2%EF%BC%9A%E6%9F%90%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%E3%80%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E3%80%81%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%90%8E%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E2%86%92%E2%9C%85%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%88%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 例3：某区法院适用普通程序审理张某诉李某侵权纠纷案，判决驳回张某诉讼请求，张某不服上诉。中院认为事实清楚、权利义务明确，经双方同意后由审判员一人独任审理→❌错误（一审是普通程序判决，不符合二审独任的一审基础条件）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BE%8B3%EF%BC%9A%E6%9F%90%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%E3%80%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%90%8E%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%98%AF%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 例4：某中院受理甲公司诉乙公司合同纠纷案，驳回乙公司管辖权异议，乙公司不服上诉。高院认为事实清楚、权利义务明确，经双方同意后由审判员张某独任审理→❌错误（高院二审不能独任）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E4%BE%8B4%EF%BC%9A%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%E3%80%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%90%8E%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="✅ 秒杀结论：凡是由中院一审的民事案件，一审、二审都绝对不能适用独任制（案件本身重大复杂）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%87%A1%E6%98%AF%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E9%83%BD%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、回避制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）回避的适用对象" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="判断方法：凡是我们期待其保持中立的人，都需要适用回避制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%87%A1%E6%98%AF%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E6%9C%9F%E5%BE%85%E5%85%B6%E4%BF%9D%E6%8C%81%E4%B8%AD%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="具体对象：审判人员（审判员、人民陪审员）、法官助理、书记员、司法技术人员、翻译人员、鉴定人、勘验人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E3%80%81%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E3%80%81%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E5%91%98%E3%80%81%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E3%80%81%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E3%80%81%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="❌ 不适用回避的对象：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 诉讼代理人（本来就是受一方委托帮其说话的，不期待中立）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AC%E6%9D%A5%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E5%8F%97%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E5%B8%AE%E5%85%B6%E8%AF%B4%E8%AF%9D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%9F%E5%BE%85%E4%B8%AD%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 证人（虽然期待其如实作证，但具有不可替代性，回避后可能没有适格证人，因此不适用回避）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E8%99%BD%E7%84%B6%E6%9C%9F%E5%BE%85%E5%85%B6%E5%A6%82%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E6%9B%BF%E4%BB%A3%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）回避的法定原因" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 与案件有利害关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="是本案当事人或者当事人、诉讼代理人近亲属的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%91%E4%BA%B2%E5%B1%9E%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="与本案有利害关系的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="担任过本案的证人、鉴定人、辩护人、诉讼代理人、翻译人员的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E8%BF%87%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%BE%A9%E6%8A%A4%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="易错点：不是证人、代理人要回避，而是曾经担任过本案证人、代理人的审判人员等要回避" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E8%A6%81%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9B%BE%E7%BB%8F%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E8%BF%87%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E7%AD%89%E8%A6%81%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="与本案当事人、诉讼代理人有其他关系，可能影响对案件公正审理的（如同学、朋友、师生、远房亲戚、债权债务关系等）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%85%AC%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%90%8C%E5%AD%A6%E3%80%81%E6%9C%8B%E5%8F%8B%E3%80%81%E5%B8%88%E7%94%9F%E3%80%81%E8%BF%9C%E6%88%BF%E4%BA%B2%E6%88%9A%E3%80%81%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="考试技巧：看是否有修饰词提示“可能影响公正审理”，如“多年出生入死的战友”→需要回避" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7%EF%BC%9A%E7%9C%8B%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%9C%89%E4%BF%AE%E9%A5%B0%E8%AF%8D%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E2%80%9C%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%85%AC%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E2%80%9C%E5%A4%9A%E5%B9%B4%E5%87%BA%E7%94%9F%E5%85%A5%E6%AD%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%88%98%E5%8F%8B%E2%80%9D%E2%86%92%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 存在不正当行为" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8D%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="接受当事人、诉讼代理人请客送礼的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%B7%E5%AE%A2%E9%80%81%E7%A4%BC%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="违反规定会见当事人、诉讼代理人的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E4%BC%9A%E8%A7%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="为当事人推荐、介绍诉讼代理人的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90%E3%80%81%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="辅助理解：非工作时间、非工作场合会见当事人→违规会见→需要回避" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E9%9D%9E%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E3%80%81%E9%9D%9E%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%9C%BA%E5%90%88%E4%BC%9A%E8%A7%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E2%86%92%E8%BF%9D%E8%A7%84%E4%BC%9A%E8%A7%81%E2%86%92%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 参与过前序程序的审判" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E8%BF%87%E5%89%8D%E5%BA%8F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原则：在一个审判程序中参与过本案审判工作的审判人员，不得再参与该案其他程序的审判（防止先入为主的偏见）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E8%BF%87%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%86%8D%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%A5%E6%A1%88%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%88%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E5%85%88%E5%85%A5%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%81%8F%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="例外：发回重审的案件，一审法院作出裁判后又进入二审程序的，原二审程序中的审判人员不受上述规定限制" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%88%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="理由：原二审只是撤销原判发回重审，没有对案件进行实质性审理，没有产生偏见" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E6%80%A7%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E5%81%8F%E8%A7%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）回避的方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 自行回避：审判人员等发现自己有回避事由，主动提出回避" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E7%AD%89%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="实践中最常见：既是对法官的约束，也是对法官的保护（避免陷入公私两难的境地）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%80%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A2%E6%98%AF%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%EF%BC%88%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E9%99%B7%E5%85%A5%E5%85%AC%E7%A7%81%E4%B8%A4%E9%9A%BE%E7%9A%84%E5%A2%83%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 申请回避：当事人发现审判人员等有回避事由，向法院提出申请" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E7%AD%89%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 指令回避：审判人员等有回避事由，没有自行回避，当事人也没有申请回避，由院长或审判委员会决定其回避" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%8C%87%E4%BB%A4%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E7%AD%89%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%9F%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E6%88%96%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%B6%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）申请回避的程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 申请方式：口头或书面均可，必须说明理由（我国实行有因回避，不承认无因回避）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%A3%E5%A4%B4%E6%88%96%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%9D%87%E5%8F%AF%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%9E%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%A0%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E6%97%A0%E5%9B%A0%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 申请时间：最迟在法庭辩论终结前提出" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E8%BF%9F%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="理由：法庭辩论终结后，只剩合议庭秘密评议和公开宣判两个环节，申请回避已无实际意义" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E5%89%A9%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%AE%E5%92%8C%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E7%8E%AF%E8%8A%82%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%B7%B2%E6%97%A0%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 申请效力：申请后，回避决定作出前，被申请回避的人应当暂停本案工作，但案件需要采取紧急措施的除外" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E6%9A%82%E5%81%9C%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E7%9A%84%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（五）回避的决定权（高频考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="✅ 秒杀方法：看判决书最后有没有这个人的署名" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9C%8B%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E6%9C%89%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%BD%B2%E5%90%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="判决书最后署名的人（审判长、审判员、人民陪审员、书记员）→院长决定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E7%BD%B2%E5%90%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%95%BF%E3%80%81%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E3%80%81%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E3%80%81%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E5%91%98%EF%BC%89%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="判决书最后不署名的人（鉴定人、翻译人员、勘验人）→审判长或独任审判员决定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%8D%E7%BD%B2%E5%90%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E3%80%81%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%95%BF%E6%88%96%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="法定规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 审判人员（包括人民陪审员）的回避：由院长决定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%EF%BC%88%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%EF%BC%89%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 其他人员的回避：由审判长或独任审判员决定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%95%BF%E6%88%96%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 院长担任审判长或独任审判员时的回避：由审判委员会集体决定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%95%BF%E6%88%96%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E6%97%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E9%9B%86%E4%BD%93%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（六）回避的救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AD%EF%BC%89%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 申请人对驳回回避申请决定不服的：可以向作出决定的法院申请复议一次" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 复议期间：被申请回避的人员不停止本案的工作" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="理由：院长已经审查认为被申请人没有问题，为了保证诉讼效率，不停止工作" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. ❌ 被决定回避的人：不能申请复议（巴不得回避，不用承担审案压力）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E2%9D%8C%20%E8%A2%AB%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%88%E5%B7%B4%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%A8%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E5%AE%A1%E6%A1%88%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（七）回避的效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%83%EF%BC%89%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="审判人员回避后，诉讼程序继续进行，原来已经进行的诉讼程序依然有效，不需要重新进行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E6%9D%A5%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%BE%9D%E7%84%B6%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="易错点：民事诉讼中回避不导致程序重来，这与仲裁程序不同" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E4%B8%8D%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E9%87%8D%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%8E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（八）经典例题（老师讲义例1-例3）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AB%EF%BC%89%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E4%BE%8B%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88%E8%AE%B2%E4%B9%89%E4%BE%8B1-%E4%BE%8B3%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 例1：某区法院审理徐某诉某饭店食物中毒纠纷案，开庭后徐某发现人民陪审员丙与被告法定代表人是亲兄弟，遂提出回避申请" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BE%8B1%EF%BC%9A%E6%9F%90%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%BE%90%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%89%E6%9F%90%E9%A5%AD%E5%BA%97%E9%A3%9F%E7%89%A9%E4%B8%AD%E6%AF%92%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%90%8E%E5%BE%90%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E4%B8%99%E4%B8%8E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%B2%E5%85%84%E5%BC%9F%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%82%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="A. 徐某可以在知道丙与被告法定代表人是亲兄弟时提出回避申请→✅正确（法庭辩论终结前均可）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E5%BE%90%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%9C%A8%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E4%B8%99%E4%B8%8E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%B2%E5%85%84%E5%BC%9F%E6%97%B6%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E2%86%92%E2%9C%85%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%89%8D%E5%9D%87%E5%8F%AF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="B. 法院对回避申请作出决定前，丙不停止参与本案审理→❌错误（申请后应暂停工作）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%99%E4%B8%8D%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%90%8E%E5%BA%94%E6%9A%82%E5%81%9C%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="C. 应当由审判长决定丙是否回避→❌错误（人民陪审员是审判人员，由院长决定）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%95%BF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%99%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="D. 法院作出回避决定后，徐某可以对此上诉→❌错误（只能申请复议，不能上诉）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BE%90%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%B9%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 例2：王某诉马某侵权纠纷案，开庭审理后合议庭评议完毕，通知8月1日宣判。马某7月31日发现书记员张某是原告表妹夫，提出回避申请" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BE%8B2%EF%BC%9A%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%89%E9%A9%AC%E6%9F%90%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%AE%E5%AE%8C%E6%AF%95%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A58%E6%9C%881%E6%97%A5%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%E9%A9%AC%E6%9F%907%E6%9C%8831%E6%97%A5%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E5%91%98%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E6%98%AF%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%A1%A8%E5%A6%B9%E5%A4%AB%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="A. 以书记员不属于应当回避的人员为由驳回申请→❌错误（书记员属于回避对象）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E4%BB%A5%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E5%91%98%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E5%91%98%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="B. 以马某的申请不符合法定回避情形为由驳回申请→❌错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E4%BB%A5%E9%A9%AC%E6%9F%90%E7%9A%84%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="C. 因为马某超过了法定申请回避期限，法院对申请不予审查→✅正确（法庭辩论已经终结，不能再申请回避）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E9%A9%AC%E6%9F%90%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87%E4%BA%86%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E2%86%92%E2%9C%85%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="D. 法院应当延期宣判，对回避申请进行审查→❌错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%BB%B6%E6%9C%9F%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 例3：甲公司诉赵某违约案，由鲍法官独任审理。赵某申请鲍法官回避被驳回。后甲公司被收购，法定代表人变更为薛某，赵某发现薛某与鲍法官是同学，再次提出回避申请" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BE%8B3%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%AF%89%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E9%B2%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%B2%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E8%A2%AB%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E3%80%82%E5%90%8E%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%A2%AB%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E4%B8%BA%E8%96%9B%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E8%96%9B%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%8E%E9%B2%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E6%98%AF%E5%90%8C%E5%AD%A6%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="A. 赵某不能再次提出回避申请，只能申请复议→❌错误（可以新的事实理由再次申请）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="B. 鲍法官应当暂停本案的审理工作→✅正确（申请后回避决定作出前应暂停工作）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E9%B2%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E6%9A%82%E5%81%9C%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E2%86%92%E2%9C%85%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%90%8E%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%89%8D%E5%BA%94%E6%9A%82%E5%81%9C%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="C. 法院可以裁定驳回赵某的回避申请→❌错误（回避用决定书，不用裁定书）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%A8%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="D. 如果法院决定鲍法官回避，赵某可以再次提出管辖权异议→❌错误（回避后原程序继续有效，驳回管辖权异议的裁定依然有效）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E9%B2%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%90%8E%E5%8E%9F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%BE%9D%E7%84%B6%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="四、公开审判制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）公开审判的内容" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="审判过程公开：允许群众旁听，允许新闻媒体报道" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E7%BE%A4%E4%BC%97%E6%97%81%E5%90%AC%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E6%96%B0%E9%97%BB%E5%AA%92%E4%BD%93%E6%8A%A5%E9%81%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="审判结果公开：一律公开宣判" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="❌ 绝对不公开：合议庭评议过程（秘密进行，任何人不得旁听）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%AE%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%88%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E6%97%81%E5%90%AC%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）公开审判的例外（高频考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 法定不公开（绝对不公开）：法律规定必须不公开，无需当事人申请" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%88%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="涉及国家秘密的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="涉及个人隐私的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%90%E7%A7%81%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法律另有规定的其他案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%8F%A6%E6%9C%89%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 申请不公开（相对不公开）：原则上公开，当事人申请不公开的，法院可以决定不公开" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%88%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8A%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="离婚案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="涉及商业秘密的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）易错点辨析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="❌ 错误：民事诉讼中，开庭时当事人是未成年人的案件不公开审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E6%97%B6%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AA%E6%88%90%E5%B9%B4%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="✅ 正确：民事诉讼中，未成年人案件不是法定不公开情形，与是否公开审理无关" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AA%E6%88%90%E5%B9%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="理由：民事诉讼中未成年人当原告或被告不是不光彩的事，与刑事诉讼中未成年被告人的保护逻辑不同" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%AA%E6%88%90%E5%B9%B4%E4%BA%BA%E5%BD%93%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%88%96%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%89%E5%BD%A9%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%AA%E6%88%90%E5%B9%B4%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="✅ 重要结论：不论案件是否公开审理，宣判一律公开进行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%BA%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="理由：公开宣判只宣布判决主文和结果，不会泄露国家秘密或个人隐私" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E5%8F%AA%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%BB%E6%96%87%E5%92%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E6%88%96%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%90%E7%A7%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="五、两审终审制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E4%B8%A4%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）基本概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="一个民事案件经过两级人民法院审理后即告终结" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E5%8D%B3%E5%91%8A%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人对一审判决、裁定不服，可以在法定期限内向上一级法院提起上诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%86%85%E5%90%91%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="二审法院作出的判决、裁定是终审判决、裁定，立即发生法律效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）制度逻辑" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="上级法院对下级法院的审判工作进行监督制约，通过二审程序纠正一审可能存在的错误，保证案件公正审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E5%88%B6%E7%BA%A6%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%9A%84%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%8C%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%85%AC%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）例外提示" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="两审终审制度存在例外，后续程序专题会详细讲解（如最高人民法院一审终审、特别程序一审终审、小额诉讼程序一审终审等）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%A4%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%E4%BC%9A%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%AE%B2%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="本专题核心考点复盘" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E5%A4%8D%E7%9B%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 合议制：重点掌握一审普通程序、二审程序独任制的适用条件，以及人民陪审员的参加范围" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%9A%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E6%8E%8C%E6%8F%A1%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 回避制：重点掌握回避的适用对象、申请时间、决定权，以及回避后诉讼程序继续进行的规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%9A%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E6%8E%8C%E6%8F%A1%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E3%80%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E3%80%81%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%90%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 公开审判制：重点掌握法定不公开和申请不公开的情形，牢记宣判一律公开" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%9A%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E6%8E%8C%E6%8F%A1%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%92%8C%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%8C%E7%89%A2%E8%AE%B0%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 两审终审制：掌握基本概念，知道存在例外即可" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E4%B8%A4%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%9A%E6%8E%8C%E6%8F%A1%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%EF%BC%8C%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题04 主管与管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9804%20%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、概述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="主管" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：解决案件归不归法院管的问题，是法院与其他纠纷解决机构之间的分工" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%BD%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%92%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E5%B7%A5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="逻辑地位：主管是管辖的前提，只有确定案件属于法院主管，才需要进一步讨论管辖问题" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E6%98%AF%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%BF%9B%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="法院主管的范围" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="平等主体之间因人身、财产权利义务发生的纠纷，属于人民法院民事诉讼主管范围" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B9%B3%E7%AD%89%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E5%9B%A0%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E3%80%81%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：解决归哪个法院管的问题，是法院系统内部上下级之间、同级之间的分工" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%92%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%AA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E3%80%81%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E5%B7%A5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="管辖的两大维度（坐标轴比喻）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%A4%E5%A4%A7%E7%BB%B4%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%88%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%E8%BD%B4%E6%AF%94%E5%96%BB%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 级别管辖（纵坐标）：确定案件归哪一级法院管（基层、中院、高院、最高院）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E7%BA%B5%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%BD%92%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%88%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E3%80%81%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E3%80%81%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E3%80%81%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 地域管辖（横坐标）：确定案件归同一级别中的哪个地区的法院管" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E6%A8%AA%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%BD%92%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%AA%E5%9C%B0%E5%8C%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="核心逻辑：级别管辖+地域管辖=唯一确定的管辖法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96+%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96=%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="法院主管与人民调解委员会的关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 人民调解 vs 诉讼调解（核心区分金标准：看法院是否立案）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%20vs%20%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E9%87%91%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%9A%E7%9C%8B%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="| 类型 | 组织主体 | 性质 | 时间节点 | 效力 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 人民调解 | 人民调解委员会（社会组织） | 社会救济 | 法院立案之前 | 达成的调解协议具有合同约束力，无强制执行力 |
| 诉讼调解 | 人民法院（国家审判机关） | 公力救济 | 法院立案之后 | 制作的调解书与判决书具有同等法律效力，有强制执行力 |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%224%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%88%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%3Cb%3E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%8A%9B%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%8A%9B%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="辅助理解：诉前调解工作室、法院邀请人民调解员参与诉讼中的调解，只要法院已经立案，都属于诉讼调解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%A4%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%82%80%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%91%98%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 人民调解协议的效力（高频考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 一般效力：具有合同约束力，双方当事人应当自觉履行，但无强制执行力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%87%AA%E8%A7%89%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 对方不履行调解协议的救济：只能就调解协议向法院起诉，不能就原纠纷起诉（调解协议替代原纠纷成为新的诉讼标的）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%B0%B1%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%B0%B1%E5%8E%9F%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%9B%BF%E4%BB%A3%E5%8E%9F%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 赋予强制执行力的途径：双方当事人共同向法院申请司法确认调解协议效力，法院适用特别程序审查后作出的确认裁定具有强制执行力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%88%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%90%8E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="法院主管与仲裁机构的关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%8E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 民商事仲裁 vs 劳动仲裁（核心区别）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%B0%91%E5%95%86%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%20vs%20%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="| 区别点 | 民商事仲裁 | 劳动仲裁 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 机构性质 | 民间组织（自收自支事业单位） | 行政机构（人社局下属单位） |
| 管辖权来源 | 当事人书面仲裁协议授权 | 法律直接规定 |
| 裁决效力 | 一裁终局，不得再向法院起诉 | 非终局，对裁决不服可在15日内向法院起诉 |
| 与诉讼的关系 | 或裁或审，有效仲裁协议排斥法院主管 | 仲裁前置，未经仲裁不得直接起诉 |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E5%95%86%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E9%97%B4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%EF%BC%88%E8%87%AA%E6%94%B6%E8%87%AA%E6%94%AF%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%9A%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%BA%E7%A4%BE%E5%B1%80%E4%B8%8B%E5%B1%9E%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%A3%81%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%86%8D%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A815%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%224%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%88%96%E8%A3%81%E6%88%96%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%8E%92%E6%96%A5%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 法院主管与民商事仲裁的关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%8E%E6%B0%91%E5%95%86%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="核心原则：或裁或审" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%88%96%E8%A3%81%E6%88%96%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="规则：当事人达成有效的书面仲裁协议的，应当向仲裁机构申请仲裁，不得向法院起诉，法院不予受理（有效仲裁协议排斥法院主管）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%90%91%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%8E%92%E6%96%A5%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 法院主管与劳动仲裁的关系（劳动纠纷解决专题）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="（1）劳动纠纷的解决途径" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%881%EF%BC%89%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 和解：劳动者与用人单位自行协商解决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%80%85%E4%B8%8E%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 调解：由人民调解委员会等调解组织调解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E7%AD%89%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 劳动仲裁：向劳动争议仲裁委员会申请仲裁" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="4. 劳动诉讼：对仲裁裁决不服的，向法院提起诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="核心规则：劳动纠纷仲裁前置，未经劳动仲裁直接向法院起诉的，法院不予受理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="立法理由：劳动纠纷数量多、专业性强（需认定劳动关系、计算工资、加班费等），由专业的劳动仲裁委先行处理，减轻法院负担" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E5%A4%9A%E3%80%81%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E6%80%A7%E5%BC%BA%EF%BC%88%E9%9C%80%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%81%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%B7%A5%E8%B5%84%E3%80%81%E5%8A%A0%E7%8F%AD%E8%B4%B9%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E5%85%88%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%87%8F%E8%BD%BB%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B4%9F%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="（2）仲裁前置的例外（高频考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="情形：劳动者以用人单位的工资欠条为证据直接提起诉讼，且诉讼请求不涉及劳动关系其他争议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%80%85%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A5%E8%B5%84%E6%AC%A0%E6%9D%A1%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="处理：视为拖欠劳动报酬争议，法院按照普通民事纠纷受理，无需仲裁前置" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%8B%96%E6%AC%A0%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%A5%E9%85%AC%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法理：工资欠条已明确双方权利义务，无需再认定劳动关系、计算工资等，本质是欠债还钱的普通民事纠纷" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E5%B7%A5%E8%B5%84%E6%AC%A0%E6%9D%A1%E5%B7%B2%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E5%86%8D%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%81%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%B7%A5%E8%B5%84%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AF%E6%AC%A0%E5%80%BA%E8%BF%98%E9%92%B1%E7%9A%84%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="（3）劳动纠纷人民调解的效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%883%EF%BC%89%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 一般效力：达成的调解协议具有劳动合同约束力，无强制执行力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 对方不履行调解协议的救济：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="一般情形：属于劳动纠纷，应当先申请劳动仲裁，对仲裁裁决不服再起诉（仍需仲裁前置）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%85%88%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E5%86%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%8D%E9%9C%80%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="例外：仅就劳动报酬争议达成调解协议，用人单位不履行给付义务的，劳动者可以直接向法院起诉，无需仲裁前置（与工资欠条原理相同）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E5%B0%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%A5%E9%85%AC%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%80%85%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E8%B5%84%E6%AC%A0%E6%9D%A1%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="3. 赋予强制执行力的途径：向法院申请司法确认调解协议效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%88%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="4. 其他救济：符合督促程序条件的，可以向法院申请支付令" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%EF%BC%9A%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="（4）劳动仲裁的核心规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%884%EF%BC%89%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 管辖：劳动争议由劳动合同履行地或者用人单位所在地的劳动争议仲裁委员会管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%9A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="冲突解决：双方当事人分别向劳动合同履行地和用人单位所在地申请仲裁的，由劳动合同履行地的仲裁委员会管辖（方便劳动者）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E5%90%91%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E5%92%8C%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%80%85%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="2. 当事人：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="一般：劳动者和用人单位为双方当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%EF%BC%9A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%80%85%E5%92%8C%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%BA%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="劳务派遣：劳动者为一方，劳务派遣单位和用工单位为共同另一方" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A1%E6%B4%BE%E9%81%A3%EF%BC%9A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%80%85%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A1%E6%B4%BE%E9%81%A3%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E5%92%8C%E7%94%A8%E5%B7%A5%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="3. 先予执行（高频考点）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="适用案件：追索劳动报酬、工伤医疗费、经济补偿或者赔偿金的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%A5%E9%85%AC%E3%80%81%E5%B7%A5%E4%BC%A4%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E%E8%A1%A5%E5%81%BF%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E9%87%91%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="适用条件：当事人之间权利义务关系明确，不先予执行将严重影响申请人生活" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%B0%86%E4%B8%A5%E9%87%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="程序：由仲裁庭裁决，移送人民法院执行（裁决权在仲裁庭，执行权在法院）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E6%9D%83%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9D%83%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="特殊保护：劳动者申请先予执行的，可以不提供担保" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%EF%BC%9A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%80%85%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="4. 调解：仲裁庭在作出裁决前，应当先行调解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E5%9C%A8%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%85%88%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="效力：仲裁庭制作的调解书与裁决书具有同等法律效力，有强制执行力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%8E%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="5. 裁决：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="作出规则：按照多数仲裁员的意见作出；不能形成多数意见的，按照首席仲裁员的意见作出" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%B0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%9B%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A6%96%E5%B8%AD%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="先行裁决：部分事实已经查清的，可以就该部分先行裁决（由仲裁庭决定，当事人不能申请）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%88%E8%A1%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%9A%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E6%9F%A5%E6%B8%85%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%B0%B1%E8%AF%A5%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%85%88%E8%A1%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B1%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="效力：对裁决不服的，可以在收到裁决书之日起15日内向法院起诉；期满不起诉的，裁决生效，具有强制执行力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%9C%A8%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B715%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9B%E6%9C%9F%E6%BB%A1%E4%B8%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="（5）经典真题示例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%885%EF%BC%89%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：甲公司拖欠员工陈某工资，双方经人民调解委员会调解达成协议，约定甲公司1个月内支付工资5万元。期限届满甲公司拒不履行，陈某如何救济？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8B%96%E6%AC%A0%E5%91%98%E5%B7%A5%E9%99%88%E6%9F%90%E5%B7%A5%E8%B5%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E7%BB%8F%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B81%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E5%86%85%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E5%B7%A5%E8%B5%845%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E3%80%82%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%88%E6%9F%90%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="答案：BD" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9ABD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="A. 申请法院强制执行调解协议书（❌，人民调解协议无强制执行力）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%88%E2%9D%8C%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%A0%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="B. 直接向法院起诉要求履行调解协议（✅，仅就劳动报酬达成协议，无需仲裁前置）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%88%E2%9C%85%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%85%E5%B0%B1%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%A5%E9%85%AC%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="C. 应当先申请劳动仲裁，对仲裁裁决不服再起诉（❌，属于例外情形）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%85%88%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E5%86%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E2%9D%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="D. 就调解协议向法院申请支付令（✅，金钱给付且权利义务明确）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E5%B0%B1%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%EF%BC%88%E2%9C%85%EF%BC%8C%E9%87%91%E9%92%B1%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E4%B8%94%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、管辖的基本原则：管辖权恒定原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E6%81%92%E5%AE%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）基本含义" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%90%AB%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="确定管辖法院以起诉时为准，起诉时对案件有管辖权的法院，不会因为确定管辖的事实发生变化而丧失管辖权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%A5%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%BA%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%A7%E5%A4%B1%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="具体体现：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 不受行政区划变更的影响：起诉时属于甲县辖区，立案后划到乙县，仍由甲县法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%92%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%EF%BC%9A%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E7%94%B2%E5%8E%BF%E8%BE%96%E5%8C%BA%EF%BC%8C%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E5%90%8E%E5%88%92%E5%88%B0%E4%B9%99%E5%8E%BF%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8D%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B2%E5%8E%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 不受当事人住所地变更的影响：起诉时被告住甲县，立案后搬到乙县，仍由甲县法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%EF%BC%9A%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E7%94%B2%E5%8E%BF%EF%BC%8C%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E5%90%8E%E6%90%AC%E5%88%B0%E4%B9%99%E5%8E%BF%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8D%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B2%E5%8E%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）管辖权恒定的例外（高频考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E6%81%92%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="情形：原告在诉讼中增加、变更诉讼请求，导致案件标的额超出受诉法院级别管辖标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E3%80%81%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9D%E8%B6%85%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="处理：受诉法院应当依法将案件移送给有管辖权的上级法院，不再适用管辖权恒定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E6%81%92%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="立法理由：防止原告通过“先少诉、后增加”的方式规避级别管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E2%80%9C%E5%85%88%E5%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E5%90%8E%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E8%A7%84%E9%81%BF%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）不适用例外的情形" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="情形：被告提出反诉，导致案件标的额超出受诉法院级别管辖标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9D%E8%B6%85%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="处理：受诉法院继续审理，不移送管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="立法理由：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 反诉是独立的诉，被告选择以反诉方式提出，视为其认可受诉法院的管辖权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E6%98%AF%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B6%E8%AE%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 基于牵连管辖，受理本诉的法院当然取得对反诉案件的管辖权（违反专属管辖的除外）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E7%89%B5%E8%BF%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%E5%AF%B9%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、级别管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）级别管辖的基本概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：划分上下级人民法院之间受理第一审民事案件的分工和权限" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%92%E5%88%86%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E5%B7%A5%E5%92%8C%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="我国法院四级：基层人民法院、中级人民法院、高级人民法院、最高人民法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%9B%9B%E7%BA%A7%EF%BC%9A%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E3%80%81%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E3%80%81%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E3%80%81%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）基层人民法院的管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则：第一审民事案件原则上都由基层人民法院管辖，但法律另有规定的除外" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8A%E9%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%8F%A6%E6%9C%89%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="立法理由：基层法院数量最多、分布最广，最方便当事人诉讼和法院审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A%E3%80%81%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E6%9C%80%E5%B9%BF%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%92%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）中级人民法院的管辖（核心考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 重大涉外案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="易错点：不是所有涉外案件都由中院管辖，只有重大涉外案件才由中院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%89%8D%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="举例：中国人张三与美国人玛丽在广州白云区结婚，后因感情不和起诉离婚，由白云区法院管辖（一般涉外案件）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BE%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8E%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD%E5%9C%A8%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E7%99%BD%E4%BA%91%E5%8C%BA%E7%BB%93%E5%A9%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8E%E5%9B%A0%E6%84%9F%E6%83%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%92%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E7%99%BD%E4%BA%91%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 本辖区有重大影响的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%9C%AC%E8%BE%96%E5%8C%BA%E6%9C%89%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 最高人民法院确定由中级人民法院管辖的案件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="（1）海事海商案件：由海事法院管辖，海事法院的级别相当于中级人民法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%881%EF%BC%89%E6%B5%B7%E4%BA%8B%E6%B5%B7%E5%95%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E6%B5%B7%E4%BA%8B%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E6%B5%B7%E4%BA%8B%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%9B%B8%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="（2）公益诉讼案件：由中级人民法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="（3）专利纠纷案件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%883%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%93%E5%88%A9%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="由知识产权法院、最高人民法院确定的中级人民法院、最高人民法院确定的基层人民法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B1%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E4%BA%A7%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E3%80%81%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E3%80%81%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="注意：只有最高人民法院有权确定哪些中院、基层法院可以管辖专利纠纷，各省高院无权确定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%93%AA%E4%BA%9B%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E3%80%81%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%B8%93%E5%88%A9%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%84%E7%9C%81%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="我国现有4个知识产权法院：北京、上海、广州、海南自由贸易港知识产权法院（均相当于中院）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E7%8E%B0%E6%9C%894%E4%B8%AA%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E4%BA%A7%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E3%80%81%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E3%80%81%E6%B5%B7%E5%8D%97%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E8%B4%B8%E6%98%93%E6%B8%AF%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E4%BA%A7%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88%E5%9D%87%E7%9B%B8%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="（4）与民商事仲裁相关的案件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%884%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8E%E6%B0%91%E5%95%86%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="✅ 秒杀口诀：看见仲裁找中院，除了国内仲裁的保全和国内仲裁的证据保全找基层法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%E5%8F%A3%E8%AF%80%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9C%8B%E8%A7%81%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%89%BE%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%A4%E4%BA%86%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%89%BE%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="由中院管辖的仲裁相关案件：确认仲裁协议效力、撤销仲裁裁决、执行仲裁裁决、不予执行仲裁裁决、涉外仲裁的保全、涉外仲裁的证据保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%81%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%81%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="由基层法院管辖的仲裁相关案件：国内仲裁的财产保全、国内仲裁的证据保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B1%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%81%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（四）高级人民法院的管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="管辖本辖区内有重大影响的第一审民事案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9C%AC%E8%BE%96%E5%8C%BA%E5%86%85%E6%9C%89%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="易错点：高院没有“认为应当由本院审理的案件”的管辖权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E2%80%9C%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（五）最高人民法院的管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 在全国范围内有重大影响的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9C%A8%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%86%85%E6%9C%89%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 认为应当由本院审理的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="核心考点：有且仅有最高人民法院享有此项特殊权力，高院、中院、基层法院均无此权力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%94%E4%BB%85%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E6%AD%A4%E9%A1%B9%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E3%80%81%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E3%80%81%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%9D%87%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、地域管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="概述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="考试定位：管辖部分的绝对重点与难点，每年必考，分值占比高" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E4%B8%8E%E9%9A%BE%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%AF%8F%E5%B9%B4%E5%BF%85%E8%80%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%86%E5%80%BC%E5%8D%A0%E6%AF%94%E9%AB%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="核心逻辑：在级别管辖确定后，进一步确定同一级别中哪个地区的法院对案件有管辖权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9B%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E4%B8%AD%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%AA%E5%9C%B0%E5%8C%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="一般地域管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）概念澄清（高频易错点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E6%BE%84%E6%B8%85%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="❌ 错误表述：原告就被告是一般地域管辖，被告就原告是特殊地域管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E8%A1%A8%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%B0%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%B0%B1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%98%AF%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="✅ 正确定义：只要是以当事人的住所与法院的隶属关系确定的管辖，都叫一般地域管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E4%B8%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E9%9A%B6%E5%B1%9E%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E5%8F%AB%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="包括两种情形：原告就被告（原则）、被告就原告（例外）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%B0%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%B0%B1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%88%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="特殊地域管辖：不以当事人住所与法院的隶属关系确定的管辖（如合同履行地、侵权行为地）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%A5%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E4%B8%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E9%9A%B6%E5%B1%9E%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）一般地域管辖的原则：原告就被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%B0%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="基本规则：原则上由被告住所地法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8A%E7%94%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="双方情况相同的三种情形（仍适用原告就被告）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%B0%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 双方都被监禁或被采取强制性教育措施" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E9%83%BD%E8%A2%AB%E7%9B%91%E7%A6%81%E6%88%96%E8%A2%AB%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%80%A7%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 双方当事人都被注销户籍" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%BD%E8%A2%AB%E6%B3%A8%E9%94%80%E6%88%B7%E7%B1%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 夫妻双方都离开住所地超过一年" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%A4%AB%E5%A6%BB%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E9%83%BD%E7%A6%BB%E5%BC%80%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）一般地域管辖的例外：被告就原告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%B0%B1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="基本规律：被告一方有特殊情况，原告就被告无法实现，故倒过来由原告住所地法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E8%A7%84%E5%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%9C%89%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%B0%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%8C%E6%95%85%E5%80%92%E8%BF%87%E6%9D%A5%E7%94%B1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="民诉法规定的4种情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%844%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 对不在中华人民共和国领域内居住的人提起的有关身份关系的诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%85%B1%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%BD%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E5%86%85%E5%B1%85%E4%BD%8F%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 对下落不明或者宣告失踪的人提起的有关身份关系的诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8B%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E5%A4%B1%E8%B8%AA%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 对被采取强制性教育措施的人提起的诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%AF%B9%E8%A2%AB%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%80%A7%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="4. 对正在被监禁的人提起的诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%AF%B9%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E8%A2%AB%E7%9B%91%E7%A6%81%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="民诉解释规定的3种情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%843%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 被告一方被注销户籍" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E8%A2%AB%E6%B3%A8%E9%94%80%E6%88%B7%E7%B1%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 追索赡养费、扶养费、抚养费案件的几个被告住所地不在同一辖区的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E6%89%B6%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%87%A0%E4%B8%AA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%8D%E5%9C%A8%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E8%BE%96%E5%8C%BA%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 夫妻一方离开住所地超过一年，另一方起诉离婚的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%A4%AB%E5%A6%BB%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E7%A6%BB%E5%BC%80%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）重要细节考点" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E7%BB%86%E8%8A%82%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 身份关系限制：前两种例外情形必须限于身份关系诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E9%99%90%E4%BA%8E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="立法理由：防止原告滥诉。若不加限制，原告可随意在自己住所地起诉外国公民或下落不明人（如起诉特朗普还钱），导致司法资源浪费。身份关系诉讼需提供结婚证、收养登记等证明，能有效过滤滥诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%BB%A5%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A0%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%AF%E9%9A%8F%E6%84%8F%E5%9C%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%AC%E6%B0%91%E6%88%96%E4%B8%8B%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E8%BF%98%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E6%B5%AA%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%82%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E9%9C%80%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%BB%93%E5%A9%9A%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E6%94%B6%E5%85%BB%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%AD%89%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E8%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E8%BF%87%E6%BB%A4%E6%BB%A5%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 两个“可以”：后两种例外情形（追索三费、夫妻一方离开住所地）是“可以”由原告住所地法院管辖，而非“只能”" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E2%80%9C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E4%B8%89%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E5%A4%AB%E5%A6%BB%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E7%A6%BB%E5%BC%80%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E2%80%9D%E7%94%B1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E9%9D%9E%E2%80%9C%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原告仍可选择向被告住所地法院起诉，法律只是为了方便原告提供了另一个选择" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%BB%8D%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%90%91%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E4%BA%86%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 兜底性地位：一般地域管辖是民事诉讼管辖的基础性、兜底性规定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%9C%E5%BA%95%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%98%AF%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%80%A7%E3%80%81%E5%85%9C%E5%BA%95%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="只要法律没有规定特殊地域管辖的案件，一律适用一般地域管辖（原告就被告）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%B0%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="典型例子：不当得利纠纷、无因管理纠纷、股东代表诉讼，均由被告住所地法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%93%E5%BE%97%E5%88%A9%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%81%E6%97%A0%E5%9B%A0%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%81%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%9D%87%E7%94%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="特殊地域管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）侵权纠纷的管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="基本规则：由侵权行为地和被告住所地法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="侵权行为地的范围：包括侵权行为实施地和侵权结果发生地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%9C%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BD%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="特殊侵权纠纷的管辖：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 信息网络侵权：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="侵权行为实施地：被诉侵权行为的计算机等信息设备所在地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BD%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E8%AF%89%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%AD%89%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="侵权结果发生地：被侵权人住所地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="立法理由：解决“侵权零成本，维权跑断腿”的问题，方便受害人维权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E2%80%9C%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E9%9B%B6%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%B4%E6%9D%83%E8%B7%91%E6%96%AD%E8%85%BF%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%B4%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="2. 产品、服务质量侵权：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E3%80%81%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="管辖法院：产品制造地、产品销售地、服务提供地、侵权行为地、被告住所地法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E5%88%B6%E9%80%A0%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E9%94%80%E5%94%AE%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="典型案例：北京公司委托天津工厂生产电吹风，在上海销售，左宁在上海购买后在重庆使用时被烧伤。有管辖权的法院：北京（被告住所地）、天津（产品制造地）、上海（产品销售地）、重庆（侵权结果发生地）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%A5%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%B5%E5%90%B9%E9%A3%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E9%94%80%E5%94%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E8%B4%AD%E4%B9%B0%E5%90%8E%E5%9C%A8%E9%87%8D%E5%BA%86%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%97%B6%E8%A2%AB%E7%83%A7%E4%BC%A4%E3%80%82%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%EF%BC%88%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%A5%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E5%88%B6%E9%80%A0%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E9%94%80%E5%94%AE%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E9%87%8D%E5%BA%86%EF%BC%88%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）合同纠纷的管辖（核心中的核心）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="基本规则：由被告住所地和合同履行地法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="被告住所地：永远有管辖权，无需讨论" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%B8%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="1. 合同履行地的确定：有约定从约定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%8E%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原则：合同明确约定履行地的，直接以约定履行地为合同履行地，与实际履行地无关" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E4%BB%A5%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="唯一例外：合同签订后根本没有实际履行，且约定履行地不在当事人任何一方住所地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E5%90%8E%E6%A0%B9%E6%9C%AC%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%8D%E5%9C%A8%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="此时约定履行地与案件无实际联系，没有管辖权，案件只能由被告住所地法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%97%A0%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 合同履行地的确定：无约定或约定不明（法定履行地）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E6%88%96%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="给付货币的：接收货币一方住所地为合同履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E8%B4%A7%E5%B8%81%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%A7%E5%B8%81%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="交付不动产的：不动产所在地为合同履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="交付其他标的的：履行义务一方住所地为合同履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="即时结清的合同：交易行为地为合同履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8D%B3%E6%97%B6%E7%BB%93%E6%B8%85%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="租赁合同、融资租赁合同：租赁物使用地为合同履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A7%9F%E8%B5%81%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E3%80%81%E8%9E%8D%E8%B5%84%E7%A7%9F%E8%B5%81%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A7%9F%E8%B5%81%E7%89%A9%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="以信息网络方式订立的买卖合同：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A5%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E8%AE%A2%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="通过信息网络交付标的（如虚拟商品、充值、在线视频）：买受人住所地为合同履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E3%80%81%E5%85%85%E5%80%BC%E3%80%81%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%B0%E5%8F%97%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="通过其他方式交付标的（如实物快递）：收货地为合同履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%AE%9E%E7%89%A9%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%92%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%A7%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 法定履行地的判断方法（高频易错点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="✅ 核心方法：结合合同性质，看原告的诉讼请求是要求被告履行合同约定的何种主要义务" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E5%90%88%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%8C%E7%9C%8B%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%98%AF%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%95%E7%A7%8D%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="❌ 绝对误区：不能将违约金、赔偿金等违约责任当成合同主要义务" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%AF%E5%8C%BA%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%B0%86%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E3%80%81%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E9%87%91%E7%AD%89%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%BD%93%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="典型示例：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 花瓶买卖合同（甲卖花瓶给乙，价款20万）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B2%E5%8D%96%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%E7%BB%99%E4%B9%99%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%B7%E6%AC%BE20%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="甲交了花瓶，乙不给钱，甲起诉乙要钱：诉讼请求是给付货币，甲是接收货币方，甲住所地为合同履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%86%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%8D%E7%BB%99%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E8%A6%81%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E8%B4%A7%E5%B8%81%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E6%98%AF%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%A7%E5%B8%81%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="乙给了钱，甲不交花瓶，乙起诉甲要花瓶：诉讼请求是交付其他标的，甲是履行义务方，甲住所地为合同履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B9%99%E7%BB%99%E4%BA%86%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%A4%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%94%B2%E8%A6%81%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E6%98%AF%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="2. 房屋买卖合同（甲卖房子给乙，价款200万）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B2%E5%8D%96%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%E7%BB%99%E4%B9%99%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%B7%E6%AC%BE200%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="甲交了房，乙不给钱，甲起诉乙要钱：诉讼请求是给付货币，甲住所地为合同履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%86%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%8D%E7%BB%99%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E8%A6%81%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E8%B4%A7%E5%B8%81%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="乙给了钱，甲不交房，乙起诉甲要房：诉讼请求是交付不动产，房屋所在地为合同履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B9%99%E7%BB%99%E4%BA%86%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%A4%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%94%B2%E8%A6%81%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="3. 甲公司起诉乙公司要求支付质量不合格的违约金20万：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%88%E6%A0%BC%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%9120%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="违约金不是合同主要义务，乙公司的主要义务是交付货物" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E8%B4%A7%E7%89%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="属于交付其他标的，乙公司是履行义务方，乙公司住所地为合同履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%98%AF%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）其他特殊地域管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 公司诉讼（2012年民诉法新增，高频考点）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%882012%E5%B9%B4%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%EF%BC%8C%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="管辖法院：公司住所地法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="适用范围：公司设立、确认股东资格、分配利润、解散、股东名册记载、请求变更公司登记、股东知情权、公司决议、公司合并分立、增资减资等公司内部纠纷" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%AE%BE%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%81%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%E3%80%81%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E5%88%A9%E6%B6%A6%E3%80%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%95%A3%E3%80%81%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E5%90%8D%E5%86%8C%E8%AE%B0%E8%BD%BD%E3%80%81%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E3%80%81%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E7%9F%A5%E6%83%85%E6%9D%83%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%86%B3%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%86%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%81%E5%A2%9E%E8%B5%84%E5%87%8F%E8%B5%84%E7%AD%89%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="立法理由：方便所有股东参加诉讼，方便法院就地调查公司生产经营状况" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B0%B1%E5%9C%B0%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E7%8A%B6%E5%86%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 保险合同纠纷：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="一般保险合同：被告住所地、保险标的物所在地法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="人身保险合同：被告住所地、被保险人住所地法院（无保险标的物）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="运输工具、运输货物保险合同：被告住所地、运输工具登记注册地、运输目的地、保险事故发生地法院（标的物会动，去掉标的物所在地）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%90%E8%BE%93%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E3%80%81%E8%BF%90%E8%BE%93%E8%B4%A7%E7%89%A9%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E8%BF%90%E8%BE%93%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E8%BF%90%E8%BE%93%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E4%BC%9A%E5%8A%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%BB%E6%8E%89%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 票据纠纷：被告住所地、票据支付地法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 运输合同纠纷：被告住所地、运输始发地、目的地法院（火车票、快递单上必然有这两个地点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%90%E8%BE%93%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%90%E8%BE%93%E5%A7%8B%E5%8F%91%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88%E7%81%AB%E8%BD%A6%E7%A5%A8%E3%80%81%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%92%E5%8D%95%E4%B8%8A%E5%BF%85%E7%84%B6%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%9C%B0%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="5. 运输侵权纠纷：被告住所地、事故发生地、车辆船舶最先到达地、航空器最先降落地法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%90%E8%BE%93%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E8%BD%A6%E8%BE%86%E8%88%B9%E8%88%B6%E6%9C%80%E5%85%88%E5%88%B0%E8%BE%BE%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E8%88%AA%E7%A9%BA%E5%99%A8%E6%9C%80%E5%85%88%E9%99%8D%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="立法理由：方便受害人在就医地起诉（如在甲县山区发生事故，受害人被送到乙县医院治疗，可在乙县起诉）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%B0%B1%E5%8C%BB%E5%9C%B0%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%9C%A8%E7%94%B2%E5%8E%BF%E5%B1%B1%E5%8C%BA%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%E8%A2%AB%E9%80%81%E5%88%B0%E4%B9%99%E5%8E%BF%E5%8C%BB%E9%99%A2%E6%B2%BB%E7%96%97%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E4%B9%99%E5%8E%BF%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="6. 海难救助、共同海损：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B5%B7%E9%9A%BE%E6%95%91%E5%8A%A9%E3%80%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E6%B5%B7%E6%8D%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="✅ 秒杀考点：被告住所地法院没有管辖权（唯一两类被告住所地无管辖权的案件）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%A4%E7%B1%BB%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%97%A0%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="专属管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：法律规定某些特殊案件只能由特定法院管辖，其他法院均无管辖权，当事人也不能通过协议改变" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E6%9F%90%E4%BA%9B%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E7%89%B9%E5%AE%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%9D%87%E6%97%A0%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="三类专属管辖案件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 不动产纠纷：由不动产所在地法院专属管辖（核心考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 港口作业纠纷：由港口所在地法院专属管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B8%AF%E5%8F%A3%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E6%B8%AF%E5%8F%A3%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 遗产继承纠纷：由被继承人死亡时住所地和主要遗产所在地法院专属管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E6%97%B6%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="不动产纠纷的范围（高频易错点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="❌ 错误：只要涉及房子、土地的纠纷都是不动产纠纷" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%E3%80%81%E5%9C%9F%E5%9C%B0%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="✅ 正确：不动产纠纷仅包括两类：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%BB%85%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E4%B8%A4%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 因不动产的权利确认、分割、相邻关系等引起的物权纠纷" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E3%80%81%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E3%80%81%E7%9B%B8%E9%82%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%AD%89%E5%BC%95%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 四类特殊合同纠纷：农村土地承包经营合同纠纷、房屋租赁合同纠纷、建设工程施工合同纠纷、政策性房屋买卖合同纠纷" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%9B%9B%E7%B1%BB%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%9C%E6%9D%91%E5%9C%9F%E5%9C%B0%E6%89%BF%E5%8C%85%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%81%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E7%A7%9F%E8%B5%81%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%81%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%BE%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E6%96%BD%E5%B7%A5%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%81%E6%94%BF%E7%AD%96%E6%80%A7%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="不适用专属管辖的不动产相关合同：普通商品房买卖合同、商铺买卖合同、土地使用权转让合同等（按一般合同纠纷处理）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%9A%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%88%BF%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E3%80%81%E5%95%86%E9%93%BA%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E3%80%81%E5%9C%9F%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%83%E8%BD%AC%E8%AE%A9%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%88%E6%8C%89%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="✅ 解题习惯：做任何管辖题目，第一步先判断是否属于专属管辖，有专属管辖直接适用，无需考虑其他规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E4%B9%A0%E6%83%AF%EF%BC%9A%E5%81%9A%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%E5%85%88%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%80%83%E8%99%91%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="协议管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：双方当事人通过书面协议的方式，自行约定纠纷的管辖法院，从而改变法律规定的特殊地域管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8E%E8%80%8C%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="本质：尊重当事人的意思自治，方便当事人选择对自己最便利的法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%8A%E9%87%8D%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E8%87%AA%E6%B2%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%AF%B9%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%9C%80%E4%BE%BF%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="（一）协议管辖的适用条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 适用范围：仅适用于合同或者其他财产权益纠纷" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="身份关系纠纷（离婚、解除收养）不能协议管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%88%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E3%80%81%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E6%94%B6%E5%85%BB%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="婚姻关系解除后因财产分割发生的纠纷、同居关系财产纠纷，可以协议管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E5%90%8E%E5%9B%A0%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%81%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%85%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 形式要求：必须是书面协议，口头管辖协议无效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%A3%E5%A4%B4%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 联系要求：协议选择的法院必须是与争议有实际联系的地点的法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="法定参考地点：原告住所地、被告住所地、合同签订地、合同履行地、标的物所在地（记忆口诀：两个人+两个合同+一个标的物）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E5%9C%B0%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%88%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E5%8F%A3%E8%AF%80%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA+%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C+%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="4. 禁止性规定：不得违反级别管辖和专属管辖的规定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）重要考点" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 所有财产纠纷均可协议管辖：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%9D%87%E5%8F%AF%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="公司诉讼属于财产纠纷，可以协议管辖（如公司章程中约定公司内部纠纷由大股东住所地法院管辖，协议有效）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%AB%A0%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%94%B1%E5%A4%A7%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 约定多个法院的管辖协议有效：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="当事人约定两个以上与争议有实际联系地点的法院管辖，管辖协议有效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E5%9C%B0%E7%82%B9%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="原告可以选择向其中任何一个法院起诉（选择管辖）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%90%91%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 起诉时不能确定管辖法院的，协议无效：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="有效示例：“因履行本合同发生纠纷，由原告住所地法院管辖”（起诉时原告身份确定，管辖法院明确）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%9B%A0%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%AC%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="无效示例：“因履行本合同发生纠纷，由守约方住所地法院管辖”（起诉时无法确定谁是守约方，管辖法院不明确）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%9B%A0%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%AC%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%88%E7%BA%A6%E6%96%B9%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E8%B0%81%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%88%E7%BA%A6%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="合同纠纷管辖的三步走解题思路（技术流核心）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%E8%B5%B0%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%EF%BC%88%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%B5%81%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="命题特点：命题老师会将专属管辖、协议管辖、法定管辖（被告住所地+合同履行地）揉合在一道题中，设置多个干扰项" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%91%BD%E9%A2%98%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%91%BD%E9%A2%98%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88%E4%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0+%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89%E6%8F%89%E5%90%88%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E9%81%93%E9%A2%98%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="解题步骤（必须严格按顺序）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%EF%BC%88%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%B8%A5%E6%A0%BC%E6%8C%89%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 第一步：找专属管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%BE%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="先判断案件是否属于专属管辖范围，若属于，直接由专属管辖法院管辖，其他规则一律不考虑" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%88%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%8C%E8%8B%A5%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E4%B8%8D%E8%80%83%E8%99%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 第二步：找协议管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%BE%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="若没有专属管辖，再看当事人之间是否有合法有效的管辖协议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%8B%A5%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E7%9C%8B%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%9C%89%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="若有有效管辖协议，按协议确定管辖法院，无需考虑法定管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%8B%A5%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%80%83%E8%99%91%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 第三步：适用法定管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="若没有专属管辖也没有有效协议管辖，进入法定管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%8B%A5%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%B9%9F%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="先拿下被告住所地（永远有管辖权）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%88%E6%8B%BF%E4%B8%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%B0%B8%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="再讨论合同履行地：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="有约定履行地的，以约定履行地为准（合同未实际履行且约定履行地不在一方住所地的除外）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%BA%E5%87%86%EF%BC%88%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%9C%AA%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%94%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%8D%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E7%9A%84%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="没有约定履行地的，按法定规则确定履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="经典模型案例演示（老师讲义例1-例4）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E6%BC%94%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%88%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88%E8%AE%B2%E4%B9%89%E4%BE%8B1-%E4%BE%8B4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 例1（专属管辖优先）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B1%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：A区甲公司与B区乙公司签订合同，约定乙公司将位于C区的厂房出租给甲公司，双方书面协议纠纷由合同签订地D区法院管辖。后乙公司拒不履行，甲公司起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9AA%E5%8C%BA%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%8EB%E5%8C%BA%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%B0%86%E4%BD%8D%E4%BA%8EC%E5%8C%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%82%E6%88%BF%E5%87%BA%E7%A7%9F%E7%BB%99%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%94%B1%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E5%9C%B0D%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E5%90%8E%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="分析：第一步，房屋租赁合同纠纷属于不动产纠纷，由不动产所在地C区法院专属管辖。管辖协议违反专属管辖无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E7%A7%9F%E8%B5%81%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0C%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="答案：C区法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AC%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 例2（协议管辖优先）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B2%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：A区甲公司与B区乙公司签订木材买卖合同，约定在C区交货。后双方书面协议纠纷由合同实际履行地法院管辖。乙公司实际在D区交货，因质量问题甲公司起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9AA%E5%8C%BA%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%8EB%E5%8C%BA%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E6%9C%A8%E6%9D%90%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%9C%A8C%E5%8C%BA%E4%BA%A4%E8%B4%A7%E3%80%82%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%94%B1%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%9C%A8D%E5%8C%BA%E4%BA%A4%E8%B4%A7%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="分析：第一步，无专属管辖。第二步，有有效管辖协议（实际履行地法院），实际履行地为D区。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%BAD%E5%8C%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="答案：D区法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AD%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 例3（合同未实际履行）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B3%EF%BC%88%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%9C%AA%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：A区甲公司与B区乙公司签订木材买卖合同，约定在C区交货。后乙公司拒不履行，甲公司起诉要求交付木材。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9AA%E5%8C%BA%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%8EB%E5%8C%BA%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E6%9C%A8%E6%9D%90%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%9C%A8C%E5%8C%BA%E4%BA%A4%E8%B4%A7%E3%80%82%E5%90%8E%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E6%9C%A8%E6%9D%90%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="分析：第一步，无专属管辖。第二步，无协议管辖。第三步，法定管辖。被告住所地B区有管辖权。合同未实际履行，约定履行地C区不在任何一方住所地，无管辖权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0B%E5%8C%BA%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%9C%AA%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0C%E5%8C%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="答案：B区法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AB%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="4. 例4（有约定履行地且已履行）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B4%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%94%E5%B7%B2%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：A区甲公司与B区乙公司签订家具加工合同，约定在C区加工。乙公司实际在D区完成加工，因质量问题甲公司起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9AA%E5%8C%BA%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%8EB%E5%8C%BA%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E5%AE%B6%E5%85%B7%E5%8A%A0%E5%B7%A5%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%9C%A8C%E5%8C%BA%E5%8A%A0%E5%B7%A5%E3%80%82%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%9C%A8D%E5%8C%BA%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E5%8A%A0%E5%B7%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="分析：第一步，无专属管辖。第二步，无协议管辖。第三步，法定管辖。被告住所地B区有管辖权。有约定履行地C区，且合同已履行，C区有管辖权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0B%E5%8C%BA%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0C%E5%8C%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B7%B2%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8CC%E5%8C%BA%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="答案：B区、C区法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AB%E5%8C%BA%E3%80%81C%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="五、共同管辖与选择管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="共同管辖：两个以上法院对同一案件都有管辖权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="选择管辖：原告可以选择向其中任何一个有管辖权的法院起诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%90%91%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="冲突解决：原告向两个以上有管辖权的法院起诉的，由最先立案的法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%90%91%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E5%85%88%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="处理规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 后立案的法院应当将案件移送给先立案的法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99%E5%85%88%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 先立案的法院不得将案件移送给其他有管辖权的法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%85%88%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="六、裁定管辖（核心重点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AD%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="裁定管辖是指人民法院通过裁定的方式确定纠纷的管辖法院，是对法定管辖的补充和纠正，包括三种类型：移送管辖、指定管辖、管辖权转移。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%98%AF%E6%8C%87%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E5%92%8C%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%81%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="一、移送管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 本质：错误立案的纠错程序（所有规则均围绕此本质展开）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E5%9D%87%E5%9B%B4%E7%BB%95%E6%AD%A4%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E5%B1%95%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 适用范围" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="同级法院之间：纠正错误的地域管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="上下级法院之间：纠正错误的级别管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 核心规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="单方行为：无需受移送法院同意，哪怕受移送法院是上级法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%95%E6%96%B9%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E5%8F%97%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%93%AA%E6%80%95%E5%8F%97%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原理：案件依法本就该由受移送法院管辖，移送是纠错，不是协商" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E6%9C%AC%E5%B0%B1%E8%AF%A5%E7%94%B1%E5%8F%97%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E6%98%AF%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="只能移送一次：受移送法院认为自己没有管辖权的，不得将案件退回移送法院，也不得再自行移送，只能报请自己的上级法院指定管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%80%E5%9B%9E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%86%8D%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%8A%A5%E8%AF%B7%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="共同管辖的移送规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="两个以上法院都有管辖权的案件，由最先立案的法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E5%85%88%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="后立案的法院没有管辖权，应当裁定将案件移送给先立案的法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99%E5%85%88%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="先立案的法院已经取得管辖权，不得将案件移送给其他有管辖权的法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%88%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 辅助理解：移送管辖的唯一目的是纠正立案错误，错了就移，移一次就够，不能反复折腾当事人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%8C%E9%94%99%E4%BA%86%E5%B0%B1%E7%A7%BB%EF%BC%8C%E7%A7%BB%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E5%B0%B1%E5%A4%9F%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%8D%E5%A4%8D%E6%8A%98%E8%85%BE%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、指定管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 概念：在特殊情况下，由上级法院通过裁定指定某一下级法院对具体案件行使管辖权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 适用情形" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="有管辖权的法院因特殊原因不能行使管辖权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%9B%A0%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="自然灾害：如地震导致法院办公场所损毁，无法正常办公" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%81%BE%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E5%9C%B0%E9%9C%87%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8A%9E%E5%85%AC%E5%9C%BA%E6%89%80%E6%8D%9F%E6%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%E5%8A%9E%E5%85%AC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法院作为案件一方当事人：如县法院向新华书店购买图书后拖欠货款，被新华书店起诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E5%8E%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%91%E6%96%B0%E5%8D%8E%E4%B9%A6%E5%BA%97%E8%B4%AD%E4%B9%B0%E5%9B%BE%E4%B9%A6%E5%90%8E%E6%8B%96%E6%AC%A0%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E6%96%B0%E5%8D%8E%E4%B9%A6%E5%BA%97%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="全体法官需要回避：如本院院长被起诉离婚，本院所有法官均为其下属，无法公正审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%A8%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E8%A2%AB%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%9D%87%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%8B%E5%B1%9E%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%85%AC%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="受移送法院认为自己对移送来的案件没有管辖权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%AF%B9%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E6%9D%A5%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="管辖权发生争议，协商解决不成" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="争议类型：包括积极争议（抢着管）和消极争议（都不管）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E7%A7%AF%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%88%E6%8A%A2%E7%9D%80%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%E5%92%8C%E6%B6%88%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%88%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 管辖权争议的处理流程" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="第一步：争议双方法院先自行协商" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%88%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="第二步：协商不成的，逐级报请共同的上级法院指定管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%90%E7%BA%A7%E6%8A%A5%E8%AF%B7%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="跨省争议特殊流程：两家高院先协商，协商不成的，再报请最高人民法院指定管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%B7%A8%E7%9C%81%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%A4%E5%AE%B6%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E5%85%88%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E6%8A%A5%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 辅助理解：指定管辖是解决“没人管”或“抢着管”问题的最终兜底方式。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%98%AF%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E2%80%9C%E6%B2%A1%E4%BA%BA%E7%AE%A1%E2%80%9D%E6%88%96%E2%80%9C%E6%8A%A2%E7%9D%80%E7%AE%A1%E2%80%9D%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%85%9C%E5%BA%95%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、管辖权转移" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 本质：在上下级法院之间对级别管辖的刚性规定进行调整和变通。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%E5%92%8C%E5%8F%98%E9%80%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 适用范围：只能发生在有隶属关系的上下级法院之间。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E9%9A%B6%E5%B1%9E%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 两种转移方向" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="上调性转移：下级法院管辖的案件转移给上级法院审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%B0%83%E6%80%A7%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E7%BB%99%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="转移方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 下级法院报请上级法院同意后转移" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8A%A5%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%90%8E%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 上级法院主动下裁定提审" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E4%B8%8B%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="核心：只要上级法院同意即可" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="下放性转移：上级法院管辖的案件转移给下级法院审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8B%E6%94%BE%E6%80%A7%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E7%BB%99%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="2012年民诉法修改背景：防止上级法院（尤其是中院）通过下放管辖权规避级别管辖，控制案件终审权，逃避高院的二审监督" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E2012%E5%B9%B4%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88%E5%B0%A4%E5%85%B6%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%8B%E6%94%BE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E8%A7%84%E9%81%BF%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%83%E9%81%BF%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="严格限制条件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%A5%E6%A0%BC%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 确有必要（司法解释明确三类情形）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E6%9C%89%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="破产案件中有关债务人的纠纷" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="当事人人数众多，不方便诉讼的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%97%E5%A4%9A%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="最高人民法院确定的其他案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="2. 程序要求：必须在开庭前报请自己的上级法院批准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8A%A5%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="禁止性规定：下级法院不得主动要求上级法院将案件下放给自己审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8B%E6%94%BE%E7%BB%99%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 移送管辖 vs 管辖权转移（必考区分）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%20vs%20%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%BF%85%E8%80%83%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="| 情形 | 性质 | 是否需要同意/批准 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 甲区法院受理后认为本案应由中院管辖，将案件移送中院 | 移送管辖（纠错） | 不需要中院同意 |
| 甲区法院受理后认为本案需要中院审理，报请中院提审 | 管辖权转移（变通） | 需要中院同意 |
| 中院受理后认为本案应由甲区法院管辖，将案件移送甲区法院 | 移送管辖（纠错） | 不需要高院批准 |
| 中院受理后认为本案确有必要由基层法院审理，将案件下放给甲区法院 | 管辖权转移（变通） | 需要高院批准 |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F/%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%94%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E5%BA%94%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%94%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E6%8A%A5%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%98%E9%80%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E5%BA%94%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%94%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%224%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%A1%AE%E6%9C%89%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E7%94%B1%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8B%E6%94%BE%E7%BB%99%E7%94%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%98%E9%80%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="5. 典型案例：某中院院长收受原告500万贿赂，将本应由中院一审的2.5亿元案件下放给辖区基层法院审理，自己作为二审法院控制终审权，规避高院监督。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E6%94%B6%E5%8F%97%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A500%E4%B8%87%E8%B4%BF%E8%B5%82%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E6%9C%AC%E5%BA%94%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%842.5%E4%BA%BF%E5%85%83%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8B%E6%94%BE%E7%BB%99%E8%BE%96%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%84%E9%81%BF%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="七、管辖权异议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%83%E3%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="管辖权异议是指当事人认为受诉法院对案件没有管辖权，而向法院提出的不服管辖的意见或主张。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%98%AF%E6%8C%87%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E6%88%96%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="一、提出主体" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="本案当事人，实践中几乎都是被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E4%B8%AD%E5%87%A0%E4%B9%8E%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="绝对禁止：有独立请求权第三人（有独三）、无独立请求权第三人（无独三）均不得提出管辖权异议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%9D%87%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="辅助理解：第三人是主动“插足”他人已经开始的诉讼的，就像婚姻中的第三者无权要求原配搬家一样，无权对法院的管辖权提出异议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E2%80%9C%E6%8F%92%E8%B6%B3%E2%80%9D%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E5%83%8F%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E8%80%85%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%8E%9F%E9%85%8D%E6%90%AC%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、异议客体" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E5%AE%A2%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="一审民事案件的管辖权，包括级别管辖和地域管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、提出时间" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="提交答辩状期间（被告收到起诉状副本之日起15日内）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E15%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="逾期提出的，人民法院不予审查" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="四、应诉管辖（默示管辖）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E9%BB%98%E7%A4%BA%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 适用条件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="被告在提交答辩状期间未提出管辖权异议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%9C%A8%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="被告应诉答辩（提交答辩状）或者提出反诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%EF%BC%89%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外：违反级别管辖和专属管辖的，不成立应诉管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 法律效力（一旦成立，产生终局性效力）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A6%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%E6%80%A7%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="受诉法院依法取得对案件的管辖权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人之后不得再提出管辖权异议（包括一审后续程序、二审、发回重审、再审程序）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%86%8D%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院不得再移送管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%86%8D%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人不得以“法院没有管辖权”为由提起上诉或申请再审，该上诉/再审理由不成立" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BB%A5%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%88%96%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89/%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="五、管辖权异议的处理与救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 法院审查处理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="异议不成立：裁定驳回管辖权异议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="异议成立：裁定移送有管辖权的法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 救济途径：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="当事人对管辖权异议裁定不服的，可以在10日内向上一级人民法院提起上诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E10%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E5%90%91%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="民事诉讼中可以上诉的裁定只有三个：不予受理、驳回起诉、管辖权异议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%81%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 特殊情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="管辖权异议裁定作出前，原告申请撤回起诉的，人民法院裁定准予撤诉，对管辖权异议不再审查，并在裁定书中一并写明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%86%E4%BA%88%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E5%9C%A8%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E5%86%99%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="被告对驳回管辖权异议裁定不服，不上诉却缺席判决，之后又以“法院无管辖权”为由上诉的，二审法院不予审查" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%AF%B9%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E5%8D%B4%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%88%E4%BB%A5%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%97%A0%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="六、典型真题" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AD%E3%80%81%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 金某诉文某违约金案：文某在法院组织的庭前会议中才提出管辖权异议，且此前已提出反诉。法院对管辖权异议不予审查，继续审理本诉（应诉管辖）和反诉（牵连管辖）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%91%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%89%E6%96%87%E6%9F%90%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%87%E6%9F%90%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E6%AD%A4%E5%89%8D%E5%B7%B2%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%89%E5%92%8C%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E7%89%B5%E8%BF%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 甲诉乙、丙房屋买卖合同案：丙在二审中才提出管辖权异议，二审法院不予审查。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B2%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E3%80%81%E4%B8%99%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%99%E5%9C%A8%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 素文公司诉宇威公司案：宇威公司对一审法院驳回管辖权异议的裁定不服，不上诉却缺席判决，之后上诉主张一审法院无管辖权。二审法院继续审理并依法作出裁判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%B4%A0%E6%96%87%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%AF%89%E5%AE%87%E5%A8%81%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%87%E5%A8%81%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E5%8D%B4%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%97%A0%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="补充：特殊案件的主管与管辖（与实体法融合考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%EF%BC%9A%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、破产法院的集中管辖（与《企业破产法》融合）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%86%E4%B8%AD%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E3%80%8A%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E3%80%8B%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 基础规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="破产案件由债务人住所地人民法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="人民法院受理破产申请后，所有与债务人有关的民事诉讼，均由受理破产申请的法院集中管辖，其他所有管辖规则（一般地域、特殊地域、专属管辖、协议管辖）均不再适用" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%8E%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9D%87%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%9B%86%E4%B8%AD%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E3%80%81%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E3%80%81%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%89%E5%9D%87%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 拓展规则1：受理破产申请前已受理案件的处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%93%E5%B1%95%E8%A7%84%E5%88%991%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%89%8D%E5%B7%B2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="不需要移送管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="程序处理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 裁定诉讼中止，等待债务人的财产管理人接管财产后，诉讼继续进行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%8E%A5%E7%AE%A1%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 已经对债务人财产采取保全措施的，应当解除保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%AF%B9%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 已经进入执行程序的，应当裁定中止执行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 拓展规则2：与管辖权转移的结合" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%93%E5%B1%95%E8%A7%84%E5%88%992%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E5%90%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="受理破产申请的法院是中级以上人民法院的，其集中管辖的案件，可以在报经自己的上级法院批准后，根据管辖权转移规则，将案件转移给辖区内的基层人民法院审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E9%9B%86%E4%B8%AD%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8A%A5%E7%BB%8F%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E7%BB%99%E8%BE%96%E5%8C%BA%E5%86%85%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 拓展规则3：与仲裁协议的关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%93%E5%B1%95%E8%A7%84%E5%88%993%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="集中管辖是管辖规则，其适用前提是案件属于人民法院主管" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%9B%86%E4%B8%AD%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E6%98%AF%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人之间存在合法有效的仲裁协议的，案件不属于人民法院主管，应当根据仲裁协议申请仲裁。集中管辖规则不能对抗仲裁协议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9B%86%E4%B8%AD%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%AF%B9%E6%8A%97%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="5. 典型案例：甲公司与乙公司签订厂房租赁合同，约定因履行合同发生纠纷由D区法院管辖。后乙公司因经营不善被申请破产，由乙公司住所地B区法院受理破产申请。甲公司起诉乙公司追讨租金，由B区法院集中管辖，原协议管辖不再适用。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%8E%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E5%8E%82%E6%88%BF%E7%A7%9F%E8%B5%81%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%9B%A0%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%94%B1D%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E5%90%8E%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%9B%A0%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%96%84%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0B%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%BF%BD%E8%AE%A8%E7%A7%9F%E9%87%91%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1B%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%9B%86%E4%B8%AD%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、有担保合同的主管与管辖（与《民法典担保制度解释》融合，第21条）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E6%9C%89%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E3%80%8A%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E3%80%8B%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88%EF%BC%8C%E7%AC%AC21%E6%9D%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 主管问题（人民法院 vs 仲裁委员会）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20vs%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="核心规则：仲裁协议具有相对性，仅对仲裁协议的双方当事人有约束力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%85%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="处理方式：分别确定，只看纠纷双方当事人之间是否存在仲裁协议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E7%9C%8B%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="双方有仲裁协议：只能申请仲裁，人民法院无管辖权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%97%A0%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="双方无仲裁协议：可以向人民法院起诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%97%A0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%91%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="典型例子：张三（债权人）与李四（债务人）签订借款合同，无仲裁条款；张三与王五（连带责任保证人）签订担保合同，约定因履行担保合同发生纠纷由广州仲裁委员会仲裁。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%88%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%88%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%9B%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8E%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%9B%A0%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%94%B1%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="张三起诉李四：人民法院受理（双方无仲裁协议）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%97%A0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="张三起诉王五：人民法院不受理（双方有仲裁协议）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="张三一并起诉李四和王五：人民法院仅受理对李四的起诉，不受理对王五的起诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%92%8C%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BB%85%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%AF%B9%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%AF%B9%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 管辖问题（人民法院之间，前提是主合同和担保合同均无仲裁条款，属于人民法院主管）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BB%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%92%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%9D%87%E6%97%A0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="核心规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 债权人单独起诉债务人：根据主合同确定管辖法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 债权人单独起诉担保人：根据担保合同确定管辖法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 债权人一并起诉债务人和担保人：根据主合同确定管辖法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E5%92%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="辅助理解：主管解决的是“法院和仲裁委的关系”（两家人，各玩各的）；管辖解决的是“法院内部的关系”（一家人，弟弟听哥哥的，担保合同听主合同的）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%92%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%A4%E5%AE%B6%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%84%E7%8E%A9%E5%90%84%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9B%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%B6%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%9F%E5%BC%9F%E5%90%AC%E5%93%A5%E5%93%A5%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%90%AC%E4%B8%BB%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="典型例子：张三与李四的借款合同约定由A区法院管辖；张三与王五的担保合同约定由B区法院管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%94%B1A%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%9B%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8E%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%94%B1B%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="张三单独起诉李四：A区法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%9AA%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="张三单独起诉王五：B区法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%9AB%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="张三一并起诉李四和王五：A区法院管辖（根据主合同确定）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%92%8C%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%9AA%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%BB%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="主管与管辖全章逻辑总结" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%85%A8%E7%AB%A0%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 一般地域管辖：双方情况一样原告就被告，被告一方特殊被告就原告，前两个例外限身份关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B7%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%B0%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%B0%B1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E9%99%90%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="2. 侵权纠纷：被告住所地+侵权行为地，信息网络侵权结果地包括被侵权人住所地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0+%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%8C%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%9C%B0%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E8%A2%AB%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="3. 合同纠纷：三步走解题思路（专属→协议→法定），法定管辖先拿被告住所地，再看履行地" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%E8%B5%B0%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E2%86%92%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E2%86%92%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%85%88%E6%8B%BF%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E7%9C%8B%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="4. 专属管辖：不动产纠纷包括物权纠纷+四类合同，普通商品房买卖不适用" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7+%E5%9B%9B%E7%B1%BB%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%88%BF%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="5. 协议管辖：仅适用于财产纠纷，书面形式，不违反级别和专属管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="6. 海难救助、共同海损：被告住所地无管辖权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E6%B5%B7%E9%9A%BE%E6%95%91%E5%8A%A9%E3%80%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E6%B5%B7%E6%8D%9F%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%97%A0%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="7. 先主管，再管辖：先确定案件是否属于人民法院主管，再讨论由哪个人民法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%88%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%88%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E7%94%B1%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="8. 管辖的确定顺序：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E8.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="第一步：级别管辖（确定由哪一级法院管）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%94%B1%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="第二步：地域管辖（确定由同一级的哪个法院管）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%94%B1%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%AA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="优先适用：专属管辖 协议管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%20%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="其次适用：特殊地域管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B6%E6%AC%A1%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%9A%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="兜底适用：一般地域管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%9C%E5%BA%95%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="9. 裁定管辖：对法定管辖的补充和纠正" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E9.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E5%92%8C%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="移送管辖：错误立案的纠错程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%9A%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="指定管辖：解决管辖权争议和特殊情况" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E5%92%8C%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="管辖权转移：对级别管辖的变通调整" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E9%80%9A%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="10. 管辖权异议与应诉管辖：当事人的管辖权救济途径和法院管辖权的确认方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E10.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8E%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%E5%92%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题05 当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9805%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、当事人的三个核心概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）诉讼权利能力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 定义：以自己的名义起诉、应诉的资格（解决“能不能当当事人”的问题）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E2%80%9C%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%BD%93%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 享有诉讼权利能力的主体" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="自然人：始于出生，终于死亡。只要活着就有诉讼权利能力，与精神状态、年龄无关" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E5%87%BA%E7%94%9F%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%88%E4%BA%8E%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E3%80%82%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E6%B4%BB%E7%9D%80%E5%B0%B1%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E3%80%81%E5%B9%B4%E9%BE%84%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="易错点：精神病人、未成年人有诉讼权利能力，可以自己的名义起诉应诉，只是没有诉讼行为能力，需要法定代理人代为诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E7%97%85%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E6%9C%AA%E6%88%90%E5%B9%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="法人：始于成立，终于终止（注销为终止标志）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%88%E4%BA%8E%E7%BB%88%E6%AD%A2%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%A8%E9%94%80%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%88%E6%AD%A2%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="其他组织（依法登记并领取营业执照）：始于成立，终于终止" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E5%B9%B6%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%88%E4%BA%8E%E7%BB%88%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 依法登记并领取营业执照的个人独资企业、合伙企业、中外合作企业、外资企业等" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E5%B9%B6%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%8B%AC%E8%B5%84%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E3%80%81%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E3%80%81%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%96%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E3%80%81%E5%A4%96%E8%B5%84%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E7%AD%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 依法设立并领取营业执照的法人分支机构（分公司，子公司本身是独立法人）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%BE%E7%AB%8B%E5%B9%B6%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%EF%BC%88%E5%88%86%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%AD%90%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E6%98%AF%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 依法设立并领取营业执照的商业银行、政策性银行和非银行金融机构的分支机构" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%BE%E7%AB%8B%E5%B9%B6%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%81%E6%94%BF%E7%AD%96%E6%80%A7%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E9%9D%9E%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 典型案例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="甲乙丙合伙开丽都酒楼，仅依法登记未领取营业执照：无诉讼权利能力，告甲乙丙三个合伙人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%99%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E5%BC%80%E4%B8%BD%E9%83%BD%E9%85%92%E6%A5%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%85%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E6%9C%AA%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B2%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%99%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="甲乙丙合伙开丽都酒楼，依法登记并领取营业执照：有诉讼权利能力，告丽都酒楼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%99%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E5%BC%80%E4%B8%BD%E9%83%BD%E9%85%92%E6%A5%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E5%B9%B6%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BD%E9%83%BD%E9%85%92%E6%A5%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="东方商场自行设立乙市分公司，私刻印章营业：分公司无诉讼权利能力，告东方商场" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%B9%E5%95%86%E5%9C%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E8%AE%BE%E7%AB%8B%E4%B9%99%E5%B8%82%E5%88%86%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%8C%E7%A7%81%E5%88%BB%E5%8D%B0%E7%AB%A0%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%86%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%97%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%B9%E5%95%86%E5%9C%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="保险公司分支机构：每天大量当被告，赋予其诉讼权利能力可平衡全国法院诉讼负担" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%EF%BC%9A%E6%AF%8F%E5%A4%A9%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8F%E5%BD%93%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%88%E5%85%B6%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E5%8F%AF%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B4%9F%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）诉讼行为能力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 定义：不仅能以自己的名义起诉应诉，还能亲自参加诉讼、行使权利、履行义务的资格（解决“能不能自己打官司”的问题）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%85%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E8%83%BD%E4%BA%B2%E8%87%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E3%80%81%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E2%80%9C%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%89%93%E5%AE%98%E5%8F%B8%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 主体的诉讼行为能力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法人和其他组织：诉讼行为能力与诉讼权利能力同时产生、同时消灭（始于成立，终于终止）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E5%92%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E3%80%81%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%B6%88%E7%81%AD%EF%BC%88%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%88%E4%BA%8E%E7%BB%88%E6%AD%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="比喻：法人打从娘胎里出来就18岁，同时具有权利能力和行为能力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%AF%94%E5%96%BB%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%93%E4%BB%8E%E5%A8%98%E8%83%8E%E9%87%8C%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%A5%E5%B0%B118%E5%B2%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E5%92%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="自然人：民诉中仅分“有”和“无”两种" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%AD%E4%BB%85%E5%88%86%E2%80%9C%E6%9C%89%E2%80%9D%E5%92%8C%E2%80%9C%E6%97%A0%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="✅ 有诉讼行为能力：民法中的完全民事行为能力人（年满18周岁且精神正常，或16周岁以上以自己劳动收入为主要生活来源）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%B9%B4%E6%BB%A118%E5%91%A8%E5%B2%81%E4%B8%94%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%9616%E5%91%A8%E5%B2%81%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E6%94%B6%E5%85%A5%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="❌ 无诉讼行为能力：民法中的无民事行为能力人、限制民事行为能力人，不能亲自诉讼，必须由法定代理人代为诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E6%97%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BA%B2%E8%87%AA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）当事人适格（正当当事人）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%88%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 定义：针对具体案件，有资格作为本案原告、被告起诉应诉的资格（解决“是不是本案的正确当事人”的问题）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E2%80%9C%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 与诉讼权利能力的关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="诉讼权利能力是抽象的、普遍的资格；当事人适格是具体的、针对个案的资格" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E6%98%AF%E6%8A%BD%E8%B1%A1%E7%9A%84%E3%80%81%E6%99%AE%E9%81%8D%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%9B%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E6%98%AF%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E3%80%81%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%AA%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="有诉讼权利能力不一定是适格当事人；适格当事人一定有诉讼权利能力（诉讼权利能力是当事人适格的基础和前提）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9B%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%92%8C%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 典型对比案例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="左宁欠我10万元：在座同学都有诉讼权利能力，但只有我和左宁是本案适格当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E6%AC%A0%E6%88%9110%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E5%BA%A7%E5%90%8C%E5%AD%A6%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E6%88%91%E5%92%8C%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="松花江污染案：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%BE%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="松花江、太阳岛、鲟鳇鱼：无诉讼权利能力，不能当原告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%BE%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F%E3%80%81%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E5%B2%9B%E3%80%81%E9%B2%9F%E9%B3%87%E9%B1%BC%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%BD%93%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="北大六名师生：有诉讼权利能力，但不是适格当事人（与案件无直接利害关系）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8C%97%E5%A4%A7%E5%85%AD%E5%90%8D%E5%B8%88%E7%94%9F%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%97%A0%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="沿岸受损渔民：有诉讼权利能力，且是适格当事人（侵权受害人）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B2%BF%E5%B2%B8%E5%8F%97%E6%8D%9F%E6%B8%94%E6%B0%91%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E6%98%AF%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="符合条件的环保组织：有诉讼权利能力，且是适格当事人（基于法律规定的公益诉讼起诉权）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E7%8E%AF%E4%BF%9D%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E6%98%AF%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 当事人适格的判断标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：本案所争议的实体法律关系（诉讼标的）的双方当事人，就是适格当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E6%89%80%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%89%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="合同纠纷：实体债权人和债务人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E5%92%8C%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="侵权纠纷：实体受害人和侵权行为人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%E5%92%8C%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="三个例外（虽不是争议实体法律关系的当事人，但依然是适格当事人）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%99%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E4%BE%9D%E7%84%B6%E6%98%AF%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 确认之诉中对诉讼标的享有确认利益的人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%AD%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="常见于消极确认之诉（请求确认不存在某种法律关系）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E4%BA%8E%E6%B6%88%E6%9E%81%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%9F%90%E7%A7%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案例：左宁被妇女和小孩讹诈，起诉请求确认与小孩不存在抚养关系。左宁不是抚养关系的当事人，但因有确认利益（自证清白、摆脱纠纷），是适格原告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E8%A2%AB%E5%A6%87%E5%A5%B3%E5%92%8C%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%A9%E8%AE%B9%E8%AF%88%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8E%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%A9%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%82%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%9B%A0%E6%9C%89%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%EF%BC%88%E8%87%AA%E8%AF%81%E6%B8%85%E7%99%BD%E3%80%81%E6%91%86%E8%84%B1%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="2. 依法或依授权对他人民事法律关系/权利享有管理权的人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E6%88%96%E4%BE%9D%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB/%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="包括：失踪人的财产代管人、遗产管理人、遗嘱执行人、股东代表诉讼中的股东、经作者授权的著作权集体管理组织、为保护死者名誉起诉的死者近亲属" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%B1%E8%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E4%BB%A3%E7%AE%A1%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E3%80%81%E7%BB%8F%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E8%91%97%E4%BD%9C%E6%9D%83%E9%9B%86%E4%BD%93%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E3%80%81%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E6%AD%BB%E8%80%85%E5%90%8D%E8%AA%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%BB%E8%80%85%E8%BF%91%E4%BA%B2%E5%B1%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案例1：张三被宣告失踪，妻子李四为财产代管人。李四发现王五欠张三10万元，李四可以自己的名义起诉王五（李四是适格原告）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B1%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%A2%AB%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E5%A4%B1%E8%B8%AA%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%BB%E5%AD%90%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%BA%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E4%BB%A3%E7%AE%A1%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%AC%A0%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%8910%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%88%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%AF%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案例2：甲公司董事长张三怠于起诉乙公司索要货款，小股东赵六可以自己的名义提起股东代表诉讼（赵六是适格原告）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B2%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%91%A3%E4%BA%8B%E9%95%BF%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E6%80%A0%E4%BA%8E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%B4%A2%E8%A6%81%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%8F%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E8%B5%B5%E5%85%AD%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%89%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%88%E8%B5%B5%E5%85%AD%E6%98%AF%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="3. 公益诉讼中依法有权提起公益诉讼的机关、组织" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E3%80%81%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="案例：化工厂排污污染河流，当地环保组织虽不是侵权受害人，但基于法律规定可以作为原告提起公益诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%96%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E6%8E%92%E6%B1%A1%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E6%B2%B3%E6%B5%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%B0%E7%8E%AF%E4%BF%9D%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E8%99%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、常见的适格当事人（高频考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）个人合伙" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="未依法登记领取营业执照的个人合伙：全体合伙人为共同诉讼人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AA%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%A8%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="依法登记领取营业执照的合伙企业：合伙企业为当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="区分标准：是否依法登记并领取营业执照" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E5%B9%B6%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）个体工商户" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%AA%E4%BD%93%E5%B7%A5%E5%95%86%E6%88%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 判断步骤：第一步先找字号" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%E5%85%88%E6%89%BE%E5%AD%97%E5%8F%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 具体规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="有字号的：以营业执照上登记的字号为当事人，同时注明经营者信息" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%89%E5%AD%97%E5%8F%B7%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7%E4%B8%8A%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%97%E5%8F%B7%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%B3%A8%E6%98%8E%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E8%80%85%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="没有字号的：以经营者为当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%AD%97%E5%8F%B7%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E8%80%85%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="营业执照上登记的经营者与实际经营者不一致的：登记经营者和实际经营者为共同诉讼人（仅适用于无字号的情形）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7%E4%B8%8A%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E8%80%85%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E8%80%85%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E8%80%85%E5%92%8C%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E8%80%85%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%97%A0%E5%AD%97%E5%8F%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 真题示例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="刘某注册个体餐馆，字号“刘大厨私房菜”，张某实际经营。因供货纠纷起诉：有字号，告“刘大厨私房菜”" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E4%B8%AA%E4%BD%93%E9%A4%90%E9%A6%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%AD%97%E5%8F%B7%E2%80%9C%E5%88%98%E5%A4%A7%E5%8E%A8%E7%A7%81%E6%88%BF%E8%8F%9C%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E4%BE%9B%E8%B4%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E5%AD%97%E5%8F%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%91%8A%E2%80%9C%E5%88%98%E5%A4%A7%E5%8E%A8%E7%A7%81%E6%88%BF%E8%8F%9C%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="刘某注册个体餐馆（无字号），张某实际经营。因供货纠纷起诉：无字号，刘某和张某为共同原告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E4%B8%AA%E4%BD%93%E9%A4%90%E9%A6%86%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E5%AD%97%E5%8F%B7%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E4%BE%9B%E8%B4%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E5%AD%97%E5%8F%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E5%92%8C%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）无/限制民事行为能力人致人损害" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E6%97%A0/%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="规则：无/限制民事行为能力人和其监护人为共同被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0/%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E5%92%8C%E5%85%B6%E7%9B%91%E6%8A%A4%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="立法理由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 监护人根据民法典规定承担赔偿责任，是实体赔偿义务人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%9B%91%E6%8A%A4%E4%BA%BA%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 无/限制民事行为能力人本人有财产的，从本人财产中支付赔偿费用，需将其列为被告以便执行中查明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%97%A0/%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8E%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E4%B8%AD%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E5%B0%86%E5%85%B6%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BB%A5%E4%BE%BF%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%E6%9F%A5%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="真题示例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="高中生小赵（侵权时未满18周岁）打伤小张，起诉时小赵已满18周岁：小赵和其监护人老赵为共同被告；小张为原告，其监护人老张为法定代理人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E7%94%9F%E5%B0%8F%E8%B5%B5%EF%BC%88%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%97%B6%E6%9C%AA%E6%BB%A118%E5%91%A8%E5%B2%81%EF%BC%89%E6%89%93%E4%BC%A4%E5%B0%8F%E5%BC%A0%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E5%B0%8F%E8%B5%B5%E5%B7%B2%E6%BB%A118%E5%91%A8%E5%B2%81%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%8F%E8%B5%B5%E5%92%8C%E5%85%B6%E7%9B%91%E6%8A%A4%E4%BA%BA%E8%80%81%E8%B5%B5%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9B%E5%B0%8F%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E7%9B%91%E6%8A%A4%E4%BA%BA%E8%80%81%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%BA%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（四）村委会、居委会和村民小组" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E6%9D%91%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E5%B1%85%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A%E5%92%8C%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E5%B0%8F%E7%BB%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="村委会、居委会：当然可以作为当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%91%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E5%B1%85%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="村民小组：有独立财产的村民小组才能作为当事人（判断标准：有钱没钱）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E5%B0%8F%E7%BB%84%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E5%B0%8F%E7%BB%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E9%92%B1%E6%B2%A1%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（五）挂靠" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="民法典规定：以挂靠形式从事民事活动致人损害，挂靠方和被挂靠方承担连带责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E4%BB%8E%E4%BA%8B%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%E6%96%B9%E5%92%8C%E8%A2%AB%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%E6%96%B9%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="民诉规则：当事人请求挂靠人和被挂靠人依法承担责任的，挂靠人和被挂靠人为共同诉讼人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%E4%BA%BA%E5%92%8C%E8%A2%AB%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%E4%BA%BA%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%E4%BA%BA%E5%92%8C%E8%A2%AB%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="核心要点：权利人有选择权，可以只告挂靠方、只告被挂靠方，或将二者列为共同被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A6%81%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%AA%E5%91%8A%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%E6%96%B9%E3%80%81%E5%8F%AA%E5%91%8A%E8%A2%AB%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E5%B0%86%E4%BA%8C%E8%80%85%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="易错点：不是必须将二者列为共同被告，答案必须体现权利人的选择权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%B0%86%E4%BA%8C%E8%80%85%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（六）法人/其他组织的工作人员执行工作任务致人损害" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AD%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="民法典规定：由法人/其他组织承担赔偿责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="民诉规则：以法人/其他组织为当事人，工作人员不能作为当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="真题示例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="甲公司起诉乙公司索要货款，乙公司称已将货款交给甲公司业务员张三，甲公司称张三无权收款且未交回货款。张三的身份：不能作为共同原告、共同被告或第三人，只能作为证人（排除法解题）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%B4%A2%E8%A6%81%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%A7%B0%E5%B7%B2%E5%B0%86%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%91%98%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%A7%B0%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%E6%94%B6%E6%AC%BE%E4%B8%94%E6%9C%AA%E4%BA%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%82%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E7%9A%84%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E3%80%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%88%96%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（七）企业法人解散注销" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%83%EF%BC%89%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E8%A7%A3%E6%95%A3%E6%B3%A8%E9%94%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="判断标准：以注销为唯一分界点" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E9%94%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%88%86%E7%95%8C%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="注销前：无论处于撤销、清算、破产、宣告破产等任何阶段，只要未注销，法人依然存在，以法人为当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E9%94%80%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E8%AE%BA%E5%A4%84%E4%BA%8E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E3%80%81%E6%B8%85%E7%AE%97%E3%80%81%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E3%80%81%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E6%9C%AA%E6%B3%A8%E9%94%80%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E4%BE%9D%E7%84%B6%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%A5%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="易错点：清算组织、破产管理人不能以自己的名义起诉应诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E6%B8%85%E7%AE%97%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E3%80%81%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="注销后" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E9%94%80%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="依法清算并注销：债权债务消灭，无被告可告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E6%B8%85%E7%AE%97%E5%B9%B6%E6%B3%A8%E9%94%80%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E6%B6%88%E7%81%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%AF%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="未经依法清算即被注销：以该企业法人的股东、出资人、发起人为当事人（有逃避债务嫌疑）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E6%B8%85%E7%AE%97%E5%8D%B3%E8%A2%AB%E6%B3%A8%E9%94%80%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%A5%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E3%80%81%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%8F%91%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E9%80%83%E9%81%BF%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E5%AB%8C%E7%96%91%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（八）提供劳务致人损害" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AB%EF%BC%89%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A1%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="民法典规定：由接受劳务方承担赔偿责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A1%E6%96%B9%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="民诉规则：以接受劳务方为被告，提供劳务方不能作为被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A1%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A1%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（九）劳务派遣" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%9D%EF%BC%89%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A1%E6%B4%BE%E9%81%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="民法典规定：由接受派遣的用工单位承担赔偿责任；派遣单位有过错的，承担相应责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E6%B4%BE%E9%81%A3%E7%9A%84%E7%94%A8%E5%B7%A5%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9B%E6%B4%BE%E9%81%A3%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="民诉规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 用工单位必须作为被告（一定要承担责任）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%94%A8%E5%B7%A5%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E8%A6%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 派遣单位是否作为被告：视权利人主张而定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B4%BE%E9%81%A3%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%86%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%8C%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="权利人主张派遣单位承担责任：派遣单位和用工单位为共同被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%B4%BE%E9%81%A3%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9A%E6%B4%BE%E9%81%A3%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E5%92%8C%E7%94%A8%E5%B7%A5%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="权利人未主张派遣单位承担责任：仅以用工单位为被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%B4%BE%E9%81%A3%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%A8%E5%B7%A5%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="核心要点：答案中必须出现用工单位，派遣单位可有可无" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A6%81%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E7%94%A8%E5%B7%A5%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%8C%E6%B4%BE%E9%81%A3%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E5%8F%AF%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%AF%E6%97%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（十）担保法律关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%81%EF%BC%89%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 连带保证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="权利人有选择权：可以只告债务人、只告保证人，或将二者列为共同被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%AA%E5%91%8A%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%8F%AA%E5%91%8A%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E5%B0%86%E4%BA%8C%E8%80%85%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 一般保证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="可以只告债务人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%AA%E5%91%8A%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="不能只告保证人（法院必须追加债务人为共同被告，以保障保证人的先诉抗辩权）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%AA%E5%91%8A%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%85%88%E8%AF%89%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="可以将债务人和保证人列为共同被告，但判决必须明确执行顺序（先执行债务人财产）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%B0%86%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E5%92%8C%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E5%85%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（十一）侵害死者权益" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E6%AD%BB%E8%80%85%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="对侵害死者遗体、遗骨、姓名、荣誉、肖像、隐私等行为提起诉讼的，死者的近亲属为当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E6%AD%BB%E8%80%85%E9%81%97%E4%BD%93%E3%80%81%E9%81%97%E9%AA%A8%E3%80%81%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D%E3%80%81%E8%8D%A3%E8%AA%89%E3%80%81%E8%82%96%E5%83%8F%E3%80%81%E9%9A%90%E7%A7%81%E7%AD%89%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%AD%BB%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%91%E4%BA%B2%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、结合民法典判断适格当事人（通用方法）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E7%BB%93%E5%90%88%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）基本原理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="当事人适格的判断原则是“争议实体法律关系的双方当事人”，因此民法典规定的实体赔偿义务人，就是民事诉讼中的适格被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）民法典责任规定的三种类型及对应当事人确定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%8A%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 单独责任：民法典规定“由A承担责任”" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B1A%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="民诉规则：仅以A为被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E4%BB%A5A%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="示例：法人工作人员执行职务致人损害，由法人承担责任→告法人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%81%8C%E5%8A%A1%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E2%86%92%E5%91%8A%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 连带责任：民法典规定“由A和B承担连带责任”" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B1A%E5%92%8CB%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="民诉规则：权利人有选择权，可以只告A、只告B，或将A和B列为共同被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%AA%E5%91%8AA%E3%80%81%E5%8F%AA%E5%91%8AB%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E5%B0%86A%E5%92%8CB%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="示例：挂靠致人损害，挂靠方和被挂靠方承担连带责任→权利人可选择告谁" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%E6%96%B9%E5%92%8C%E8%A2%AB%E6%8C%82%E9%9D%A0%E6%96%B9%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E2%86%92%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%91%8A%E8%B0%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 补充/相应责任：民法典规定“由A承担责任，B有过错的承担补充/相应责任”" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85/%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B1A%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8CB%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85/%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="民诉规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. A必须作为被告（一定要承担责任）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E8%A6%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. B是否作为被告：视权利人主张而定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20B%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%8C%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="权利人主张B承担责任：A和B为共同被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0B%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9AA%E5%92%8CB%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="权利人未主张B承担责任：仅以A为被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0B%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E4%BB%A5A%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="示例：第三人在酒店侵权，由侵权人承担责任，酒店未尽安全保障义务的承担补充责任→侵权人必为被告，酒店是否为被告看权利人主张" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E9%85%92%E5%BA%97%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E9%85%92%E5%BA%97%E6%9C%AA%E5%B0%BD%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E2%86%92%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E5%BF%85%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E9%85%92%E5%BA%97%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%9C%8B%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）递进式案例演示" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E9%80%92%E8%BF%9B%E5%BC%8F%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E6%BC%94%E7%A4%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 基础版：左宁在丽都酒楼吃饭，被顾客李佳不小心泼热汤烫伤" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E7%89%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%BD%E9%83%BD%E9%85%92%E6%A5%BC%E5%90%83%E9%A5%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E9%A1%BE%E5%AE%A2%E6%9D%8E%E4%BD%B3%E4%B8%8D%E5%B0%8F%E5%BF%83%E6%B3%BC%E7%83%AD%E6%B1%A4%E7%83%AB%E4%BC%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="民法典规定：由侵权人李佳承担责任，丽都酒楼未尽安全保障义务的承担补充责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%8E%E4%BD%B3%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BD%E9%83%BD%E9%85%92%E6%A5%BC%E6%9C%AA%E5%B0%BD%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人确定：李佳必为被告；丽都酒楼是否为被告看左宁是否主张" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%8E%E4%BD%B3%E5%BF%85%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9B%E4%B8%BD%E9%83%BD%E9%85%92%E6%A5%BC%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%9C%8B%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 进阶版：李佳是精神病人（无民事行为能力人）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9B%E9%98%B6%E7%89%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%8E%E4%BD%B3%E6%98%AF%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E7%97%85%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="增加规则：无民事行为能力人致人损害，本人和监护人为共同被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E5%92%8C%E7%9B%91%E6%8A%A4%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人确定：李佳和其监护人戴鹏必为共同被告；丽都酒楼是否为被告看左宁是否主张" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%8E%E4%BD%B3%E5%92%8C%E5%85%B6%E7%9B%91%E6%8A%A4%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%B4%E9%B9%8F%E5%BF%85%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9B%E4%B8%BD%E9%83%BD%E9%85%92%E6%A5%BC%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%9C%8B%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 高阶版：左宁也是精神病人（无民事行为能力人）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%AB%98%E9%98%B6%E7%89%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E7%97%85%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="增加规则：无民事行为能力人有诉讼权利能力，是适格原告，但无诉讼行为能力，需法定代理人代为诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%97%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人确定：原告为左宁，其妻子高高为法定代理人；被告为李佳和戴鹏（必列），丽都酒楼（可选）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BA%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E5%A6%BB%E5%AD%90%E9%AB%98%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%BA%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9B%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BA%E6%9D%8E%E4%BD%B3%E5%92%8C%E6%88%B4%E9%B9%8F%EF%BC%88%E5%BF%85%E5%88%97%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BD%E9%83%BD%E9%85%92%E6%A5%BC%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、当事人变更" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）法定变更（基于法律规定）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 自然人死亡" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="诉讼中一方当事人死亡，其民事权利义务发生继承的，由继承人继续诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外：民事权利义务具有人身专属性的（如离婚诉讼），诉讼终结" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 法人/其他组织合并、分立" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E3%80%81%E5%88%86%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="由合并、分立后的法人/其他组织承担原当事人的诉讼权利义务，继续进行诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B1%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E3%80%81%E5%88%86%E7%AB%8B%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E5%8E%9F%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）意定变更（基于当事人意思表示，主要指诉讼中债权债务转让）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%84%8F%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E6%8C%87%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E8%BD%AC%E8%AE%A9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 当事人恒定主义（司法解释的技术性处理）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%81%92%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%BB%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%A7%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="诉讼中债权债务转让的，依然由原债权人、债务人继续进行诉讼，法院所作判决直接对受让人发生法律效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E8%BD%AC%E8%AE%A9%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%9D%E7%84%B6%E7%94%B1%E5%8E%9F%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%80%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%AF%B9%E5%8F%97%E8%AE%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="立法目的：避免官司打到一半驳回起诉、重新起诉，浪费司法资源" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E5%AE%98%E5%8F%B8%E6%89%93%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%80%E5%8D%8A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%B5%AA%E8%B4%B9%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 受让人的程序权利保障" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E8%AE%A9%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="受让人可以申请以无独立请求权第三人的身份参加诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%97%E8%AE%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="受让人可以向法院申请替代原债权人的诉讼地位参加诉讼，由法院根据案件情况决定是否准许" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%97%E8%AE%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9B%BF%E4%BB%A3%E5%8E%9F%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="法院准许：受让人成为新原告，原债权人退出诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E8%AE%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E6%96%B0%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法院不准许：追加受让人为无独立请求权第三人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E5%8F%97%E8%AE%A9%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 真题示例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="陈某诉刘某借款纠纷，诉讼中陈某将债权转让给谢某" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%99%88%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%89%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%88%E6%9F%90%E5%B0%86%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E8%BD%AC%E8%AE%A9%E7%BB%99%E8%B0%A2%E6%9F%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="正确选项：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 陈某作为原告可以申请撤诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E9%99%88%E6%9F%90%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 谢某可以申请以无独三身份参加诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%B0%A2%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%A5%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 谢某可以申请替代陈某的诉讼地位，法院根据情况决定是否准许" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E8%B0%A2%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%9B%BF%E4%BB%A3%E9%99%88%E6%9F%90%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="4. 法院不准许谢某替代的，可以追加谢某为无独三" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E8%B0%A2%E6%9F%90%E6%9B%BF%E4%BB%A3%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E8%B0%A2%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题06 共同诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9806%20%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、共同诉讼概述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="定义：一方或者双方当事人为两人以上，共同进行诉讼的制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%A4%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="本质：为提高诉讼效率、避免矛盾判决，将多个相关联的诉合并审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BA%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E3%80%81%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E7%9F%9B%E7%9B%BE%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="分类：普通共同诉讼、必要共同诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、普通共同诉讼 vs 必要共同诉讼（核心区分）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%20vs%20%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）核心区分标准：诉讼标的的个数" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="普通共同诉讼：诉讼标的同种类（存在两个以上独立的诉讼标的）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E7%A7%8D%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="必要共同诉讼：诉讼标的同一（只有一个诉讼标的）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）本质与审理要求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="普通共同诉讼：本质是若干独立可分之诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%8B%A5%E5%B9%B2%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E5%8F%AF%E5%88%86%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="审理要求：为提高诉讼效率，经当事人同意可以合并审理，也可以分开审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BA%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%8F%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%88%86%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="必要共同诉讼：本质是一个不可分之诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%88%86%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="审理要求：法院必须合并审理、合一判决，不得分开审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%81%E5%90%88%E4%B8%80%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%88%86%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）经典区分案例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 大巴车系列案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E8%BD%A6%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="旅游公司大巴车发生交通事故，40名乘客起诉旅游公司赔偿：40个独立的侵权/违约法律关系→普通共同诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%97%85%E6%B8%B8%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E8%BD%A6%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%EF%BC%8C40%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%98%E5%AE%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%85%E6%B8%B8%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%EF%BC%9A40%E4%B8%AA%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83/%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="40名乘客共同将大巴车抬下悬崖，旅游公司起诉40名乘客赔偿：1个共同侵权法律关系→必要共同诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E40%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%98%E5%AE%A2%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%B0%86%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E8%BD%A6%E6%8A%AC%E4%B8%8B%E6%82%AC%E5%B4%96%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%85%E6%B8%B8%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%8940%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%98%E5%AE%A2%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%EF%BC%9A1%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 打人vs名誉侵权案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%93%E4%BA%BAvs%E5%90%8D%E8%AA%89%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="我和李佳共同打伤左宁：1个共同侵权法律关系→必要共同诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%91%E5%92%8C%E6%9D%8E%E4%BD%B3%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E6%89%93%E4%BC%A4%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%EF%BC%9A1%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="我和李佳共同起诉左宁名誉侵权：2个独立的名誉侵权法律关系→普通共同诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%91%E5%92%8C%E6%9D%8E%E4%BD%B3%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E5%90%8D%E8%AA%89%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%9A2%E4%B8%AA%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E8%AA%89%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 连带保证案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="甲公司起诉债务人张三和连带保证人李四：1个借款担保法律关系→必要共同诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%92%8C%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%9A1%E4%B8%AA%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（四）简单判断方法：看“赔几份”" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%9A%E7%9C%8B%E2%80%9C%E8%B5%94%E5%87%A0%E4%BB%BD%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="普通共同诉讼：加起来赔多份（如旅游公司给40名乘客每人赔一份）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E5%8A%A0%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%E8%B5%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%9A%E4%BB%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%97%85%E6%B8%B8%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%BB%9940%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%98%E5%AE%A2%E6%AF%8F%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%94%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%BD%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="必要共同诉讼：加起来赔一份（如40名乘客加起来赔一辆大巴车）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E5%8A%A0%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%E8%B5%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%8240%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%98%E5%AE%A2%E5%8A%A0%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%E8%B5%94%E4%B8%80%E8%BE%86%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E8%BD%A6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（五）共同诉讼人的内部关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="普通共同诉讼：相互独立，互不干扰（你打你的，我打我的，一人的行为对其他人不生效）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B8%E4%BA%92%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BD%A0%E6%89%93%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E6%89%93%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="必要共同诉讼：一人行为经其他共同诉讼人同意，对其他人生效（凡事商量着来）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%87%A1%E4%BA%8B%E5%95%86%E9%87%8F%E7%9D%80%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、常考的必要共同诉讼人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E5%B8%B8%E8%80%83%E7%9A%84%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）追索赡养费案件（高频考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="规则：应当将所有赡养义务人作为共同被告，一个都不能少" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%B0%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="立法理由：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 赡养老人是所有子女不可分割的共同义务，只要老人未得到完全赡养，所有子女都视为未尽赡养义务" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E8%80%81%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%AF%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E8%80%81%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AA%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%BD%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%AA%E5%B0%BD%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 表面是老人与子女的矛盾，实质往往是子女之间的矛盾（如偏心问题），追加所有子女才能一次性解决纠纷" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%A1%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%98%AF%E8%80%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8E%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%9F%9B%E7%9B%BE%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E5%BE%80%E5%BE%80%E6%98%AF%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E7%9F%9B%E7%9B%BE%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%81%8F%E5%BF%83%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="典型案例：张老头有四个儿子，老大出力、老二出钱、老三老四不管。张老头只起诉老三张丙要赡养费→法院必须追加老大张甲、老二张乙、老四张丁为共同被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%B4%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E5%84%BF%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%81%E5%A4%A7%E5%87%BA%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%87%BA%E9%92%B1%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E4%B8%89%E8%80%81%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%8D%E7%AE%A1%E3%80%82%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%B4%E5%8F%AA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%80%81%E4%B8%89%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%99%E8%A6%81%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%E2%86%92%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%A7%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%81%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）遗产继承纠纷（高频考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="规则：部分继承人起诉的，人民法院应当通知其他继承人作为共同原告参加诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="被通知的继承人不愿参加诉讼又不明确表示放弃实体权利的：仍列为共同原告，不到庭不影响案件审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%84%BF%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8F%88%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8D%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="被通知的继承人明确表示放弃实体权利的：不再列为当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="典型案例：张老头去世，老大张甲起诉老二张乙争遗产" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%B4%E5%8E%BB%E4%B8%96%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%81%E5%A4%A7%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E4%BA%89%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="老三张丙：不愿参加诉讼，但不放弃继承权→列为共同原告，其陈述为当事人陈述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%81%E4%B8%89%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%99%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%84%BF%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E6%9D%83%E2%86%92%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="老四张丁：不愿参加诉讼，明确放弃继承权→不列为当事人，其陈述为证人证言" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%81%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%84%BF%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E6%9D%83%E2%86%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、代表人诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）概述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：一方或者双方当事人人数众多（10人以上），由人数众多的一方当事人推举2-5名代表人，代表本方当事人进行诉讼的制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%97%E5%A4%9A%EF%BC%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E10%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%97%E5%A4%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8E%A8%E4%B8%BE2-5%E5%90%8D%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E6%9C%AC%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="本质：共同诉讼的延伸（人数进一步增多，无法全部到庭参加诉讼）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E8%BF%9B%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%E5%A2%9E%E5%A4%9A%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="代表人数量：2-5人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E2-5%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）代表人的诉讼权利（核心考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="一般诉讼行为（如申请回避、提出管辖权异议、申请证据保全、同意在线开庭等）：直接对所代表的当事人生效，无需经被代表人同意" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E3%80%81%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%81%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E7%BB%8F%E8%A2%AB%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="处分实体权利的行为（承认、放弃、变更诉讼请求，进行和解、调解等）：必须经被代表人同意，谁同意对谁生效，谁不同意对谁不生效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E3%80%81%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E3%80%81%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E8%A2%AB%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%AF%B9%E8%B0%81%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%AF%B9%E8%B0%81%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）经典真题解析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 在线开庭同意权案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E6%9D%83%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="案情：甲公司起诉20名债务人，20名债务人推选罗某、胡某为代表人。法院拟采取在线方式开庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%8920%E5%90%8D%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C20%E5%90%8D%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%89%E7%BD%97%E6%9F%90%E3%80%81%E8%83%A1%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8B%9F%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="考点：同意在线开庭是一般程序性行为，代表人同意即对全体被代表人生效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%8D%B3%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%A8%E4%BD%93%E8%A2%AB%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="正确选项：A. 必须经甲公司同意后，可以对甲公司在线开庭；C. 必须经罗某、胡某同意后，对被告方在线开庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%9AA.%20%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%9BC.%20%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E7%BD%97%E6%9F%90%E3%80%81%E8%83%A1%E6%9F%90%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%96%B9%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 调解不同意案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="案情：100多名消费者起诉成发公司，诉讼中原告选定彭某、张某为诉讼代表人。彭某、张某与成发公司达成调解协议，多数消费者同意，甲不同意调解坚持要求判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A100%E5%A4%9A%E5%90%8D%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E8%80%85%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%88%90%E5%8F%91%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E9%80%89%E5%AE%9A%E5%BD%AD%E6%9F%90%E3%80%81%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%E5%BD%AD%E6%9F%90%E3%80%81%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%8E%E6%88%90%E5%8F%91%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E8%80%85%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%9D%9A%E6%8C%81%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="考点：调解涉及处分实体权利，必须经被代表人同意，不同意的对其不生效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E8%A2%AB%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="正确选项：D. 法院应当制作调解书，但调解书对甲不生效，对甲继续审理并作出判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%9AD.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%B2%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（四）代表人诉讼的分类" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 人数确定的代表人诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="定义：起诉时人数众多的一方当事人人数已经确定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%97%E5%A4%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="性质：既可以是普通共同诉讼，也可以是必要共同诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%98%AF%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%98%AF%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="代表人的产生方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 全体当事人推选共同的代表人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%85%A8%E4%BD%93%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%89%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 部分当事人推选自己的代表人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%89%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="选不出代表人的处理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="普通共同诉讼：另行起诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="必要共同诉讼：亲自参加诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%B2%E8%87%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 人数不确定的代表人诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8D%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="定义：起诉时人数众多的一方当事人人数尚未确定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%97%E5%A4%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E5%B0%9A%E6%9C%AA%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="性质：只能是普通共同诉讼（必要共同诉讼必须一次性解决，被告不明确不符合起诉条件）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="特殊程序：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 确定权利范围：法院确定可能受到损害的权利人范围" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%97%E5%88%B0%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 发布公告：敦促潜在权利人向法院登记权利（公告期不少于30日）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%95%A6%E4%BF%83%E6%BD%9C%E5%9C%A8%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%8D%E5%B0%91%E4%BA%8E30%E6%97%A5%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 登记权利：权利人在公告期内向法院登记权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%E5%86%85%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="4. 确定代表人：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="第一步：参加登记的权利人推选代表人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%89%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="第二步：推选不出的，法院提出人选与当事人协商" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%89%E4%B8%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="第三步：协商不成的，法院指定代表人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="5. 审理与判决：代表人代表参加登记的权利人进行诉讼，法院作出判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="判决效力：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="对所有参加登记的权利人具有直接约束力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="对未参加登记的权利人：可以另行起诉，法院经审理认为其诉讼请求成立的，裁定适用已作出的判决（判决具有预决效力）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B6%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%B7%B2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E9%A2%84%E5%86%B3%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="五、证券纠纷特别代表人诉讼（《证券法》规定）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%88%E3%80%8A%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B8%E6%B3%95%E3%80%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）普通人数不确定代表人诉讼的痛点" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8D%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E7%97%9B%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 代表人由普通投资者担任，人力、物力、财力无法与上市公司抗衡，维权能力不足" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B1%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%BA%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%81%E7%89%A9%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%81%E8%B4%A2%E5%8A%9B%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8A%97%E8%A1%A1%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%B4%E6%9D%83%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 中小投资者维权成本高（需主动登记、参与推选等），往往因损失小而放弃维权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%AD%E5%B0%8F%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E7%BB%B4%E6%9D%83%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E9%AB%98%EF%BC%88%E9%9C%80%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E3%80%81%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%89%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BE%80%E5%BE%80%E5%9B%A0%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E5%B0%8F%E8%80%8C%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E7%BB%B4%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）特别代表人诉讼的核心制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="代表人：由投资者保护机构（如投资者服务中心、投保基金公司）担任（受50名以上投资者委托）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E3%80%81%E6%8A%95%E4%BF%9D%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%89%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%9750%E5%90%8D%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="加入方式：默示加入，明示退出（投资者只要不主动声明退出，即视为同意由投资者保护机构代表其参加诉讼）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%BB%98%E7%A4%BA%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%8E%E7%A4%BA%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E7%94%B1%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E5%85%B6%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="权利登记：投资者保护机构直接向证券登记结算机构调取权利人名单，为所有未声明退出的投资者登记权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%90%91%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B8%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%BB%93%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E8%B0%83%E5%8F%96%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8D%E5%8D%95%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%AA%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="判决效力：对所有未声明退出的投资者具有直接约束力；声明退出的投资者可以另行起诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9B%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）典型真题解析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="案情：甲公司是一家上市公司，在公报中虚构业绩导致大量投资者损失，共有5808名投资者受到损害。某证券投资保护基金公司受易某等80名投资者委托担任特别代表人，郭某一人声明退出。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E5%85%AC%E6%8A%A5%E4%B8%AD%E8%99%9A%E6%9E%84%E4%B8%9A%E7%BB%A9%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8F%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B1%E6%9C%895808%E5%90%8D%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E5%8F%97%E5%88%B0%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E3%80%82%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B8%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%8F%97%E6%98%93%E6%9F%90%E7%AD%8980%E5%90%8D%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%AD%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="正确选项：B. 如果代表人胜诉，判决约束除郭某外的5807名投资者" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%9AB.%20%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%83%9C%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E9%99%A4%E9%83%AD%E6%9F%90%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%845807%E5%90%8D%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="六、本专题核心考点复盘" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AD%E3%80%81%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E5%A4%8D%E7%9B%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 普通共同诉讼vs必要共同诉讼：看诉讼标的个数（多个vs一个），或看赔几份（多份vs一份）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BCvs%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E7%9C%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AAvs%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E7%9C%8B%E8%B5%94%E5%87%A0%E4%BB%BD%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E4%BB%BDvs%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%BD%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="2. 追索赡养费：必须追加所有赡养义务人为共同被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="3. 遗产继承：不放弃实体权利的继承人必须列为共同原告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="4. 代表人诉讼：一般程序性行为代表人说了算，处分实体权利必须经被代表人同意" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%B4%E4%BA%86%E7%AE%97%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E8%A2%AB%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="5. 人数确定的代表人诉讼：选不出代表人的，普通共同诉讼另行起诉，必要共同诉讼亲自参加" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%B2%E8%87%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="6. 人数不确定的代表人诉讼：只能是普通共同诉讼，判决对参加登记的人生效，未登记的另行起诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8D%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%AF%B9%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AA%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="7. 证券特别代表人诉讼：投资者保护机构担任代表人，默示加入、明示退出" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B8%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%98%E7%A4%BA%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%E3%80%81%E6%98%8E%E7%A4%BA%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题07 第三人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9807%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、第三人概述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="定义：对原被告之间争议的诉讼标的有独立请求权，或者虽无独立请求权但与案件处理结果有法律上的利害关系，而参加到原被告已经开始的诉讼中的人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E8%99%BD%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%E4%BD%86%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%9C%89%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E5%88%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="分类：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 有独立请求权第三人（有独三）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 无独立请求权第三人（无独三）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、有独立请求权第三人（有独三）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）概念与参诉理由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%82%E8%AF%89%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="概念：对本诉当事人所争议的诉讼标的有独立的请求权，为维护自己权利而参加诉讼的人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%80%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E8%80%8C%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="参诉理由：认为原被告的权利主张侵犯了自己的权利，将原告和被告一并作为被告，提起独立的诉讼请求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%82%E8%AF%89%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%BE%B5%E7%8A%AF%E4%BA%86%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%92%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="本质：有独三提起了一个独立的诉（有独三之诉），与原被告之间的本诉是两个相互独立的诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E7%9B%B8%E4%BA%92%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）经典案例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 耕牛买卖案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%80%95%E7%89%9B%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="案情：张三将牛租给李四，李四擅自将牛卖给王五，王五起诉李四要求交付耕牛。诉讼中张三主张牛是自己的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%86%E7%89%9B%E7%A7%9F%E7%BB%99%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%93%85%E8%87%AA%E5%B0%86%E7%89%9B%E5%8D%96%E7%BB%99%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%8C%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E8%80%95%E7%89%9B%E3%80%82%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%89%9B%E6%98%AF%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="分析：本诉是王五与李四之间的买卖合同关系，张三不是该买卖合同的当事人，基于独立的所有权主张权利→有独三" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E6%98%AF%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%A5%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 房屋买卖案（易混点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%88%E6%98%93%E6%B7%B7%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="案情：张老头去世，留有房屋一套，有两个儿子张甲、张乙。张甲瞒着张乙将房屋卖给李四，后因合同纠纷张甲起诉李四。诉讼中张乙闻讯赶回，主张房屋权利，坚决不同意卖房。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%B4%E5%8E%BB%E4%B8%96%EF%BC%8C%E7%95%99%E6%9C%89%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E4%B8%80%E5%A5%97%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%84%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E3%80%81%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E3%80%82%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E7%9E%92%E7%9D%80%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E5%B0%86%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E5%8D%96%E7%BB%99%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8E%E5%9B%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%82%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E9%97%BB%E8%AE%AF%E8%B5%B6%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E5%9D%9A%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%8D%96%E6%88%BF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="分析：本诉是张甲与李四之间的买卖合同关系，张乙不是该买卖合同的当事人，基于独立的继承权主张权利→有独三" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E6%98%AF%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%A5%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="易混对比：张甲、张乙共有一辆汽车，李四将车砸坏，张甲起诉李四赔偿。诉讼中张乙主张权利→张乙是侵权法律关系的当事人→共同原告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%93%E6%B7%B7%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E3%80%81%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E5%85%B1%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E8%BE%86%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%B0%86%E8%BD%A6%E7%A0%B8%E5%9D%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E2%86%92%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E6%98%AF%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）有独三之诉的独立性" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="本诉与有独三之诉相互独立，一个诉的效力不影响另一个诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E7%9B%B8%E4%BA%92%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="具体体现：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 原告申请撤回本诉的，法院准许后，有独三之诉继续进行（有独三作为原告，本诉原被告作为被告）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 原告经传票传唤无正当理由拒不到庭的：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%BB%8F%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="本诉中：原告不到庭→按撤诉处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%89%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="有独三之诉中：本诉原告是被告→缺席判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%98%AF%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（四）参诉方式与时间" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%82%E8%AF%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%8E%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 参诉方式：只能以起诉的方式参加诉讼，法院不得依职权追加有独三" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%82%E8%AF%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 参诉时间：案件受理后，法庭辩论终结前" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%82%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 二审中参诉的处理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%82%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="二审中，有独三可以参加诉讼，但二审法院只能调解，不能判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="调解不成的，撤销原判，发回重审" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="原理：若二审直接判决，对有独三之诉而言相当于一审终审，剥夺其上诉权；若告知另行起诉，可能会出现两个相互冲突的生效判决（如一个判归原告，一个判归有独三）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%8B%A5%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%80%8C%E8%A8%80%E7%9B%B8%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%89%A5%E5%A4%BA%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%9B%E8%8B%A5%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E4%BC%9A%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E7%9B%B8%E4%BA%92%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%88%A4%E5%BD%92%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%88%A4%E5%BD%92%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、无独立请求权第三人（无独三）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="对原被告所争议的诉讼标的没有独立请求权，但与案件处理结果存在法律上的利害关系，为维护自己利益而参加诉讼的人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%89%80%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E8%80%8C%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）经典案例（区分共同被告与无独三）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%88%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8E%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="矿泉水侵权vs违约案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9F%BF%E6%B3%89%E6%B0%B4%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83vs%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 我起诉超市侵权：本诉是我与超市之间的侵权法律关系。厂家生产了不合格矿泉水，也是侵权人，是侵权法律关系的当事人→共同被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%88%91%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E6%98%AF%E6%88%91%E4%B8%8E%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%82%E5%8E%82%E5%AE%B6%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%88%E6%A0%BC%E7%9F%BF%E6%B3%89%E6%B0%B4%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 我起诉超市违约：本诉是我与超市之间的买卖合同关系。基于合同相对性，厂家不是该买卖合同的当事人，但案件处理结果与厂家有法律上的利害关系（超市败诉后会向厂家追偿）→无独三" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%88%91%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E6%98%AF%E6%88%91%E4%B8%8E%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%82%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%82%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%A5%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%82%E5%AE%B6%E6%9C%89%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%E5%90%8E%E4%BC%9A%E5%90%91%E5%8E%82%E5%AE%B6%E8%BF%BD%E5%81%BF%EF%BC%89%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）一招制敌：共同原被告vs有独三无独三的区分方法" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%80%E6%8B%9B%E5%88%B6%E6%95%8C%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8Avs%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 核心方法" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 第一步：找到案件的原告和被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 第二步：找到原被告之间的法律关系（诉讼标的）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 第三步：将第三人代入该法律关系中检验：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A3%E5%85%A5%E8%AF%A5%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%B8%AD%E6%A3%80%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="✅ 套得进去，是该法律关系的一方当事人→共同原告/共同被告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E5%A5%97%E5%BE%97%E8%BF%9B%E5%8E%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%A5%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A/%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="❌ 套不进去，不是该法律关系的一方当事人→有独三/无独三（再根据是否有独立请求权区分）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E5%A5%97%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%9B%E5%8E%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%A5%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89/%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%86%8D%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 方法验证（多案例）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 遗产继承案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：张老头去世，有四个儿子张甲、张乙、张丙、张丁。张甲起诉张乙争遗产（法定继承）。法院通知张丙、张丁参加诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%B4%E5%8E%BB%E4%B8%96%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E5%84%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E3%80%81%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E3%80%81%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%99%E3%80%81%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%81%E3%80%82%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E4%BA%89%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%99%E3%80%81%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%81%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="张丙基于法定继承主张权利：是法定继承法律关系的当事人→共同原告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%99%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%9A%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="张丁拿出遗嘱，主张房屋归自己一人所有（基于遗嘱继承）：不是法定继承法律关系的当事人→有独三" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%81%E6%8B%BF%E5%87%BA%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E5%BD%92%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%EF%BC%88%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 耕牛买卖案：王五诉李四交付耕牛（买卖合同关系），张三主张牛是自己的→张三不是买卖合同当事人→有独三" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%80%95%E7%89%9B%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E8%80%95%E7%89%9B%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%89%9B%E6%98%AF%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E2%86%92%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 汽车侵权案：张甲诉李四赔偿砸车损失（侵权法律关系），张乙主张共有权→张乙是侵权法律关系当事人→共同原告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E7%A0%B8%E8%BD%A6%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%88%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%85%B1%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E2%86%92%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E6%98%AF%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E2%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 理论基础" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="当事人适格的判断原则：原则上，本案所争议的实体法律关系的双方当事人，就是适格当事人。因此，只有是争议法律关系的当事人，才能成为共同原告或共同被告；否则只能是第三人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E6%89%80%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%88%96%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9B%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（四）无独三的参诉方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%82%E8%AF%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="可以自己申请参加诉讼，也可以由法院依职权追加参加诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="对比：有独三只能以起诉方式参加，法院不得追加" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%A5%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（五）无独三的诉讼权利（高频考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 绝对不能享有的权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="不能提出管辖权异议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="不能放弃、变更诉讼请求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E3%80%81%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="不能申请撤诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="原理：无独三没有自己独立的诉讼请求，上述权利的行使以享有诉讼请求为前提" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%BA%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="陷阱题：“无独三不能承认、放弃、变更诉讼请求”→❌ 无独三可以承认对方的诉讼请求（如厂家作为无独三可以承认原告的赔偿请求）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B1%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E3%80%81%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E3%80%81%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E2%80%9D%E2%86%92%E2%9D%8C%20%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%8E%82%E5%AE%B6%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 附条件享有的权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E9%99%84%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="上诉权：一审判决判决无独三承担责任的，无独三有权上诉；判决不承担责任的，无独三无权上诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9B%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="签收调解书的权利：调解书需要无独三承担义务的，必须经无独三签收后才生效；不需要其承担义务的，无需其签收" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E5%90%8E%E6%89%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%9B%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B6%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E5%85%B6%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="核心：权利的享有以是否承担责任/义务为条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB/%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、第三人撤销之诉（入门）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="本该作为有独三或无独三参加诉讼的人，因不能归责于本人的事由未参加诉讼，但有证据证明发生法律效力的判决、裁定、调解书的部分或者全部内容错误，损害其民事权益的，可以自知道或者应当知道其民事权益受到损害之日起六个月内，向作出该生效判决、裁定、调解书的人民法院提起诉讼，请求撤销或者改变原生效裁判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%88%96%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%BD%92%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8E%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%8C%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E5%85%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E5%8F%97%E5%88%B0%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AD%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%AF%A5%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）核心要点" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A6%81%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 性质：形成之诉（变更之诉）（原告的诉讼请求是撤销或改变原生效裁判所确立的权利义务关系）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%98%AF%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%88%96%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%89%80%E7%A1%AE%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 审理程序：法院适用一审普通程序审理，所作判决是一审判决，当事人不服的可以上诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 管辖法院：由作出该生效裁判的人民法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%AF%A5%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="示例：我告超市违约，白云区法院一审，广州中院二审维持原判。厂家该做无独三但未参加诉讼，要提第三人撤销之诉→向广州中院提起（生效判决是中院作出的，下级法院不能改上级法院的判决）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%91%E5%91%8A%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%EF%BC%8C%E7%99%BD%E4%BA%91%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%E5%8E%82%E5%AE%B6%E8%AF%A5%E5%81%9A%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BD%86%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%8F%90%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E2%86%92%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%EF%BC%88%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="本专题核心考点复盘" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E5%A4%8D%E7%9B%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 有独三：对诉讼标的有独立请求权，以起诉方式参加，是独立的诉，本诉撤诉不影响有独三之诉，二审参诉只能调解，调解不成发回重审" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%8F%82%E8%AF%89%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="2. 无独三：与案件处理结果有法律上的利害关系，可以申请或法院追加参加，不能提管辖权异议、不能放弃变更诉讼请求、不能撤诉，判决承担责任的可以上诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%9C%89%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%88%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="3. 区分方法：先找原被告之间的法律关系，第三人是该法律关系当事人的是共同原被告，否则是有独三无独三" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%88%E6%89%BE%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%A5%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="4. 第三人撤销之诉：本该做有独三无独三的人未参加诉讼，6个月内向作出生效裁判的法院起诉，是形成之诉，适用一审普通程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%A5%E5%81%9A%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C6%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E5%86%85%E5%90%91%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题08 诉讼代理人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9808%20%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、诉讼代理人概述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="定义：根据法律规定或当事人委托，代理当事人进行诉讼活动的人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E6%88%96%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="分类：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 法定代理人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 委托代理人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、法定代理人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）基本概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：根据法律规定代理无诉讼行为能力的当事人进行诉讼活动的人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="被代理人范围：无民事行为能力人、限制民事行为能力人（均无诉讼行为能力）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%9D%87%E6%97%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="代理权来源：法律直接规定，无需当事人授权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="代理权限：全权代理，有权代理当事人实施所有诉讼行为，其所为诉讼行为与当事人所为诉讼行为效力相同" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%A8%E6%9D%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BD%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E6%89%80%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%80%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）法定代理人与当事人的区别（核心考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 诉讼地位不同" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="诉讼中只能以当事人的名义起诉、应诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法定代理人不能以自己的名义起诉、应诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 事件效力不同" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法定代理人所为诉讼行为与当事人所为诉讼行为效力相同" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%80%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%80%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="发生在法定代理人身上的事件与发生在当事人身上的事件效力不同：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%9C%A8%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="当事人死亡：可能导致诉讼终止、当事人变更甚至诉讼终结" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%88%E6%AD%A2%E3%80%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E7%94%9A%E8%87%B3%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法定代理人死亡：不影响诉讼进行，更换法定代理人后诉讼继续" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 判决针对对象不同" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院判决仅针对当事人，不针对法定代理人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%BB%85%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、委托代理人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）基本概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：根据当事人、法定代表人或法定代理人的委托，代为进行诉讼活动的人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="被代理人要求：必须有诉讼行为能力（否则无法进行授权）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="代理权来源：当事人的委托授权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）授权方式（核心考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="分为一般授权和特别授权两种" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="1. 一般授权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="只要当事人出具委托授权书，委托代理人即可代为行使的权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%85%B7%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="主要包括：代为起诉、应诉、提交证据、申请回避、申请财产保全、签收一般诉讼文书等程序性权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E3%80%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%81%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%AD%89%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 特别授权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="不仅需要出具委托授权书，还必须在委托授权书中明确具体授予的权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%85%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%87%BA%E5%85%B7%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%9C%A8%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%8E%88%E4%BA%88%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="必须特别授权的权利（均涉及处分当事人实体权利）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%88%E5%9D%87%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="代为承认、放弃、变更诉讼请求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E3%80%81%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E3%80%81%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="代为和解、调解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="代为上诉、反诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 常考陷阱" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B8%B8%E8%80%83%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="委托授权书中仅写“全权代理”“特别授权”等字样，而没有具体列明授权内容的，视为一般授权，委托代理人不得行使上述需要特别授权的权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%E4%BB%85%E5%86%99%E2%80%9C%E5%85%A8%E6%9D%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E2%80%9D%E2%80%9C%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E2%80%9D%E7%AD%89%E5%AD%97%E6%A0%B7%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E5%88%97%E6%98%8E%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）代理阶段" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="委托授权书中未明确载明代理阶段的，视为代理权限仅适用于一审、二审诉讼程序，不包括执行程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%BD%BD%E6%98%8E%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="若要授予代理人执行阶段的代理权，必须在委托授权书中明确予以说明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%8B%A5%E8%A6%81%E6%8E%88%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%9C%A8%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（四）真题示例解析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="案情：张某委托李律师代为诉讼，委托授权书中明确载明“可以代为调解”。李律师可以代为实施下列哪些行为？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%9D%8E%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%BD%BD%E6%98%8E%E2%80%9C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%E6%9D%8E%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BD%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E5%93%AA%E4%BA%9B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="分析：张某对李律师的授权是“一般授权 + 调解事项的特别授权”" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E5%AF%B9%E6%9D%8E%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E7%9A%84%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%20+%20%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%E7%9A%84%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="选项：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="A. 签署调解协议：✅ 有调解的特别授权，可以代为调解并签署调解协议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%9A%E2%9C%85%20%E6%9C%89%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%B9%B6%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="B. 签收调解书：✅ 一般授权即可签收一般诉讼文书，但调解书因涉及实体权利生效，需有调解的特别授权，本案符合条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%9A%E2%9C%85%20%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%9B%A0%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="C. 参加法院组织的调解并发表意见：✅ 属于调解授权范围内的行为" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E7%9A%84%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E8%A1%A8%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%9A%E2%9C%85%20%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%86%85%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="D. 申请法院执行调解书：❌ 委托授权书未明确授予执行阶段代理权，代理权限仅限于诉讼阶段" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%9A%E2%9D%8C%20%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%A6%E6%9C%AA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%8E%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E4%BB%85%E9%99%90%E4%BA%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="答案：ABC" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AABC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（五）委托代理的法律后果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 在法律规定和授权范围内，代理人的诉讼行为直接对被代理的当事人生效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%92%8C%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%86%85%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%AF%B9%E8%A2%AB%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 出庭规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="一般规则：当事人委托了代理人后，本人可以不再出庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BA%86%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外：离婚诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="离婚诉讼中，即使委托了代理人，本人也必须亲自到庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E4%BD%BF%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BA%86%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%9F%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BA%B2%E8%87%AA%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="例外的例外：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 本人不能正确表达意志的，可以不出庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E6%84%8F%E5%BF%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 本人确有特殊困难不能到庭的，必须向法庭提交书面意见" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E6%9C%89%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%9B%B0%E9%9A%BE%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="立法理由：离婚涉及身份关系的解除，必须由当事人本人亲自表达真实意愿，代理人无法代为决定是否离婚" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%B2%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%84%8F%E6%84%BF%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="本专题核心考点复盘" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E5%A4%8D%E7%9B%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 法定代理人：仅代理无诉讼行为能力人，全权代理，以当事人名义诉讼，判决针对当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%97%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%A8%E6%9D%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8D%E4%B9%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="2. 委托代理人：授权分为一般授权和特别授权，处分实体权利必须特别授权，“全权代理”视为一般授权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E5%88%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E5%92%8C%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E2%80%9C%E5%85%A8%E6%9D%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E2%80%9D%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="3. 代理阶段：未明确说明的，不包括执行阶段" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="4. 出庭规则：一般有代理人本人可不出庭，离婚诉讼除外（不能正确表达或有困难提交书面意见的除外）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%96%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%B0%E9%9A%BE%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E7%9A%84%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题09 证明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9809%20%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、证明的三个核心概念与逻辑关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）三个基本概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 证明对象：哪些事实需要证据证明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%93%AA%E4%BA%9B%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 证明责任：应当由谁来提供证据证明该事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E8%B0%81%E6%9D%A5%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%AF%A5%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 证明标准：承担证明责任的人需要将事实证明到何种程度，法院才会采信" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B0%86%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%95%E7%A7%8D%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%8D%E4%BC%9A%E9%87%87%E4%BF%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）逻辑联系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="证明对象是证明责任的基础，证明责任是证明标准的基础" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="先确定某事实是证明对象，再讨论由谁承担证明责任，最后讨论需要证明到什么程度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%88%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%9F%90%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E7%94%B1%E8%B0%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%88%B0%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、证明对象" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）基本逻辑" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则上，所有案件事实都需要证据证明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E9%83%BD%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="从反面规定免证事实：不需要证据证明，不证自明的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%8E%E5%8F%8D%E9%9D%A2%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%AF%81%E8%87%AA%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="免证事实之外的所有事实，都属于证明对象，需要证据证明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）七类免证事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%83%E7%B1%BB%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 自然规律和定理、定律" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E8%A7%84%E5%BE%8B%E5%92%8C%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86%E3%80%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="特点：绝对免证，不允许反驳和推翻" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%E5%92%8C%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例子：太阳东升西落、两点之间线段最短、相对论" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%B8%9C%E5%8D%87%E8%A5%BF%E8%90%BD%E3%80%81%E4%B8%A4%E7%82%B9%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%BA%BF%E6%AE%B5%E6%9C%80%E7%9F%AD%E3%80%81%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="辅助理解：自然规律和定理是经过科学验证的客观真理，人类无法推翻" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E8%A7%84%E5%BE%8B%E5%92%8C%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%BA%E7%B1%BB%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 众所周知的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BC%97%E6%89%80%E5%91%A8%E7%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="特点：一定范围内为人们共同知晓的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%86%85%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%9F%A5%E6%99%93%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例子：广州市是广东省省会、北京是中国首都" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E5%B8%82%E6%98%AF%E5%B9%BF%E4%B8%9C%E7%9C%81%E7%9C%81%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%A6%96%E9%83%BD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="效力：可以用相反证据反驳" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 根据法律规定推定的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="特点：基于法律规定，从基础事实直接推导出结论事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8E%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8E%A8%E5%AF%BC%E5%87%BA%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例子：著作权法规定“在作品上署名的人推定为作者”" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E8%91%97%E4%BD%9C%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%9C%A8%E4%BD%9C%E5%93%81%E4%B8%8A%E7%BD%B2%E5%90%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="效力：可以用相反证据反驳" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 根据已知事实和日常生活经验法则推定的另一事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%B7%B2%E7%9F%A5%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%92%8C%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="考点：经验法则的分类" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="✅ 日常生活领域的经验法则：免证，法官作为普通人也知晓" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%9F%E7%9F%A5%E6%99%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="例子：客厅挂着黑白遗照推定照片上的人已去世" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A2%E5%8E%85%E6%8C%82%E7%9D%80%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E9%81%97%E7%85%A7%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%B2%E5%8E%BB%E4%B8%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="❌ 专业领域的经验法则：不免证，需要证据证明（法官不是专业人士）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%A3%AB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="例子：青霉素本身不会导致人体过敏、医学报告中“边界清晰”一般指良性肿瘤" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%89%E7%B4%A0%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%93%E8%BF%87%E6%95%8F%E3%80%81%E5%8C%BB%E5%AD%A6%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%AD%E2%80%9C%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C%E6%B8%85%E6%99%B0%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8C%87%E8%89%AF%E6%80%A7%E8%82%BF%E7%98%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="效力：可以用相反证据反驳" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="5. 已为仲裁机构生效裁决所确认的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B7%B2%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E6%89%80%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="6. 已为人民法院生效裁判所确认的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B7%B2%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%89%80%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="7. 已为有效公证文书所证明的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B7%B2%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E6%89%80%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="上述三类统称为预决事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A2%84%E5%86%B3%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="效力：可以用相反证据推翻" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）反驳 vs 推翻（核心区别）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%20vs%20%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="| 区别点 | 反驳 | 推翻 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 适用对象 | 众所周知的事实、法律推定的事实、日常生活经验法则推定的事实 | 预决事实（仲裁裁决、法院裁判、公证文书确认的事实） |
| 证明要求 | 只需让法官对原事实产生怀疑，内心确信动摇即可 | 不仅要让法官怀疑原事实，还要让法官相信相反事实成立 |
| 难度 | 较低 | 很高 |
| 结果 | 法院不再采信原事实 | 法院不再采信原事实，转而采信相反事实 |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BC%97%E6%89%80%E5%91%A8%E7%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E9%A2%84%E5%86%B3%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E9%9C%80%E8%AE%A9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%AF%B9%E5%8E%9F%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E6%80%80%E7%96%91%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%85%E5%BF%83%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%8A%A8%E6%91%87%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%85%E8%A6%81%E8%AE%A9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E6%80%80%E7%96%91%E5%8E%9F%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E8%A6%81%E8%AE%A9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E7%9B%B8%E4%BF%A1%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E9%9A%BE%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%BE%83%E4%BD%8E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%BE%88%E9%AB%98%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%224%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E9%87%87%E4%BF%A1%E5%8E%9F%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E9%87%87%E4%BF%A1%E5%8E%9F%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E8%BD%AC%E8%80%8C%E9%87%87%E4%BF%A1%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="自认制度（每年必考，绝对重点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%88%E6%AF%8F%E5%B9%B4%E5%BF%85%E8%80%83%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="在诉讼中，对于对方主张的于己不利的事实，明确表示承认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%8E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8E%E5%B7%B1%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法律效果：对于自认的事实，对方当事人无需举证证明，法院直接认定该事实成立" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%8E%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%A5%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）自认的场合（只有以下三个场合的承认才构成自认）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%BA%E5%90%88%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E5%9C%BA%E5%90%88%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E6%89%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 庭审过程中" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 法院组织的证据交换、调查、询问过程中" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%81%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 当事人向法院提交的起诉状、答辩状、代理词等书面材料中" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E3%80%81%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E3%80%81%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E8%AF%8D%E7%AD%89%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="❌ 庭外承认不构成自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E5%BA%AD%E5%A4%96%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="例子：开庭前一晚左宁承认欠我10万元、休庭后在洗手间左宁承认欠我10万元，均不构成自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%80%E6%99%9A%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E6%AC%A0%E6%88%9110%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E3%80%81%E4%BC%91%E5%BA%AD%E5%90%8E%E5%9C%A8%E6%B4%97%E6%89%8B%E9%97%B4%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E6%AC%A0%E6%88%9110%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%9D%87%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）自认的效果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="仅导致对方主张的事实直接得以认定，并不当然导致自认人败诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%85%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%BE%97%E4%BB%A5%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B9%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="自认人仍可以提出其他抗辩（如时效抗辩、已经履行的抗辩等）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%8D%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%E3%80%81%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）自认 vs 认诺（核心区别）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%20vs%20%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="| 区别点 | 自认 | 认诺 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 承认对象 | 对方主张的事实 | 对方提出的诉讼请求 |
| 法律效果 | 对方无需举证证明该事实 | 对方的诉讼请求直接成立，认诺人败诉 |
| 例子 | 李四承认借了张三10万元 | 李四同意归还张三10万元 |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%BA%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%3Cb%3E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%3Cb%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%AF%A5%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%BA%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E5%80%9F%E4%BA%86%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%8910%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%8910%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（五）自认的范围（哪些事实不能自认）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E5%93%AA%E4%BA%9B%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院应当依职权调查的事实，不允许自认，包括三类：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 涉及国家利益、社会公共利益、第三人合法权益的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 涉及身份关系的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 涉及依职权追加当事人、中止诉讼、终结诉讼、回避等程序性事项" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%AD%89%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="易错点：身份关系案件中并非所有事实都不能自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%AD%E5%B9%B6%E9%9D%9E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="❌ 不能自认：与身份本身有关的事实（如婚姻关系是否有效、亲子关系是否存在）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E3%80%81%E4%BA%B2%E5%AD%90%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="✅ 可以自认：与身份无关的事实（如离婚诉讼中的出轨事实、家庭暴力事实、财产转移事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BA%E8%BD%A8%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E6%9A%B4%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="典型案例：王某起诉马某离婚" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E9%A9%AC%E6%9F%90%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="马某说“我同意离婚”：认诺（承认诉讼请求），不是自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%A9%AC%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%B4%E2%80%9C%E6%88%91%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%9A%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="马某说“我承认有出轨行为”：自认（与身份无关的事实），构成自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%A9%AC%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%B4%E2%80%9C%E6%88%91%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E6%9C%89%E5%87%BA%E8%BD%A8%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="马某说“儿子王小某是我和宋某生的”：不构成自认（亲子关系是身份关系事实，法院必须依职权查清）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%A9%AC%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%B4%E2%80%9C%E5%84%BF%E5%AD%90%E7%8E%8B%E5%B0%8F%E6%9F%90%E6%98%AF%E6%88%91%E5%92%8C%E5%AE%8B%E6%9F%90%E7%94%9F%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%B2%E5%AD%90%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%AF%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%B8%85%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（六）自认的方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AD%EF%BC%89%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 明示自认：明确表示承认（如“借了”“打了”）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%8E%E7%A4%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E2%80%9C%E5%80%9F%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9D%E2%80%9C%E6%89%93%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 默示自认：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%BB%98%E7%A4%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="对一方陈述的事实，另一方既不承认也不否认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%97%A2%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%A6%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="经审判人员说明并询问后，仍不明确表示肯定或否定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E5%B9%B6%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8D%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E8%82%AF%E5%AE%9A%E6%88%96%E5%90%A6%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法律效果：视为对该事实的自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%A5%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 委托代理人的自认（高频考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="✅ 委托代理人（无论一般授权还是特别授权）都可以代为自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E8%AE%BA%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%89%E9%83%BD%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="❌ 一般授权的委托代理人只是不能代为认诺（承认诉讼请求）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="当事人反对委托代理人自认的两种方法：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 在委托授权书中明确排除其代为自认的权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9C%A8%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 在委托代理人承认的当场明确予以反对" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%9C%A8%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（七）共同诉讼中的自认（绝对重点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%83%EF%BC%89%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%88%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 普通共同诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="特点：共同诉讼人之间相互独立" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9B%B8%E4%BA%92%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="自认规则：自认相互独立，部分共同诉讼人的承认仅对作出承认的人构成自认，对其他共同诉讼人不生效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9B%B8%E4%BA%92%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 必要共同诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="特点：只有一个诉讼标的，事实必须统一认定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%80%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="自认规则：一票否决制" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E7%A5%A8%E5%90%A6%E5%86%B3%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="部分共同诉讼人承认，其他共同诉讼人有一人明确反对的，对所有人都不构成自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="部分共同诉讼人承认，其他共同诉讼人都不反对的，对所有人都构成自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%BD%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="通俗理解：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%97%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="普通共同诉讼：我和李佳一起逛街，他买东西跟我没关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%91%E5%92%8C%E6%9D%8E%E4%BD%B3%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7%E9%80%9B%E8%A1%97%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%96%E4%B9%B0%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%E8%B7%9F%E6%88%91%E6%B2%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="必要共同诉讼：我和老婆一起逛街，我想买东西，老婆说不准买，我就不能买" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%91%E5%92%8C%E8%80%81%E5%A9%86%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7%E9%80%9B%E8%A1%97%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E6%83%B3%E4%B9%B0%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%81%E5%A9%86%E8%AF%B4%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%86%E4%B9%B0%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%B9%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="真题示例1（连带保证案）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B1%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：张某向刘某借款60万，黄某为连带保证人。刘某起诉张某、黄某要求归还本金60万及利息。开庭时张某承认存在利息约定，黄某自始至终主张不存在利息约定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E5%90%91%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE60%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BA%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E3%80%81%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%9160%E4%B8%87%E5%8F%8A%E5%88%A9%E6%81%AF%E3%80%82%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E6%97%B6%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%88%A9%E6%81%AF%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%88%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%88%A9%E6%81%AF%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="考点：必要共同诉讼中，黄某明确反对，张某的承认不构成自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="结论：利息事实真伪不明，由主张利息存在的刘某承担不利后果，推定利息不存在，张某、黄某对剩余54万本金承担连带责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A9%E6%81%AF%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%AA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%88%A9%E6%81%AF%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E5%88%A9%E6%81%AF%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E3%80%81%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E5%AF%B9%E5%89%A9%E4%BD%9954%E4%B8%87%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%91%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="真题示例2（食品质量案）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B2%EF%BC%88%E9%A3%9F%E5%93%81%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：张某在向某经营的食品店购买食品后认为存在质量问题，起诉向某赔偿。向某申请追加生产商甲公司为共同被告。甲公司在庭前答辩状中承认产品确实存在问题，庭审时主张答辩状是之前律师写的，内容不属实。向某自始至终说自己对情况不了解。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E5%9C%A8%E5%90%91%E6%9F%90%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E7%9A%84%E9%A3%9F%E5%93%81%E5%BA%97%E8%B4%AD%E4%B9%B0%E9%A3%9F%E5%93%81%E5%90%8E%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%90%91%E6%9F%90%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82%E5%90%91%E6%9F%90%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E5%95%86%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E3%80%82%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%9C%A8%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9E%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E6%98%AF%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%8D%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E5%86%99%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%82%E5%90%91%E6%9F%90%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%88%E8%AF%B4%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%AF%B9%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="考点：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 答辩状中的承认构成自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 委托代理人的自认视为当事人的自认，当事人未当场反对的，自认有效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AA%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%BA%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="3. 必要共同诉讼中，向某未明确反对，甲公司的自认对向某也构成自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E6%9F%90%E6%9C%AA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E5%AF%B9%E5%90%91%E6%9F%90%E4%B9%9F%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="结论：甲公司的承认构成自认，产品质量问题直接认定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（八）限制的自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AB%EF%BC%89%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 部分自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="对对方主张的事实，承认其中一部分，否认其他部分" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E8%AE%A4%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="规则：对承认的部分构成自认，对否认的部分不构成自认，对方仍需对否认部分举证证明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E5%90%A6%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%BB%8D%E9%9C%80%E5%AF%B9%E5%90%A6%E8%AE%A4%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="例子：张三起诉李四归还借款10万，李四说“我只借了8万”，对8万构成自认，张三需对剩余2万举证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE10%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%AF%B4%E2%80%9C%E6%88%91%E5%8F%AA%E5%80%9F%E4%BA%868%E4%B8%87%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B98%E4%B8%87%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E9%9C%80%E5%AF%B9%E5%89%A9%E4%BD%992%E4%B8%87%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 附条件自认（难点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%99%84%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%88%E9%9A%BE%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="对对方主张的事实明确承认，但附加一个条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E9%99%84%E5%8A%A0%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="核心规则：防止断章取义，关键看承认的事实与所附条件是否基于同一法律关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E6%96%AD%E7%AB%A0%E5%8F%96%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E7%9C%8B%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8E%E6%89%80%E9%99%84%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="✅ 基于同一法律关系：表达的是一个完整意思，必须统一认定（要么事实和条件都成立，要么都不成立）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%9A%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%80%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%88%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%92%8C%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E9%83%BD%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%88%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="❌ 基于不同法律关系：表达的是两个独立意思，可以分别认定（承认事实构成自认，所附条件另行处理）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%9A%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E9%99%84%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="典型案例1（同一法律关系）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B1%EF%BC%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：张三起诉李四归还借款10万，没有借条。李四说“我借了，但这钱我已经还了”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE10%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E3%80%82%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%AF%B4%E2%80%9C%E6%88%91%E5%80%9F%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E8%BF%99%E9%92%B1%E6%88%91%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%98%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="分析：“借了”和“还了”都基于同一借款法律关系，是一个完整意思" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%80%9F%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9D%E5%92%8C%E2%80%9C%E8%BF%98%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9D%E9%83%BD%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="错误逻辑：断章取义，认定“借了”构成自认，“还了”由李四举证，判决李四再还10万（会导致冤假错案）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%AD%E7%AB%A0%E5%8F%96%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%80%9F%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E2%80%9C%E8%BF%98%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9D%E7%94%B1%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%86%8D%E8%BF%9810%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%88%E4%BC%9A%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E5%86%A4%E5%81%87%E9%94%99%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="正确逻辑：统一认定，要么认定借了且还了（驳回原告诉讼请求），要么认定没借（驳回原告诉讼请求）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%80%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%88%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E5%80%9F%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%94%E8%BF%98%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%88%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%88%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E6%B2%A1%E5%80%9F%EF%BC%88%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="典型案例2（不同法律关系）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B2%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：张三起诉李四归还借款10万。李四说“我借了，但张三曾经欠我10万货款”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE10%E4%B8%87%E3%80%82%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%AF%B4%E2%80%9C%E6%88%91%E5%80%9F%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E6%9B%BE%E7%BB%8F%E6%AC%A0%E6%88%9110%E4%B8%87%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="分析：“借了”基于借款法律关系，“欠货款”基于买卖合同法律关系，是两个独立意思" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%80%9F%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9D%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E2%80%9C%E6%AC%A0%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%E2%80%9D%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="处理：“借了”构成自认，认定借款事实成立；“欠货款”是另一法律关系，李四另行起诉主张" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%80%9F%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%9B%E2%80%9C%E6%AC%A0%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%E2%80%9D%E6%98%AF%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（九）自认的撤销" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%9D%EF%BC%89%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="撤销条件（满足其一即可，实践中几乎不可能）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%80%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E4%B8%AD%E5%87%A0%E4%B9%8E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 经对方当事人同意" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%8F%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 有证据证明自认是在受胁迫或者重大误解情况下作出的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E6%98%AF%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E8%83%81%E8%BF%AB%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E8%AF%AF%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%8B%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="时间限制：必须在法庭辩论终结前提出" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（十）调解、和解中的自认不产生效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%81%EF%BC%89%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%81%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="规则：在诉讼中，当事人为了达成调解协议或者和解目的作出的妥协而认可的事实，不得在其后的诉讼中作为对其不利的根据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%A6%A5%E5%8D%8F%E8%80%8C%E8%AE%A4%E5%8F%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%9C%A8%E5%85%B6%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="立法目的：消除当事人调解的后顾之忧，促进纠纷解决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E6%B6%88%E9%99%A4%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8E%E9%A1%BE%E4%B9%8B%E5%BF%A7%EF%BC%8C%E4%BF%83%E8%BF%9B%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="✅ 做题技巧：只要看到“法院依法组织调解……但未能达成调解协议”，直接将调解过程中所有承认的事实全部划掉，视为从未发生过" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E5%81%9A%E9%A2%98%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E7%9C%8B%E5%88%B0%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E2%80%A6%E2%80%A6%E4%BD%86%E6%9C%AA%E8%83%BD%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%B0%86%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E5%88%92%E6%8E%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%8E%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E8%BF%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="真题示例：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：郭某诉张某财产损害一案，法院进行庭前调解，张某承认对郭某财产造成损害，但在赔偿数额上无法达成协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E9%83%AD%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%89%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E4%B8%80%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E5%AF%B9%E9%83%AD%E6%9F%90%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%9C%A8%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E6%95%B0%E9%A2%9D%E4%B8%8A%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="处理：调解中的承认不构成自认，郭某仍需对张某造成损害的事实举证证明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%AD%E6%9F%90%E4%BB%8D%E9%9C%80%E5%AF%B9%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="答案：C" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="本专题核心考点复盘" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E5%A4%8D%E7%9B%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 免证事实共七类，只有自然规律和定理不能反驳推翻，其他可以反驳或推翻" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%85%B1%E4%B8%83%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E8%A7%84%E5%BE%8B%E5%92%8C%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%E6%88%96%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 自认仅适用于诉讼中的三个场合，庭外承认不构成自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E5%9C%BA%E5%90%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%AD%E5%A4%96%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 自认是承认事实，认诺是承认诉讼请求，自认不当然导致败诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E6%98%AF%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%BA%E6%98%AF%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 涉及国家利益、社会公共利益、第三人利益、身份关系、程序性事项的事实不能自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="5. 一般授权的委托代理人可以代为自认，不能代为认诺" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="6. 必要共同诉讼中的自认实行一票否决制，只要有一人反对就不构成自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9E%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%A5%A8%E5%90%A6%E5%86%B3%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="7. 附条件自认关键看是否基于同一法律关系，同一法律关系的必须统一认定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%E9%99%84%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E7%9C%8B%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%80%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="8. 调解和解中的自认不产生效力，看到调解没达成协议直接划掉中间内容" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E8.%20%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E7%9C%8B%E5%88%B0%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%B2%A1%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%88%92%E6%8E%89%E4%B8%AD%E9%97%B4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、证明责任的概念与本质" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）问题的提出：事实不清、真伪不明时的裁判规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E7%9A%84%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B8%85%E3%80%81%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%AA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E6%97%B6%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="争议事实的三种可能状态：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 原告通过充分证据证明事实成立 → 法院采信原告主张" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%85%85%E5%88%86%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%87%87%E4%BF%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 被告通过充分证据证明事实不成立 → 法院采信被告主张" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%85%85%E5%88%86%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%87%87%E4%BF%A1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 双方都无法证明事实真伪 → 事实不清、真伪不明 → 适用证明责任裁判" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E9%83%BD%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%AA%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B8%85%E3%80%81%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%AA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="证明责任的定义：法律或司法解释预先规定，当某一争议事实最终处于真伪不明状态时，由承担证明责任的一方当事人承担不利后果的制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%88%96%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E9%A2%84%E5%85%88%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%A4%84%E4%BA%8E%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%AA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%E7%9A%84%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）证明责任的双重含义" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8C%E9%87%8D%E5%90%AB%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 行为责任：谁应当主动提供证据证明该事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%81%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%AF%A5%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 结果责任：当事实最终不清、真伪不明时，谁承担败诉的不利后果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E4%B8%8D%E6%B8%85%E3%80%81%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%AA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="✅ 本质：结果责任（不利风险负担）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E8%B4%9F%E6%8B%85%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="去掉行为责任只保留结果责任，依然可以解决问题（当事人为了避免败诉会主动举证）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%BB%E6%8E%89%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%8F%AA%E4%BF%9D%E7%95%99%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%9D%E7%84%B6%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%E4%BC%9A%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="去掉结果责任只保留行为责任，无法解决问题（无法回答不举证的法律后果）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%BB%E6%8E%89%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%8F%AA%E4%BF%9D%E7%95%99%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%9E%E7%AD%94%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="核心逻辑：承担证明责任的一方，若举证充分则败诉风险不发生；若举证不足导致事实不清，则败诉风险变为现实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E8%8B%A5%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E5%85%85%E5%88%86%E5%88%99%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%EF%BC%9B%E8%8B%A5%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B8%85%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E5%8F%98%E4%B8%BA%E7%8E%B0%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）典型案例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="张三起诉李四打人赔偿10万元，打没打事实不清 → 由主张侵权成立的张三承担证明责任 → 推定侵权事实不成立 → 判决驳回张三诉讼请求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%89%93%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF10%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%93%E6%B2%A1%E6%89%93%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B8%85%20%E2%86%92%20%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="客观上张三确实被李四打了，但没有任何证据 → 依然根据证明责任判决张三败诉（证明责任是法律假定，可能与客观事实不符）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E4%B8%8A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9E%E8%A2%AB%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%89%93%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%20%E2%86%92%20%E4%BE%9D%E7%84%B6%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%81%87%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、理解证明责任的六个注意事项" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%85%AD%E4%B8%AA%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 真伪不明是证明责任的唯一适用前提" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%AA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="事实清楚、证据确实充分时，直接以证据证明的事实裁判，不适用证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9E%E5%85%85%E5%88%86%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 当事人是证明责任的唯一主体，法院不承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="不存在“判决本院败诉”的裁判方式，因此法院不可能承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E2%80%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 同一事实只能由一方当事人承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="若双方都承担同一事实的证明责任，事实不清时法院依然无法作出裁判" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%8B%A5%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E9%83%BD%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B8%85%E6%97%B6%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E7%84%B6%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 证明责任由法律/司法解释预先规定，法定不变" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B/%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E9%A2%84%E5%85%88%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="不存在当事人约定证明责任的情况" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="不存在证明责任在当事人之间来回转移的情况" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%9C%A8%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E6%9D%A5%E5%9B%9E%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="5. 不承担证明责任的一方，也可以行使举证权利（提供反证）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%88%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="其提供的证据是为了反驳对方主张，而非承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B6%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E9%9D%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="6. 证明责任是法律假定，可能与客观事实不符" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%81%87%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="目的是解决事实不清时的裁判难题，而非绝对还原客观事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B8%85%E6%97%B6%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E9%9A%BE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E9%9D%9E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E8%BF%98%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、证明责任的分配原则：谁主张谁举证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%81%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E8%B0%81%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）原则的完整表述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A1%A8%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="谁主张积极事实，谁承担证明责任；主张消极事实的一方，不承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%81%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%A7%AF%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9B%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%B6%88%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="积极事实：已经发生、客观存在的事实（如“借了钱”“还了钱”“打了人”）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A7%AF%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E3%80%81%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E2%80%9C%E5%80%9F%E4%BA%86%E9%92%B1%E2%80%9D%E2%80%9C%E8%BF%98%E4%BA%86%E9%92%B1%E2%80%9D%E2%80%9C%E6%89%93%E4%BA%86%E4%BA%BA%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="消极事实：没有发生、不存在的事实（如“没借钱”“没还钱”“没打人”）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B6%88%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E2%80%9C%E6%B2%A1%E5%80%9F%E9%92%B1%E2%80%9D%E2%80%9C%E6%B2%A1%E8%BF%98%E9%92%B1%E2%80%9D%E2%80%9C%E6%B2%A1%E6%89%93%E4%BA%BA%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）合同纠纷中的体现（无需背诵，可直接推导）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%83%8C%E8%AF%B5%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8E%A8%E5%AF%BC%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 主张合同成立并生效 → 对合同成立生效的事实承担证明责任（成立生效是积极事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E5%B9%B6%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%AF%B9%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%88%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%98%AF%E7%A7%AF%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 主张合同变更、解除、终止、撤销 → 对变更、解除、终止、撤销的事实承担证明责任（变更是积极事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E3%80%81%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E3%80%81%E7%BB%88%E6%AD%A2%E3%80%81%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%AF%B9%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E3%80%81%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E3%80%81%E7%BB%88%E6%AD%A2%E3%80%81%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E6%98%AF%E7%A7%AF%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 主张合同已经履行 → 对合同履行的事实承担证明责任（履行是积极事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%AF%B9%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%98%AF%E7%A7%AF%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 主张代理权存在 → 对有代理权的事实承担证明责任（有代理权是积极事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%AF%B9%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%E6%98%AF%E7%A7%AF%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）侵权纠纷中的一般分配规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 原告证明侵权构成要件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="一般侵权（过错责任）：四要件 → 侵权行为、损害结果、行为与结果之间的因果关系、被告有过错" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%9B%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%20%E2%86%92%20%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%81%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%81%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="无过错责任：三要件 → 侵权行为、损害结果、行为与结果之间的因果关系（过错不是构成要件，无需证明）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%89%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%20%E2%86%92%20%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%81%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%81%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 被告证明免责事由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="免责事由：虽然侵权构成要件全部成立，但依法可以免除或减轻责任的事实（如受害人故意、不可抗力、第三人过错）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E8%99%BD%E7%84%B6%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%85%8D%E9%99%A4%E6%88%96%E5%87%8F%E8%BD%BB%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%85%E6%84%8F%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E6%8A%97%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="辅助理解：凡是被告说完事实后，正常人脑子里会闪现“活该”两个字的，都是免责事由（如“谁让你故意逗我们家狗的”）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E5%87%A1%E6%98%AF%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%B4%E5%AE%8C%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%E4%BA%BA%E8%84%91%E5%AD%90%E9%87%8C%E4%BC%9A%E9%97%AA%E7%8E%B0%E2%80%9C%E6%B4%BB%E8%AF%A5%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E2%80%9C%E8%B0%81%E8%AE%A9%E4%BD%A0%E6%95%85%E6%84%8F%E9%80%97%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E5%AE%B6%E7%8B%97%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）两类法定证明责任倒置" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%A4%E7%B1%BB%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 环境污染、生态破坏纠纷 → 因果关系倒置" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E3%80%81%E7%94%9F%E6%80%81%E7%A0%B4%E5%9D%8F%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="一般规则：原告证明行为与损害结果之间存在因果关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="倒置后：由被告证明其行为与损害结果之间不存在因果关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%85%B6%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="原告仍需证明：侵权行为、损害结果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%BB%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%81%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="被告仍需证明：免责事由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BB%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="典型案例：化工厂排污致鱼虾死亡、飞机低空飞行噪音致鸡减产、光污染致奶牛产奶量下降、垃圾焚烧空气污染致养殖物死亡" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%96%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E6%8E%92%E6%B1%A1%E8%87%B4%E9%B1%BC%E8%99%BE%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E3%80%81%E9%A3%9E%E6%9C%BA%E4%BD%8E%E7%A9%BA%E9%A3%9E%E8%A1%8C%E5%99%AA%E9%9F%B3%E8%87%B4%E9%B8%A1%E5%87%8F%E4%BA%A7%E3%80%81%E5%85%89%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E8%87%B4%E5%A5%B6%E7%89%9B%E4%BA%A7%E5%A5%B6%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8B%E9%99%8D%E3%80%81%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE%E7%84%9A%E7%83%A7%E7%A9%BA%E6%B0%94%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E8%87%B4%E5%85%BB%E6%AE%96%E7%89%A9%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 民法中的过错推定案件 → 过错倒置" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="一般规则：原告证明被告有过错" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="倒置后：由被告证明自己没有过错" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="原告仍需证明：侵权行为、损害结果、行为与结果之间的因果关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%BB%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%81%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%81%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="被告仍需证明：免责事由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BB%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="典型案例：搁置物、悬挂物、堆放物、林木折断致人损害（花盆从阳台掉落砸人）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%90%81%E7%BD%AE%E7%89%A9%E3%80%81%E6%82%AC%E6%8C%82%E7%89%A9%E3%80%81%E5%A0%86%E6%94%BE%E7%89%A9%E3%80%81%E6%9E%97%E6%9C%A8%E6%8A%98%E6%96%AD%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%88%E8%8A%B1%E7%9B%86%E4%BB%8E%E9%98%B3%E5%8F%B0%E6%8E%89%E8%90%BD%E7%A0%B8%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="四、侵权纠纷证明责任分配万能解题技巧" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E4%B8%87%E8%83%BD%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）标准解题步骤" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 第一步：在草稿纸上写下基础框架：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E8%8D%89%E7%A8%BF%E7%BA%B8%E4%B8%8A%E5%86%99%E4%B8%8B%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原告：[姓名]          被告：[姓名]" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9A%5B%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D%5D%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9A%5B%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D%5D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="侵权行为            免责事由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="损害结果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="因果关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="过错" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 第二步：判断是否为无过错责任 → 若是，直接划掉“过错”" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%8B%A5%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%88%92%E6%8E%89%E2%80%9C%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 第三步：判断是否存在证明责任倒置 → 若有，将倒置的要件（因果关系/过错）圈起来，打箭头移到被告名下" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%8B%A5%E6%9C%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB/%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%EF%BC%89%E5%9C%88%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%93%E7%AE%AD%E5%A4%B4%E7%A7%BB%E5%88%B0%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 第四步：最终写在原告名下的事实由原告证明，写在被告名下的事实由被告证明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E7%AC%AC%E5%9B%9B%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%86%99%E5%9C%A8%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%94%B1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%99%E5%9C%A8%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%94%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="5. 第五步：将选项与上述结论逐一比对，表述一致则正确，不一致则错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%E9%80%90%E4%B8%80%E6%AF%94%E5%AF%B9%EF%BC%8C%E8%A1%A8%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E5%88%99%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E5%88%99%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）真题示例完整演练" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%BC%94%E7%BB%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="例1：饲养动物致人损害（无过错责任，无倒置）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B1%EF%BC%9A%E9%A5%B2%E5%85%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%89%A9%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：甲饲养的宠物狗将乙咬伤，乙起诉甲要求损害赔偿。诉讼中，甲主张乙被咬伤是因为乙故意逗狗造成的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E9%A5%B2%E5%85%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A0%E7%89%A9%E7%8B%97%E5%B0%86%E4%B9%99%E5%92%AC%E4%BC%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%94%B2%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E8%A2%AB%E5%92%AC%E4%BC%A4%E6%98%AF%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E4%B9%99%E6%95%85%E6%84%8F%E9%80%97%E7%8B%97%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="解题过程：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 基础框架：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="原告：乙          被告：甲" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%99%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="侵权行为        免责事由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="损害结果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="因果关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="过错（划掉，饲养动物致人损害是无过错责任）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%EF%BC%88%E5%88%92%E6%8E%89%EF%BC%8C%E9%A5%B2%E5%85%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%89%A9%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E6%98%AF%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="2. 无证明责任倒置规定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%97%A0%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="3. 最终分配：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="原告乙证明：侵权行为（狗咬人）、损害结果（乙受伤）、因果关系（受伤是狗咬导致）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B9%99%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%88%E7%8B%97%E5%92%AC%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%99%E5%8F%97%E4%BC%A4%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%97%E4%BC%A4%E6%98%AF%E7%8B%97%E5%92%AC%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="被告甲证明：免责事由（乙故意逗狗）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B2%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%99%E6%95%85%E6%84%8F%E9%80%97%E7%8B%97%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
              <outline text="选项分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="A. 甲应当对乙受损害与自己狗没有因果关系进行举证 → 错误（因果关系由乙证明）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E7%94%B2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E4%B9%99%E5%8F%97%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E4%B8%8E%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%8B%97%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%94%B1%E4%B9%99%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="B. 甲应当对乙故意逗狗而遭狗咬伤的事实承担证明责任 → 正确（免责事由由甲证明）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E7%94%B2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E4%B9%99%E6%95%85%E6%84%8F%E9%80%97%E7%8B%97%E8%80%8C%E9%81%AD%E7%8B%97%E5%92%AC%E4%BC%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%88%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B2%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="C. 乙应当对自己没有逗狗的故意承担证明责任 → 错误（免责事由由甲证明）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E4%B9%99%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E9%80%97%E7%8B%97%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E6%84%8F%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B2%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="D. 乙应当对自己受到狗的伤害以及自己没有逗狗的故意承担证明责任 → 错误（后半句错误）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E4%B9%99%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%8F%97%E5%88%B0%E7%8B%97%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A4%E5%AE%B3%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E9%80%97%E7%8B%97%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E6%84%8F%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%90%8E%E5%8D%8A%E5%8F%A5%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="答案：B" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="例2：堆放物致人损害（过错推定，过错倒置）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B2%EF%BC%9A%E5%A0%86%E6%94%BE%E7%89%A9%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：夏某在回宿舍的楼道里被季某堆放在楼梯过道的衣柜倒塌砸伤，夏某向法院起诉季某要求损害赔偿。诉讼中，双方当事人对被告季某是否存在过错产生争议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%8F%E6%9F%90%E5%9C%A8%E5%9B%9E%E5%AE%BF%E8%88%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A5%BC%E9%81%93%E9%87%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%AD%A3%E6%9F%90%E5%A0%86%E6%94%BE%E5%9C%A8%E6%A5%BC%E6%A2%AF%E8%BF%87%E9%81%93%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A3%E6%9F%9C%E5%80%92%E5%A1%8C%E7%A0%B8%E4%BC%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%8F%E6%9F%90%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%AD%A3%E6%9F%90%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%AD%A3%E6%9F%90%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="解题过程：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 基础框架：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="原告：夏某          被告：季某" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%8F%E6%9F%90%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9A%E5%AD%A3%E6%9F%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="侵权行为        免责事由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="损害结果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="因果关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="过错（圈起来，箭头到被告，过错推定倒置过错）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%EF%BC%88%E5%9C%88%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E7%AE%AD%E5%A4%B4%E5%88%B0%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="2. 不是无过错责任，过错保留" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E4%BF%9D%E7%95%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="3. 最终分配：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="原告夏某证明：侵权行为（衣柜倒塌）、损害结果（夏某受伤）、因果关系（受伤是衣柜倒塌导致）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%A4%8F%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%88%E8%A1%A3%E6%9F%9C%E5%80%92%E5%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%8F%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%97%E4%BC%A4%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%97%E4%BC%A4%E6%98%AF%E8%A1%A3%E6%9F%9C%E5%80%92%E5%A1%8C%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="被告季某证明：免责事由、自己没有过错" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%AD%A3%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%E3%80%81%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
              <outline text="选项分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="A. 法院承担证明责任 → 错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="B. 过错不是本案的证明对象 → 错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="C. 应当由季某证明自己没有过错 → 正确（过错倒置给季某）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E5%AD%A3%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%E7%BB%99%E5%AD%A3%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="D. 应当由夏某证明季某有过错 → 错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E5%A4%8F%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AD%A3%E6%9F%90%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="答案：C" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="例3：环境污染致人损害（无过错责任，因果关系倒置）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B3%EF%BC%9A%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：甲公司用飞机低空飞行为某村喷洒农药，每次飞行都会途经李某的养鸡场。三个月后，李某发现鸡的重量低于合同要求，认为是甲公司飞机低空飞行产生噪音导致鸡的食欲下降，遂向法院起诉甲公司。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%94%A8%E9%A3%9E%E6%9C%BA%E4%BD%8E%E7%A9%BA%E9%A3%9E%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%9F%90%E6%9D%91%E5%96%B7%E6%B4%92%E5%86%9C%E8%8D%AF%EF%BC%8C%E6%AF%8F%E6%AC%A1%E9%A3%9E%E8%A1%8C%E9%83%BD%E4%BC%9A%E9%80%94%E7%BB%8F%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E7%9A%84%E5%85%BB%E9%B8%A1%E5%9C%BA%E3%80%82%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E9%B8%A1%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8D%E9%87%8F%E4%BD%8E%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%98%AF%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E9%A3%9E%E6%9C%BA%E4%BD%8E%E7%A9%BA%E9%A3%9E%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E5%99%AA%E9%9F%B3%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E9%B8%A1%E7%9A%84%E9%A3%9F%E6%AC%B2%E4%B8%8B%E9%99%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%82%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="解题过程：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 基础框架：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="原告：李某          被告：甲公司" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="侵权行为        免责事由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="损害结果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="因果关系（圈起来，箭头到被告，环境污染倒置因果关系）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%9C%88%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E7%AE%AD%E5%A4%B4%E5%88%B0%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="过错（划掉，环境污染是无过错责任）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%EF%BC%88%E5%88%92%E6%8E%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E6%98%AF%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="2. 无过错责任，划掉过错" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%92%E6%8E%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="3. 最终分配：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="原告李某证明：侵权行为（甲公司飞机低空飞行产生噪音）、损害结果（鸡减产）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E9%A3%9E%E6%9C%BA%E4%BD%8E%E7%A9%BA%E9%A3%9E%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E5%99%AA%E9%9F%B3%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%88%E9%B8%A1%E5%87%8F%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="被告甲公司证明：免责事由、噪音与鸡减产之间没有因果关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%E3%80%81%E5%99%AA%E9%9F%B3%E4%B8%8E%E9%B8%A1%E5%87%8F%E4%BA%A7%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
              <outline text="选项分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="A. 李某应当对飞机噪音与鸡的减产有因果关系承担证明责任 → 错误（因果关系倒置给甲公司）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E9%A3%9E%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%AA%E9%9F%B3%E4%B8%8E%E9%B8%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%87%8F%E4%BA%A7%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%E7%BB%99%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="B. 甲公司应当对飞机噪音与鸡的减产没有因果关系承担证明责任 → 正确" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E9%A3%9E%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%AA%E9%9F%B3%E4%B8%8E%E9%B8%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%87%8F%E4%BA%A7%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="C. 李某应当对甲公司有过错的事实承担证明责任 → 错误（无过错责任，过错不是证明对象）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="D. 甲公司应当对自己没有过错的事实承担证明责任 → 错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="答案：B" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="五、民法典及司法解释中特殊的证明责任规定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E5%8F%8A%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E4%B8%AD%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）代理纠纷的证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 核心原理：善意推定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E5%96%84%E6%84%8F%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="法律推定每一个人都是善意的，主张自己是善意的一方无需承担证明责任；反之，主张对方非善意的一方，应当对对方知道或者应当知道相关事实承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%96%84%E6%84%8F%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%98%AF%E5%96%84%E6%84%8F%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9B%E5%8F%8D%E4%B9%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E9%9D%9E%E5%96%84%E6%84%8F%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 无权代理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="无权代理行为未被追认，相对人请求行为人履行债务或者赔偿损失的，由行为人就相对人知道或者应当知道行为人无代理权的事实承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%AA%E8%A2%AB%E8%BF%BD%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%BA%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%B0%B1%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%BA%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A0%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 表见代理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A1%A8%E8%A7%81%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="对是否构成表见代理产生争议的：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%A1%A8%E8%A7%81%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 由相对人对代理人的行为存在代理权外观的事实承担证明责任（如委托授权书、加盖公章的空白合同）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%E5%A4%96%E8%A7%82%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%81%E5%8A%A0%E7%9B%96%E5%85%AC%E7%AB%A0%E7%9A%84%E7%A9%BA%E7%99%BD%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 由被代理人对相对人知道行为人没有代理权或者相对人有过失的事实承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%BA%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%BA%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）违约金酌减的证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E9%85%8C%E5%87%8F%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 违约金酌减制度：当事人在合同中约定的违约金过分高于实际损失的，违约方可以请求法院或者仲裁机构予以适当减少" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E9%85%8C%E5%87%8F%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E8%BF%87%E5%88%86%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%8E%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E6%96%B9%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%82%E5%BD%93%E5%87%8F%E5%B0%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 核心原理：违约金合理推定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="法律推定当事人在合同中约定的违约金是合理的，是双方对违约风险和损失的预先评估" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E6%98%AF%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%AF%B9%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E5%92%8C%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%84%E5%85%88%E8%AF%84%E4%BC%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 证明责任分配：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="由违约方对约定的违约金过分高于实际损失的事实承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E6%96%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E8%BF%87%E5%88%86%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%8E%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="守约方主张约定的违约金合理的，也可以提供相应证据，但这是行为意义上的举证义务，不承担结果意义上的证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%88%E7%BA%A6%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="4. 注意：当事人可以通过反诉或者抗辩的方式请求调整违约金" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="本专题核心考点复盘" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E5%A4%8D%E7%9B%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 证明责任的本质是结果责任，是事实不清、真伪不明时的不利风险负担" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B8%85%E3%80%81%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%AA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E6%97%B6%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E8%B4%9F%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 分配总原则：谁主张积极事实谁举证，主张消极事实不举证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E6%80%BB%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%81%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%A7%AF%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B0%81%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%B6%88%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 侵权纠纷一般规则：原告证明侵权构成要件，被告证明免责事由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 两类法定倒置：环境污染导因果关系，过错推定案件导过错" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E4%B8%A4%E7%B1%BB%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E5%AF%BC%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%AF%BC%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="5. 解题技巧：先写四要件和免责事由，再划掉过错（无过错责任），再倒置要件，最后对应选项" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%88%E5%86%99%E5%9B%9B%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%E5%92%8C%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%88%92%E6%8E%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="6. 特殊规则：代理纠纷适用善意推定，违约金酌减适用违约金合理推定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%96%84%E6%84%8F%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E9%85%8C%E5%87%8F%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="证明标准与证明逻辑" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、证明标准的概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E7%9A%84%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：承担证明责任的当事人，需要将待证事实证明到何种程度，法院才会采信其主张的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B0%86%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%95%E7%A7%8D%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%8D%E4%BC%9A%E9%87%87%E4%BF%A1%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="本质：法官内心对事实的确信程度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%86%85%E5%BF%83%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="与证明责任的关系：证明责任是“谁来证明”，证明标准是“要证明到什么程度”；达不到证明标准即视为事实不清、真伪不明，由承担证明责任的一方承担不利后果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E8%B0%81%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%88%B0%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%A6%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%9B%E8%BE%BE%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E5%8D%B3%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B8%85%E3%80%81%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%AA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、民事诉讼中的三级证明标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E7%BA%A7%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）三级标准的量化与含义" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%89%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8F%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E5%90%AB%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="| 证明标准 | 内心确信程度 | 适用范围 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 较大可能性 | 事实成立的可能性＞51% | 程序性事实（如回避、保全、管辖异议） |
| 高度可能性 | 事实成立的可能性＞75% | 一般实体性事实（民事诉讼的一般标准） |
| 排除合理怀疑 | 事实成立的可能性＞95% | 特殊实体性事实（欺诈、胁迫、恶意串通、口头遗嘱、赠与） |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%86%85%E5%BF%83%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E8%BE%83%E5%A4%A7%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%9E51%25%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E3%80%81%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E9%AB%98%E5%BA%A6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%9E75%25%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%88%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E6%80%80%E7%96%91%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%9E95%25%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%88%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%E3%80%81%E8%83%81%E8%BF%AB%E3%80%81%E6%81%B6%E6%84%8F%E4%B8%B2%E9%80%9A%E3%80%81%E5%8F%A3%E5%A4%B4%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E3%80%81%E8%B5%A0%E4%B8%8E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="辅助理解：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="排除合理怀疑是人类理性能够达到的最高证明标准，100%的“排除一切怀疑”在司法实践中无法实现" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E6%80%80%E7%96%91%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%BA%E7%B1%BB%E7%90%86%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%8C100%25%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E4%B8%80%E5%88%87%E6%80%80%E7%96%91%E2%80%9D%E5%9C%A8%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E4%B8%AD%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="民事诉讼不采用刑事诉讼的“排除合理怀疑”作为一般标准，仅适用于上述五类特殊实体事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%8D%E9%87%87%E7%94%A8%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E6%80%80%E7%96%91%E2%80%9D%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E4%BA%94%E7%B1%BB%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）核心易错点：证明标准必须以证明责任为前提" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E4%B8%BA%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="只有承担证明责任的当事人，才需要将事实证明到相应的证明标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B0%86%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%88%B0%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="不承担证明责任的当事人，没有提供证据的义务，因此不讨论其证明标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E5%85%B6%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）经典四问辨析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E5%9B%9B%E9%97%AE%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原被告因合同纠纷诉至法院，关于合同效力发生争议，判断下列表述正误：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%9B%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%87%B3%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E8%BF%B0%E6%AD%A3%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="1. 原告主张合同成立并生效，应当将合同成立并生效的事实证明到高度可能性标准，否则承担不利后果 → ✅ 正确" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E5%B9%B6%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E5%B9%B6%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%88%B0%E9%AB%98%E5%BA%A6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%20%E2%86%92%20%E2%9C%85%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="理由：原告对合同成立生效承担证明责任，一般实体事实适用高度可能性标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%AF%B9%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E9%AB%98%E5%BA%A6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 被告主张合同关系不存在，应当将合同关系不存在的事实证明到高度可能性标准，否则承担不利后果 → ❌ 错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%88%B0%E9%AB%98%E5%BA%A6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%20%E2%86%92%20%E2%9D%8C%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="理由：被告对合同不存在不承担证明责任，不讨论证明标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%AF%B9%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 被告主张合同存在欺诈而要求撤销合同，应当将存在欺诈的事实证明到高度可能性标准，否则承担不利后果 → ❌ 错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%E8%80%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%88%B0%E9%AB%98%E5%BA%A6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%20%E2%86%92%20%E2%9D%8C%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="理由：被告对存在欺诈承担证明责任，但欺诈属于特殊实体事实，应当适用“排除合理怀疑”标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%AF%B9%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E2%80%9C%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E6%80%80%E7%96%91%E2%80%9D%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="4. 原告主张合同不存在欺诈，应当将合同不存在欺诈的事实证明到排除合理怀疑标准，否则承担不利后果 → ❌ 错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%88%B0%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E6%80%80%E7%96%91%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%20%E2%86%92%20%E2%9D%8C%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="理由：原告对合同不存在欺诈不承担证明责任，不讨论证明标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%AF%B9%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、证明的逻辑：证明对象→证明责任→证明标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E2%86%92%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E2%86%92%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）三者的逻辑关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%89%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 第一步：判断某事实是否是证明对象（需要证据证明的事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%9F%90%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 第二步：如果是证明对象，再判断由谁承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 第三步：如果确定了证明责任承担者，最后讨论其需要达到的证明标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%86%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%80%85%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E5%85%B6%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%B0%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="核心：不是证明对象的事实，绝对不讨论证明责任；不承担证明责任的当事人，绝对不讨论证明标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）常见的非证明对象（考试高频陷阱）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%9E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%88%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 与案件无关的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="包括：真的八竿子打不着的事实；无过错责任中被告是否有过错的事实（无过错责任中，被告无论是否有过错都要承担责任，因此过错与案件无关）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%EF%BC%9A%E7%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E5%85%AB%E7%AB%BF%E5%AD%90%E6%89%93%E4%B8%8D%E7%9D%80%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9B%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E4%B8%AD%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%97%A0%E8%AE%BA%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E9%83%BD%E8%A6%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 免证事实（虽然与案件有关，但不需要证据证明）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%99%BD%E7%84%B6%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="包括：自然规律和定理、众所周知的事实、法律推定的事实、经验法则推定的事实、生效裁判/仲裁裁决/公证文书确认的事实、当事人自认的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%EF%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E8%A7%84%E5%BE%8B%E5%92%8C%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86%E3%80%81%E4%BC%97%E6%89%80%E5%91%A8%E7%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4/%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3/%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）经典真题陷阱解析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B1%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="例1：2016年化肥质量侵权案（史上最阴险的证明责任题）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B1%EF%BC%9A2016%E5%B9%B4%E5%8C%96%E8%82%A5%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%B2%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%80%E9%98%B4%E9%99%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：刘月购买甲公司的化肥使用后农作物生长异常，起诉甲公司要求退款并赔偿损失。诉讼中，刘月向法院提供了本村吴某起诉甲公司损害赔偿的生效判决书，以证明甲公司出售的化肥有质量问题且与其所受损害存在因果关系。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%98%E6%9C%88%E8%B4%AD%E4%B9%B0%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%96%E8%82%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%90%8E%E5%86%9C%E4%BD%9C%E7%89%A9%E7%94%9F%E9%95%BF%E5%BC%82%E5%B8%B8%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E9%80%80%E6%AC%BE%E5%B9%B6%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E3%80%82%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%98%E6%9C%88%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E4%BA%86%E6%9C%AC%E6%9D%91%E5%90%B4%E6%9F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%87%BA%E5%94%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%96%E8%82%A5%E6%9C%89%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%B6%E6%89%80%E5%8F%97%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="问题：关于刘月所受损害与使用甲公司化肥因果关系的证明责任分配，正确的是？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E5%88%98%E6%9C%88%E6%89%80%E5%8F%97%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E4%B8%8E%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%8C%96%E8%82%A5%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="A. 应当由刘月负担有因果关系的证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E5%88%98%E6%9C%88%E8%B4%9F%E6%8B%85%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="B. 应当由甲公司负担无因果关系的证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B4%9F%E6%8B%85%E6%97%A0%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="C. 由法院裁量分配" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E9%87%8F%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="D. 由当事人协商分配" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="陷阱分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B1%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="表面考点：产品质量侵权的证明责任分配（一般由原告证明因果关系）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A1%A8%E9%9D%A2%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E7%94%B1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="真实考点：生效判决认定的事实是免证事实，不是证明对象，因此不讨论证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="逻辑推导：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E6%8E%A8%E5%AF%BC%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="1. 吴某诉甲公司的生效判决书已经认定了“甲公司化肥有质量问题”以及“质量问题与损害结果存在因果关系”" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%90%B4%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%89%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%8C%96%E8%82%A5%E6%9C%89%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E2%80%9D%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E2%80%9C%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E4%B8%8E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="2. 法院生效裁判确认的事实是免证事实，刘月无需举证证明因果关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%98%AF%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%98%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="3. 甲公司否认该事实的，应当由甲公司提供相反证据推翻该免证事实，即由甲公司证明无因果关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%90%A6%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%A5%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%A5%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A0%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
              <outline text="答案：B" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="例2：五环公司与四海公司合同纠纷案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B2%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%94%E7%8E%AF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：五环公司起诉四海公司要求支付货款。四海公司辩称已经将货款交给五环公司的业务员付某。五环公司承认付某是本公司业务员，但认为其无权代理收取货款，且付某未将货款交回公司。四海公司出示了盖有五环公司印章的委托授权书，证明付某有权收款。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%94%E7%8E%AF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%9B%9B%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%82%E5%9B%9B%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%BE%A9%E7%A7%B0%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%B0%86%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99%E4%BA%94%E7%8E%AF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%91%98%E4%BB%98%E6%9F%90%E3%80%82%E4%BA%94%E7%8E%AF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%BB%98%E6%9F%90%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AC%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%91%98%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B6%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%94%B6%E5%8F%96%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E4%BB%98%E6%9F%90%E6%9C%AA%E5%B0%86%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%A4%E5%9B%9E%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E3%80%82%E5%9B%9B%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%87%BA%E7%A4%BA%E4%BA%86%E7%9B%96%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%94%E7%8E%AF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%8D%B0%E7%AB%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E4%BB%98%E6%9F%90%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E6%94%B6%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="问题：本案需要由四海公司承担证明责任的事实包括？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%94%B1%E5%9B%9B%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="A. 四海公司已经将货款交给了付某 → ✅ 正确（主张合同已经履行，由履行方承担证明责任）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E5%9B%9B%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%B0%86%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99%E4%BA%86%E4%BB%98%E6%9F%90%20%E2%86%92%20%E2%9C%85%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="B. 付某是五环公司的业务员 → ❌ 错误（五环公司已经自认，自认的事实是免证事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E4%BB%98%E6%9F%90%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%94%E7%8E%AF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%91%98%20%E2%86%92%20%E2%9D%8C%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%E7%8E%AF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%98%AF%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="C. 五环公司授权付某代理收取货款 → ✅ 正确（主张有代理权，由主张方承担证明责任）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E4%BA%94%E7%8E%AF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%BB%98%E6%9F%90%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%94%B6%E5%8F%96%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%20%E2%86%92%20%E2%9C%85%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%96%B9%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="D. 付某将收取的货款交到了五环公司 → ❌ 错误（与本案无关，四海公司只要证明将钱交给了有权代理的付某即履行了义务，付某是否交回公司与四海公司无关）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E4%BB%98%E6%9F%90%E5%B0%86%E6%94%B6%E5%8F%96%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%A4%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%86%E4%BA%94%E7%8E%AF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%20%E2%86%92%20%E2%9D%8C%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%9B%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%B0%86%E9%92%B1%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99%E4%BA%86%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%98%E6%9F%90%E5%8D%B3%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%86%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%98%E6%9F%90%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%BA%A4%E5%9B%9E%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="答案：AC" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AAC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="例3：薛某雇佣杨某劳务侵权案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B3%EF%BC%9A%E8%96%9B%E6%9F%90%E9%9B%87%E4%BD%A3%E6%9D%A8%E6%9F%90%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A1%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案情：薛某雇佣杨某料理家务。杨某扔垃圾时，袋中的玻璃碎片划伤了邻居乔某。乔某诉至法院要求赔偿。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E8%96%9B%E6%9F%90%E9%9B%87%E4%BD%A3%E6%9D%A8%E6%9F%90%E6%96%99%E7%90%86%E5%AE%B6%E5%8A%A1%E3%80%82%E6%9D%A8%E6%9F%90%E6%89%94%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%8B%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%A2%8E%E7%89%87%E5%88%92%E4%BC%A4%E4%BA%86%E9%82%BB%E5%B1%85%E4%B9%94%E6%9F%90%E3%80%82%E4%B9%94%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%89%E8%87%B3%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="问题：关于本案说法正确的是？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E8%AF%B4%E6%B3%95%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="A. 乔某应当起诉杨某 → ❌ 错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E4%B9%94%E6%9F%90%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A8%E6%9F%90%20%E2%86%92%20%E2%9D%8C%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="B. 乔某应当起诉杨某和薛某 → ❌ 错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E4%B9%94%E6%9F%90%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A8%E6%9F%90%E5%92%8C%E8%96%9B%E6%9F%90%20%E2%86%92%20%E2%9D%8C%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="C. 乔某应当起诉薛某，由薛某承担其主观无过错的证明责任 → ❌ 错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E4%B9%94%E6%9F%90%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%96%9B%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E8%96%9B%E6%9F%90%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%BB%E8%A7%82%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%E2%9D%8C%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="D. 乔某应当起诉薛某，薛某主观是否有过错不是本案的证明对象 → ✅ 正确" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E4%B9%94%E6%9F%90%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%96%9B%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%8C%E8%96%9B%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BB%E8%A7%82%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%20%E2%86%92%20%E2%9C%85%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="提供劳务致人损害，由接受劳务方薛某承担无过错责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A1%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A1%E6%96%B9%E8%96%9B%E6%9F%90%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="无过错责任中，被告是否有过错与案件无关，不是证明对象，不需要证据证明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="答案：D" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="证明全章核心考点复盘" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%85%A8%E7%AB%A0%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E5%A4%8D%E7%9B%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）证明对象" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 免证事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="绝对免证：自然规律和定理（不允许反驳、推翻）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E8%A7%84%E5%BE%8B%E5%92%8C%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%E3%80%81%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="相对免证（可以反驳/推翻）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%8D%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3/%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="可以用相反证据反驳：众所周知的事实、法律推定的事实、日常生活经验法则推定的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BC%97%E6%89%80%E5%91%A8%E7%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="可以用相反证据推翻：法院生效裁判确认的事实、仲裁机构生效裁决确认的事实、生效公证文书证明的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 自认制度（每年必考）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%88%E6%AF%8F%E5%B9%B4%E5%BF%85%E8%80%83%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="自认的场合：庭审中；证据交换、调查、询问中；起诉状、答辩状、代理词等书面材料中" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%BA%E5%90%88%EF%BC%9A%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%9B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%81%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%9B%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E3%80%81%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E3%80%81%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E8%AF%8D%E7%AD%89%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="自认的范围：涉及国家利益、社会公共利益、第三人利益、身份关系、程序性事项的事实不能自认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%9A%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="自认vs认诺：自认是承认事实，不当然导致败诉；认诺是承认诉讼请求，直接导致败诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4vs%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%BA%EF%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E6%98%AF%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9B%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%BA%E6%98%AF%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="委托代理人的自认：无论一般授权还是特别授权，委托代理人的自认视为当事人的自认；当事人可以通过“委托授权书明确排除”或“当场明确反对”来否定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E8%AE%BA%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%9B%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E2%80%9C%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%A6%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E2%80%9D%E6%88%96%E2%80%9C%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%BA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E2%80%9D%E6%9D%A5%E5%90%A6%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="共同诉讼中的自认：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="普通共同诉讼：自认相互独立，仅对作出承认的人生效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9B%B8%E4%BA%92%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%85%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="必要共同诉讼：一票否决制，只要有一人明确反对，对所有人都不构成自认；无人反对则对所有人生效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E7%A5%A8%E5%90%A6%E5%86%B3%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%9B%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E5%88%99%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="附条件自认：承认的事实与所附条件基于同一法律关系的，必须统一认定；基于不同法律关系的，可以分别认定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%99%84%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8E%E6%89%80%E9%99%84%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%80%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9B%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="调解中的自认：为达成调解协议作出的妥协和让步，不得在后续诉讼中作为对其不利的证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BA%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%A6%A5%E5%8D%8F%E5%92%8C%E8%AE%A9%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%9C%A8%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 本质：事实不清、真伪不明时的不利风险负担" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B8%85%E3%80%81%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%AA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E6%97%B6%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E8%B4%9F%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 分配原则：谁主张积极事实，谁承担证明责任；主张消极事实的不承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%81%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%A7%AF%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9B%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%B6%88%E6%9E%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 侵权纠纷一般规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原告证明：侵权构成要件（一般侵权四要件：行为、结果、因果关系、过错；无过错责任三要件：行为、结果、因果关系）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E5%9B%9B%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%81%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%81%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%81%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%EF%BC%9B%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E4%B8%89%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%81%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%81%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="被告证明：免责事由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 两类法定倒置：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E4%B8%A4%E7%B1%BB%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="环境污染、生态破坏纠纷：因果关系倒置（被告证明无因果关系）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E3%80%81%E7%94%9F%E6%80%81%E7%A0%B4%E5%9D%8F%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A0%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="过错推定案件：过错倒置（被告证明自己无过错）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%97%A0%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）证明标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 较大可能性：程序性事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%BE%83%E5%A4%A7%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 高度可能性：一般实体性事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E9%AB%98%E5%BA%A6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 排除合理怀疑：欺诈、胁迫、恶意串通、口头遗嘱、赠与" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E6%80%80%E7%96%91%EF%BC%9A%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%E3%80%81%E8%83%81%E8%BF%AB%E3%80%81%E6%81%B6%E6%84%8F%E4%B8%B2%E9%80%9A%E3%80%81%E5%8F%A3%E5%A4%B4%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E3%80%81%E8%B5%A0%E4%B8%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题10 证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9810%20%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="证据的理论分类" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、证据理论分类概述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="理论上根据三个不同标准，将证据分为三组：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA%E4%B8%8A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%88%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%89%E7%BB%84%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 原始证据 vs 传来证据（按证据来源划分）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%20vs%20%E4%BC%A0%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%88%E6%8C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%E5%88%92%E5%88%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 直接证据 vs 间接证据（按证据与待证事实的关系/内容完整性划分）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%20vs%20%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%88%E6%8C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%8E%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB/%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%80%A7%E5%88%92%E5%88%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 本证 vs 反证（按证据与证明责任的关系划分）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%20vs%20%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%88%E6%8C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%92%E5%88%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、原始证据 vs 传来证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%20vs%20%E4%BC%A0%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）分类标准：证据的来源" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原始证据：直接来源于案件事实，没有经过复制、转述的证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E3%80%81%E8%BD%AC%E8%BF%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="传来证据：经过复制、转述之后形成的证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BC%A0%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E3%80%81%E8%BD%AC%E8%BF%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）典型例子" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="借条原件（原始证据）vs 借条复印件（传来证据）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89vs%20%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E4%BC%A0%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="物证原物（原始证据）vs 物证照片（传来证据）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%A9%E8%AF%81%E5%8E%9F%E7%89%A9%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89vs%20%E7%89%A9%E8%AF%81%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87%EF%BC%88%E4%BC%A0%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="证人陈述自己亲身所见所闻（原始证据）vs 证人转述他人的所见所闻（传来证据）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E4%BA%B2%E8%BA%AB%E6%89%80%E8%A7%81%E6%89%80%E9%97%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89vs%20%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E8%BD%AC%E8%BF%B0%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%89%80%E8%A7%81%E6%89%80%E9%97%BB%EF%BC%88%E4%BC%A0%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）区分意义" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 原始证据的证明力一般大于传来证据（复制、转述过程中可能出现失真失实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BC%A0%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E3%80%81%E8%BD%AC%E8%BF%B0%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E5%A4%B1%E7%9C%9F%E5%A4%B1%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 传来证据也具有证据能力，可以作为证据使用，只是证明力相对较小" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BC%A0%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%B9%9F%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E8%BE%83%E5%B0%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、直接证据 vs 间接证据（绝对重点，高频易错）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%20vs%20%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%88%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%8C%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）正确区分方法（避开命题陷阱）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%88%E9%81%BF%E5%BC%80%E5%91%BD%E9%A2%98%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="❌ 不要用定义区分：“能够单独直接证明待证事实的是直接证据，不能的是间接证据”（易产生歧义）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E7%94%A8%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E6%98%93%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E6%AD%A7%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="✅ 唯一正确标准：只看证据内容的完整性" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9C%85%20%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E7%9C%8B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="直接证据：内容上能够完整证明整个案件事实的证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8A%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AA%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="间接证据：内容上只能证明待证事实的一个部分、一个片段，需要与其他证据相结合才能证明案件事实的证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%89%87%E6%AE%B5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9B%B8%E7%BB%93%E5%90%88%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）核心易错点" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="直接证据与间接证据的区分，与证据的来源无关，与证据的证明力大小无关" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%8E%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="经典反例：无法与原件核对的借条复印件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E5%8F%8D%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%E6%A0%B8%E5%AF%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="虽然是复印件（传来证据）、证明力极小，但内容上能够完整证明借款事实，因此是直接证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%99%BD%E7%84%B6%E6%98%AF%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E4%BC%A0%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E6%9E%81%E5%B0%8F%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8A%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="命题老师常设陷阱：反复强调“复印件”“无法与原件核对”，用来源和证明力干扰判断" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%91%BD%E9%A2%98%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88%E5%B8%B8%E8%AE%BE%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B1%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%8D%E5%A4%8D%E5%BC%BA%E8%B0%83%E2%80%9C%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%E2%80%9D%E2%80%9C%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%E6%A0%B8%E5%AF%B9%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%E5%92%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）经典真题解析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="民事诉讼中，下列哪些证据属于间接证据？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E5%93%AA%E4%BA%9B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="A. 无法与原件、原物核对的复印件、复制品" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%81%E5%8E%9F%E7%89%A9%E6%A0%B8%E5%AF%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%81%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E5%93%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="B. 存在疑点的视听资料、电子数据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%96%91%E7%82%B9%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E3%80%81%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="C. 证明夫妻感情破裂的证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%A4%AB%E5%A6%BB%E6%84%9F%E6%83%85%E7%A0%B4%E8%A3%82%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="D. 与一方当事人或者其代理人有利害关系的证人出具的证言" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%85%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="选项分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="A、B、D：命题老师均未告知证据的具体内容，因此既可能是内容完整的直接证据，也可能是内容不完整的间接证据，无法判断。三个选项均是用“来源”“证明力大小”来干扰考生。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA%E3%80%81B%E3%80%81D%EF%BC%9A%E5%91%BD%E9%A2%98%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88%E5%9D%87%E6%9C%AA%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%A2%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%9A%84%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E3%80%82%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E5%9D%87%E6%98%AF%E7%94%A8%E2%80%9C%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%E2%80%9D%E2%80%9C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E2%80%9D%E6%9D%A5%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E8%80%83%E7%94%9F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="C：证明夫妻感情破裂的证据，根据生活经验，只能通过生活中的点点滴滴（如打架、分居、出轨等）来综合证明，每一个证据都只能证明其中一个片段，因此所有证明夫妻感情破裂的证据都是间接证据。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%A4%AB%E5%A6%BB%E6%84%9F%E6%83%85%E7%A0%B4%E8%A3%82%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%82%B9%E7%82%B9%E6%BB%B4%E6%BB%B4%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%89%93%E6%9E%B6%E3%80%81%E5%88%86%E5%B1%85%E3%80%81%E5%87%BA%E8%BD%A8%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%E6%9D%A5%E7%BB%BC%E5%90%88%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%83%BD%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%89%87%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%A4%AB%E5%A6%BB%E6%84%9F%E6%83%85%E7%A0%B4%E8%A3%82%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="答案：C" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）区分意义" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="直接证据定案：只需在真实性上查证属实，即可直接定案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E9%9C%80%E5%9C%A8%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%8A%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%81%E5%B1%9E%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="间接证据定案：不仅需要每个间接证据都查证属实，还需要证据之间、证据与案件事实之间形成完整的逻辑闭环，才能定案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%85%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%83%BD%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%81%E5%B1%9E%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%9A%84%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E9%97%AD%E7%8E%AF%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="四、本证 vs 反证（绝对重点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%20vs%20%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%88%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）三步走判断方法" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%E8%B5%B0%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 第一步：确定该证据想要证明的待证事实是什么" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%83%B3%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 第二步：确定该待证事实由谁承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%A5%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B1%E8%B0%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 第三步：看该证据是谁提供的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%9C%8B%E8%AF%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%81%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="承担证明责任的人提供的证据 → 本证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="不承担证明责任的人提供的证据 → 反证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）基础案例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 张三起诉李四归还借款10万，张三向法院提交借条" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE10%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="待证事实：借款事实成立" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="证明责任：由主张借款成立的张三承担" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="证据提供者：张三" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%80%85%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="结论：借条是本证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 李四主张借款已经归还，向法院提交收条" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E6%94%B6%E6%9D%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="待证事实：还款事实成立" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%98%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="证明责任：由主张还款成立的李四承担" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E8%BF%98%E6%AC%BE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="证据提供者：李四" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%80%85%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="结论：收条是本证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%B6%E6%9D%A1%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 左宁起诉我打人要求赔偿，我向法院提供12月8日往返广州的登机牌、住宿费发票以及同学证言，证明我当天不在北京" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%88%91%E6%89%93%E4%BA%BA%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B12%E6%9C%888%E6%97%A5%E5%BE%80%E8%BF%94%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E7%9A%84%E7%99%BB%E6%9C%BA%E7%89%8C%E3%80%81%E4%BD%8F%E5%AE%BF%E8%B4%B9%E5%8F%91%E7%A5%A8%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E5%90%8C%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%88%91%E5%BD%93%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%8D%E5%9C%A8%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="待证事实：我没有打人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%91%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%89%93%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="证明责任：由主张打人成立的左宁承担" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%89%93%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A6%E5%AE%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="证据提供者：我（不承担证明责任）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%80%85%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%91%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="结论：上述证据是反证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）进阶易错案例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E8%BF%9B%E9%98%B6%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 老太太倒在我的车前，起诉我开车撞她。我提供车载行车记录仪，显示我刹车的位置离老太太倒地的位置还有两米远" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%80%81%E5%A4%AA%E5%A4%AA%E5%80%92%E5%9C%A8%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E8%BD%A6%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%88%91%E5%BC%80%E8%BD%A6%E6%92%9E%E5%A5%B9%E3%80%82%E6%88%91%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%BD%A6%E8%BD%BD%E8%A1%8C%E8%BD%A6%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E4%BB%AA%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E6%88%91%E5%88%B9%E8%BD%A6%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%E7%A6%BB%E8%80%81%E5%A4%AA%E5%A4%AA%E5%80%92%E5%9C%B0%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%E8%BF%98%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%A4%E7%B1%B3%E8%BF%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="待证事实：我没有撞到老太太" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%91%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%92%9E%E5%88%B0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%AA%E5%A4%AA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="证明责任：由主张撞人成立的老太太承担" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%92%9E%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%80%81%E5%A4%AA%E5%A4%AA%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="证据提供者：我（不承担证明责任）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%80%85%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%91%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="结论：行车记录仪是反证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%E8%A1%8C%E8%BD%A6%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E4%BB%AA%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 老太太倒在我的车上，起诉我开车撞她。我提供车载行车记录仪，显示在撞上之前老太太正在闯红灯" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%80%81%E5%A4%AA%E5%A4%AA%E5%80%92%E5%9C%A8%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E8%BD%A6%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%88%91%E5%BC%80%E8%BD%A6%E6%92%9E%E5%A5%B9%E3%80%82%E6%88%91%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%BD%A6%E8%BD%BD%E8%A1%8C%E8%BD%A6%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E4%BB%AA%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E5%9C%A8%E6%92%9E%E4%B8%8A%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%8D%E8%80%81%E5%A4%AA%E5%A4%AA%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E9%97%AF%E7%BA%A2%E7%81%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="待证事实：受害人有故意（免责事由）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E6%95%85%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%88%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="证明责任：由主张免责事由成立的我承担" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%88%91%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="证据提供者：我（承担证明责任）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%80%85%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%91%EF%BC%88%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="结论：行车记录仪是本证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%E8%A1%8C%E8%BD%A6%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E4%BB%AA%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）区分意义" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="本证：承担证明责任的人提供的证据，必须达到相应的证明标准，否则待证事实真伪不明，承担证明责任的一方败诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%B0%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%AA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="反证：不承担证明责任的人提供的证据，不需要达到证明标准，只要能让待证事实陷入真伪不明的状态即可" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%B0%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E8%83%BD%E8%AE%A9%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%B7%E5%85%A5%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%AA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="五、证明逻辑综合应用（深度拓展真题）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E7%BB%BC%E5%90%88%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%88%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E6%8B%93%E5%B1%95%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）真题一：借款关系证明对象判断" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="甲起诉乙要求归还借款50万，向法院提交了一张银行转账凭证，证明自己借给乙50万。诉讼中，乙主张甲向自己转账是为了偿还自己以前借给甲的50万。下列说法正确的是？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE50%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E5%BC%A0%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%BD%AC%E8%B4%A6%E5%87%AD%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%80%9F%E7%BB%99%E4%B9%9950%E4%B8%87%E3%80%82%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E5%90%91%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E8%BD%AC%E8%B4%A6%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E5%81%BF%E8%BF%98%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E4%BB%A5%E5%89%8D%E5%80%9F%E7%BB%99%E7%94%B2%E7%9A%8450%E4%B8%87%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E8%AF%B4%E6%B3%95%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="A. 甲提交的银行转账凭证属于直接证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E7%94%B2%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%9A%84%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%BD%AC%E8%B4%A6%E5%87%AD%E8%AF%81%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="B. 甲提交的银行转账凭证属于间接证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E7%94%B2%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%9A%84%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%BD%AC%E8%B4%A6%E5%87%AD%E8%AF%81%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="C. 乙对甲曾经向自己借款的事实承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E4%B9%99%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%B2%E6%9B%BE%E7%BB%8F%E5%90%91%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="D. 甲应当对借款给乙的事实承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E7%94%B2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E7%BB%99%E4%B9%99%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="选项分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="A、B：银行转账凭证只能证明甲向乙转了50万，但无法证明该转款是借款（也可能是投资、赠与、还款等），内容不完整，因此是间接证据。A错，B对。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA%E3%80%81B%EF%BC%9A%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%BD%AC%E8%B4%A6%E5%87%AD%E8%AF%81%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%94%B2%E5%90%91%E4%B9%99%E8%BD%AC%E4%BA%8650%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%AF%A5%E8%BD%AC%E6%AC%BE%E6%98%AF%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E3%80%81%E8%B5%A0%E4%B8%8E%E3%80%81%E8%BF%98%E6%AC%BE%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82A%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8CB%E5%AF%B9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="C：乙主张的“甲曾经向自己借款50万”（借款二），乙并未就该笔借款提起反诉或另行起诉，也未交纳诉讼费，因此不是本案的审理对象，相关事实不是本案的证明对象，不讨论证明责任。C错。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B2%E6%9B%BE%E7%BB%8F%E5%90%91%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE50%E4%B8%87%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E5%B9%B6%E6%9C%AA%E5%B0%B1%E8%AF%A5%E7%AC%94%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E6%88%96%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E6%9C%AA%E4%BA%A4%E7%BA%B3%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B4%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E3%80%82C%E9%94%99%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="D：甲起诉要求归还的“乙向甲借款50万”（借款一）是本案的审理对象，甲主张该借款关系成立，应当承担证明责任。D对。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E4%B9%99%E5%90%91%E7%94%B2%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE50%E4%B8%87%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E8%AF%A5%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E3%80%82D%E5%AF%B9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="答案：BD" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9ABD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）真题二：本证反证的前提" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="詹某打电话向某某借款5万元，并发短信提供账号。某某当日即转款，之后因詹某拒不还款，某某起诉詹某要求偿还借款。诉讼中，詹某否认向某某借款的事实，主张某某转的款是为了偿还之前向自己借的款。下列表述正确的是？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A9%B9%E6%9F%90%E6%89%93%E7%94%B5%E8%AF%9D%E5%90%91%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE5%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E7%9F%AD%E4%BF%A1%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E3%80%82%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E5%BD%93%E6%97%A5%E5%8D%B3%E8%BD%AC%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E5%9B%A0%E8%A9%B9%E6%9F%90%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%98%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A9%B9%E6%9F%90%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%81%BF%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%82%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%A9%B9%E6%9F%90%E5%90%A6%E8%AE%A4%E5%90%91%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E8%BD%AC%E7%9A%84%E6%AC%BE%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E5%81%BF%E8%BF%98%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%8D%E5%90%91%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%80%9F%E7%9A%84%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E8%BF%B0%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="A. 某某提供的银行转账凭证属于书证，该证据对借款事实而言是直接证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%BD%AC%E8%B4%A6%E5%87%AD%E8%AF%81%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%AF%B9%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%80%8C%E8%A8%80%E6%98%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="B. 某某提供的记载詹某表示要向其借款5万元的手机短信，属于电子数据，该证据对借款事实而言是间接证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B0%E8%BD%BD%E8%A9%B9%E6%9F%90%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E8%A6%81%E5%90%91%E5%85%B6%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE5%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E7%9A%84%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E7%9F%AD%E4%BF%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%AF%B9%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%80%8C%E8%A8%80%E6%98%AF%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="C. 某某提供的记载詹某表示要向其借款5万元的手机通话录音，属于电子数据，该证据对借款事实而言是直接证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B0%E8%BD%BD%E8%A9%B9%E6%9F%90%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E8%A6%81%E5%90%91%E5%85%B6%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE5%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E7%9A%84%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E9%80%9A%E8%AF%9D%E5%BD%95%E9%9F%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%AF%B9%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%80%8C%E8%A8%80%E6%98%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="D. 詹某提供的一份某某书写的向其借款10万元的借条复印件，该证据对于某某主张的詹某借款的事实而言属于反证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E8%A9%B9%E6%9F%90%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%BD%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E4%B9%A6%E5%86%99%E7%9A%84%E5%90%91%E5%85%B6%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE10%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E7%9A%84%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%8E%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%A9%B9%E6%9F%90%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%80%8C%E8%A8%80%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="选项分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="A：银行转账凭证只能证明转款事实，不能证明是借款，是间接证据。A错。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA%EF%BC%9A%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%BD%AC%E8%B4%A6%E5%87%AD%E8%AF%81%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%BD%AC%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%98%AF%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%82A%E9%94%99%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="B：手机短信只能证明詹某有借款的意思表示（邀约），不能证明某某已经承诺并提供了借款，内容不完整，是间接证据。B对。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E7%9F%AD%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%A9%B9%E6%9F%90%E6%9C%89%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%88%E9%82%80%E7%BA%A6%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA%E5%B9%B6%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E4%BA%86%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%82B%E5%AF%B9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="C：手机通话录音同样只能证明詹某有借款的意思表示，不能证明借款事实成立，是间接证据。C错。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E9%80%9A%E8%AF%9D%E5%BD%95%E9%9F%B3%E5%90%8C%E6%A0%B7%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%A9%B9%E6%9F%90%E6%9C%89%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%82C%E9%94%99%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="D：詹某主张的“某某曾经向自己借款10万”（借款二），詹某并未起诉，不是本案的审理对象，相关事实不是证明对象。该借条复印件证明的是与本案无关的事实，因此既不是本证，也不是反证。D错。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED%EF%BC%9A%E8%A9%B9%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E6%9B%BE%E7%BB%8F%E5%90%91%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE10%E4%B8%87%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%A9%B9%E6%9F%90%E5%B9%B6%E6%9C%AA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E3%80%82%E8%AF%A5%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A2%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82D%E9%94%99%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="答案：B" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）核心逻辑总结" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="证明的完整逻辑链条：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E9%93%BE%E6%9D%A1%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="1. 第一步：判断某事实是否是本案的证明对象（即是否是法院审理的法律关系相关的事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%9F%90%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%B3%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 第二步：如果是证明对象，再判断由谁承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B1%E8%B0%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 第三步：如果确定了证明责任承担者，再判断证据是本证还是反证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%86%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%80%85%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 第四步：最后讨论本证需要达到的证明标准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E7%AC%AC%E5%9B%9B%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%B0%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="不是证明对象的事实，绝对不讨论证明责任，也绝对不讨论本证反证。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="证据的法定分类" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、证据的法定分类概述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="民事诉讼法规定的八种法定证据：当事人陈述、物证、书证、视听资料、电子数据、证人证言、鉴定意见、勘验笔录" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%85%AB%E7%A7%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E3%80%81%E7%89%A9%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E3%80%81%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%E3%80%81%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E3%80%81%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E7%AC%94%E5%BD%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="重点掌握：物证书证、视听资料电子数据、证人证言、鉴定意见；当事人陈述、勘验笔录考点较少，了解即可" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E6%8E%8C%E6%8F%A1%EF%BC%9A%E7%89%A9%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%E3%80%81%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%9B%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E3%80%81%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E7%AC%94%E5%BD%95%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E8%BE%83%E5%B0%91%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、物证、书证、视听资料、电子数据（第一组重点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E7%89%A9%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E3%80%81%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%88%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E7%BB%84%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）物证 vs 书证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E7%89%A9%E8%AF%81%20vs%20%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="物证：用物品的物理属性（颜色、大小、痕迹、损坏状态、重量等）证明案件事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%A9%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%A8%E7%89%A9%E5%93%81%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E9%A2%9C%E8%89%B2%E3%80%81%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E3%80%81%E7%97%95%E8%BF%B9%E3%80%81%E6%8D%9F%E5%9D%8F%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E3%80%81%E9%87%8D%E9%87%8F%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="书证：用文书记载的内容、表达的思想证明案件事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E8%BD%BD%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E3%80%81%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E7%9A%84%E6%80%9D%E6%83%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="典型案例：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 用书的棱角砸人头部，该书是物证（用物理属性证明伤害事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%94%A8%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E6%A3%B1%E8%A7%92%E7%A0%B8%E4%BA%BA%E5%A4%B4%E9%83%A8%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E4%B9%A6%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%A9%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%94%A8%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E4%BC%A4%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 记载他人私生活细节的书籍用于名誉侵权诉讼，是书证（用内容证明侵权事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%AE%B0%E8%BD%BD%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E7%A7%81%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E7%BB%86%E8%8A%82%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%A6%E7%B1%8D%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%8D%E8%AA%89%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%94%A8%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）视听资料 vs 电子数据（高频易错点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%20vs%20%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="视听资料：用录音、录像等技术手段形成的声音和图像，储存在感光材料、磁带、录像带、胶卷等非电子介质中" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%A8%E5%BD%95%E9%9F%B3%E3%80%81%E5%BD%95%E5%83%8F%E7%AD%89%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%89%8B%E6%AE%B5%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E5%A3%B0%E9%9F%B3%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%BE%E5%83%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%82%A8%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%84%9F%E5%85%89%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E3%80%81%E7%A3%81%E5%B8%A6%E3%80%81%E5%BD%95%E5%83%8F%E5%B8%A6%E3%80%81%E8%83%B6%E5%8D%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%89%E9%9D%9E%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E4%BB%8B%E8%B4%A8%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="电子数据：储存在电子介质（U盘、移动硬盘、储存卡、电脑硬盘、手机内存等）中的信息资料" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%82%A8%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E4%BB%8B%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88U%E7%9B%98%E3%80%81%E7%A7%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%A1%AC%E7%9B%98%E3%80%81%E5%82%A8%E5%AD%98%E5%8D%A1%E3%80%81%E7%94%B5%E8%84%91%E7%A1%AC%E7%9B%98%E3%80%81%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="核心区别（辅助理解）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%EF%BC%88%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 传播方式：视听资料的传播离不开实物载体；电子数据可以离开实物载体在虚拟空间快速传播" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%E7%A6%BB%E4%B8%8D%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%9E%E7%89%A9%E8%BD%BD%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%9B%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%A6%BB%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%9E%E7%89%A9%E8%BD%BD%E4%BD%93%E5%9C%A8%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 复制效果：视听资料复制件效果差，复制次数越多效果越差；电子数据可以实现精确复制，复制件与原件无差别" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BB%B6%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E5%B7%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E6%AC%A1%E6%95%B0%E8%B6%8A%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E8%B6%8A%E5%B7%AE%EF%BC%9B%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E7%B2%BE%E7%A1%AE%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%E6%97%A0%E5%B7%AE%E5%88%AB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 修改难度：视听资料难以修改；电子数据可以轻松剪辑、修改且不留痕迹" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E9%9A%BE%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E9%9A%BE%E4%BB%A5%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%EF%BC%9B%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%BD%BB%E6%9D%BE%E5%89%AA%E8%BE%91%E3%80%81%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%8D%E7%95%99%E7%97%95%E8%BF%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="医院影像设备的证据定性（司考经典考点）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8C%BB%E9%99%A2%E5%BD%B1%E5%83%8F%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%B8%E8%80%83%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 传统X光片：原理与胶卷相机完全相同，用感光胶片成像 → 视听资料（当年司法部答案）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BC%A0%E7%BB%9FX%E5%85%89%E7%89%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%83%B6%E5%8D%B7%E7%9B%B8%E6%9C%BA%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E6%84%9F%E5%85%89%E8%83%B6%E7%89%87%E6%88%90%E5%83%8F%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%BD%93%E5%B9%B4%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E9%83%A8%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. DR（数码X射线）：将X射线信号转化为数码编号储存 → 电子数据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EDR%EF%BC%88%E6%95%B0%E7%A0%81X%E5%B0%84%E7%BA%BF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86X%E5%B0%84%E7%BA%BF%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%BA%E6%95%B0%E7%A0%81%E7%BC%96%E5%8F%B7%E5%82%A8%E5%AD%98%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. CT、MRI（磁共振）、超声（B超、彩超）、PET-CT：均采用数码成像技术 → 电子数据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3ECT%E3%80%81MRI%EF%BC%88%E7%A3%81%E5%85%B1%E6%8C%AF%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E8%B6%85%E5%A3%B0%EF%BC%88B%E8%B6%85%E3%80%81%E5%BD%A9%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81PET-CT%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9D%87%E9%87%87%E7%94%A8%E6%95%B0%E7%A0%81%E6%88%90%E5%83%8F%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="辅助理解：从X光片到DR的发展，等同于从胶卷相机到数码相机的发展" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8EX%E5%85%89%E7%89%87%E5%88%B0DR%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%91%E5%B1%95%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%90%8C%E4%BA%8E%E4%BB%8E%E8%83%B6%E5%8D%B7%E7%9B%B8%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B0%E6%95%B0%E7%A0%81%E7%9B%B8%E6%9C%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%91%E5%B1%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="电子数据的原件规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="当事人以电子数据作为证据的，应当提供原始载体" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E8%BD%BD%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="电子数据的制作者制作的与原件一致的副本，或者直接来源于电子数据的打印件或其他可以显示、识别的输出介质，视为电子数据的原件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%8E%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%E6%88%96%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E3%80%81%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E4%BB%8B%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="典型案例：用数码相机拍摄的照片打印出来提交法庭，视为电子数据原件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%95%B0%E7%A0%81%E7%9B%B8%E6%9C%BA%E6%8B%8D%E6%91%84%E7%9A%84%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%A5%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）书证的三大证据规则（绝对重点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="书证、视听资料、电子数据本质相同，都是用内容证明案件事实，因此书证的所有规则同样适用于视听资料和电子数据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E3%80%81%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%94%A8%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E5%90%8C%E6%A0%B7%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%92%8C%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="1. 最佳证据规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="书证应当提供原件，原件是最佳证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="提供原件确有困难的，可以提供复印件，复印件也具有证据能力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%E7%A1%AE%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%B0%E9%9A%BE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%E4%B9%9F%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 书证的真实性规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="公文书证 vs 私文书证：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AC%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%20vs%20%E7%A7%81%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="公文书证：国家公权力机关行使法定职权制作的文书" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%85%AC%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="构成要件：① 制作主体是国家公权力机关；② 制作内容是行使法定职权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E2%91%A0%20%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E6%98%AF%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%85%AC%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%9B%E2%91%A1%20%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E6%98%AF%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="效力：内容直接推定为真实，对方有相反证据足以推翻的除外" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E6%9C%89%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%B6%B3%E4%BB%A5%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%E7%9A%84%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="典型案例：公安机关的行政处罚决定书是公文书证；公安机关与装修公司签订的办公楼装修合同是私文书证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%AE%89%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E5%A4%84%E7%BD%9A%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E6%98%AF%E5%85%AC%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%9B%E5%85%AC%E5%AE%89%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E4%B8%8E%E8%A3%85%E4%BF%AE%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%9E%E5%85%AC%E6%A5%BC%E8%A3%85%E4%BF%AE%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%98%AF%E7%A7%81%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="私文书证：公文书证以外的所有文书" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A7%81%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E4%BB%A5%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="私文书证的真实性规则（核心考点）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A7%81%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="真实性分为两个层面：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E5%88%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%B1%82%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="1. 形式真实性：文书本身是真的，签名、盖章、捺印是真实的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E6%98%AF%E7%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E3%80%81%E7%9B%96%E7%AB%A0%E3%80%81%E6%8D%BA%E5%8D%B0%E6%98%AF%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="2. 内容真实性：文书记载的内容是制作者的真实意思表示" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E8%BD%BD%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E6%98%AF%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="证明责任分配：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="1. 形式真实性：由主张以该私文书证证明案件事实的当事人承担证明责任（有争议时可申请司法鉴定）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%A5%E7%A7%81%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%B6%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="2. 内容真实性：推定规则。只要私文书证具备形式真实性（签名、盖章真实），就推定其记载的内容是制作者的真实意思表示；谁反对该推定，由谁对相反事实承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E7%A7%81%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E5%85%B7%E5%A4%87%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%88%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E3%80%81%E7%9B%96%E7%AB%A0%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%B6%E8%AE%B0%E8%BD%BD%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E6%98%AF%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%9B%E8%B0%81%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%A5%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E8%B0%81%E5%AF%B9%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="典型案例：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="1. 张三起诉李四归还借款10万，提供借条。李四主张借条上的签名是伪造的 → 形式真实性争议 → 由张三对借条真实性承担证明责任（申请笔迹鉴定）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE10%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E3%80%82%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%BC%AA%E9%80%A0%E7%9A%84%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%20%E2%86%92%20%E7%94%B1%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%AF%B9%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%AC%94%E8%BF%B9%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="2. 鉴定确认签名是李四的，李四主张是被张三胁迫签的借条 → 内容真实性争议 → 推定内容真实，由李四对被胁迫的事实承担证明责任（证明标准为排除合理怀疑）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%98%AF%E8%A2%AB%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%83%81%E8%BF%AB%E7%AD%BE%E7%9A%84%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%AF%B9%E8%A2%AB%E8%83%81%E8%BF%AB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E6%80%80%E7%96%91%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="3. 李四承认签名是自己的，但主张借条上的10万是赌债而非借款 → 内容真实性争议 → 推定是借款，由李四对是赌债的事实承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%8410%E4%B8%87%E6%98%AF%E8%B5%8C%E5%80%BA%E8%80%8C%E9%9D%9E%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%AF%B9%E6%98%AF%E8%B5%8C%E5%80%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="4. 张老太起诉银行赔偿理财产品亏损，银行提供有张老太签名的《风险告知书》。张老太承认签名是自己的，但主张自己不识字，是银行工作人员骗她签的，银行明确告知是保本产品 → 内容真实性争议 → 推定内容真实，由张老太对被欺诈的事实承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%AA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E7%90%86%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E4%BA%8F%E6%8D%9F%EF%BC%8C%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%AA%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E7%9A%84%E3%80%8A%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%8B%E3%80%82%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%AA%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E4%B8%8D%E8%AF%86%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E9%AA%97%E5%A5%B9%E7%AD%BE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E6%98%AF%E4%BF%9D%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%AA%E5%AF%B9%E8%A2%AB%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 文书提出命令规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="适用条件：有证据证明对方当事人持有某项书证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8C%81%E6%9C%89%E6%9F%90%E9%A1%B9%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="程序：承担证明责任的一方当事人可以申请法院责令对方当事人提交" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法律后果：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 对方无正当理由拒不提交 → 推定申请人主张的该书证内容为真实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%A5%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 对方不仅不提交，还故意毁损、灭失该书证 → 推定申请人主张的以该书证能够证明的案件事实为真实，同时可以对其罚款、拘留，构成犯罪的追究刑事责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%85%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E6%95%85%E6%84%8F%E6%AF%81%E6%8D%9F%E3%80%81%E7%81%AD%E5%A4%B1%E8%AF%A5%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%A5%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%81%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%EF%BC%8C%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E7%8A%AF%E7%BD%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%BD%E7%A9%B6%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="典型案例：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 张三起诉李四归还借款10万，提供借条复印件，复印件上注明“原件由李四保管”并有李四签名 → 有证据证明李四持有原件 → 法院责令李四提交，李四拒不提交 → 推定借条复印件内容为真实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE10%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8A%E6%B3%A8%E6%98%8E%E2%80%9C%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%E7%94%B1%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%BF%9D%E7%AE%A1%E2%80%9D%E5%B9%B6%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%8C%81%E6%9C%89%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 李四当庭用打火机烧毁借条原件 → 推定借款事实为真实，同时对李四罚款10万元" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%BD%93%E5%BA%AD%E7%94%A8%E6%89%93%E7%81%AB%E6%9C%BA%E7%83%A7%E6%AF%81%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E5%AF%B9%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE10%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="3. 张三起诉李四离婚，主张李四出轨，提供用手机拍摄的李四与第三者的聊天记录照片。李四在质证时将自己的手机格式化 → 推定李四出轨的事实为真实，同时对李四罚款5万元" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%87%BA%E8%BD%A8%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%94%A8%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E6%8B%8D%E6%91%84%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%8E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E8%81%8A%E5%A4%A9%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87%E3%80%82%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%9C%A8%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E6%97%B6%E5%B0%86%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E5%8C%96%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%87%BA%E8%BD%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E5%AF%B9%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE5%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）域外书证的认证规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E5%9F%9F%E5%A4%96%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="在中国领域外形成的公文书证：应当经所在国公证机关证明，或者履行中国与该国订立的有关条约中规定的证明手续" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E5%A4%96%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E5%85%AC%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%9A%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%BB%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%A5%E5%9B%BD%E8%AE%A2%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E6%9D%A1%E7%BA%A6%E4%B8%AD%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%89%8B%E7%BB%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="在中国领域外形成的涉及身份关系的证据：应当经所在国公证机关证明，并经中国驻该国使领馆认证，或者履行条约规定的证明手续" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E5%A4%96%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%9A%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%BB%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%A9%BB%E8%AF%A5%E5%9B%BD%E4%BD%BF%E9%A2%86%E9%A6%86%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9D%A1%E7%BA%A6%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%89%8B%E7%BB%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="典型案例：日本法院作出的判决书在中国作为证据使用，未经中国法院承认执行，也未经过日本公证机关公证 → 不符合法定形式，不能作为证据使用" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%20%E2%86%92%20%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、证人证言（第二组重点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%EF%BC%88%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E7%BB%84%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）证人资格" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="凡是知道案件情况的单位和个人，都有义务出庭作证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%87%A1%E6%98%AF%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="不能正确表达意思的人，不能作为证人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="核心易错点：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 无/限制民事行为能力人可以作为证人：只要知道案件情况，能够正确表达即可" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0/%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%EF%BC%8C%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="其所作的与其年龄、智力、精神状态不相当的证言，不得单独作为定案根据（有证据能力，只是证明力小，需要其他证据补强）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B6%E6%89%80%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%B6%E5%B9%B4%E9%BE%84%E3%80%81%E6%99%BA%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%81%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E7%9B%B8%E5%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E5%B0%8F%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A1%A5%E5%BC%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="2. 与案件有利害关系的人可以作为证人：证人不适用回避制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="其提供的对与其有利害关系的当事人有利的证言，不得单独作为定案根据（有证据能力，只是证明力小，需要其他证据补强）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B6%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%B6%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E5%B0%8F%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A1%A5%E5%BC%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）证人出庭程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：证人出庭应当由当事人在举证期限届满前申请法院通知" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外：证言涉及法院应当依职权调查的事实（国家利益、社会公共利益、第三人利益、身份关系、程序性事项），法院可以依职权通知证人出庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="未经法院通知，证人不得出庭作证，但双方当事人均同意并经法院准许的除外" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9D%87%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%B9%B6%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E7%9A%84%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）证人出庭义务与例外（2019年证据规定核心修改）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%B8%8E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%882019%E5%B9%B4%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：证人应当出庭作证，接受审判人员和当事人的询问" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E5%92%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="视为出庭：证人在审理前的准备阶段或者法院调查、询问等双方当事人在场时陈述证言的，视为出庭作证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%81%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E7%AD%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%BA%E6%97%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="可以不出庭的法定情形（经法院准许）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 健康原因不能出庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 路途遥远，交通不便不能出庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%B7%AF%E9%80%94%E9%81%A5%E8%BF%9C%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BE%BF%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 自然灾害等不可抗力不能出庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%81%BE%E5%AE%B3%E7%AD%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E6%8A%97%E5%8A%9B%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="4. 其他正当理由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="可以不出庭的议定情形：双方当事人均同意证人以其他方式作证，并经法院准许的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9D%87%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A5%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法律后果：无正当理由未出庭的证人以书面等方式提供的证言，不得作为定案根据（直接否定其证据能力，不是证明力小的问题）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%9C%AA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E7%AD%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%90%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%B6%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="对比2002年旧证据规定：原规定是“不得单独作为定案根据”（有证据能力，证明力小），2019年修改后大幅提高了证人出庭的要求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%942002%E5%B9%B4%E6%97%A7%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E5%B0%8F%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C2019%E5%B9%B4%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%90%8E%E5%A4%A7%E5%B9%85%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%86%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）证人出庭费用的补助" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A5%E5%8A%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="证人因履行出庭作证义务而支出的交通、住宿、就餐等必要费用以及误工损失，由败诉方当事人承担" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%9B%A0%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E8%80%8C%E6%94%AF%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E3%80%81%E4%BD%8F%E5%AE%BF%E3%80%81%E5%B0%B1%E9%A4%90%E7%AD%89%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E8%AF%AF%E5%B7%A5%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="由申请方当事人先行垫付" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%88%E8%A1%8C%E5%9E%AB%E4%BB%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（五）证人作证的要求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 签署并宣读保证书：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E5%B9%B6%E5%AE%A3%E8%AF%BB%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="法院应当要求证人签署保证书，并当庭宣读保证书的内容" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E5%BD%93%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A3%E8%AF%BB%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="例外：无/限制民事行为能力人不需要签署" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0/%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法律后果：证人拒绝签署或者宣读保证书的，不得作证，并自行承担相关费用" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%AE%A3%E8%AF%BB%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="典型案例：35岁的张三和5岁的张小三目睹了一起交通事故，法院通知二人出庭作证，二人均拒绝签署保证书 → 张三不得作证，张小三可以作证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A35%E5%B2%81%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%92%8C5%E5%B2%81%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%A0%E5%B0%8F%E4%B8%89%E7%9B%AE%E7%9D%B9%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%BA%8C%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E4%BA%BA%E5%9D%87%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E5%B0%8F%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 如实陈述义务：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A6%82%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="证人应当客观陈述其亲身感知的事实，不得使用猜测性、推断性、评论性的语言" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E5%85%B6%E4%BA%B2%E8%BA%AB%E6%84%9F%E7%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%8C%9C%E6%B5%8B%E6%80%A7%E3%80%81%E6%8E%A8%E6%96%AD%E6%80%A7%E3%80%81%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="规则：意见证据规则。证人发表的猜测性、推断性、评论性的意见，不得作为证据使用" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%91%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84%E7%8C%9C%E6%B5%8B%E6%80%A7%E3%80%81%E6%8E%A8%E6%96%AD%E6%80%A7%E3%80%81%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 其他要求：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="证人作证前不得旁听庭审" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E6%97%81%E5%90%AC%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="不得以宣读事先准备的书面材料的方式陈述证言（必须脱稿，凭回忆陈述）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BB%A5%E5%AE%A3%E8%AF%BB%E4%BA%8B%E5%85%88%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%EF%BC%88%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E8%84%B1%E7%A8%BF%EF%BC%8C%E5%87%AD%E5%9B%9E%E5%BF%86%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="证人应当就其作证的事项连续陈述，陈述过程中不得被打断" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%B1%E5%85%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%93%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="审判人员可以询问证人，当事人及其诉讼代理人经审判人员许可后也可以询问证人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%B6%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E8%AE%B8%E5%8F%AF%E5%90%8E%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="询问证人时，其他证人不得在场（分别作证，防止相互干扰）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E7%9B%B8%E4%BA%92%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法院认为有必要的，可以要求证人之间进行对质" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%AF%B9%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（六）典型真题解析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AD%EF%BC%89%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="甲乙公司因合同纠纷提起诉讼，甲公司申请丙运输公司的赵某作为证人出庭作证，乙公司申请本公司的仓库管理员钱某出庭作证。下列表述正确的是？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%9B%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%99%E8%BF%90%E8%BE%93%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%9C%AC%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%91%98%E9%92%B1%E6%9F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E8%BF%B0%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="A. 因为钱某是乙公司的员工，需要经过甲公司同意后，方有证人资格" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E9%92%B1%E6%9F%90%E6%98%AF%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%9A%84%E5%91%98%E5%B7%A5%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="B. 为提高效率，赵某提前写好证词，当庭宣读" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E4%B8%BA%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E6%8F%90%E5%89%8D%E5%86%99%E5%A5%BD%E8%AF%81%E8%AF%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A3%E8%AF%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="C. 法院可安排赵某、钱某对质" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E5%AE%89%E6%8E%92%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E3%80%81%E9%92%B1%E6%9F%90%E5%AF%B9%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="D. 赵某因为路途遥远，申请视频作证，法院未询问乙公司意见，直接同意" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E8%B7%AF%E9%80%94%E9%81%A5%E8%BF%9C%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9C%AA%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="选项分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="A：与案件有利害关系的人也有证人资格，不需要对方当事人同意 → 错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%9F%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="B：证人不得以宣读事先准备的书面材料的方式陈述证言 → 错误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BB%A5%E5%AE%A3%E8%AF%BB%E4%BA%8B%E5%85%88%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="C：法院认为有必要的，可以要求证人之间进行对质 → 正确" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%AF%B9%E8%B4%A8%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="D：路途遥远属于法定不出庭情形，经法院准许即可，不需要询问对方当事人意见 → 正确" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED%EF%BC%9A%E8%B7%AF%E9%80%94%E9%81%A5%E8%BF%9C%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="答案：CD" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9ACD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="四、其他证据种类（了解即可）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%A7%8D%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）当事人陈述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="当事人对自己的主张，只有本人陈述而不能提出其他相关证据的，其主张不予支持，但对方当事人认可的除外" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%A4%E5%8F%AF%E7%9A%84%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）鉴定意见" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="鉴定人必须是具有相应资格的专业人员" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%AF%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="鉴定人应当出庭接受当事人质询，无正当理由拒不出庭的，鉴定意见不得作为定案根据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%A2%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人可以申请有专门知识的人出庭，就鉴定意见或者专业问题提出意见" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）勘验笔录" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E7%AC%94%E5%BD%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="勘验物证或者现场，勘验人必须出示人民法院的证件，并邀请当地基层组织或者当事人所在单位派人参加" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E7%89%A9%E8%AF%81%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%8E%B0%E5%9C%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E4%BA%BA%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%87%BA%E7%A4%BA%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E9%82%80%E8%AF%B7%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E6%B4%BE%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人或者当事人的成年家属应当到场，拒不到场的，不影响勘验的进行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%88%90%E5%B9%B4%E5%AE%B6%E5%B1%9E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%88%B0%E5%9C%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%9C%BA%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="本专题核心考点复盘" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E5%A4%8D%E7%9B%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 物证用物理属性证明，书证用内容证明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%89%A9%E8%AF%81%E7%94%A8%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E7%94%A8%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 传统X光片是视听资料，所有数码影像都是电子数据；电子数据的打印件视为原件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BC%A0%E7%BB%9FX%E5%85%89%E7%89%87%E6%98%AF%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%95%B0%E7%A0%81%E5%BD%B1%E5%83%8F%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%9B%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 私文书证形式真实性由主张方证明，内容真实性推定真实，反对者证明相反事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%A7%81%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E8%80%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 对方持有书证拒不提交的，推定书证内容真实；故意毁损的，推定待证事实真实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E6%8C%81%E6%9C%89%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9B%E6%95%85%E6%84%8F%E6%AF%81%E6%8D%9F%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="5. 无/限制民事行为能力人、与案件有利害关系的人都可以做证人，只是证言不能单独定案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E6%97%A0/%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%BD%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%81%9A%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="6. 2019年证据规定后，无正当理由未出庭的证人书面证言不得作为定案根据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%202019%E5%B9%B4%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%9C%AA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="7. 证人必须签署保证书（无/限制民事行为能力人除外），拒绝签署的不得作证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0/%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="8. 证人不得发表猜测性、推断性、评论性意见（意见证据规则）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E8.%20%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%8F%91%E8%A1%A8%E7%8C%9C%E6%B5%8B%E6%80%A7%E3%80%81%E6%8E%A8%E6%96%AD%E6%80%A7%E3%80%81%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%E6%80%A7%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%88%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="鉴定意见、当事人陈述与勘验笔录" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E3%80%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E7%AC%94%E5%BD%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、鉴定意见（绝对重点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%88%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）鉴定的启动" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 原则：由当事人在法院指定的期间内申请鉴定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%86%85%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 例外（法院依职权鉴定）：待鉴定事实属于法院应当依职权调查的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BE%85%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="涉及国家利益、社会公共利益、第三人合法权益" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="涉及身份关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="涉及依职权追加当事人、中止诉讼、终结诉讼、回避等程序性事项" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%AD%89%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 核心规则：谁承担证明责任，谁申请鉴定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原理：承担证明责任的一方若无法提供证据证明待证事实，又不申请鉴定的，将承担证明责任的不利后果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E8%8B%A5%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%88%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="典型例题" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 例一（环境污染案）：甲工厂排污致张某鱼虾死亡，张某起诉赔偿。需鉴定：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%88%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E6%8E%92%E6%B1%A1%E8%87%B4%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E9%B1%BC%E8%99%BE%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82%E9%9C%80%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="死亡鱼虾的价值（属于损害结果，由原告张某承担证明责任）→ 张某申请鉴定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E9%B1%BC%E8%99%BE%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC%EF%BC%88%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="排污行为与损害结果之间的因果关系（环境污染案件因果关系倒置，由被告甲工厂承担证明责任）→ 甲工厂申请鉴定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8E%92%E6%B1%A1%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%80%92%E7%BD%AE%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B2%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B2%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="2. 例二（合同真实性案）：原告主张合同成立生效，提交合同原件，被告主张合同是伪造的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%98%AF%E4%BC%AA%E9%80%A0%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="合同形式真实性由主张以合同证明案件事实的原告承担证明责任 → 原告申请鉴定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="3. 例三（收条真实性案）：被告主张借款已归还，提交收条，原告主张收条是伪造的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%88%E6%94%B6%E6%9D%A1%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E5%B7%B2%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E6%94%B6%E6%9D%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%94%B6%E6%9D%A1%E6%98%AF%E4%BC%AA%E9%80%A0%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="收条形式真实性由主张以收条证明案件事实的被告承担证明责任 → 被告申请鉴定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%94%B6%E6%9D%A1%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%BB%A5%E6%94%B6%E6%9D%A1%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="4. 2025年真题（收货单签名案）：王某起诉李某支付货款，提交23张李某签名的收货确认单，李某主张其中9张签名是伪造的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E2025%E5%B9%B4%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%A7%E5%8D%95%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A423%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%A7%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%8D%95%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD9%E5%BC%A0%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%BC%AA%E9%80%A0%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="收货单形式真实性由主张以收货单证明交货事实的王某承担证明责任 → 王某申请鉴定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%A7%E5%8D%95%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%BB%A5%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%A7%E5%8D%95%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E4%BA%A4%E8%B4%A7%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="法院不得依职权决定鉴定（不涉及国家、社会、第三人利益或身份关系）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E6%88%96%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）鉴定前的准备" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 鉴定开始前，法院应当要求鉴定人签署承诺书" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 鉴定材料必须质证：未经质证的材料不得作为鉴定根据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="典型案例：亲子鉴定中，送检的头发（检材）必须经过双方质证，确保一根是父亲的、一根是孩子的，否则鉴定意见无意义" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%B2%E5%AD%90%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%81%E6%A3%80%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%B4%E5%8F%91%EF%BC%88%E6%A3%80%E6%9D%90%EF%BC%89%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%9D%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B9%E6%98%AF%E7%88%B6%E4%BA%B2%E7%9A%84%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B9%E6%98%AF%E5%AD%A9%E5%AD%90%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E6%97%A0%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）鉴定人的确定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 当事人申请鉴定的：法院组织当事人协商确定鉴定人，协商不成的，由法院指定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 法院依职权鉴定的：由法院在询问当事人意见后指定鉴定人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E5%90%8E%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）鉴定书的形式要求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 鉴定书应当由鉴定人签名或者盖章，并附有鉴定人的资格证明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%9B%96%E7%AB%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E9%99%84%E6%9C%89%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 委托机构进行鉴定的：鉴定书应当由鉴定机构盖章，并有从事鉴定的人员签名（鉴定人个人负责制）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E7%9B%96%E7%AB%A0%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%8E%E4%BA%8B%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%9F%E8%B4%A3%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 多名鉴定人对同一问题鉴定出现不同意见的：如实注明所有意见，不得少数服从多数，最终采信哪个意见由法院综合审查判断" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%A4%9A%E5%90%8D%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A6%82%E5%AE%9E%E6%B3%A8%E6%98%8E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%B0%91%E6%95%B0%E6%9C%8D%E4%BB%8E%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E9%87%87%E4%BF%A1%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%AA%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%BC%E5%90%88%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（五）鉴定人出庭（核心考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 出庭情形（二选一）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%E9%80%89%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="当事人对鉴定意见有异议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法院认为鉴定人应当出庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 2019年证据规定修改的出庭程序：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E2019%E5%B9%B4%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="鉴定人完成鉴定后提交鉴定书 → 法院将副本送达双方当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%8E%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B0%86%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="当事人有异议的，提交书面异议 → 法院要求鉴定人进行书面答复" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E7%AD%94%E5%A4%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="书面答复后当事人仍有异议的，再通知鉴定人出庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E7%AD%94%E5%A4%8D%E5%90%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="立法目的：解决实践中鉴定人因错别字、歧义等非实质性异议频繁出庭的问题" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E4%B8%AD%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%9B%A0%E9%94%99%E5%88%AB%E5%AD%97%E3%80%81%E6%AD%A7%E4%B9%89%E7%AD%89%E9%9D%9E%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E6%80%A7%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E9%A2%91%E7%B9%81%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 出庭费用：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原则：与证人出庭费用相同，由败诉方当事人承担，申请方先行垫付" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%96%B9%E5%85%88%E8%A1%8C%E5%9E%AB%E4%BB%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="例外：因鉴定意见不明确或有瑕疵导致鉴定人出庭的，由鉴定人自行承担" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%A0%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%88%96%E6%9C%89%E7%91%95%E7%96%B5%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="4. 鉴定人拒不出庭的法律后果：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="鉴定意见不得作为定案根据（未经充分质证）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%85%E5%88%86%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="支付费用的当事人有权要求鉴定人返还鉴定费用" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法院可以建议鉴定人的行业主管部门或者行业组织对拒不出庭的鉴定人进行处罚" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E9%83%A8%E9%97%A8%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%AF%B9%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%84%E7%BD%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（六）当事人自行委托鉴定的效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AD%EF%BC%89%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 性质：不属于民事诉讼法规定的“鉴定意见”（未经过法院启动鉴定程序、未协商/指定鉴定人、鉴定材料未质证）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E6%9C%AA%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86/%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E6%9C%AA%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 证据能力：可以作为证据使用，适用书证的规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 对方救济：对方当事人有证据或者有理由予以反驳，并且申请鉴定的，法院应当准许" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%9C%89%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E4%B8%94%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、有专门知识的人（专家辅助人）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）基本概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="又称专家辅助人，是指具备相应专业知识，受当事人委托出庭，就鉴定意见或者专业问题提出意见的人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%88%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E6%8C%87%E5%85%B7%E5%A4%87%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%97%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="❌ 禁止表述为“专家证人”：我国不承认专家证人制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E8%A1%A8%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）出庭程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="由当事人在举证期限内申请，法院通知1-2名有专门知识的人出庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A51-2%E5%90%8D%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="❌ 法院不得依职权通知有专门知识的人出庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）出庭作用" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 对鉴定意见提出意见 → 视为当事人的质证意见（帮当事人质证）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%AF%B9%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%B8%AE%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 对专业问题提出意见 → 视为当事人的陈述意见（帮当事人陈述）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%B8%AE%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）核心规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 费用承担：由申请方当事人自行承担（帮一方打官司，谁请谁出钱）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%B8%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%89%93%E5%AE%98%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E8%AF%B7%E8%B0%81%E5%87%BA%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 回避制度：不适用回避制度（不需要中立，花钱请你来就是帮我说话的）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%AD%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E8%8A%B1%E9%92%B1%E8%AF%B7%E4%BD%A0%E6%9D%A5%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E5%B8%AE%E6%88%91%E8%AF%B4%E8%AF%9D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 询问与对质：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E4%B8%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="法院可以对出庭的有专门知识的人进行询问" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%B9%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="经法院准许，当事人可以对出庭的有专门知识的人进行询问" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%B9%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="当事人各自申请的有专门知识的人可以就案件中的专业问题进行对质" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%84%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%B0%B1%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%AF%B9%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="典型真题" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="甲公司因工程质量问题起诉乙公司，提交了起诉前自行委托某鉴定中心刘某出具的鉴定意见书，并申请刘某出庭。乙公司申请某大学张教授出庭发表意见。下列说法正确的是？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%9B%A0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%86%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%9F%90%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%85%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%9F%90%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E5%BC%A0%E6%95%99%E6%8E%88%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E5%8F%91%E8%A1%A8%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E8%AF%B4%E6%B3%95%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="A. 经法庭准许，刘某和张教授可以当庭对质" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E5%92%8C%E5%BC%A0%E6%95%99%E6%8E%88%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%BD%93%E5%BA%AD%E5%AF%B9%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="B. 刘某发表的意见属于鉴定意见" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%91%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="C. 法院可直接认定该鉴定意见书的证明力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%A5%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="D. 张教授发表的意见视为当事人的陈述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E5%BC%A0%E6%95%99%E6%8E%88%E5%8F%91%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="答案：AD" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EAD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="解析：刘某和张教授均为有专门知识的人，可以对质；其发表的意见视为当事人的陈述；自行委托的鉴定意见书属于书证，证明力需由法院审查判断，不能直接认定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E5%92%8C%E5%BC%A0%E6%95%99%E6%8E%88%E5%9D%87%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%B9%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%9B%E5%85%B6%E5%8F%91%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%9B%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%A6%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E9%9C%80%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、司法技术人员（拓展考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%93%E5%B1%95%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院指派或者聘请的，帮助法官审查判断专业证据、认定专业事实的司法辅助人员" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E6%B4%BE%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E8%81%98%E8%AF%B7%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%B8%AE%E5%8A%A9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%81%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="典型：知识产权案件中的技术调查官" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%9A%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E4%BA%A7%E6%9D%83%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E5%AE%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）核心规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 作用：帮助法官审查专业证据、认定专业事实（帮法官干活）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B8%AE%E5%8A%A9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%81%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%88%E5%B8%AE%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%B9%B2%E6%B4%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 立场：中立" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AB%8B%E5%9C%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%AD%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 回避制度：适用回避制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 回避决定：属于“其他人员”，回避由审判长决定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E2%80%9C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%95%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="典型真题" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="甲乙公司就某一专利侵权事项发生纠纷诉至法院，法院指派该领域专家王某担任技术调查官。甲公司以王某是乙公司的大股东为由申请王某回避。下列说法正确的是？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%B0%B1%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%93%E5%88%A9%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%87%B3%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E6%B4%BE%E8%AF%A5%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E5%AE%98%E3%80%82%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%BB%A5%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E6%98%AF%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A7%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E8%AF%B4%E6%B3%95%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="A. 王某应当适用回避制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="B. 王某不应当适用回避制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%8D%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="C. 王某的回避由审判长决定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%95%BF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="D. 王某是专家证人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="答案：AC" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EAC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="解析：技术调查官属于司法技术人员，应当适用回避制度，其回避由审判长决定；我国没有专家证人制度。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E5%AE%98%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%95%BF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9B%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="四、当事人陈述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）出庭义务" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院认为有必要的，可以要求当事人本人到庭，就案件有关事实接受询问" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院应当在询问前责令当事人签署并宣读保证书" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E5%89%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E5%B9%B6%E5%AE%A3%E8%AF%BB%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）当事人不到庭的法律后果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="负有证明责任的当事人拒绝到庭、拒绝接受询问、拒绝签署保证书，待证事实又欠缺其他证据证明的，法院对其主张的事实不予认定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%B4%9F%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%81%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E3%80%81%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%8F%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%AC%A0%E7%BC%BA%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）当事人出庭的双重作用与后果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8C%E9%87%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8E%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 作用一：行使诉讼权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="当事人可以委托代理人代为行使诉讼权利，代理人在授权范围内的诉讼行为对当事人发生效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%86%85%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AF%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="原告经传票传唤无正当理由拒不到庭，又不委托代理人的 → 按撤诉处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%BB%8F%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%88%E4%B8%8D%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%89%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="被告经传票传唤无正当理由拒不到庭，又不委托代理人的 → 缺席判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%BB%8F%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%88%E4%B8%8D%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 作用二：提供当事人陈述（证据）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="当事人不到庭的，视为放弃提供该证据的权利，法院根据现有证据和证明责任规则认定案件事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%AF%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E7%8E%B0%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%92%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2023年典型真题" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2023%E5%B9%B4%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="甲起诉乙归还借款10万元，委托张律师代理诉讼。法院认为现有证据无法证明债权成立，通知甲到庭陈述事实，甲以工作繁忙为由拒绝到庭。第二次开庭时甲仍未出庭，仅委托张律师出庭。关于本案表述正确的是？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE10%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E5%BC%A0%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E7%8E%B0%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E7%94%B2%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E4%BB%A5%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E7%B9%81%E5%BF%99%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E6%97%B6%E7%94%B2%E4%BB%8D%E6%9C%AA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%85%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E5%BC%A0%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E8%A1%A8%E8%BF%B0%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="A. 可以对甲拘传" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%B2%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="B. 可以对甲缺席判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%B2%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="C. 按甲撤诉处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E6%8C%89%E7%94%B2%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="D. 如果现有证据无法证明债权成立，法院可以对甲主张的债权不予认定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E7%8E%B0%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="答案：D" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3ED%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="解析：甲委托了律师出庭，已经行使了诉讼权利，不能按撤诉处理或缺席判决；甲不是必须到庭的当事人，不能拘传；甲不到庭提供陈述，现有证据不足的，法院对其主张的债权不予认定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BA%86%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E4%BA%86%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%8C%89%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%88%96%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%9B%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%EF%BC%9B%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%8C%E7%8E%B0%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）拘传的适用范围（易错点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="民事诉讼中拘传适用极少，仅适用于以下情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9E%81%E5%B0%91%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 负有赡养、抚养、抚育义务的被告（为了保障基本生存需要和弘扬公序良俗）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%B4%9F%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E8%82%B2%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E7%94%9F%E5%AD%98%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%92%8C%E5%BC%98%E6%89%AC%E5%85%AC%E5%BA%8F%E8%89%AF%E4%BF%97%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 虚假诉讼案件中，为了查清违法事实、进行处罚" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%99%9A%E5%81%87%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E6%9F%A5%E6%B8%85%E8%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%84%E7%BD%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 执行环节中，被执行人拒不履行生效判决、转移财产的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%8E%AF%E8%8A%82%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="❌ 一般的合同纠纷、侵权纠纷中，不得拘传原告（仅为私权利纠纷，不值得通过限制人身自由保障）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%9D%8C%20%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%81%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%85%E4%B8%BA%E7%A7%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%80%BC%E5%BE%97%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="五、勘验笔录" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E7%AC%94%E5%BD%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="勘验主体：司法工作人员（法院的工作人员）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="定义：审判人员对与案件有关的现场、物品进行勘查、检验后制作的笔录" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%8E%B0%E5%9C%BA%E3%80%81%E7%89%A9%E5%93%81%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%98%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%81%E6%A3%80%E9%AA%8C%E5%90%8E%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%94%E5%BD%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="证据全章核心考点复盘" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%85%A8%E7%AB%A0%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E5%A4%8D%E7%9B%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）证据的理论分类" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 原始证据 vs 传来证据（按来源划分）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%20vs%20%E4%BC%A0%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%8C%89%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%E5%88%92%E5%88%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原始证据证明力一般大于传来证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8E%E4%BC%A0%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 直接证据 vs 间接证据（按内容完整性划分）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%20vs%20%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%8C%89%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%80%A7%E5%88%92%E5%88%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="只看内容是否能完整证明案件事实，与来源、证明力大小无关" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AA%E7%9C%8B%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="典型：无法与原件核对的借条复印件是直接证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%E6%A0%B8%E5%AF%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%80%9F%E6%9D%A1%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%E6%98%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 本证 vs 反证（按与证明责任的关系划分）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%20vs%20%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%8C%89%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%92%E5%88%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="承担证明责任的人提供的是本证，不承担的是反证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）证据的法定分类" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 物证、书证、视听资料、电子数据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%A9%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E3%80%81%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="本质相同，都是用内容证明案件事实，因此书证的规则同样适用于视听资料和电子数据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%94%A8%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E5%90%8C%E6%A0%B7%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%92%8C%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="书证三大核心规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 最佳证据规则：应当提供原件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 真实性规则：公文书证推定为真实；私文书证形式真实性由主张方证明，内容真实性推定真实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9B%E7%A7%81%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 文书提出命令规则：对方持有书证拒不提交的，推定书证内容为真实；故意毁损的，推定待证事实为真实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E6%8C%81%E6%9C%89%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9B%E6%95%85%E6%84%8F%E6%AF%81%E6%8D%9F%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E5%BE%85%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 证人证言" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="证人资格：知道案件情况且能正确表达，无/限制民事行为能力人、与案件有利害关系的人都可以做证人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%9A%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%94%E8%83%BD%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0/%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%BD%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%81%9A%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="出庭义务：无正当理由未出庭的证人书面证言不得作为定案根据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%9C%AA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 鉴定意见" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="谁承担证明责任谁申请鉴定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%B0%81%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E8%B0%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="鉴定人无正当理由拒不出庭的，鉴定意见不得作为定案根据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 有专门知识的人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="作用：帮当事人质证、帮当事人陈述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%9A%E5%B8%AE%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E5%B8%AE%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="费用申请方承担，不适用回避制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%96%B9%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题11 证明的程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9811%20%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="第一节 证据保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%8A%82%20%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="为了防止证据灭失或者日后难以取得，根据当事人的申请，或者由法院依职权裁定对证据进行保全。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%81%AD%E5%A4%B1%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%97%A5%E5%90%8E%E9%9A%BE%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%EF%BC%8C%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、诉讼中的证据保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 适用情形：证据可能灭失或者日后难以取得" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E7%81%AD%E5%A4%B1%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%97%A5%E5%90%8E%E9%9A%BE%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 启动方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="当事人申请" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院依职权裁定（仅适用于法院应当依职权调查的事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 申请时间：举证期限届满前" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 管辖法院：受理案件的法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="5. 担保要求：可能给他人造成损失的，应当责令提供担保；仅采取拍照、录像、勘验等不会造成损失的措施，无需提供担保" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%9B%E4%BB%85%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E6%8B%8D%E7%85%A7%E3%80%81%E5%BD%95%E5%83%8F%E3%80%81%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E7%AD%89%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、诉前的证据保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 适用情形：情况紧急，证据可能灭失或者日后难以取得" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E7%81%AD%E5%A4%B1%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%97%A5%E5%90%8E%E9%9A%BE%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 启动方式：只能由利害关系人申请，法院不得依职权启动" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 管辖法院（三选一）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%E9%80%89%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="证据所在地法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="被申请人住所地法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="将来对案件有管辖权的法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B0%86%E6%9D%A5%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 裁定期限：法院必须在48小时内作出裁定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E48%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="5. 后续要求：申请人应当在法院采取保全措施后30日内依法提起诉讼或者申请仲裁；逾期不起诉或不申请仲裁的，法院应当裁定解除保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E30%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%9B%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%88%96%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="6. 担保要求：应当责令提供担保（诉前保全风险大，必须担保）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="第二节 举证与调查收集证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E8%8A%82%20%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、举证期限" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 举证期限的确定：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院在审理前的准备阶段确定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人协商一致后，经法院准许" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 法定期限要求：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="一审普通程序：法院确定的举证期限不得少于15日" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%B0%91%E4%BA%8E15%E6%97%A5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="二审程序：当事人提供新证据的，法院确定的举证期限不得少于10日" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%96%B0%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%B0%91%E4%BA%8E10%E6%97%A5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人协商确定的举证期限，不受上述期限限制，可以少于法定期限" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%B0%91%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 举证期限的延长：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E7%9A%84%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="当事人在举证期限内提供证据确有困难的，可以申请延长" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%86%85%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%A1%AE%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%B0%E9%9A%BE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="申请时间：必须在举证期限届满前书面申请" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="举证期限届满后，不得再申请延长，此时已构成逾期举证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%86%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E5%B7%B2%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 逾期举证的法律后果（根据主观恶性和证据重要性分层次处理）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%BB%E8%A7%82%E6%81%B6%E6%80%A7%E5%92%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E6%80%A7%E5%88%86%E5%B1%82%E6%AC%A1%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="故意或重大过失逾期举证：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%85%E6%84%8F%E6%88%96%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E8%BF%87%E5%A4%B1%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="一般情形：法院不予采纳该证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E9%87%87%E7%BA%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="例外：该证据与案件基本事实相关的，法院应当采纳，但应当对当事人予以训诫、罚款" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E9%87%87%E7%BA%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%AD%E8%AF%AB%E3%80%81%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="一般过失逾期举证：法院应当采纳该证据，并对当事人予以训诫" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E8%BF%87%E5%A4%B1%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E9%87%87%E7%BA%B3%E8%AF%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E5%AF%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%AD%E8%AF%AB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="无主观过错逾期举证：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E4%B8%BB%E8%A7%82%E8%BF%87%E9%94%99%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="因客观原因无法在举证期限内提供" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%A0%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%86%85%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="对方当事人对逾期提供证据无异议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%97%A0%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="处理：视为未逾期，正常采纳该证据，无需训诫、罚款" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%AA%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%E9%87%87%E7%BA%B3%E8%AF%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%AE%AD%E8%AF%AB%E3%80%81%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、当事人主张的事实与法院认定不一致的处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="（证据规定第53条，核心考点）" _mubu_note="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%AC%AC53%E6%9D%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E">
          <outline text="（一）适用情形" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 当事人主张的法律关系性质与法院根据案件事实作出的认定不一致" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 当事人主张的民事行为效力与法院根据案件事实作出的认定不一致" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）错误处理方式及原理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%8F%8A%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 错误方式一：法院直接以自己认定的事实作出判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="错误原因：构成突袭判决，剥夺了当事人对法院认定事实的辩论权，违反辩论原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%EF%BC%9A%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AA%81%E8%A2%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%89%A5%E5%A4%BA%E4%BA%86%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 错误方式二：法院告知当事人变更诉讼请求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="错误原因：违反法官职业道德（泄露未决案件结果），破坏司法中立，违反平等原则（法官变相帮助一方当事人）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E8%81%8C%E4%B8%9A%E9%81%93%E5%BE%B7%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E6%9C%AA%E5%86%B3%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%A0%B4%E5%9D%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%AD%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B9%B3%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%8F%98%E7%9B%B8%E5%B8%AE%E5%8A%A9%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）正确处理方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 法院应当将法律关系性质或者民事行为效力作为焦点问题进行审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="法院在归纳争议焦点时，应当将其认定的事实归纳为争议焦点，引导双方当事人围绕该焦点进行举证、质证和辩论，保护当事人的辩论权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%9C%A8%E5%BD%92%E7%BA%B3%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E5%85%B6%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%92%E7%BA%B3%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%95%E5%AF%BC%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9B%B4%E7%BB%95%E8%AF%A5%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E5%92%8C%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 当事人根据法庭审理情况变更诉讼请求的，法院应当准许" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原理：当事人有权在法律规定的范围内处分自己的民事权利和诉讼权利（处分原则）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%86%85%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E5%92%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 法院可以根据案件具体情况重新指定举证期限" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="不是必须重新指定，由法院根据审理情况决定是否需要当事人补充举证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）典型案例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 案例一（民事行为效力争议）：张三起诉李四要求解除合同，双方均默认合同有效。法院经审理认为合同无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%88%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%9D%87%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="处理：法院应当将“合同是否有效”归纳为争议焦点，引导双方辩论；张三可以变更诉讼请求为确认合同无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E2%80%9C%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E2%80%9D%E5%BD%92%E7%BA%B3%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%95%E5%AF%BC%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9B%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%BA%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 案例二（法律关系性质争议）：张三持房屋买卖合同起诉李四，要求李四交付房屋并过户。法院经审理认为双方实为借款合同关系，房屋买卖合同是为了规避流押条款。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E6%8C%81%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E5%B9%B6%E8%BF%87%E6%88%B7%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%BA%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%84%E9%81%BF%E6%B5%81%E6%8A%BC%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="处理：法院应当将“本案法律关系是买卖合同还是借款合同”归纳为争议焦点，引导双方辩论；张三可以变更诉讼请求为返还借款。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E2%80%9C%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%AF%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E2%80%9D%E5%BD%92%E7%BA%B3%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%95%E5%AF%BC%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9B%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%BA%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 案例三（合同成立与否争议）：张三起诉李四要求确认合同无效。法院经审理认为合同不成立。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%88%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E4%B8%8E%E5%90%A6%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="处理：法院应当将“合同是否成立”归纳为争议焦点，引导双方辩论；张三可以变更诉讼请求为确认合同不成立。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E2%80%9C%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E2%80%9D%E5%BD%92%E7%BA%B3%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%95%E5%AF%BC%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9B%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%BA%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、法院调查收集证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）基本原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院调查收集证据以依申请为原则，以依职权为例外。法院不得主动依职权调查收集与当事人实体权利义务相关的证据，否则会破坏司法中立。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%A5%E4%BE%9D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%BA%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E4%B8%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E4%BC%9A%E7%A0%B4%E5%9D%8F%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%AD%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）法院依职权调查收集证据的范围（仅适用于以下三类事实）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 涉及国家利益、社会公共利益、第三人合法权益的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 涉及身份关系的事实" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 涉及依职权追加当事人、中止诉讼、终结诉讼、回避等程序性事项" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%AD%89%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）高频考点总结：法院应当依职权调查的三类事实的适用场景" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 涉及上述三类事实的，不适用自认，法院必须依职权查清" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%B8%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 涉及上述三类事实的，法院可以依职权通知证人出庭作证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 涉及上述三类事实的，法院可以依职权决定鉴定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 涉及上述三类事实的，法院可以依职权调查收集证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）法院调查收集证据的质证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 法院依职权调查收集的证据：无需质证，在庭审时出示，就调查收集情况作出说明，听取当事人意见即可" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E6%97%B6%E5%87%BA%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%AC%E5%8F%96%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 法院依当事人申请调查收集的证据：视为申请方当事人提供的证据，进行正常的质证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="第三节 质证与证据的认定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E8%8A%82%20%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、质证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 概念：证据应当在法庭上出示，由当事人就证据的客观性、关联性、合法性发表意见，进行质疑和辩驳的程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E4%B8%8A%E5%87%BA%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%B0%B1%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E6%80%A7%E3%80%81%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E6%80%A7%E3%80%81%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%80%A7%E5%8F%91%E8%A1%A8%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%B4%A8%E7%96%91%E5%92%8C%E8%BE%A9%E9%A9%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 法律效力：未经质证的证据，不得作为认定案件事实的根据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 视为质证的情形：当事人在审理前的准备阶段认可的证据，经审判人员在庭审中说明后，视为质证过的证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E8%AE%A4%E5%8F%AF%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E8%BF%87%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 质证的公开性：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：质证应当公开进行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外：涉及国家秘密、商业秘密、个人隐私或者法律规定应当保密的证据，不得公开质证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E3%80%81%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E3%80%81%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%90%E7%A7%81%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E4%BF%9D%E5%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="易错点：涉及商业秘密的证据是依职权不公开质证，与“涉及商业秘密的案件依申请不公开审理”不同" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E2%80%9C%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BE%9D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="典型案例：公开审理的合同纠纷案件中，质证一份涉及商业秘密的证据时，法官应当责令旁听群众退庭，然后进行不公开质证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%BD%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E6%97%81%E5%90%AC%E7%BE%A4%E4%BC%97%E9%80%80%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E7%84%B6%E5%90%8E%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、证据的认定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）证据裁判原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院认定案件事实，必须以证据为根据。法院应当以证据能够证明的案件事实为依据，依法作出裁判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%BA%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%BA%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）非法证据排除规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 排除情形：以下列方法形成或者获取的证据，不得作为认定案件事实的根据：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="严重侵害他人合法权益的方法" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%A5%E9%87%8D%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="违反法律禁止性规定的方法" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="严重违背公序良俗的方法" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%A5%E9%87%8D%E8%BF%9D%E8%83%8C%E5%85%AC%E5%BA%8F%E8%89%AF%E4%BF%97%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 核心原理：从根本上遏制非法取证行为。通过剥夺非法取证者的诉讼利益，使其非法取证的目的落空，从而保护公民的合法权益、法律秩序和公序良俗。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%E6%A0%B9%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%8A%E9%81%8F%E5%88%B6%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E5%8F%96%E8%AF%81%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%82%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%89%A5%E5%A4%BA%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E5%8F%96%E8%AF%81%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%BF%E5%85%B6%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E5%8F%96%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%90%BD%E7%A9%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8E%E8%80%8C%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E5%85%AC%E6%B0%91%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E7%A7%A9%E5%BA%8F%E5%92%8C%E5%85%AC%E5%BA%8F%E8%89%AF%E4%BF%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 高频考点：偷拍偷录的合法性" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%81%B7%E6%8B%8D%E5%81%B7%E5%BD%95%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="典型案例：北大方正集团诉高术天利公司著作权侵权纠纷案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%97%E5%A4%A7%E6%96%B9%E6%AD%A3%E9%9B%86%E5%9B%A2%E8%AF%89%E9%AB%98%E6%9C%AF%E5%A4%A9%E5%88%A9%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%91%97%E4%BD%9C%E6%9D%83%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="案情：北大方正派员工冒充消费者，偷拍偷录高术天利公司安装盗版软件的过程，并进行了公证。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%97%E5%A4%A7%E6%96%B9%E6%AD%A3%E6%B4%BE%E5%91%98%E5%B7%A5%E5%86%92%E5%85%85%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E8%80%85%EF%BC%8C%E5%81%B7%E6%8B%8D%E5%81%B7%E5%BD%95%E9%AB%98%E6%9C%AF%E5%A4%A9%E5%88%A9%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E7%9B%97%E7%89%88%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%86%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="最高法院裁判观点：北大方正的偷拍偷录行为不属于非法方法，取得的证据可以作为定案根据。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E8%A7%82%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%97%E5%A4%A7%E6%96%B9%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%81%B7%E6%8B%8D%E5%81%B7%E5%BD%95%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="结论：偷拍偷录本身不属于非法方法（未经对方允许用手机、录音笔、摄像机等普通设备录音录像）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%81%B7%E6%8B%8D%E5%81%B7%E5%BD%95%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E7%94%A8%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E3%80%81%E5%BD%95%E9%9F%B3%E7%AC%94%E3%80%81%E6%91%84%E5%83%8F%E6%9C%BA%E7%AD%89%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E5%BD%95%E9%9F%B3%E5%BD%95%E5%83%8F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="非法方法的界定：使用专门的窃听、窃录设备（如针孔摄像头、电话窃听器、秘密行踪记录仪等）进行的窃听、窃录，属于法律禁止的非法方法。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E7%9A%84%E7%95%8C%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%9A%84%E7%AA%83%E5%90%AC%E3%80%81%E7%AA%83%E5%BD%95%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E9%92%88%E5%AD%94%E6%91%84%E5%83%8F%E5%A4%B4%E3%80%81%E7%94%B5%E8%AF%9D%E7%AA%83%E5%90%AC%E5%99%A8%E3%80%81%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E8%A1%8C%E8%B8%AA%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E4%BB%AA%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%AA%83%E5%90%AC%E3%80%81%E7%AA%83%E5%BD%95%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）自由心证制度（核心考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%BF%83%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 两个基本概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="证据能力：又称证据资格，是指某一材料能够作为证据使用的法律资格。解决的是“能不能作为证据”的问题。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%88%E7%A7%B0%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E6%8C%87%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%80%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%E3%80%82%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="证明力：是指证据对案件事实的证明作用的有无和大小。解决的是“能在多大程度上证明案件事实”的问题。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%98%AF%E6%8C%87%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E6%97%A0%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E3%80%82%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E8%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%9A%E5%A4%A7%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 证据能力与证明力的核心区别" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="| 比较项 | 证据能力 | 证明力 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 性质 | 法律属性 | 自然属性 |
| 决定因素 | 法律规定 | 经验常识、逻辑推理 |
| 考量因素 | 真实性、价值判断（如权利保护、公序良俗） | 仅考量真实性、关联性 |
| 典型规则 | 非法证据排除规则、无正当理由未出庭的证人书面证言不得作为定案根据 | 无法律预先规定，由法官自由判断 |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%AF%94%E8%BE%83%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%9B%A0%E7%B4%A0%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%E5%B8%B8%E8%AF%86%E3%80%81%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%80%83%E9%87%8F%E5%9B%A0%E7%B4%A0%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E3%80%81%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E5%BA%8F%E8%89%AF%E4%BF%97%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E8%80%83%E9%87%8F%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%E3%80%81%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%224%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E3%80%81%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%9C%AA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E9%A2%84%E5%85%88%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 法定证据制度 vs 自由心证制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%20vs%20%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%BF%83%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="法定证据制度（封建社会纠问制诉讼下的制度）：法律预先明文规定每一种证据的证明力大小，法官只需将证据的证明力机械相加即可定案。缺点是过于机械，不符合认识规律。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%B0%81%E5%BB%BA%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E7%BA%A0%E9%97%AE%E5%88%B6%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E9%A2%84%E5%85%88%E6%98%8E%E6%96%87%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%8F%AA%E9%9C%80%E5%B0%86%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E6%9C%BA%E6%A2%B0%E7%9B%B8%E5%8A%A0%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E3%80%82%E7%BC%BA%E7%82%B9%E6%98%AF%E8%BF%87%E4%BA%8E%E6%9C%BA%E6%A2%B0%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%86%E8%A7%84%E5%BE%8B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="自由心证制度（现代诉讼制度）：法律只规定证据能力（什么能作为证据），不规定证明力的大小。证明力的有无和大小，由审判人员依照法定程序，全面、客观地审核证据，依据法律规定，遵循职业道德，运用逻辑推理和日常生活经验，独立进行判断。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%BF%83%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%8E%B0%E4%BB%A3%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%8F%AA%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E3%80%82%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E6%97%A0%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E4%BE%9D%E7%85%A7%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E3%80%81%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%A1%E6%A0%B8%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%B5%E5%BE%AA%E8%81%8C%E4%B8%9A%E9%81%93%E5%BE%B7%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%90%E7%94%A8%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E5%92%8C%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="4. 心证公开：法官应当在裁判文书中公开判断的理由和结果，接受社会监督，防止自由心证的滥用。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%83%E8%AF%81%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%A8%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E5%92%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%EF%BC%8C%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%BF%83%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E6%BB%A5%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="5. 典型真题（2016年主观题）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%882016%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%BB%E8%A7%82%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="题目：张某驾车将李某撞伤，交警大队出具交通事故认定书，认定张某承担事故全部责任。李某起诉张某赔偿，向法院提供了该交通事故认定书。问：该交通事故认定书是否当然具有证明力？请说明理由。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E9%A9%BE%E8%BD%A6%E5%B0%86%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E6%92%9E%E4%BC%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%A4%E8%AD%A6%E5%A4%A7%E9%98%9F%E5%87%BA%E5%85%B7%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E3%80%82%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E4%BA%86%E8%AF%A5%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%E9%97%AE%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%A5%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9F%E8%AF%B7%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="答案：不当然具有证明力。理由：证明力的有无和大小，应当由审判人员依照法定程序，全面、客观地审核证据，依据法律规定，遵循职业道德，运用逻辑推理和日常生活经验，独立进行判断。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E6%97%A0%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E4%BE%9D%E7%85%A7%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E3%80%81%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%A1%E6%A0%B8%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%B5%E5%BE%AA%E8%81%8C%E4%B8%9A%E9%81%93%E5%BE%B7%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%90%E7%94%A8%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E5%92%8C%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（四）不能单独作为认定案件事实的证据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 当事人的陈述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 无民事行为能力人、限制民事行为能力人所作的与其年龄、智力、精神健康状况不相当的证言" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%97%A0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%80%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%B6%E5%B9%B4%E9%BE%84%E3%80%81%E6%99%BA%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%81%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E7%8A%B6%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%8D%E7%9B%B8%E5%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 与一方当事人或者其代理人有利害关系的证人出具的证言" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%85%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E8%A8%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 存在疑点的视听资料、电子数据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%96%91%E7%82%B9%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E3%80%81%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="5. 无法与原件、原物核对的复印件、复制品" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%81%E5%8E%9F%E7%89%A9%E6%A0%B8%E5%AF%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%B0%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%81%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E5%93%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="原理：上述证据的证明力较小，不能单独定案，需要其他证据补强其证明力。这是司法解释对司法实践中普遍经验常识的总结和归纳，不违反自由心证原则。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E8%BE%83%E5%B0%8F%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%A1%A5%E5%BC%BA%E5%85%B6%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E5%AF%B9%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E4%B8%AD%E6%99%AE%E9%81%8D%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%E5%B8%B8%E8%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E5%92%8C%E5%BD%92%E7%BA%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%BF%83%E8%AF%81%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题12 保全与先予执行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9812%20%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="第一节 保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%8A%82%20%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、保全的分类" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）按内容分类" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%8C%89%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 财产保全：查封、扣押、冻结对方当事人的财产，防止其转移、隐匿、变卖财产，保障将来生效判决能够顺利执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%E3%80%81%E6%89%A3%E6%8A%BC%E3%80%81%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E5%85%B6%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E3%80%81%E9%9A%90%E5%8C%BF%E3%80%81%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%96%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%E5%B0%86%E6%9D%A5%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E9%A1%BA%E5%88%A9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 行为保全：责令对方当事人作出或者不得作出一定的行为，以防止给权利人的合法权益造成难以弥补的损害。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E7%BB%99%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E9%9A%BE%E4%BB%A5%E5%BC%A5%E8%A1%A5%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="典型例子：人身安全保护令、人格权侵害禁止令、知识产权侵权纠纷中责令停止生产销售侵权产品。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E4%BB%A4%E3%80%81%E4%BA%BA%E6%A0%BC%E6%9D%83%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E4%BB%A4%E3%80%81%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E4%BA%A7%E6%9D%83%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%B8%AD%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E9%94%80%E5%94%AE%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）按时间分类" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%8C%89%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 诉前保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 诉讼中的保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 执行前的保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、诉前保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 适用情形：情况紧急，不立即采取保全措施将会使申请人的合法权益遭受难以弥补的损害。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E5%B0%86%E4%BC%9A%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E9%81%AD%E5%8F%97%E9%9A%BE%E4%BB%A5%E5%BC%A5%E8%A1%A5%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 启动方式：只能依利害关系人申请，法院不得依职权启动诉前保全。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E4%BE%9D%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 管辖法院（三选一）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%E9%80%89%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="被保全财产所在地法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="被申请人住所地法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="将来对案件有管辖权的法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B0%86%E6%9D%A5%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 管辖衔接：采取诉前保全措施的法院与受理案件的法院不一致的，采取保全措施的法院应当将保全财产及保全手续移送给受理案件的法院，诉前保全裁定视为受理案件的法院作出的裁定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E8%A1%94%E6%8E%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E5%8F%8A%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%89%8B%E7%BB%AD%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="5. 担保要求：应当责令申请人提供担保（诉前保全风险大，必须担保）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="6. 裁定期限：法院必须在48小时内作出裁定；裁定采取保全措施的，应当立即开始执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E48%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9B%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="7. 后续要求：申请人应当在法院采取保全措施之日起30日内依法提起诉讼或者申请仲裁；逾期不起诉或不申请仲裁的，法院应当裁定解除保全。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E30%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%9B%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%88%96%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、诉讼中的保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 适用情形：可能因当事人一方的行为或者其他原因，致使判决难以执行或者造成当事人其他损害的案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%A0%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%B4%E4%BD%BF%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%9A%BE%E4%BB%A5%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 启动方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：依申请人申请" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E4%BE%9D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外：法院认为必要时，可以依职权裁定保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 管辖法院：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：由受理案件的法院管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外：当事人提起上诉，二审法院尚未接到一审法院报送的案卷材料期间，当事人申请保全的，由一审法院采取保全措施（一审法院对案情更了解）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B0%9A%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%A5%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8A%A5%E9%80%81%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E5%8D%B7%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%E6%9B%B4%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 担保要求：可以责令申请人提供担保（风险可控，担保不是必须的，由法院根据案情决定）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E5%8F%AF%E6%8E%A7%EF%BC%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="5. 裁定期限：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="一般情况：法院应当在5日内作出裁定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E5%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="情况紧急：必须在48小时内作出裁定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E48%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="四、执行前的保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 适用时间：判决生效后、履行期限届满前。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%90%8E%E3%80%81%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原理：判决生效前可以申请诉讼中的保全；履行期限届满后可以直接申请强制执行，无需保全。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%89%8D%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%EF%BC%9B%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 管辖法院：执行法院（一审法院或者与一审法院同级的被执行财产所在地法院）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 后续要求：申请人应当在生效法律文书确定的履行期限届满后5日内申请执行；逾期不申请执行的，法院应当裁定解除保全。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%A8%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E5%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%9B%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 担保要求：可以不责令申请人提供担保（判决已经生效，当事人之间的权利义务关系已经确定，错误保全的风险极小）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E7%9A%84%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E6%9E%81%E5%B0%8F%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="五、保全的共同问题" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="（一）保全措施" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 一般财产：采取查封、扣押、冻结等措施。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%E3%80%81%E6%89%A3%E6%8A%BC%E3%80%81%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%E7%AD%89%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="查封：就地查封，不转移财产的占有" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%B1%E5%9C%B0%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%A0%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="扣押：将财产转移至法院指定地点保管" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A3%E6%8A%BC%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E8%87%B3%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E5%9C%B0%E7%82%B9%E4%BF%9D%E7%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="冻结：针对银行账户、股票账户、基金账户等" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%9A%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E3%80%81%E8%82%A1%E7%A5%A8%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E3%80%81%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E7%AD%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 不宜长期保存的物品：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9C%E9%95%BF%E6%9C%9F%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E5%93%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="处理方式：责令物品持有人及时变价处理，由法院保存价款；必要时，由法院组织变卖，变卖后由法院保存价款。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E7%89%A9%E5%93%81%E6%8C%81%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8A%E6%97%B6%E5%8F%98%E4%BB%B7%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E4%BB%B7%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%9B%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%96%E5%90%8E%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E4%BB%B7%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="典型例子：季节性商品、鲜活易腐烂变质的水果、蔬菜等。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%AD%A3%E8%8A%82%E6%80%A7%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E3%80%81%E9%B2%9C%E6%B4%BB%E6%98%93%E8%85%90%E7%83%82%E5%8F%98%E8%B4%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%B0%B4%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%81%E8%94%AC%E8%8F%9C%E7%AD%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 对担保财产的保全：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="法院可以对抵押物、质押物、留置物等担保财产采取保全措施。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%B9%E6%8A%B5%E6%8A%BC%E7%89%A9%E3%80%81%E8%B4%A8%E6%8A%BC%E7%89%A9%E3%80%81%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E7%89%A9%E7%AD%89%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="采取保全措施后，不影响担保物权人的优先受偿权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%E5%8F%97%E5%81%BF%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="对质押物、留置物采取保全措施的，一般不改变其占有状态，仍由质押权人、留置权人保管；确有必要由法院保管的，也不影响担保物权人的优先受偿权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B4%A8%E6%8A%BC%E7%89%A9%E3%80%81%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E7%89%A9%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E5%85%B6%E5%8D%A0%E6%9C%89%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8D%E7%94%B1%E8%B4%A8%E6%8A%BC%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E4%BF%9D%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%9B%E7%A1%AE%E6%9C%89%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BF%9D%E7%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%E5%8F%97%E5%81%BF%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（二）保全的救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="当事人对保全裁定不服的，可以向作出保全裁定的法院申请复议一次。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="复议期间不停止原裁定的执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%8D%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（三）保全的解除" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="有下列情形之一的，法院应当裁定解除保全：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%80%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="1. 保全错误的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 申请人撤回保全申请的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 申请人的起诉或者诉讼请求被人民法院生效裁判驳回的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%A2%AB%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 诉前保全措施采取后，申请人在30日内不起诉或者不申请仲裁的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A830%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E4%B8%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="5. 财产纠纷案件，被申请人向法院提供充分、有效的担保的，法院应当裁定解除保全。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%85%E5%88%86%E3%80%81%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="重要限制：仅限于财产纠纷案件。行为保全不能通过提供担保解除。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E9%99%90%E4%BA%8E%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="反面例子：离婚诉讼中，法院裁定责令丈夫停止对妻子实施家庭暴力（行为保全），丈夫不能以提供100万担保为由要求解除保全。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8D%E9%9D%A2%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E4%B8%88%E5%A4%AB%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E5%AF%B9%E5%A6%BB%E5%AD%90%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E6%9A%B4%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%88%E5%A4%AB%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B100%E4%B8%87%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="六、典型真题与考点解析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AD%E3%80%81%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E4%B8%8E%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="例一：水果买卖合同诉前保全案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%B4%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="案情：位于A省B县的甲公司与A省C县的乙公司订立水果买卖合同，甲公司付款后乙公司不发货。甲公司担心乙公司转移水果，向水果仓库所在地D县法院申请诉前保全。法院采取保全措施后，甲公司向被告住所地C县法院起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%8D%E4%BA%8EA%E7%9C%81B%E5%8E%BF%E7%9A%84%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%8EA%E7%9C%81C%E5%8E%BF%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%AE%A2%E7%AB%8B%E6%B0%B4%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%BB%98%E6%AC%BE%E5%90%8E%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%91%E8%B4%A7%E3%80%82%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8B%85%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E6%B0%B4%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E6%B0%B4%E6%9E%9C%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0D%E5%8E%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%90%91%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0C%E5%8E%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="选项分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="A. 甲公司应当提供担保 ✅（诉前保全必须担保）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%20%E2%9C%85%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="B. D县法院应当冻结这批水果 ❌（冻结针对账户，水果应变卖后保存价款）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20D%E5%8E%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%E8%BF%99%E6%89%B9%E6%B0%B4%E6%9E%9C%20%E2%9D%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%B0%B4%E6%9E%9C%E5%BA%94%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%96%E5%90%8E%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E4%BB%B7%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="C. C县法院受理案件后，D县法院应当将保全手续一并移送给C县法院 ✅（保全为诉讼服务）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20C%E5%8E%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8CD%E5%8E%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%89%8B%E7%BB%AD%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99C%E5%8E%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%E2%9C%85%EF%BC%88%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="D. C县法院受理案件后，应当将案件移送D县法院 ❌" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20C%E5%8E%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81D%E5%8E%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%E2%9D%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="答案：AC" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AAC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="例二：管辖争议时的保全处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%B6%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="案情：甲因专利纠纷向A区法院申请诉前保全，A区法院采取保全措施后，甲向B区法院起诉。B区法院受理后认为本院无管辖权，将案件移送给A区法院。A区法院认为B区法院移送错误。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%93%E5%88%A9%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%90%91A%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%EF%BC%8CA%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E5%90%91B%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82B%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E6%97%A0%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99A%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E3%80%82A%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BAB%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="处理：在上级法院对案件管辖权作出最终指定前，采取保全措施的A区法院应当暂停处理，等待管辖权确定，不得擅自移送保全财产。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E7%9A%84A%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9A%82%E5%81%9C%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E6%93%85%E8%87%AA%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="例三：行为保全的救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%9A%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="人身安全保护令：本质是行为保全。对人身安全保护令裁定不服的，向作出裁定的法院申请复议一次。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E4%BB%A4%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AF%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%82%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E4%BB%A4%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="人格权侵害禁止令：本质是行为保全。对禁止令裁定不服的，向作出裁定的法院申请复议一次。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%A0%BC%E6%9D%83%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E4%BB%A4%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AF%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E3%80%82%E5%AF%B9%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E4%BB%A4%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="第二节 先予执行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E8%8A%82%20%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="先予执行是指在诉讼过程中，判决尚未生效前，为了解决权利人生产、生活的紧急需要，法院依法裁定责令义务人预先履行一定义务的制度。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%98%AF%E6%8C%87%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%B0%9A%E6%9C%AA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E3%80%81%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E7%9A%84%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E9%A2%84%E5%85%88%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、适用范围" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 追索赡养费、抚养费、抚育费、抚恤金、医疗费用的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E8%82%B2%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E6%81%A4%E9%87%91%E3%80%81%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 追索劳动报酬的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%A5%E9%85%AC%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 因情况紧急需要先予执行的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%9B%A0%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、劳动仲裁中的先予执行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="劳动者在劳动仲裁中申请先予执行的，由仲裁庭作出裁决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%80%85%E5%9C%A8%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%AD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="先予执行裁决作出后，应当移送人民法院执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="劳动者申请先予执行的，可以不提供担保。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%80%85%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="四、适用条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 当事人之间的权利义务关系明确" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 权利人有实现权利的迫切需要（不先予执行将严重影响申请人的生活或者生产经营）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%AB%E5%88%87%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%B0%86%E4%B8%A5%E9%87%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 必须由当事人提出申请，法院不得依职权裁定先予执行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 被申请人有履行能力（先予执行的目的是解决紧急需要，被申请人无履行能力的，裁定无意义）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A0%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%97%A0%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="五、程序要求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 启动方式：只能依当事人申请，法院不得依职权启动。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E4%BE%9D%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 担保要求：可以责令申请人提供担保（不是必须的）。申请人不提供担保的，驳回申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原理：申请人通常是经济困难的弱势群体，无力提供担保。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%9A%E5%B8%B8%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E%E5%9B%B0%E9%9A%BE%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%B1%E5%8A%BF%E7%BE%A4%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E5%8A%9B%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 范围限制：先予执行的范围应当限于当事人诉讼请求的范围，并且以满足权利人生产、生活的急需为限。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E9%99%90%E4%BA%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E4%B8%94%E4%BB%A5%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E3%80%81%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%80%A5%E9%9C%80%E4%B8%BA%E9%99%90%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="六、救济与最终处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AD%E3%80%81%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 救济：当事人对先予执行裁定不服的，可以向作出裁定的法院申请复议一次。复议期间不停止原裁定的执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E3%80%82%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%8D%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 最终处理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院作出最终判决时，应当对先予执行的情况予以说明。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="判决支持申请人全部诉讼请求的：先予执行的部分应当在最终执行金额中扣除。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%87%91%E9%A2%9D%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%A3%E9%99%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="判决驳回申请人诉讼请求的：先予执行错误，申请人应当返还因先予执行所取得的财产；拒不返还的，法院强制执行（执行回转）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E5%9B%A0%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%89%80%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%9B%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%9B%9E%E8%BD%AC%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="专题总结：各类程序中的担保要求对比" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%84%E7%B1%BB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="| 程序类型 | 担保要求 | 核心原理 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 诉前证据保全 | 应当责令提供担保 | 诉前风险大，法院对案情一无所知 |
| 诉讼中证据保全 | 可能给他人造成损失的，应当责令提供担保 | 仅拍照、录像等无风险措施无需担保 |
| 诉前财产/行为保全 | 应当责令提供担保 | 诉前风险最大，错误保全可能性高 |
| 诉讼中财产/行为保全 | 可以责令提供担保 | 法院对案情已有了解，风险可控 |
| 执行前保全 | 可以不责令提供担保 | 判决已生效，权利义务关系明确，错误风险极小 |
| 先予执行 | 可以责令提供担保 | 申请人多为经济困难群体，无力提供担保 |
| 劳动仲裁先予执行（劳动者申请） | 可以不提供担保 | 保护劳动者合法权益 |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A0%E6%89%80%E7%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E6%8B%8D%E7%85%A7%E3%80%81%E5%BD%95%E5%83%8F%E7%AD%89%E6%97%A0%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%E9%AB%98%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%224%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%E5%B7%B2%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E5%8F%AF%E6%8E%A7%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%225%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%B7%B2%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%8C%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E6%9E%81%E5%B0%8F%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%226%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E%E5%9B%B0%E9%9A%BE%E7%BE%A4%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E5%8A%9B%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%227%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%85%88%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%80%85%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%80%85%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题13 对妨害民事诉讼的强制措施" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9813%20%E5%AF%B9%E5%A6%A8%E5%AE%B3%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、概述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="对妨害民事诉讼的强制措施，是指人民法院在民事诉讼过程中，为了保障诉讼活动和执行活动的顺利进行，对实施妨害诉讼、妨害执行行为的人依法采取的强制手段。主要包括三种：拘传、罚款、拘留。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E5%A6%A8%E5%AE%B3%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E6%8C%87%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%9C%A8%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E5%92%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%9A%84%E9%A1%BA%E5%88%A9%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BD%E5%A6%A8%E5%AE%B3%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E5%A6%A8%E5%AE%B3%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%8B%E6%AE%B5%E3%80%82%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%E3%80%81%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%81%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、拘传" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="人民法院对必须到庭的当事人，经两次传票传唤，无正当理由拒不到庭的，可以由院长签发拘传票，强制其到庭参加诉讼的强制措施。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%A4%E6%AC%A1%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B1%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E7%AD%BE%E5%8F%91%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E5%85%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="本质：限制公民人身自由，因此适用条件极为严格。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E5%85%AC%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E6%9E%81%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%A5%E6%A0%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）一般当事人不到庭的处理（与拘传对比）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 原告不到庭：视为原告不想解决纠纷，按撤诉处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E6%83%B3%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 被告不到庭：视为被告放弃陈述与申辩的权利，法院在没有被告陈述申辩的情况下依法作出缺席判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%8E%E7%94%B3%E8%BE%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%9C%A8%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E7%94%B3%E8%BE%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%8B%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）拘传的严格适用条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%A5%E6%A0%BC%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 适用对象：仅适用于必须到庭的当事人，范围非常狭窄：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E9%9D%9E%E5%B8%B8%E7%8B%AD%E7%AA%84%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="负有赡养、抚养、抚育义务的当事人（司法解释明确规定）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%B4%9F%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E8%82%B2%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="不到庭就无法查清违法事实的当事人（如虚假诉讼的原被告）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E5%B0%B1%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E6%9F%A5%E6%B8%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E8%99%9A%E5%81%87%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="目的：不是为了查清双方当事人之间的实体权利义务关系，而是为了查清其扰乱诉讼秩序的违法事实，以便对其进行罚款、拘留等处罚" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E6%9F%A5%E6%B8%85%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E6%9F%A5%E6%B8%85%E5%85%B6%E6%89%B0%E4%B9%B1%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A7%A9%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E4%BE%BF%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%81%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%E7%AD%89%E5%A4%84%E7%BD%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 程序条件：必须经过两次传票传唤，当事人无正当理由拒不到庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%A4%E6%AC%A1%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 批准程序：必须由院长签发拘传票，审判长或独任审判员无权签发" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E7%AD%BE%E5%8F%91%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%95%BF%E6%88%96%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%E7%AD%BE%E5%8F%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（四）考试提醒" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E6%8F%90%E9%86%92%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="考试中如果选项出现“拘传”，选择时必须极其慎重" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E4%B8%AD%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E2%80%9C%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%97%B6%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%9E%81%E5%85%B6%E6%85%8E%E9%87%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="除非明确是上述两类必须到庭的当事人，否则一般不选拘传" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%99%A4%E9%9D%9E%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%A4%E7%B1%BB%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%89%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="民事诉讼中拘传适用极少，实践中绝大多数民事法官从未申请过拘传票，考试中也极少作为正确选项出现" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9E%81%E5%B0%91%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E4%B8%AD%E7%BB%9D%E5%A4%A7%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E4%BB%8E%E6%9C%AA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%BF%87%E6%8B%98%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E4%B8%AD%E4%B9%9F%E6%9E%81%E5%B0%91%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、罚款与拘留" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E4%B8%8E%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）适用情形" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="适用于所有实施了妨害诉讼、妨害执行行为的人，包括当事人、其他诉讼参与人、案外人。典型行为包括：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BD%E4%BA%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A6%A8%E5%AE%B3%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E5%A6%A8%E5%AE%B3%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="1. 扰乱法庭秩序、哄闹冲击法庭" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%89%B0%E4%B9%B1%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E7%A7%A9%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E5%93%84%E9%97%B9%E5%86%B2%E5%87%BB%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 伪造、毁灭重要证据，妨碍人民法院审理案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BC%AA%E9%80%A0%E3%80%81%E6%AF%81%E7%81%AD%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%A8%E7%A2%8D%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 以暴力、威胁、贿买方法阻止证人作证或者指使、贿买、胁迫他人作伪证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BB%A5%E6%9A%B4%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%81%E5%A8%81%E8%83%81%E3%80%81%E8%B4%BF%E4%B9%B0%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%98%BB%E6%AD%A2%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%8C%87%E4%BD%BF%E3%80%81%E8%B4%BF%E4%B9%B0%E3%80%81%E8%83%81%E8%BF%AB%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%9C%E4%BC%AA%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 对司法工作人员、诉讼参加人、证人、翻译人员、鉴定人、勘验人、协助执行的人，进行侮辱、诽谤、诬陷、殴打或者打击报复" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%AF%B9%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E3%80%81%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E4%BE%AE%E8%BE%B1%E3%80%81%E8%AF%BD%E8%B0%A4%E3%80%81%E8%AF%AC%E9%99%B7%E3%80%81%E6%AE%B4%E6%89%93%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%89%93%E5%87%BB%E6%8A%A5%E5%A4%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="5. 以暴力、威胁或者其他方法阻碍司法工作人员执行职务" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E4%BB%A5%E6%9A%B4%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%81%E5%A8%81%E8%83%81%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%98%BB%E7%A2%8D%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%81%8C%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="6. 拒不履行人民法院已经发生法律效力的判决、裁定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="7. 隐藏、转移、变卖、毁损已被查封、扣押的财产，或者已被清点并责令其保管的财产，转移已被冻结的财产" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E3%80%81%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E3%80%81%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%96%E3%80%81%E6%AF%81%E6%8D%9F%E5%B7%B2%E8%A2%AB%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%E3%80%81%E6%89%A3%E6%8A%BC%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%B7%B2%E8%A2%AB%E6%B8%85%E7%82%B9%E5%B9%B6%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E5%85%B6%E4%BF%9D%E7%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E5%B7%B2%E8%A2%AB%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）程序要求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 罚款、拘留必须经院长批准" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%81%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 应当制作罚款决定书或拘留决定书" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）救济途径" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="对罚款、拘留决定不服的，可以自收到决定书之日起3日内向上一级人民法院申请复议一次。复议期间不停止原决定的执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%81%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E3%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E5%90%91%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%8D%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E5%8E%9F%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（四）处罚幅度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E5%A4%84%E7%BD%9A%E5%B9%85%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 拘留：期限为15日以下" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E15%E6%97%A5%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 罚款：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="对个人：人民币10万元以下" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%B8%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E10%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="对单位：人民币5万元以上100万元以下" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%B8%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E5%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A100%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、有义务协助调查、执行的单位拒不协助的处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E6%9C%89%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）有义务协助的单位范围" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%9C%89%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="包括银行、证券交易所、房屋登记管理中心、住房公积金管理中心等依法负有协助人民法院调查、执行义务的单位。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B8%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E6%89%80%E3%80%81%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E3%80%81%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%BF%E5%85%AC%E7%A7%AF%E9%87%91%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E7%AD%89%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E8%B4%9F%E6%9C%89%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）处理方式（按顺序）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%88%E6%8C%89%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 对单位予以罚款" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 对单位的主要负责人或者直接责任人员予以罚款" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%AF%B9%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E8%B4%9F%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 罚款后仍不履行协助义务的，可以对主要负责人或者直接责任人员予以拘留" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E5%90%8E%E4%BB%8D%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E8%B4%9F%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 可以向监察机关或者有关机关提出纪律处分的司法建议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%91%E7%9B%91%E5%AF%9F%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%AA%E5%BE%8B%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）典型案例：住房公积金管理中心拒不协助执行案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%BF%E5%85%AC%E7%A7%AF%E9%87%91%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="案情：A区法院执行被执行人王五的财产，发现其住房公积金账户有余额，两名执行法官携带生效法律文书和协助执行通知书到甲市住房公积金管理中心A区办事处，要求协助冻结并划扣王五的住房公积金。办事处工作人员张三、李四要求法官按个人业务取号排队，拒不协助执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%EF%BC%9AA%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%85%B6%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%BF%E5%85%AC%E7%A7%AF%E9%87%91%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E6%9C%89%E4%BD%99%E9%A2%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%A4%E5%90%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E6%90%BA%E5%B8%A6%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E5%92%8C%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%B9%A6%E5%88%B0%E7%94%B2%E5%B8%82%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%BF%E5%85%AC%E7%A7%AF%E9%87%91%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83A%E5%8C%BA%E5%8A%9E%E4%BA%8B%E5%A4%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%92%E6%89%A3%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%BF%E5%85%AC%E7%A7%AF%E9%87%91%E3%80%82%E5%8A%9E%E4%BA%8B%E5%A4%84%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E6%8C%89%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%8F%96%E5%8F%B7%E6%8E%92%E9%98%9F%EF%BC%8C%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="处理结果：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. A区法院对甲市住房公积金管理中心A区办事处处以罚款30万元（符合对单位5万-100万的罚款幅度）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20A%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%B2%E5%B8%82%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%BF%E5%85%AC%E7%A7%AF%E9%87%91%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83A%E5%8C%BA%E5%8A%9E%E4%BA%8B%E5%A4%84%E5%A4%84%E4%BB%A5%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE30%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%88%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E5%AF%B9%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D5%E4%B8%87-100%E4%B8%87%E7%9A%84%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E5%B9%85%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 对直接责任人张三、李四分别处以罚款5万元（符合对个人10万以下的罚款幅度）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%AF%B9%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E4%BB%A5%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE5%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%88%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA10%E4%B8%87%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E5%B9%85%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 向甲市住房公积金管理中心发出司法建议：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%90%91%E7%94%B2%E5%B8%82%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%BF%E5%85%AC%E7%A7%AF%E9%87%91%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="加强对A区办事处工作人员的法制培训和业务培训" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8A%A0%E5%BC%BA%E5%AF%B9A%E5%8C%BA%E5%8A%9E%E4%BA%8B%E5%A4%84%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%88%B6%E5%9F%B9%E8%AE%AD%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%9F%B9%E8%AE%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="对办事处负责人及相关责任人员进行纪律处分" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E5%8A%9E%E4%BA%8B%E5%A4%84%E8%B4%9F%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8A%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%BA%AA%E5%BE%8B%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="设立专门的协助人民法院执行的窗口，整改服务流程" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AE%BE%E7%AB%8B%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%EF%BC%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%94%B9%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题14 期间与送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9814%20%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="第一节 期间" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%8A%82%20%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、期间的分类" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="根据确定主体和方法不同，分为法定期间和指定期间：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E5%92%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%92%8C%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="1. 法定期间：法律明文规定的期间" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%98%8E%E6%96%87%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="绝对不可变期：法律规定后绝对不得变更" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%98%E6%9C%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="典型例子：上诉期（判决15天、裁定10天）、第三人撤销之诉起诉期（6个月）、申请再审期（6个月）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B315%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A10%E5%A4%A9%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%886%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%886%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="相对不可变期：法律规定后一般不得变更，特殊情况经批准可以延长" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%98%E6%9C%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%EF%BC%8C%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E7%BB%8F%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="典型例子：一审普通程序审限（6个月，经院长批准可延长）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%EF%BC%886%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%E5%8F%AF%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 指定期间：法律没有明文规定，由法院根据案件具体情况为当事人指定的期间" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%98%8E%E6%96%87%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="典型例子：举证期限、证据交换期" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2%E6%9C%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="特点：法院可以根据特殊情况依职权变更" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、期间的计算方法" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 计算单位：期间以时、日、月、年为单位计算" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E4%BB%A5%E6%97%B6%E3%80%81%E6%97%A5%E3%80%81%E6%9C%88%E3%80%81%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%BA%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 开始计算规则：期间开始的时和日不计算在内" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E5%92%8C%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%9C%A8%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="辅助理解：法律文书中表述的“收到本判决之日起”和“收到本判决之次日起”意思完全相同，收到当天都不算，一律从第二天开始计算" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%E8%A1%A8%E8%BF%B0%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E6%9C%AC%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%E2%80%9D%E5%92%8C%E2%80%9C%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E6%9C%AC%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%8B%E6%AC%A1%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%E2%80%9D%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%BD%93%E5%A4%A9%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E7%AE%97%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E4%BB%8E%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%A4%A9%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 届满日顺延规则：期间届满的最后一天是法定休假日的，以法定休假日后的第一个工作日为期间届满日" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E6%97%A5%E9%A1%BA%E5%BB%B6%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A9%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A5%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A5%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E6%97%A5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="易错点：只有期间届满的最后一天落在法定休假日才顺延；期间开始或中间有法定休假日的，不扣除" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A9%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A5%E6%89%8D%E9%A1%BA%E5%BB%B6%EF%BC%9B%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E6%88%96%E4%B8%AD%E9%97%B4%E6%9C%89%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A5%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%A3%E9%99%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="辅助理解：这就是为什么法院周一特别忙——周六、周日该办的事都顺延到周一，周一要干三天的活" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%99%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%80%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E5%BF%99%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E5%91%A8%E5%85%AD%E3%80%81%E5%91%A8%E6%97%A5%E8%AF%A5%E5%8A%9E%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E9%83%BD%E9%A1%BA%E5%BB%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%8C%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B9%B2%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%B4%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 在途期间排除规则：诉讼文书在途期间不计算在内" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9C%A8%E9%80%94%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E5%9C%A8%E9%80%94%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%9C%A8%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="规则：只要在期间届满前将文书交给邮局并盖上当日邮戳，无论文书在邮局走了多久、何时到达法院，都不算过期" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E5%89%8D%E5%B0%86%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99%E9%82%AE%E5%B1%80%E5%B9%B6%E7%9B%96%E4%B8%8A%E5%BD%93%E6%97%A5%E9%82%AE%E6%88%B3%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E8%AE%BA%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E5%9C%A8%E9%82%AE%E5%B1%80%E8%B5%B0%E4%BA%86%E5%A4%9A%E4%B9%85%E3%80%81%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E5%88%B0%E8%BE%BE%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E7%AE%97%E8%BF%87%E6%9C%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="易错点：只有文书在途期间不计算；当事人参加诉讼的在途期间（如从外地赶去法院的时间）要计算在内" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E5%9C%A8%E9%80%94%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%A8%E9%80%94%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E4%BB%8E%E5%A4%96%E5%9C%B0%E8%B5%B6%E5%8E%BB%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%89%E8%A6%81%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%9C%A8%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="典型例子：对广东高院一审判决不服要去最高院上诉，上诉期最后一天中午才写完上诉状，不用买机票去北京，直接在广州当地邮局交邮即可，不算过期" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E5%B9%BF%E4%B8%9C%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E8%A6%81%E5%8E%BB%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%88%E6%89%8D%E5%86%99%E5%AE%8C%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%A8%E4%B9%B0%E6%9C%BA%E7%A5%A8%E5%8E%BB%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%A8%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%B0%E9%82%AE%E5%B1%80%E4%BA%A4%E9%82%AE%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%AE%97%E8%BF%87%E6%9C%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、期限的耽误与顺延" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E7%9A%84%E8%80%BD%E8%AF%AF%E4%B8%8E%E9%A1%BA%E5%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 适用情形：当事人因不可抗拒的事由或者其他正当理由耽误期限" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E6%8A%97%E6%8B%92%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E8%80%BD%E8%AF%AF%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 申请时间：在障碍消除后10日内申请顺延" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E9%9A%9C%E7%A2%8D%E6%B6%88%E9%99%A4%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E10%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%A1%BA%E5%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 程序要求：必须由当事人申请，法院不得依职权主动顺延" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E9%A1%BA%E5%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 适用范围：适用于一切期间，包括法定期间、指定期间，也包括法定期间中的绝对不可变期和相对不可变期" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%88%87%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E3%80%81%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%98%E6%9C%9F%E5%92%8C%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%98%E6%9C%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="5. 决定权：是否准许顺延，由法院决定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E9%A1%BA%E5%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="典型真题：张兄和张弟因遗产继承纠纷诉至法院，一审判决张兄胜诉。张弟不服，在赴法院提交上诉状的路上被撞昏迷，待其抢救苏醒时已超过上诉期一天。下列说法正确的是？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E5%85%84%E5%92%8C%E5%BC%A0%E5%BC%9F%E5%9B%A0%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%87%B3%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%BC%A0%E5%85%84%E8%83%9C%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E5%BC%A0%E5%BC%9F%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E8%B5%B4%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E7%9A%84%E8%B7%AF%E4%B8%8A%E8%A2%AB%E6%92%9E%E6%98%8F%E8%BF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%BE%85%E5%85%B6%E6%8A%A2%E6%95%91%E8%8B%8F%E9%86%92%E6%97%B6%E5%B7%B2%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E8%AF%B4%E6%B3%95%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="A. 法律上没有途径可对张弟的上诉权予以补救" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E4%B8%8A%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%E5%8F%AF%E5%AF%B9%E5%BC%A0%E5%BC%9F%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%E8%A1%A5%E6%95%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="B. 因意外事故耽误上诉期，法院应当依职权为其顺延期限" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E5%9B%A0%E6%84%8F%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%E8%80%BD%E8%AF%AF%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B6%E9%A1%BA%E5%BB%B6%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="C. 张弟可在清醒后10日内申请顺延期限，是否准许由法院决定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E5%BC%A0%E5%BC%9F%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E6%B8%85%E9%86%92%E5%90%8E10%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E9%A1%BA%E5%BB%B6%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="D. 上诉期为法定期间，张弟提出顺延，法院不应准许" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%BA%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E5%BC%9F%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E9%A1%BA%E5%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BA%94%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="答案：C" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="第二节 送达（核心重点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E8%8A%82%20%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、送达的概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E7%9A%84%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="送达是指人民法院向当事人及其他诉讼参与人送交诉讼文书的行为。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%98%AF%E6%8C%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%91%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%81%E4%BA%A4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="注意：送达的主体只能是法院，当事人之间互相送交文书不属于民事诉讼法上的送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E4%BA%92%E7%9B%B8%E9%80%81%E4%BA%A4%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、七种法定送达方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E4%B8%83%E7%A7%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 直接送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="传统定义：法官直接将文书送交受送达人本人，或者与之同住的成年家属签收" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BC%A0%E7%BB%9F%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%B0%86%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E9%80%81%E4%BA%A4%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E4%B8%8E%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8C%E4%BD%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%88%90%E5%B9%B4%E5%AE%B6%E5%B1%9E%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="司法解释扩展的三种直接送达场合（为解决实践中“送达难”问题）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%9C%BA%E5%90%88%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%BA%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E4%B8%AD%E2%80%9C%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E9%9A%BE%E2%80%9D%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 到受送达人的住处送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%88%B0%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%8F%E5%A4%84%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 通知受送达人到法院领取文书" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 在受送达人住处之外的其他地方（如菜市场、公司、路上偶遇）送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%9C%A8%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E5%A4%84%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%9C%B0%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E8%8F%9C%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E3%80%81%E8%B7%AF%E4%B8%8A%E5%81%B6%E9%81%87%EF%BC%89%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="重要考点：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="离婚诉讼例外：不允许把文书交给在身份上既是与受送达人同住的成年家属，又是案件另一方当事人的人签收" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E6%8A%8A%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99%E5%9C%A8%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E4%B8%8A%E6%97%A2%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E4%BD%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%88%90%E5%B9%B4%E5%AE%B6%E5%B1%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%88%E6%98%AF%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="辅助理解：最高法院将“通知领取”和“偶遇送达”解释为直接送达，避免了修改法律的程序，有效解决了送达难问题" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B0%86%E2%80%9C%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E2%80%9D%E5%92%8C%E2%80%9C%E5%81%B6%E9%81%87%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E2%80%9D%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E4%B8%BA%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E4%BA%86%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E4%BA%86%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E9%9A%BE%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 留置送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="适用前提：受送达人或者与之同住的成年家属明确拒绝签收文书" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E4%B8%8E%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8C%E4%BD%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%88%90%E5%B9%B4%E5%AE%B6%E5%B1%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="高频易错点：受送达人不在家时，绝对不能适用留置送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E6%98%93%E9%94%99%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%B6%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="反面例子：七八月份当事人外出讲课两个月不在家，法官把判决书堆在当事人家门口，这种留置送达无效，严重侵害当事人的上诉权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8D%E9%9D%A2%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%83%E5%85%AB%E6%9C%88%E4%BB%BD%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%A4%96%E5%87%BA%E8%AE%B2%E8%AF%BE%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E4%B8%8D%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E6%8A%8A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E5%A0%86%E5%9C%A8%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AE%B6%E9%97%A8%E5%8F%A3%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E7%A7%8D%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%A5%E9%87%8D%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="留置方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 邀请有关基层组织或者所在单位的代表到场见证，由见证人签名" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E9%82%80%E8%AF%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E5%88%B0%E5%9C%BA%E8%A7%81%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E8%A7%81%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 用拍照、录像等方式记录送达过程" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%94%A8%E6%8B%8D%E7%85%A7%E3%80%81%E5%BD%95%E5%83%8F%E7%AD%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="重要例外：调解书绝对不能适用留置送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原理：调解书以当事人签收为生效前提，当事人拒绝签收调解书，说明当事人已经反悔，调解书不生效，留置送达没有任何意义" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%BB%A5%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 电子送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="适用前提：经受送达人同意，并且能够确认其收悉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%8F%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E4%B8%94%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%85%B6%E6%94%B6%E6%82%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="可送达文书范围：一切诉讼文书，包括判决书、裁定书、调解书" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%88%87%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="纸质文书要求：受送达人提出需要纸质文书的，人民法院应当提供" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BA%B8%E8%B4%A8%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%B8%E8%B4%A8%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="送达日期：不论是否提供纸质文书，一律以送达信息到达受送达人特定系统之日为送达之日" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%BA%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%BA%B8%E8%B4%A8%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%88%B0%E8%BE%BE%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%B9%E5%AE%9A%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="典型例子：法院于8月1日向李四的电子邮箱发送了本案判决书，邮件当日显示已读。8月5日李四提出需要纸质判决书，法院于8月8日向其提供。李四8月20日提起上诉，已超过15天上诉期，上诉无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BA%8E8%E6%9C%881%E6%97%A5%E5%90%91%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%9A%84%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E9%82%AE%E7%AE%B1%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E4%BA%86%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E9%82%AE%E4%BB%B6%E5%BD%93%E6%97%A5%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E5%B7%B2%E8%AF%BB%E3%80%828%E6%9C%885%E6%97%A5%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%B8%E8%B4%A8%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BA%8E8%E6%9C%888%E6%97%A5%E5%90%91%E5%85%B6%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E3%80%82%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B8%E6%9C%8820%E6%97%A5%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%B2%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%8715%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 邮寄送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E9%82%AE%E5%AF%84%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="适用情形：人民法院直接送达有困难" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%B0%E9%9A%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="送达方式：只能通过中国邮政的挂号信或者EMS（特快专递）送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%82%AE%E6%94%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%8C%82%E5%8F%B7%E4%BF%A1%E6%88%96%E8%80%85EMS%EF%BC%88%E7%89%B9%E5%BF%AB%E4%B8%93%E9%80%92%EF%BC%89%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="禁止性规定：绝对不能使用顺丰、京东、圆通、中通等民营快递" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E9%A1%BA%E4%B8%B0%E3%80%81%E4%BA%AC%E4%B8%9C%E3%80%81%E5%9C%86%E9%80%9A%E3%80%81%E4%B8%AD%E9%80%9A%E7%AD%89%E6%B0%91%E8%90%A5%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%92%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="法律依据：《邮政法》明确规定，快递企业不得收寄国家机关公文" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%9A%E3%80%8A%E9%82%AE%E6%94%BF%E6%B3%95%E3%80%8B%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%92%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E6%94%B6%E5%AF%84%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E5%85%AC%E6%96%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="典型案例：A区法院通过顺丰快递向被告送达开庭传票，被告收到但未出庭，法院作出缺席判决。二审法院认为送达行为违反邮政法规定，送达无效，裁定撤销原判、发回重审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9AA%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E9%A1%BA%E4%B8%B0%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%92%E5%90%91%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%86%E6%9C%AA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E9%82%AE%E6%94%BF%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E3%80%81%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="送达日期：以邮局的挂号信回执上记载的日期为送达之日，与法院寄出的送达回证是否寄回、寄回后记载的日期无关" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%82%AE%E5%B1%80%E7%9A%84%E6%8C%82%E5%8F%B7%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%9E%E6%89%A7%E4%B8%8A%E8%AE%B0%E8%BD%BD%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%84%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%9B%9E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%AF%84%E5%9B%9E%E3%80%81%E5%AF%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%90%8E%E8%AE%B0%E8%BD%BD%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="5. 委托送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="适用情形：人民法院直接送达有困难" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%B0%E9%9A%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="委托对象：只能委托其他人民法院代为送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="高频错误选项：不能委托派出所、居委会、村委会、学校、当事人所在单位等任何非法院主体" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E6%B4%BE%E5%87%BA%E6%89%80%E3%80%81%E5%B1%85%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E6%9D%91%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E3%80%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="6. 转交送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E8%BD%AC%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="适用对象：只能适用于具有特殊身份、法官无法直接接触到的人：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8E%A5%E8%A7%A6%E5%88%B0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 军人：通过其所在部队团以上单位的政治机关转交" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%86%9B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%85%B6%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E9%83%A8%E9%98%9F%E5%9B%A2%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E8%BD%AC%E4%BA%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 被监禁的人：通过其所在监狱转交" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%A2%AB%E7%9B%91%E7%A6%81%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%85%B6%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E7%9B%91%E7%8B%B1%E8%BD%AC%E4%BA%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 被采取强制性教育措施的人：通过其所在强制性教育机构转交" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E8%A2%AB%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%80%A7%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%85%B6%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%80%A7%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E8%BD%AC%E4%BA%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="高频错误选项：不能转交给居委会、村委会、学校、当事人所在单位等任何非上述三类的主体" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%BD%AC%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99%E5%B1%85%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E6%9D%91%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E3%80%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E9%9D%9E%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="7. 公告送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="性质：推定送达，实践中99.9%的受送达人不会看到公告，因此适用条件极为严格" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%EF%BC%9A%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E4%B8%AD99.9%25%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E7%9C%8B%E5%88%B0%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E6%9E%81%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%A5%E6%A0%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="适用前提（二选一）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%E9%80%89%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 受送达人下落不明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8B%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 穷尽上述所有六种送达方式，均无法送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%A9%B7%E5%B0%BD%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%85%AD%E7%A7%8D%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%9D%87%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="重要例外：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 简易程序案件不得适用公告送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 支付令不得适用公告送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="原理：支付令的核心是保障债务人的异议权，必须确保债务人收到支付令才能行使异议权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%98%AF%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="高频考点：支付令可以适用留置送达，但绝对不能公告送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="公告期：自发出公告之日起，经过30日，即视为送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%8730%E6%97%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、送达方式总结与真题演练" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E4%B8%8E%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%BC%94%E7%BB%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="典型真题：李某起诉赵某合同纠纷案，法院多次向赵某送达应诉通知书均无人签收。后法院通过赵某的邻居了解到，赵某到外地出差已经一年多没有回来居住。法院可以通过何种方式向赵某送达文书？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%A4%9A%E6%AC%A1%E5%90%91%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%B9%A6%E5%9D%87%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E3%80%82%E5%90%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E7%9A%84%E9%82%BB%E5%B1%85%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%88%B0%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E5%88%B0%E5%A4%96%E5%9C%B0%E5%87%BA%E5%B7%AE%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E5%A4%9A%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%9E%E6%9D%A5%E5%B1%85%E4%BD%8F%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%BD%95%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%90%91%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="A. 可以采取电子送达方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="B. 可以采取留置送达方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="C. 可以采取邮寄送达方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E9%82%AE%E5%AF%84%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="D. 可以采取公告送达方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="答案：C" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9AC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="解析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="- A错误：电子送达必须经受送达人同意，题目未提及赵某同意" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20A%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E6%9C%AA%E6%8F%90%E5%8F%8A%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="- B错误：留置送达的前提是受送达人拒绝签收，赵某不在家，不存在拒绝签收的情形" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20B%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%9A%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E7%9A%84%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E6%98%AF%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%8D%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="- C正确：受送达人在外地，可以通过邮寄方式送达" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20C%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%96%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E9%82%AE%E5%AF%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="- D错误：赵某只是在外地出差，并非下落不明，且可以通过邮寄方式送达，不符合公告送达的适用条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20D%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%9A%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%96%E5%9C%B0%E5%87%BA%E5%B7%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E9%9D%9E%E4%B8%8B%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E9%82%AE%E5%AF%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题15 诉讼调解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9815%20%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、调解的概念与性质" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E4%B8%8E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="定义：人民法院在立案后、审理案件过程中，组织当事人就民事纠纷进行协商，达成调解协议后，法院根据调解协议制作调解书的活动。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%9C%A8%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E5%90%8E%E3%80%81%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%B0%B1%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%EF%BC%8C%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="性质：诉讼调解是法院行使审判权的法定方式之一，生效调解书与判决书具有同等法律效力，可以申请强制执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="重要区分：此处仅指诉讼调解（法院调解），与人民调解委员会主持的人民调解不同。人民调解达成的协议仅具有合同效力，不能直接强制执行，需经法院司法确认后才能强制执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84%E4%BB%85%E6%8C%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E4%B8%BB%E6%8C%81%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E3%80%82%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%BB%85%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%90%8E%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、调解的原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 自愿原则：调解的启动、调解协议的内容必须完全出于当事人的自愿，不得强迫调解。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E5%87%BA%E4%BA%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%BC%BA%E8%BF%AB%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="2. 合法原则：调解协议的内容不得违反法律、行政法规的强制性规定，不得侵害国家利益、社会公共利益和他人合法权益。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E3%80%81%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E5%92%8C%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、调解的适用范围（核心考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）可以调解的程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="所有诉讼程序：一审程序、二审程序、再审程序均可以调解。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%9D%87%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="辅助记忆：诉讼程序的三大共性——可以辩论、可以有人民陪审员参加、可以调解。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%85%B1%E6%80%A7%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E3%80%81%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E3%80%81%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）不得调解的程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="所有非诉讼程序：执行程序、特别程序、督促程序、公示催告程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E9%9D%9E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="原理：非诉讼程序不解决当事人之间的实体权利义务纠纷，没有调解的基础和必要。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E9%9D%9E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%92%8C%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）诉讼程序中的例外：不得调解的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="身份关系的确认案件绝对不得调解。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="关键词：确认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E8%AF%8D%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="典型例子：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="婚姻效力的确认（有效/无效）不能调解；但婚姻关系的解除（离婚）、离婚后的财产分割、子女抚养问题可以调解，且离婚案件应当先行调解。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88/%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9B%E4%BD%86%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%EF%BC%88%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E3%80%81%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%85%88%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="亲子关系的确认（存在/不存在）不能调解；但亲子关系确认后的抚养费、抚养权问题可以调解。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%B2%E5%AD%90%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%88%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8/%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9B%E4%BD%86%E4%BA%B2%E5%AD%90%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E6%9D%83%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="原理：身份关系涉及社会伦理和公序良俗，其效力由法律明确规定，没有当事人自由处分的空间。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E4%BC%A6%E7%90%86%E5%92%8C%E5%85%AC%E5%BA%8F%E8%89%AF%E4%BF%97%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E7%9A%84%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、调解不公开原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="调解过程不公开：但当事人同意公开的除外。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%86%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E7%9A%84%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="调解协议内容不公开：但为保护国家利益、社会公共利益、他人合法权益，法院认为有必要公开的除外。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E7%9A%84%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="原理：调解是当事人互谅互让的过程，不公开有利于保护当事人的隐私和商业秘密，促进当事人坦诚协商。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%92%E8%B0%85%E4%BA%92%E8%AE%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%8E%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E9%9A%90%E7%A7%81%E5%92%8C%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%BF%83%E8%BF%9B%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9D%A6%E8%AF%9A%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
      <outline text="五、调解协议的核心考点（重中之重）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%88%E9%87%8D%E4%B8%AD%E4%B9%8B%E9%87%8D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 调解协议可以超出原告的诉讼请求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B6%85%E5%87%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="对比：判决绝对不能超出原告的诉讼请求，否则违反处分原则。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%B6%85%E5%87%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="典型案例：张三起诉李四要求归还借款本金10万元。法院组织调解，最终达成协议：李四于30日内归还张三本金10万元，并支付利息1万元。该协议合法有效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%9110%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%BA%8E30%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%9110%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E5%88%A9%E6%81%AF1%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E3%80%82%E8%AF%A5%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="原理：调解是当事人对自己权利的自由处分，只要双方自愿，法律不干涉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%B9%B2%E6%B6%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 可以约定不履行调解协议的民事责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="典型例子：调解协议约定“李四于30日内支付张三10万元，逾期不支付的，每日按万分之五支付违约金”。该约定合法有效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%BA%8E30%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%8910%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E6%8C%89%E4%B8%87%E5%88%86%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%E8%AF%A5%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 违反自愿、合法原则的调解协议，法院不予确认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%E3%80%81%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E7%9A%84%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="违反自愿原则：当事人受欺诈、胁迫、重大误解等情况下达成的协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%97%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%E3%80%81%E8%83%81%E8%BF%AB%E3%80%81%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E8%AF%AF%E8%A7%A3%E7%AD%89%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%8B%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="违反合法原则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="侵害国家利益、社会公共利益" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="侵害案外人合法权益" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="违反法律、行政法规的强制性规定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E3%80%81%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 禁止约定“不履行协议即可向法院起诉”的条款" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原理：诉讼调解是法院动用审判权实体解决纠纷的方式，纠纷已经通过调解得到了终局解决，再次起诉违反一事不再理原则。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8A%A8%E7%94%A8%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%86%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E7%90%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="典型例子：调解协议约定“李四于30日内支付张三10万元，逾期不支付的，张三有权向人民法院提起诉讼”。该条款无效，法院不予确认。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%BA%8E30%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%8910%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E5%90%91%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%E8%AF%A5%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="六、调解书的制作与生效（核心考点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AD%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%8E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）调解书的生效时间" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则：法院组织当事人达成调解协议后，应当制作调解书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="生效时间：调解书经双方当事人签收后生效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%BB%8F%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E5%90%8E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="反悔权：当事人在签收调解书前可以反悔，拒绝签收的，调解书不生效，法院应当及时审理并作出判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%89%8D%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%8F%8A%E6%97%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="当事人签收调解书后，不得反悔，调解书具有强制执行力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="经典真题：朱某诉刘某离婚纠纷，诉讼中二人达成调解协议，法院据此制作调解书。法院通知双方领取调解书，朱某领取并签收了调解书，刘某一直未领取。后朱某反悔不愿意离婚。下列说法正确的是？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%B1%E6%9F%90%E8%AF%89%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E4%BA%8C%E4%BA%BA%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8D%AE%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%B1%E6%9F%90%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E5%B9%B6%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E4%BA%86%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%80%E7%9B%B4%E6%9C%AA%E9%A2%86%E5%8F%96%E3%80%82%E5%90%8E%E6%9C%B1%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%E4%B8%8D%E6%84%BF%E6%84%8F%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E8%AF%B4%E6%B3%95%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="A. 朱某可以反悔，因为调解书尚未生效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E6%9C%B1%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%B0%9A%E6%9C%AA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="B. 朱某可以反悔，因为离婚案件的调解书可以随时反悔" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E6%9C%B1%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%9A%8F%E6%97%B6%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="C. 朱某不能反悔，因为其已经签收了调解书" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E6%9C%B1%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B6%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E4%BA%86%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="D. 朱某可以向法院申请撤回起诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E6%9C%B1%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="答案：CD" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3ECD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="解析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="- 调解书必须经双方当事人都签收后才生效。本案中刘某未签收，调解书尚未生效，案件仍在诉讼过程中。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%BD%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%8E%E6%89%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%AD%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E6%9C%AA%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%B0%9A%E6%9C%AA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BB%8D%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="- 朱某已经签收了调解书，其个人不能反悔（反悔权仅存在于签收前）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%E6%9C%B1%E6%9F%90%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E4%BA%86%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%E6%9D%83%E4%BB%85%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BA%8E%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="- 案件尚未审结，朱某作为原告，有权申请撤回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%B0%9A%E6%9C%AA%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%B1%E6%9F%90%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）可以不制作调解书的情形" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="符合下列情形之一的，法院可以不制作调解书，由双方当事人、审判员、书记员在调解协议或调解笔录上签字盖章后即发生法律效力：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%80%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E3%80%81%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E5%91%98%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%96%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%AC%94%E5%BD%95%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8A%E7%AD%BE%E5%AD%97%E7%9B%96%E7%AB%A0%E5%90%8E%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="1. 调解和好的离婚案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%92%8C%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%84%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 调解维持收养关系的案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81%E6%94%B6%E5%85%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 能够即时履行的案件（当庭兑现）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E5%8D%B3%E6%97%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%BD%93%E5%BA%AD%E5%85%91%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 双方当事人同意在调解协议上签字盖章即生效的" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%9C%A8%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8A%E7%AD%BE%E5%AD%97%E7%9B%96%E7%AB%A0%E5%8D%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="原理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="前两种情形没有可供强制执行的内容，制作调解书反而会给当事人日后的关系恢复留下隐患。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%AF%E4%BE%9B%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%8F%8D%E8%80%8C%E4%BC%9A%E7%BB%99%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A5%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E7%95%99%E4%B8%8B%E9%9A%90%E6%82%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="辅助理解：调解和好的夫妻，拿着写满双方矛盾的调解书回家，反而容易再次引发争吵。不制作调解书，让双方当什么事都没发生过，更有利于家庭和谐。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%92%8C%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%AB%E5%A6%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%8B%BF%E7%9D%80%E5%86%99%E6%BB%A1%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E7%9F%9B%E7%9B%BE%E7%9A%84%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%9B%9E%E5%AE%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8D%E8%80%8C%E5%AE%B9%E6%98%93%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%95%E5%8F%91%E4%BA%89%E5%90%B5%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A9%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E4%BA%8B%E9%83%BD%E6%B2%A1%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E8%BF%87%EF%BC%8C%E6%9B%B4%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%8E%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E5%92%8C%E8%B0%90%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="第三种情形虽然有履行内容，但已经当庭履行完毕，未来不会进入执行程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E8%99%BD%E7%84%B6%E6%9C%89%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%BD%93%E5%BA%AD%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%AF%95%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="第四种情形是为了防止夜长梦多。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E5%9B%9B%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E5%A4%9C%E9%95%BF%E6%A2%A6%E5%A4%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="典型例子：下午5点下班前达成调解协议，法院办公室已经下班，无法制作和盖章调解书。为了防止当事人第二天反悔，法官可以询问双方是否同意在调解协议上签字即生效。双方同意后，签字盖章即生效，无需再制作调解书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8B%E5%8D%885%E7%82%B9%E4%B8%8B%E7%8F%AD%E5%89%8D%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8A%9E%E5%85%AC%E5%AE%A4%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%8F%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%92%8C%E7%9B%96%E7%AB%A0%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%A4%A9%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%9C%A8%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8A%E7%AD%BE%E5%AD%97%E5%8D%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%BE%E5%AD%97%E7%9B%96%E7%AB%A0%E5%8D%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E5%86%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="七、禁止“调判转换”原则及例外" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%83%E3%80%81%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E2%80%9C%E8%B0%83%E5%88%A4%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E2%80%9D%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E5%8F%8A%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="当事人自行达成和解协议或者经法院调解达成调解协议后，请求法院根据和解协议、调解协议制作判决书的，人民法院不予支持。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="原理：调解书与判决书性质截然不同：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E6%88%AA%E7%84%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="调解书是一审终审，不得上诉；判决书是两审终审，可以上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9B%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%A4%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="调解过程不公开，调解书内容不公开；审判过程原则上公开，判决书应当公开。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%9B%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8A%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="如果允许根据调解协议制作判决书，会混淆两种不同性质的法律文书，破坏程序法的基本逻辑。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E4%BC%9A%E6%B7%B7%E6%B7%86%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E7%A0%B4%E5%9D%8F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%B3%95%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）两个法定例外" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="下列两种情形下，当事人请求根据调解协议制作判决书的，人民法院可以准许：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="1. 无民事行为能力人的离婚案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 涉外民事案件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原理：很多国家没有中国的诉讼调解制度，调解书在外国无法获得承认和执行。为了与国际接轨，方便当事人在外国申请承认和执行，涉外案件可以制作判决书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E5%BE%88%E5%A4%9A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%97%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E5%92%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%8E%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E6%8E%A5%E8%BD%A8%EF%BC%8C%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E5%92%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="典型真题：达盛公司因合同纠纷向甲市A区法院起诉美国福泽公司。经法院组织调解，双方达成调解协议。关于本案处理，说法正确的是？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%9A%E8%BE%BE%E7%9B%9B%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%9B%A0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%90%91%E7%94%B2%E5%B8%82A%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E7%A6%8F%E6%B3%BD%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E3%80%82%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B4%E6%B3%95%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="A. 法院应当制作调解书" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="B. 调解书送达双方当事人后即发生法律效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB.%20%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8E%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="C. 当事人要求根据调解协议制作判决书的，法院应予准许" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EC.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E4%BA%88%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="D. 法院可以将调解协议记入笔录，由双方当事人签字后生效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3ED.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%B0%86%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E8%AE%B0%E5%85%A5%E7%AC%94%E5%BD%95%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E5%AD%97%E5%90%8E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="答案：ABC" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EABC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="解析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- A正确：达成调解协议原则上应当制作调解书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20A%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%9A%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- B正确：合法有效的送达当然包含当事人签收，调解书经签收后生效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20B%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%BB%8F%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E5%90%8E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- C正确：本案是涉外民事案件，属于可以制作判决书的例外情形。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20C%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E6%98%AF%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- D错误：不制作调解书仅适用于法定的四种情形，本案不符合。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20D%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9B%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="八、两个特殊问题" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AB%E3%80%81%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）调解书与无独立请求权第三人（无独三）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="调解书需要无独三承担责任的，必须经无独三签收后才生效。无独三拒绝签收调解书的，调解书不生效，法院应当及时审理并作出判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E5%90%8E%E6%89%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%8F%8A%E6%97%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="调解书不需要无独三承担责任的，无需无独三签收，调解书自原被告双方签收后即生效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E8%87%AA%E5%8E%9F%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E5%90%8E%E5%8D%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）调解中的担保" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 调解协议可以约定一方提供担保，也可以约定案外人提供担保，法院应当准许。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 调解书应当列明担保人，并将调解书送达担保人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%88%97%E6%98%8E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E5%B0%86%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 担保人拒不签收调解书的，不影响调解书的生效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="4. 担保是否生效，取决于是否符合《民法典》规定的担保生效条件，与担保人是否签收调解书无关。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%96%E5%86%B3%E4%BA%8E%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E3%80%8A%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E3%80%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="典型例子：张三起诉李四归还借款10万元，法院组织调解，约定李四于30日内还款，案外人王五为该债务提供连带责任保证。法院制作调解书并送达三方，张三、李四签收，王五拒绝签收。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE10%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%BA%8E30%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E8%BF%98%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%A5%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%B9%B6%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%B8%89%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="- 调解书对张三、李四生效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%AF%B9%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="- 王五拒绝签收不影响调解书的效力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="- 王五的保证是否生效，看是否符合《民法典》关于保证合同生效的规定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E7%9C%8B%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E3%80%8A%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E3%80%8B%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="九、调解书内容的补正" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B9%9D%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A5%E6%AD%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="当事人签收调解书后，发现调解书的内容与调解协议的原意不一致的（本质是法院抄写错误），可以向法院提出异议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E6%84%8F%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8A%84%E5%86%99%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="处理方式：法院审查属实后，应当作出裁定书，根据调解协议的内容补正调解书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%B1%9E%E5%AE%9E%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E8%A1%A5%E6%AD%A3%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
      <outline text="十、诉讼中的和解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8D%81%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="定义：在诉讼过程中，当事人自行互谅互让，达成和解协议的活动。和解是当事人的私行为，没有法院的参与。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%92%E8%B0%85%E4%BA%92%E8%AE%A9%EF%BC%8C%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E3%80%82%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%A7%81%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="达成和解协议后的两种结案方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E7%BB%93%E6%A1%88%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 原告申请撤诉：法院裁定准许撤诉后，案件终结。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="效力：案件未经过实体处理，原告可以再次起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 申请法院根据和解协议制作调解书：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="效力：调解书经双方签收后生效，案件经过实体处理，一事不再理，不得再次起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%BB%8F%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E5%90%8E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="十一、调解程序的灵活性" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E7%81%B5%E6%B4%BB%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="诉讼调解没有严格的法定程序要求，只要不违反自愿、合法原则，调解的方式、过程可以灵活掌握。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%A5%E6%A0%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%E3%80%81%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E3%80%81%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%81%B5%E6%B4%BB%E6%8E%8C%E6%8F%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="法院可以根据需要邀请与当事人有特定关系或者有利于促成调解的单位和个人协助调解。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E9%82%80%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E7%89%B9%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%8E%E4%BF%83%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="典型案例：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 韩国留学生调解案：韩国留学生用一句“你们中国人老是不讲诚信”，激得双方当事人当场履行了债务，调解成功。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E9%9F%A9%E5%9B%BD%E7%95%99%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9F%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9A%E9%9F%A9%E5%9B%BD%E7%95%99%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9F%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%A5%E2%80%9C%E4%BD%A0%E4%BB%AC%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E8%80%81%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%B2%E8%AF%9A%E4%BF%A1%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E6%BF%80%E5%BE%97%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%BA%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%86%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 亲家调解案：担保合同纠纷中，双方发现子女互相有意，最终不仅解决了债务纠纷，还结为亲家。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BA%B2%E5%AE%B6%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%9A%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E4%BA%92%E7%9B%B8%E6%9C%89%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%85%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E4%BA%86%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E7%BB%93%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%B2%E5%AE%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题16 一审普通程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9816%20%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、民事诉讼普通程序流程演示" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E6%BC%94%E7%A4%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 起诉与立案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8E%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原告向法院提交起诉状。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="法院审查起诉状，认为符合起诉条件的，予以立案。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="文书：立案后向原告送达《受理通知书》。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E5%90%8E%E5%90%91%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%8A%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="文书：将起诉状副本和《应诉通知书》 送达被告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%8A%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 提交答辩状期间" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：被告收到起诉状副本之日起 15天内。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E15%E5%A4%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%85%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="被告的选择：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="认可管辖权：提交答辩状。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%A4%E5%8F%AF%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="不认可管辖权：提出管辖权异议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A4%E5%8F%AF%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="法院行动：将被告的答辩状副本送达原告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 举证与证据交换阶段" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="法院行动：向双方送达《举证通知书》，确定举证期限，告知逾期后果。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%8A%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="举证期限：一审普通程序由法院指定，不得少于15天。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%B0%91%E4%BA%8E15%E5%A4%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="证据交换：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="作用：相当于庭前质证，避免庭审拖延。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%9B%B8%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8E%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E6%8B%96%E5%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="效果：在证据交换中认可的证据，庭审时出示后视为质证过的证据。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2%E4%B8%AD%E8%AE%A4%E5%8F%AF%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E6%97%B6%E5%87%BA%E7%A4%BA%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%E8%BF%87%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 开庭审理阶段" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="庭前准备（书记员）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E5%91%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="核对当事人是否到庭（只查人到没到，不对人）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%AF%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AA%E6%9F%A5%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%B0%E6%B2%A1%E5%88%B0%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="宣读法庭纪律。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A3%E8%AF%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E7%BA%AA%E5%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="庭审开始（审判长）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%95%BF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="正式宣布开庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%AD%A3%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="核对当事人身份（这是审判工作，必须由审判长进行）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%AF%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%95%BF%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="告知诉讼权利义务：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="普通权利义务可提前书面告知，当庭确认。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%8F%AF%E6%8F%90%E5%89%8D%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E5%BA%AD%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="申请回避权必须当庭口头告知，并要求双方明确表态。申请节点在开始审理时。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%BD%93%E5%BA%AD%E5%8F%A3%E5%A4%B4%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E6%80%81%E3%80%82%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%97%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="法庭调查：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="目的：查事实、查证据。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9F%A5%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="流程：原告诉状 -被告答辩 -法官归纳争议焦点 -双方围绕焦点举证、质证。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%20-%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%20-%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%BD%92%E7%BA%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20-%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%9B%B4%E7%BB%95%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E3%80%81%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="法庭辩论：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="内容：围绕争议焦点，对事实认定和法律适用发表辩论意见。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%B4%E7%BB%95%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E5%92%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%8F%91%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="结束标志：法官宣布“法庭辩论结束”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 评议与宣判" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="休庭评议：法庭辩论终结后，合议庭进行秘密评议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BC%91%E5%BA%AD%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="宣判方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="当庭宣判：休庭短暂评议后立即宣判。10天内发送书面判决书（留给法官写判决）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BC%91%E5%BA%AD%E7%9F%AD%E6%9A%82%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E10%E5%A4%A9%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%88%E7%95%99%E7%BB%99%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E5%86%99%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="定期宣判：另行通知时间宣判。宣判后立即发放判决书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%91%E6%94%BE%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="宣判规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="公开宣判：所有案件，包括涉密、涉私案件，一律公开宣判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E6%B6%89%E5%AF%86%E3%80%81%E6%B6%89%E7%A7%81%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="告知事项：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 告知上诉权：上诉期限（判决15天）、上诉法院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B315%E5%A4%A9%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 特殊告知（离婚案）：宣告解除婚姻关系的判决时，必须告知当事人判决生效前不得另行结婚。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%EF%BC%88%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%93%E5%A9%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="6. 裁判文书错误的纠正" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="瑕疵（文字、计算、笔误）：下达裁定书补正。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%91%95%E7%96%B5%EF%BC%88%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E3%80%81%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E3%80%81%E7%AC%94%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8B%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E8%A1%A5%E6%AD%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【案例】瑕疵举例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E7%91%95%E7%96%B5%E4%B8%BE%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="1.  判决“十万”写成“100000万”，多写了“万”，属于笔误。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%20%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E2%80%9C%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%87%E2%80%9D%E5%86%99%E6%88%90%E2%80%9C100000%E4%B8%87%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%9A%E5%86%99%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%87%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E7%AC%94%E8%AF%AF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2.  判决书中混入了其他案件模板的无关内容。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%20%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%E6%B7%B7%E5%85%A5%E4%BA%86%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="实质内容错误（认定事实、适用法律错误）：不能随意补正，分情况处理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%9A%8F%E6%84%8F%E8%A1%A5%E6%AD%A3%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%86%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="当事人上诉：报二审法院在二审中纠正。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8A%A5%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%9C%A8%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="未上诉，判决生效：启动审判监督程序（再审） 纠正。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【案例】实质错误举例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E4%B8%BE%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法院判决后发现主动适用诉讼时效错误（适用法律错误）。处理：A/C/D。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9AA/C/D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  A（要回重做）错，已送达的判决不可收回。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20A%EF%BC%88%E8%A6%81%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%81%9A%EF%BC%89%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%B2%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E6%94%B6%E5%9B%9E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  B（裁定补正）错，实质错误不能补正。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20B%EF%BC%88%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%A1%A5%E6%AD%A3%EF%BC%89%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%A1%A5%E6%AD%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  C（等上诉后二审纠正）正确。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20C%EF%BC%88%E7%AD%89%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E5%90%8E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%EF%BC%89%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  D（等生效后再审纠正）正确。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20D%EF%BC%88%E7%AD%89%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%90%8E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%EF%BC%89%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、诉讼中的重要时间节点总结" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="此部分是对整个民诉流程中的关键时间节点的综合归纳。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%AD%A4%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E6%98%AF%E5%AF%B9%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AA%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%BC%E5%90%88%E5%BD%92%E7%BA%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="1. 提交答辩状期间" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="答辩：被告提交书面答辩意见。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="提出管辖权异议：若不提异议且应诉答辩/反诉，则视为应诉管辖（违反级别管辖和专属管辖除外）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%8B%A5%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%94%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9/%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 举证期限届满前" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="记忆口诀：凡是跟“证据”和“证明”有关的事，都在这个阶段。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E5%8F%A3%E8%AF%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%87%A1%E6%98%AF%E8%B7%9F%E2%80%9C%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E2%80%9D%E5%92%8C%E2%80%9C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E2%80%9D%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="申请延长举证期限。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="申请证据保全。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="申请法院调查收集证据。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="申请文书提出命令（责令对方提交书证）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="申请证人出庭作证。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%BD%9C%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="申请有专门知识的人（专家辅助人）出庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 法庭辩论终结前" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心逻辑：当事人最后表达意见和参与的机会。希望合议庭纳入评议的事项，必须在此前完成。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E5%92%8C%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%BA%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%82%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%E7%BA%B3%E5%85%A5%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%9C%A8%E6%AD%A4%E5%89%8D%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="申请回避：因为后续评议是秘密的，宣判只是宣告结果。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%AE%E6%98%AF%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="撤销/撤回自认。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80/%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="处理各类诉讼请求的变动：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E5%90%84%E7%B1%BB%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原告：增加、变更诉讼请求。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E3%80%81%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="被告：提出反诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="案外人（有独三）：提出独立的诉讼请求，参加诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 判决宣告前" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心逻辑：与“撤诉”相关。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E2%80%9C%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E2%80%9D%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="撤回起诉（一审）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="撤回上诉（二审）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、起诉与受理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 起诉条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心观点：起诉条件要求很低，只是形式审查，只看原告的起诉状。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%82%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%BE%88%E4%BD%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E7%9C%8B%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="具体条件（同时满足）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 原告适格：与本案有直接利害关系。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E6%9C%89%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 被告明确：指名道姓说清楚告谁即可。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%87%E5%90%8D%E9%81%93%E5%A7%93%E8%AF%B4%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%E5%91%8A%E8%B0%81%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 诉讼请求具体：有具体的事实、理由。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 主管与管辖正确：属于法院受理民事案件的范围，且受诉法院有管辖权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="对案件的处理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="审查后符合条件：7天内立案。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%90%8E%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E7%E5%A4%A9%E5%86%85%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="审查后不符合条件：裁定不予受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="受理后发现不符合条件：裁定驳回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 三大结案文书的区分" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E7%BB%93%E6%A1%88%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心区分：是程序上不行，还是实体上败诉？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%98%AF%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8D%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8A%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="裁定不予受理：案件还没进门（受理前），在门口发现不符合起诉条件，不让进。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%BF%98%E6%B2%A1%E8%BF%9B%E9%97%A8%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E9%97%A8%E5%8F%A3%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A9%E8%BF%9B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="裁定驳回起诉：案件进了门（受理后），才发现不该进来，请出去。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%BF%9B%E4%BA%86%E9%97%A8%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E4%B8%8D%E8%AF%A5%E8%BF%9B%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E5%87%BA%E5%8E%BB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="两者共同点：都是程序性驳回，未实体处理，当事人可以再次起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%A4%E8%80%85%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AA%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="判决驳回诉讼请求：案件进门了，也实体审理了，但发现原告的主张在实体法上站不住脚，判原告败诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%BF%9B%E9%97%A8%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8A%E7%AB%99%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8F%E8%84%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="特点：经过了实体处理，受一事不再理原则约束，不能再次起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E4%BA%86%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【案例群】起诉条件与裁判文书混合辨析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E7%BE%A4%E3%80%91%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8E%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E6%B7%B7%E5%90%88%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="1.  原告不适格：张三起诉，要求解除李四和村委会的合同。 -裁定不予受理/驳回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%92%8C%E6%9D%91%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E3%80%82%20-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86/%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2.  被告不要求适格（考被告明确）：王五告司机李四，但真正应负责的是车主张三。 -被告明确，受理；实体审理后，判决驳回对李四的诉请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%88%E8%80%83%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%B8%E6%9C%BA%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E5%BA%94%E8%B4%9F%E8%B4%A3%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E8%BD%A6%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E3%80%82%20-%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%AF%B9%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3.  被告不明确（受理后才发现）：张三起诉李四，受理后发现李四在起诉前已死。 -受理后发现的，裁定驳回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%9C%A8%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E5%B7%B2%E6%AD%BB%E3%80%82%20-%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="4.  被告不明确（受理前发现）：张三起诉甲公司，受理前发现已注销。 -受理前发现的，裁定不予受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%B7%B2%E6%B3%A8%E9%94%80%E3%80%82%20-%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="5.  诉讼时效已过：张三起诉还钱，但借款已过时效。 -符合起诉条件，受理；实体审理后，被告主张时效抗辩成立的，判决驳回诉讼请求。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%E5%B7%B2%E8%BF%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%BF%98%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E5%B7%B2%E8%BF%87%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%20-%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="6.  诉讼请求于法无据：张三起诉分手女友，要“青春损失费”。 -诉讼请求具体，受理；实体审理后，于法无据，判决驳回诉讼请求。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E6%97%A0%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%88%86%E6%89%8B%E5%A5%B3%E5%8F%8B%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E2%80%9C%E9%9D%92%E6%98%A5%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%B9%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%20-%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E6%97%A0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="7.  存在仲裁协议（受理前发现）：合同有仲裁条款。 -不属于法院主管，裁定不予受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%82%20-%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="8.  存在仲裁协议（受理后发现）：受理后，开庭前被告提出仲裁协议。 -不属于法院主管，裁定驳回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E8.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%20-%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="9.  复杂案例：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E9.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="      案情：甲公司告张三：①赔公司10万；②向经理李四道歉。张三反诉甲公司还工资2万。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%91%8A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%9A%E2%91%A0%E8%B5%94%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B810%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%9B%E2%91%A1%E5%90%91%E7%BB%8F%E7%90%86%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89%E3%80%82%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%BF%98%E5%B7%A5%E8%B5%842%E4%B8%87%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="      分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="          请求①：诉请主体适格，正常审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E2%91%A0%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="          请求②：要求向案外人道歉，甲公司原告不适格，应裁定驳回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E2%91%A1%EF%BC%9A%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%90%91%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="          反诉：劳动纠纷需仲裁前置，未经仲裁直接起诉，不属于法院主管，应裁定驳回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E9%9C%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 起诉状的内容" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="法定内容（四项）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 当事人基本情况。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 诉讼请求和所根据的事实与理由。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%92%8C%E6%89%80%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 证据和证据来源，证人姓名和住所。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E5%92%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D%E5%92%8C%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 受诉法院名称、起诉时间、起诉人签名盖章。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0%E3%80%81%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E3%80%81%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E7%9B%96%E7%AB%A0%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="特别注意：起诉状中不要求写“案由”。案由是法院立案庭内部管理用的分类，实践中出现纯属以讹传讹的干扰项。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%86%99%E2%80%9C%E6%A1%88%E7%94%B1%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%A1%88%E7%94%B1%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E5%BA%AD%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E4%B8%AD%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E7%BA%AF%E5%B1%9E%E4%BB%A5%E8%AE%B9%E4%BC%A0%E8%AE%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E9%A1%B9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 一事不再理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心概念：一个案件经过法院实体处理结案或在实体审理过程中，就同一事又起诉的，不予受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%BB%93%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8B%E5%8F%88%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="不适用“一事不再理”的情形（无实体处理）：裁定不予受理、驳回起诉、撤诉、按撤诉处理的案件，当事人可以再次起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E7%90%86%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%81%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E6%8C%89%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="“一事不再理”的例外情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E7%90%86%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 赡养、扶养、抚育费（三费）案件：裁判生效后，因新情况、新理由，一方再起诉要求增加或减少费用的，法院应作为新案件受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E3%80%81%E6%89%B6%E5%85%BB%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E8%82%B2%E8%B4%B9%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%E8%B4%B9%EF%BC%89%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E3%80%81%E6%96%B0%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%86%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E6%88%96%E5%87%8F%E5%B0%91%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%96%B0%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原理：判决管一辈子，期间情况变化大（物价、身体、收入等）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%80%E8%BE%88%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%88%E7%89%A9%E4%BB%B7%E3%80%81%E8%BA%AB%E4%BD%93%E3%80%81%E6%94%B6%E5%85%A5%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 离婚案件（离婚没离成的情形）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%B2%A1%E7%A6%BB%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="情形：判决不准离婚、调解和好、原告撤诉/按撤诉处理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%86%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%92%8C%E5%A5%BD%E3%80%81%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89/%E6%8C%89%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="原告在没有新情况、新理由的情况下，6个月内又起诉的，不予受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%9C%A8%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%96%B0%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E3%80%81%E6%96%B0%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E6%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%88%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="有新情况、新理由，原告在6个月内可起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E3%80%81%E6%96%B0%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%9C%A86%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E5%86%85%E5%8F%AF%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="原告6个月后可起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E6%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="被告不受6个月限制，可随时起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%976%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E9%9A%8F%E6%97%B6%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="重复起诉的判断标准（同时满足）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%88%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 当事人相同。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 诉讼标的相同。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 诉讼请求相同，或后诉请求实质上否定前诉裁判结果。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E5%90%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E4%B8%8A%E5%90%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%89%8D%E8%AF%89%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【案例】“相同”与“否定”的理解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E2%80%9C%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%8E%E2%80%9C%E5%90%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  后诉请求为前诉所包含（视为相同）：前诉判履行合同（含确认有效），后诉再单独告确认合同有效 -重复起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%BA%E5%89%8D%E8%AF%89%E6%89%80%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%89%8D%E8%AF%89%E5%88%A4%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%90%AB%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8E%E8%AF%89%E5%86%8D%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%20-%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  后诉请求实质上否定前诉结果：前诉判履行合同（隐含确认有效），后诉告确认合同无效 -重复起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E4%B8%8A%E5%90%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%89%8D%E8%AF%89%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%89%8D%E8%AF%89%E5%88%A4%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%88%E9%9A%90%E5%90%AB%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8E%E8%AF%89%E5%91%8A%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%20-%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="新事实：判决生效后发生的新事实，当事人再次起诉的，法院应当受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B0%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 起诉与受理的法律效果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="起诉的法律效果：导致诉讼时效中断（实体法效果）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="受理的法律效果：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 受诉法院取得对该案的审判权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%A5%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 受诉法院形成排他管辖权，当事人不能再向其他法院起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%92%E4%BB%96%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E5%90%91%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 当事人取得原、被告的诉讼地位和相应的权利义务。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%E5%8E%9F%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、撤诉与缺席判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8E%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 撤诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="申请撤诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="主体：诉的原告（含本诉原告、反诉原告、有独三）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%90%AB%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E3%80%81%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E3%80%81%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="时间：受理后，判决宣告前。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="决定权：由法院裁定是否准许。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="特殊情况：法庭辩论终结后原告撤诉，若被告不同意，法院可不予准许。 -因被告已陪跑全程，有获得判决以给个说法的合理期待。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%90%8E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%8B%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E3%80%82%20-%E5%9B%A0%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%B7%B2%E9%99%AA%E8%B7%91%E5%85%A8%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%97%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%BB%A5%E7%BB%99%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%B4%E6%B3%95%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E6%9C%9F%E5%BE%85%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="按撤诉处理（视为不告了）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%89%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%91%8A%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 原告接到传票，无正当理由拒不到庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%8E%A5%E5%88%B0%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 原告未经法庭许可中途退庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%AE%B8%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%AD%E9%80%94%E9%80%80%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 原告不预交案件受理费。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E9%A2%84%E4%BA%A4%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="撤诉的法律效果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="程序终结：案件不再进行实体审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="可再次起诉：因未经过实体处理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%A0%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 缺席判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心逻辑：被动参与方不来，视为放弃陈述申辩权，程序照样进行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%8A%A8%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%8D%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E7%94%B3%E8%BE%A9%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%85%A7%E6%A0%B7%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="适用对象与情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E4%B8%8E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="被告/无独三：经传票传唤，无正当理由拒不到庭，或未经许可中途退庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A/%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%8F%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E8%AE%B8%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%AD%E9%80%94%E9%80%80%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="特殊原告：原告申请撤诉未获准许，经传票传唤无正当理由拒不到庭，或未经许可中途退庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E8%8E%B7%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%E4%BC%A0%E7%A5%A8%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E8%AE%B8%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%AD%E9%80%94%E9%80%80%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="普适总结（对席/缺席/撤诉）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%82%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%88%E5%AF%B9%E5%B8%AD/%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD/%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="程序启动方（原告、上诉人、再审申请人、仲裁申请人）：通知你不来，视为不想解决了，按撤回处理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%BD%A0%E4%B8%8D%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%83%B3%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E4%BA%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="被动接受方（被告、被上诉人、再审被申请人、仲裁被申请人）：通知你不来，视为放弃陈述申辩，作出缺席判决/裁决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%8A%A8%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E6%96%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%BD%A0%E4%B8%8D%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E7%94%B3%E8%BE%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3/%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 撤诉与实体法的融合" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E7%9A%84%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="撤诉与诉讼时效：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="起诉时 -时效中断。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%20-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院裁定准予撤诉，程序终结 -诉讼时效重新计算。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%86%E4%BA%88%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%20-%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="撤诉与合同解除：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="基本规则：当事人直接起诉解除合同的，合同自起诉状副本送达对方时解除。但前提是法院判决确认了该解除主张。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E8%87%AA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E6%97%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E3%80%82%E4%BD%86%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%BA%86%E8%AF%A5%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="  【案例群】撤诉对合同解除的影响" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E7%BE%A4%E3%80%91%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%AF%B9%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  1.  诉讼一撤诉，诉讼二再告：张三起诉李四解除合同（诉一），中途撤诉。后再次起诉解除合同（诉二）并胜诉。 -合同在诉讼二的起诉状副本送达李四时解除。因为诉一未产生解除效力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%201.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%80%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%AD%E9%80%94%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E5%90%8E%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%B9%B6%E8%83%9C%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%20-%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%97%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%AA%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  2.  诉讼一撤诉，再发通知，又起诉确认：张三起诉李四解除合同（诉一），中途撤诉。后向李四发解除通知，李四有异议。张三起诉确认解除效力（诉二）并胜诉。 -合同自通知到达李四时解除。因为是走“通知解除”的路子。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%202.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%80%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%8F%91%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%88%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%AD%E9%80%94%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E5%90%8E%E5%90%91%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%91%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E5%B9%B6%E8%83%9C%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%20-%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E8%87%AA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E5%88%B0%E8%BE%BE%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%97%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E6%98%AF%E8%B5%B0%E2%80%9C%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E8%B7%AF%E5%AD%90%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="五、诉讼障碍" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E9%9A%9C%E7%A2%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 延期审理（用“决定”）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BB%B6%E6%9C%9F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E7%94%A8%E2%80%9C%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心逻辑：小障碍，只是今天这庭开不成了，换个时间再开就行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%8F%E9%9A%9C%E7%A2%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%8A%E5%A4%A9%E8%BF%99%E5%BA%AD%E5%BC%80%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E4%BA%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%8D%A2%E4%B8%AA%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%86%8D%E5%BC%80%E5%B0%B1%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="文书：决定书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 必须到庭的当事人和其他诉讼参与人有正当理由没有到庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%92%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 当事人临时提出回避申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%B4%E6%97%B6%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 需要通知新的证人、调取新的证据、重新鉴定、勘验，或需要补充调查。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E5%8F%96%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%81%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 其他应当延期的情形。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%BB%B6%E6%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【案例】正当理由 vs 不可抗拒事由" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%20vs%20%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E6%8A%97%E6%8B%92%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  “不可抗拒事由”导致后果轻微、短期内可确定的，用延期审理。如：泥石流困在家中、撞断腿住院、在庭上突发胃病/阑尾炎。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E6%8A%97%E6%8B%92%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%E2%80%9D%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%E8%BD%BB%E5%BE%AE%E3%80%81%E7%9F%AD%E6%9C%9F%E5%86%85%E5%8F%AF%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BB%B6%E6%9C%9F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%A5%E7%9F%B3%E6%B5%81%E5%9B%B0%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%AD%E3%80%81%E6%92%9E%E6%96%AD%E8%85%BF%E4%BD%8F%E9%99%A2%E3%80%81%E5%9C%A8%E5%BA%AD%E4%B8%8A%E7%AA%81%E5%8F%91%E8%83%83%E7%97%85/%E9%98%91%E5%B0%BE%E7%82%8E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  “不可抗拒事由”导致诉讼前途不明的，用诉讼中止。如：泥石流冲走下落不明、撞了后不省人事。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E6%8A%97%E6%8B%92%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%E2%80%9D%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%89%8D%E9%80%94%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%A5%E7%9F%B3%E6%B5%81%E5%86%B2%E8%B5%B0%E4%B8%8B%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E3%80%81%E6%92%9E%E4%BA%86%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%8D%E7%9C%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%8B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 诉讼中止（用“裁定”）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%EF%BC%88%E7%94%A8%E2%80%9C%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心逻辑：大障碍，大到整个诉讼要不要继续、谁来继续、何时继续都不知道了，暂停，等障碍消除再说。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%A7%E9%9A%9C%E7%A2%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%A7%E5%88%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E3%80%81%E8%B0%81%E6%9D%A5%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E3%80%81%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E6%9A%82%E5%81%9C%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E9%9A%9C%E7%A2%8D%E6%B6%88%E9%99%A4%E5%86%8D%E8%AF%B4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="文书：裁定书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="核心情形推导（以“死亡”等为线索）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E6%8E%A8%E5%AF%BC%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%A5%E2%80%9C%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E2%80%9D%E7%AD%89%E4%B8%BA%E7%BA%BF%E7%B4%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="一方当事人死亡：一般案件，等继承人来，是诉讼中止。若等不来，转诉讼终结。若是离婚、追索三费等身份关系案件，直接诉讼终结。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E7%AD%89%E4%B8%8D%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E8%BD%AC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E6%98%AF%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E3%80%81%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E4%B8%89%E8%B4%B9%E7%AD%89%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="一方当事人丧失诉讼行为能力：尚未确定法定代理人的，中止。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%A7%E5%A4%B1%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%9A%E6%9C%AA%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法人/其他组织终止：尚未确定权利义务承受人的，中止。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E7%BB%88%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%9A%E6%9C%AA%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%89%BF%E5%8F%97%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="本案须以另一案的审理结果为依据，而另一案尚未审结的：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E9%A1%BB%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%A1%88%E5%B0%9A%E6%9C%AA%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%93%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【案例群】本案与另案的关系判断" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E7%BE%A4%E3%80%91%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%A6%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="1.  借款合同诉讼中，被告因盗窃被刑拘。（无关，不中止）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%20%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%9B%A0%E7%9B%97%E7%AA%83%E8%A2%AB%E5%88%91%E6%8B%98%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2.  保管合同（银行保管箱珠宝丢失）诉讼中，银行出纳因涉嫌盗窃该珠宝被刑拘。（无关，银行都要赔，不中止）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%20%E4%BF%9D%E7%AE%A1%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%88%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E4%BF%9D%E7%AE%A1%E7%AE%B1%E7%8F%A0%E5%AE%9D%E4%B8%A2%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%87%BA%E7%BA%B3%E5%9B%A0%E6%B6%89%E5%AB%8C%E7%9B%97%E7%AA%83%E8%AF%A5%E7%8F%A0%E5%AE%9D%E8%A2%AB%E5%88%91%E6%8B%98%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%8C%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E9%83%BD%E8%A6%81%E8%B5%94%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3.  遗产继承诉讼中，一继承人因杀害邻居被刑拘。（无关，不中止）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%20%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E5%9B%A0%E6%9D%80%E5%AE%B3%E9%82%BB%E5%B1%85%E8%A2%AB%E5%88%91%E6%8B%98%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="4.  遗产继承诉讼中，一继承人因涉嫌杀害被继承人被刑拘。（有关，中止）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%20%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E5%9B%A0%E6%B6%89%E5%AB%8C%E6%9D%80%E5%AE%B3%E8%A2%AB%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%88%91%E6%8B%98%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="5.  合同纠纷诉讼中，一方配偶申请宣告该方为无民事行为能力人。（有关，中止）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%20%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E9%85%8D%E5%81%B6%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%A5%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 诉讼终结（用“裁定”）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%88%E7%94%A8%E2%80%9C%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心逻辑：极大障碍，诉讼没法继续，或无需继续，到此为止，不审了。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9E%81%E5%A4%A7%E9%9A%9C%E7%A2%8D%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B2%A1%E6%B3%95%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%B0%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%AD%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%BA%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="文书：裁定书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="情形（核心就一个“死亡”，但分情况）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E2%80%9C%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%88%86%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 原告死亡，没有继承人，或继承人放弃诉讼权利。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 被告死亡，没有遗产，也没有应当承担义务的人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 离婚案件一方当事人死亡。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 追索赡养费、扶养费、抚育费以及解除收养关系案件，一方当事人死亡。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E6%89%B6%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E8%82%B2%E8%B4%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E6%94%B6%E5%85%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. “死亡”在不同阶段对程序的影响【综合归纳】" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E2%80%9C%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E2%80%9D%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E5%AF%B9%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E3%80%90%E7%BB%BC%E5%90%88%E5%BD%92%E7%BA%B3%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="起诉前，被告已死亡（考起诉条件）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%B7%B2%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%EF%BC%88%E8%80%83%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="受理前发现：没有明确被告，不符合起诉条件 -裁定不予受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%20-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="受理后发现：受错了 -裁定驳回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E9%94%99%E4%BA%86%20-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="诉讼中，一方当事人死亡（考障碍制度）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%EF%BC%88%E8%80%83%E9%9A%9C%E7%A2%8D%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="一般案件（财产纠纷等）：先诉讼中止，等继承人表态。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E8%A1%A8%E6%80%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="等到了，愿意继续：变更当事人，诉讼继续进行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%89%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E6%84%BF%E6%84%8F%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="等不到，或放弃：诉讼终结。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="身份关系案件（离婚、解除收养、追索三费等）：诉讼终结。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E3%80%81%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E6%94%B6%E5%85%BB%E3%80%81%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E4%B8%89%E8%B4%B9%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="“诉讼中”的时间范围：指的是从受理后到判决生效前。这期间的任何时间点（庭审中、评议时、宣判时、上诉期内）都叫“诉讼中”。 -[案例]：黄某案，法庭辩论后遇车祸死亡，继承人不明。因为是合同纠纷，所以应选诉讼中止，而非终结。因为时间点处在“诉讼中”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%87%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E8%BF%99%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%88%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%E3%80%81%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%B6%E3%80%81%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E6%97%B6%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%E5%86%85%EF%BC%89%E9%83%BD%E5%8F%AB%E2%80%9C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%20-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%5B%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%5D%EF%BC%9A%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E5%90%8E%E9%81%87%E8%BD%A6%E7%A5%B8%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E6%98%AF%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E5%BA%94%E9%80%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E9%9D%9E%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%82%B9%E5%A4%84%E5%9C%A8%E2%80%9C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="六、一审审限" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AD%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="期限：立案之日起 6个月。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E6%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="延长：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="第一次延长：需本院院长批准。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%EF%BC%9A%E9%9C%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="还需延长：报请上级法院批准。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%98%E9%9C%80%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%EF%BC%9A%E6%8A%A5%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="七、判决的效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%83%E3%80%81%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 执行力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="条件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 必须是给付之诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 必须是原告胜诉的判决（支持了给付请求）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%AF%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%83%9C%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E4%BA%86%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 判决有明确的给付内容。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 形成力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="条件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 必须是形成之诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 必须是原告胜诉的判决（支持了形成请求）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%AF%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%83%9C%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E4%BA%86%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="效果：判决生效时，直接变动法律关系。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%98%E5%8A%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 既判力（禁止再诉的效力）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%97%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E5%86%8D%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="客观范围（对什么事）: 只有判决主文有既判力，判决理由没有。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E4%BA%8B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E:%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%BB%E6%96%87%E6%9C%89%E6%97%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="如何判断：看该事是否作为诉讼请求被提出，并进入判决主文。进了，就有；没进，就没有。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%9C%8B%E8%AF%A5%E4%BA%8B%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%A2%AB%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%BB%E6%96%87%E3%80%82%E8%BF%9B%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%9C%89%EF%BC%9B%E6%B2%A1%E8%BF%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【案例】抗辩 vs 反诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%20vs%20%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="甲公司告乙公司付租金，乙公司辩称合同已解除。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%91%8A%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%BB%98%E7%A7%9F%E9%87%91%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%BE%A9%E7%A7%B0%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B7%B2%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  A. 乙公司以抗辩方式主张解除，法院对此的认定属于判决理由，无既判力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20A.%20%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%AD%A4%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%97%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  B. 乙公司以反诉方式请求确认解除，法院会在主文中判，有既判力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20B.%20%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%BB%E6%96%87%E4%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E6%97%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="部分请求问题：原告只就债权的一部分起诉，判决的既判力效力及于全部债权。余下部分不能再次起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%AA%E5%B0%B1%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%8A%9B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E5%8F%8A%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E4%BD%99%E4%B8%8B%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="主观范围（对哪些人）: 相对性。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E8%A7%82%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E5%AF%B9%E5%93%AA%E4%BA%9B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E:%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：既判力只及于案件当事人。因为没参加诉讼的人没辩论机会。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%8A%9B%E5%8F%AA%E5%8F%8A%E4%BA%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E6%B2%A1%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%B2%A1%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E6%9C%BA%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="扩张（例外）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A9%E5%BC%A0%EF%BC%88%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 权利义务承受人：如当事人死亡后的继承人、法人合并/分立后的新主体。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%89%BF%E5%8F%97%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6/%E5%88%86%E7%AB%8B%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 公司决议诉讼的其他股东：股东提起的撤销决议/确认决议无效之诉的胜诉判决，既判力及于公司及未参加诉讼的其他股东。以防不同股东反复起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%86%B3%E8%AE%AE%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%86%B3%E8%AE%AE/%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%86%B3%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E8%83%9C%E8%AF%89%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%8A%9B%E5%8F%8A%E4%BA%8E%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%8F%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E4%BB%A5%E9%98%B2%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E5%8F%8D%E5%A4%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="时间范围（对什么时间之内的事）: 标准时。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E4%B9%8B%E5%86%85%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E:%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E6%97%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="标准：以判决生效时为界。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%97%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E7%95%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="效力：判决生效前发生的事，受既判力约束，不能再诉。判决生效后发生的新事实，不受既判力约束，可以再诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%97%E6%97%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%8A%9B%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E6%97%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%8A%9B%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%86%8D%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【案例】新事实的认定" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E6%96%B0%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="1.  首诉要求履行合同，因供货商停工被判败诉。判决生效后，供货商复工。 -该复工为新事实，可再次起诉履行，不能申请再审（原判没错）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%20%E9%A6%96%E8%AF%89%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E4%BE%9B%E8%B4%A7%E5%95%86%E5%81%9C%E5%B7%A5%E8%A2%AB%E5%88%A4%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%9B%E8%B4%A7%E5%95%86%E5%A4%8D%E5%B7%A5%E3%80%82%20-%E8%AF%A5%E5%A4%8D%E5%B7%A5%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E6%B2%A1%E9%94%99%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2.  首诉要求交通事故赔10万，判赔并履行完毕。一年后，因该事故后遗症，再花8万。 -后遗症是首诉标准时后的新事实，且原诉中也未主张，可再次起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%20%E9%A6%96%E8%AF%89%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%E8%B5%9410%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E8%B5%94%E5%B9%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%AF%95%E3%80%82%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E8%AF%A5%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%E5%90%8E%E9%81%97%E7%97%87%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E8%8A%B18%E4%B8%87%E3%80%82%20-%E5%90%8E%E9%81%97%E7%97%87%E6%98%AF%E9%A6%96%E8%AF%89%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E6%97%B6%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E5%8E%9F%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%AD%E4%B9%9F%E6%9C%AA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="八、确认婚姻效力案件的特别程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AB%E3%80%81%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 当事人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原告：婚姻当事人及利害关系人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="利害关系人范围（按违法程度轻重递增）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E6%8C%89%E8%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%A6%E8%BD%BB%E9%87%8D%E9%80%92%E5%A2%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 以未达法定婚龄为由：未成年方的近亲属。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E8%BE%BE%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%A9%9A%E9%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E6%88%90%E5%B9%B4%E6%96%B9%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%91%E4%BA%B2%E5%B1%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 以有禁止结婚的亲属关系为由：当事人的近亲属。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E7%BB%93%E5%A9%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%B2%E5%B1%9E%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%91%E4%BA%B2%E5%B1%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 以重婚为由：当事人的近亲属及基层组织（村委会/居委会）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E5%A9%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%91%E4%BA%B2%E5%B1%9E%E5%8F%8A%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%EF%BC%88%E6%9D%91%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A/%E5%B1%85%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="第三人（重婚案件）：涉及财产分割时，应准许合法婚姻当事人作为有独立请求权第三人参加诉讼，对财产主张权利。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E9%87%8D%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%9D%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="案例模型：A（男）与B（女）合法结婚。A又与C（女）重婚。C起诉A，要求确认婚姻无效并分割同居财产。 -合法配偶B可作为有独三参加诉讼，主张A的财产中有其份额。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9AA%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B7%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8EB%EF%BC%88%E5%A5%B3%EF%BC%89%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E7%BB%93%E5%A9%9A%E3%80%82A%E5%8F%88%E4%B8%8EC%EF%BC%88%E5%A5%B3%EF%BC%89%E9%87%8D%E5%A9%9A%E3%80%82C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89A%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%85%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E3%80%82%20-%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E9%85%8D%E5%81%B6B%E5%8F%AF%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0A%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%BD%E9%A2%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 诉讼程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="对处分权的限制（体现职权主义）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%88%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%BB%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 原告申请撤诉：不予准许。法院必须一查到底。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%B8%80%E6%9F%A5%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 审理婚姻效力问题：不适用调解，必须由法院依法判决宣告。但同案中的财产分割、子女抚养问题可以调解。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E3%80%82%E4%BD%86%E5%90%8C%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E3%80%81%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="对财产/子女问题调解成功：另行制作调解书结案。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7/%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%93%E6%A1%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="对财产/子女问题调解不成：与婚姻效力问题一并作出判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7/%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="无效情形的判断时间点：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：以起诉时的状况为准。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E7%8A%B6%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%BA%E5%87%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="典型适用：未达法定婚龄，起诉时已达龄的，法院不予支持确认无效的请求。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E8%BE%BE%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%A9%9A%E9%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E5%B7%B2%E8%BE%BE%E9%BE%84%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外：重婚绝对无效。即便起诉时原合法婚姻已解除或配偶已死亡，重婚仍无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E5%A9%9A%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%8D%B3%E4%BE%BF%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%E5%8E%9F%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E5%B7%B2%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E6%88%96%E9%85%8D%E5%81%B6%E5%B7%B2%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%EF%BC%8C%E9%87%8D%E5%A9%9A%E4%BB%8D%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="当事人死亡的处理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="核心：婚姻效力对继承等有重大影响，必须审结。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E5%AF%B9%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E7%AD%89%E6%9C%89%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%93%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 一方或双方死亡后，生存方或利害关系人起诉：法院应当受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%88%96%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%9F%E5%AD%98%E6%96%B9%E6%88%96%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 诉讼进程中一方或双方死亡：法院应继续审理，作出判决（而非像离婚案那样终结诉讼）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%88%96%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%88%E8%80%8C%E9%9D%9E%E5%83%8F%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%E9%82%A3%E6%A0%B7%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="【案例】死亡后诉讼的意义" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E5%90%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="丈夫死后留4亿遗产，婆媳起争议。若婚姻有效，儿媳分3亿，婆婆分1亿。若婚姻无效（近亲结婚），全为个人财产，婆婆得4亿，儿媳得0。因此，即使死者已矣，婚姻效力的认定意义重大。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%88%E5%A4%AB%E6%AD%BB%E5%90%8E%E7%95%994%E4%BA%BF%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E5%A9%86%E5%AA%B3%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%84%BF%E5%AA%B3%E5%88%863%E4%BA%BF%EF%BC%8C%E5%A9%86%E5%A9%86%E5%88%861%E4%BA%BF%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%91%E4%BA%B2%E7%BB%93%E5%A9%9A%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%A8%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E5%A9%86%E5%A9%86%E5%BE%974%E4%BA%BF%EF%BC%8C%E5%84%BF%E5%AA%B3%E5%BE%970%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E4%BD%BF%E6%AD%BB%E8%80%85%E5%B7%B2%E7%9F%A3%EF%BC%8C%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 与离婚诉讼的关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%B8%8E%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="关系：婚姻有效是离婚的前提。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E6%98%AF%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="审理中发现婚姻无效：法院应依职权调查。查明确属无效的，判决宣告婚姻无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%82%E6%9F%A5%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E5%B1%9E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="离婚与效力确认案件并存：离婚诉讼应裁定诉讼中止，等待确认婚姻效力案件的判决结果。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%B9%B6%E5%AD%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%BA%94%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【经典案例】原告不适格，但法院受理后怎么办？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E5%8A%9E%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="刘某之母潘某以“王某未达法定婚龄”为由，诉请确认刘、王婚姻无效。法院受理后发现，潘某是已达法定婚龄者刘某的近亲属，主体不适格。诉讼中查明王某确实未达法定婚龄，但双方达成和解，潘某申请撤诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E4%B9%8B%E6%AF%8D%E6%BD%98%E6%9F%90%E4%BB%A5%E2%80%9C%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E6%9C%AA%E8%BE%BE%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%A9%9A%E9%BE%84%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%88%98%E3%80%81%E7%8E%8B%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%8C%E6%BD%98%E6%9F%90%E6%98%AF%E5%B7%B2%E8%BE%BE%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%A9%9A%E9%BE%84%E8%80%85%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%91%E4%BA%B2%E5%B1%9E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E3%80%82%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%9F%A5%E6%98%8E%E7%8E%8B%E6%9F%90%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9E%E6%9C%AA%E8%BE%BE%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E5%A9%9A%E9%BE%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E6%BD%98%E6%9F%90%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  分析：尽管潘某主体不适格，但法院一旦受理，发现婚姻无效的违法事由，就必须审到底，不允许撤诉(C对)，不能用调解书(B错)、调解笔录(D错)的方式结案。应继续审理并判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%BD%E7%AE%A1%E6%BD%98%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A6%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89(C%E5%AF%B9)%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%A8%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6(B%E9%94%99)%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%AC%94%E5%BD%95(D%E9%94%99)%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E7%BB%93%E6%A1%88%E3%80%82%E5%BA%94%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题17 简易程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9817%20%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、简易程序的适用" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 基本适用条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="两个要件（同时满足）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 法院级别：基层法院及其派出法庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B4%BE%E5%87%BA%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 案件审级：第一审民事案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【辨析】“第一审” vs “适用一审程序”" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%E3%80%91%E2%80%9C%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E2%80%9D%20vs%20%E2%80%9C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  正确：适用于“第一审民事案件”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E2%80%9C%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  错误：适用于“适用一审程序审理的民事案件”。因为“适用一审程序”还包括发回重审、适用一审程序的再审，而这两者不能适用简易程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E2%80%9C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%9C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E2%80%9D%E8%BF%98%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%A4%E8%80%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 消极条件（禁止适用的案件）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B6%88%E6%9E%81%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="以下案件不得适用简易程序：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 被告下落不明：因为需要公告送达，而简易程序不能公告送达。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8B%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 一方人数众多：指代表人诉讼。一般的共同诉讼不在此列，符合条件仍可适用。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%97%E5%A4%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%8D%E5%9C%A8%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%EF%BC%8C%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E4%BB%8D%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 发回重审或适用审判监督程序（再审） 的案件：重审、再审是纠错程序，案情本身不简单。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%98%AF%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E4%B8%8D%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 涉及国家、社会公共利益的案件：如公益诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="5. 第三人撤销之诉：其结果动摇生效裁判的稳定性，需慎重。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%B6%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%8A%A8%E6%91%87%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E6%85%8E%E9%87%8D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="6. 其他不宜适用的案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 实务问题：无法送达的处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%AE%9E%E5%8A%A1%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="情形：适用简易程序审理中，按原告提供地址无法向被告送达文书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%90%91%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="处理（分情况）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E5%88%86%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原告提供了准确地址，只是无法送达：应裁定转为普通程序，然后公告送达。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E4%BA%86%E5%87%86%E7%A1%AE%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%EF%BC%9A%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%BD%AC%E4%B8%BA%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%84%B6%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="原告未提供准确地址，且法院也无法查实：视为起诉时没有明确被告，不符合起诉条件，裁定驳回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%AA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%87%86%E7%A1%AE%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B9%9F%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E6%9F%A5%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【真题案例】地址有误" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="夏某告陈某，适用简易程序。法院按夏某提供的地址送达，发现地址有误，多方了解也无法确定准确地址。 -因为原告无法提供准确地址，视为没有明确被告，应裁定驳回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%8F%E6%9F%90%E5%91%8A%E9%99%88%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%89%E5%A4%8F%E6%9F%90%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%9A%E6%96%B9%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%9F%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%86%E7%A1%AE%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E3%80%82%20-%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%87%86%E7%A1%AE%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 适用方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="法院依职权适用：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="条件：事实清楚、权利义务关系明确、争议不大的简单民事案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%E3%80%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E3%80%81%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="当事人协议适用：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="条件：对上述规定以外的案件，当事人双方可以约定适用简易程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A5%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【考点】程序转换的约定限制" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E3%80%91%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  “普”可转“简”：本该用普通程序的，双方可以约定用简易程序。（节约司法资源，可以）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E6%99%AE%E2%80%9D%E5%8F%AF%E8%BD%AC%E2%80%9C%E7%AE%80%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%A5%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E8%8A%82%E7%BA%A6%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  “简”不可转“普”：本该用简易程序的，双方不能约定用普通程序。（浪费司法资源，不行）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E7%AE%80%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%BD%AC%E2%80%9C%E6%99%AE%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%A5%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E6%B5%AA%E8%B4%B9%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、简易程序的特点" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 传唤、送达方式简便" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%E3%80%81%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E7%AE%80%E4%BE%BF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="方式：可以采取捎口信、电话、短信、微信、传真、电子邮件等简便方式。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E6%8D%8E%E5%8F%A3%E4%BF%A1%E3%80%81%E7%94%B5%E8%AF%9D%E3%80%81%E7%9F%AD%E4%BF%A1%E3%80%81%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E3%80%81%E4%BC%A0%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%81%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E9%82%AE%E4%BB%B6%E7%AD%89%E7%AE%80%E4%BE%BF%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="范围：可以送达一切文书，包括判决书、裁定书、调解书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%88%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="针对开庭通知的特殊保护：用简便方式送达开庭通知，未经当事人确认或没有其他证据证明当事人已收到的，法院不得缺席判决。必须确保当事人陈述申辩的权利。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%80%E4%BE%BF%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%B2%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E7%94%B3%E8%BE%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 审判组织与开庭方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E4%B8%8E%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="审判组织：由审判员一人独任审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="开庭方式灵活：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E7%81%B5%E6%B4%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="可线下开庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="经当事人同意，可以采用视听传输技术等方式在线开庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%8F%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%87%87%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%86%E5%90%AC%E4%BC%A0%E8%BE%93%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E7%AD%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="核心底线：必须开庭，不能书面审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%BA%95%E7%BA%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 举证期限与答辩期限灵活" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E4%B8%8E%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E7%81%B5%E6%B4%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="确定方式：可由法院确定，也可由当事人协商一致经法院准许。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="期限上限：不管何种方式，不得超过15天。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E7%AE%A1%E4%BD%95%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%8715%E5%A4%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【阶段总结】举证期限规则对比" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E3%80%91%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  普通程序（法院指定）：不得少于 15天。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%B0%91%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%2015%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  简易程序（所有方式）：不得超过 15天。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%2015%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  小额诉讼程序（所有方式）：一般不得超过 7天。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%207%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 审限短" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%E7%9F%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="法定期限：立案之日起 3个月。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E3%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="延长：经院长批准可延长 1个月。合计最多 4个月。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%8F%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%E5%8F%AF%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E1%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%90%88%E8%AE%A1%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E4%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 注重调解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E6%B3%A8%E9%87%8D%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="对婚姻家庭、邻里纠纷等矛盾较小的案件，应先行调解。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%81%E9%82%BB%E9%87%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%AD%89%E7%9F%9B%E7%9B%BE%E8%BE%83%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%88%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="6. 裁判文书简化" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="简化对象：判决书中的认定事实（本院经审理查明）和裁判理由（本院认为）部分。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%9F%A5%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%89%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%89%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="简化程度：可以适当简化，但不能省略。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E5%BD%93%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9C%81%E7%95%A5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【阶段总结】裁判文书说理简化对比" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E3%80%91%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%AF%B4%E7%90%86%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  普通程序：必须详细阐述。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E9%98%90%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  简易程序：可以适当简化（必须有，但写简单点）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E5%BD%93%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%9C%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%86%99%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  小额诉讼程序：可以省略（可以完全不写）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9C%81%E7%95%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%99%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、简易程序的转化" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 转化方向" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="“普”不能转“简”：已经适用普通程序的案件，开庭后不得转为简易程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E6%99%AE%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%BD%AC%E2%80%9C%E7%AE%80%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%BD%AC%E4%B8%BA%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="“简”可以转“普”：可以转为普通程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E7%AE%80%E2%80%9D%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%BD%AC%E2%80%9C%E6%99%AE%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%BD%AC%E4%B8%BA%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="转化事由：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 法院发现不宜适用简易程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 当事人提出异议，法院认为异议成立。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="文书：用裁定书转为普通程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%BD%AC%E4%B8%BA%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 审限计算" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则：审限连续计算，从立案之日起算。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="解释：简易程序已花费的审理时间，必须计入普通程序的6个月审限内，不是从转化日起重新算。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%B7%B2%E8%8A%B1%E8%B4%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E8%AE%A1%E5%85%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%846%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%E5%86%85%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E7%AE%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、小额诉讼程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 适用条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="适用法院：基层法院及其派出法庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B4%BE%E5%87%BA%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="案件类型：事实清楚、权利义务关系明确、争议不大的简单金钱给付民事案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%E3%80%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E3%80%81%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E9%87%91%E9%92%B1%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="标的额标准：（设“上年度就业人员年平均工资”为 W）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9D%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%EF%BC%88%E8%AE%BE%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8A%E5%B9%B4%E5%BA%A6%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E5%B9%B4%E5%B9%B3%E5%9D%87%E5%B7%A5%E8%B5%84%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22codespan%22%3EW%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法定适用：标的额 ≤ W × 50%，法院依职权适用。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9D%20%E2%89%A4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EW%20%C3%97%2050%25%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="协议适用：W × 50% &lt; 标的额 ≤ W × 2倍，当事人可以协议适用。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EW%20%C3%97%2050%25%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20&amp;lt;%20%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9D%20%E2%89%A4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EW%20%C3%97%202%E5%80%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="禁止适用：标的额 W × 2倍，不能适用。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9D%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EW%20%C3%97%202%E5%80%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="特殊主体：海事法院可以适用小额诉讼程序（因其特别程序法规定可适用简易程序）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B5%B7%E4%BA%8B%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E5%85%B6%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 消极条件（禁止适用的案件）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B6%88%E6%9E%81%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="以下案件不得适用小额诉讼程序：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 人身关系、财产确权案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%81%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%A1%AE%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="原理：人身关系涉公序良俗；财产确权是确物权，有对世效力，需格外慎重。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%BA%E8%BA%AB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%B6%89%E5%85%AC%E5%BA%8F%E8%89%AF%E4%BF%97%EF%BC%9B%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%A1%AE%E6%9D%83%E6%98%AF%E7%A1%AE%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%96%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E6%A0%BC%E5%A4%96%E6%85%8E%E9%87%8D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 涉外民事案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="核心判断标准：只要有涉外因素，标的额再小也不能用。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%A0%E7%B4%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9D%E5%86%8D%E5%B0%8F%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="【案例】涉外必不能用小额诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E5%BF%85%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="中国人张三告美国人汤姆，要求支付可乐款3块钱。 -标的额虽极小，但属涉外案件，不得适用小额诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%91%8A%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E6%B1%A4%E5%A7%86%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E5%8F%AF%E4%B9%90%E6%AC%BE3%E5%9D%97%E9%92%B1%E3%80%82%20-%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9D%E8%99%BD%E6%9E%81%E5%B0%8F%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%B1%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 需评估、鉴定，或对诉前评估/鉴定结果有异议的案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9C%80%E8%AF%84%E4%BC%B0%E3%80%81%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E8%AF%84%E4%BC%B0/%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 一方当事人下落不明的案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8B%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="5. 当事人提出反诉的案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="核心判断标准：只要提出反诉，就视为复杂，标的额再小也不能用。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%EF%BC%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9D%E5%86%8D%E5%B0%8F%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="【案例】提反诉必不能用小额诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E6%8F%90%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E5%BF%85%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="张三告李四，要求支付可乐款3元（本诉标的3元）。李四反诉张三，要求赔衣服扣子钱5元（反诉标的5元）。 -本反诉总标的8元，极低，但因为提出反诉，不得适用小额诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%91%8A%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E5%8F%AF%E4%B9%90%E6%AC%BE3%E5%85%83%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%89%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%843%E5%85%83%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%B5%94%E8%A1%A3%E6%9C%8D%E6%89%A3%E5%AD%90%E9%92%B15%E5%85%83%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%845%E5%85%83%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%20-%E6%9C%AC%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E6%80%BB%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%848%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%9E%81%E4%BD%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 举证与答辩期限" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%B8%BE%E8%AF%81%E4%B8%8E%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="期限：由法院确定或当事人协商一致经法院准许，一般不得超过7天。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%88%96%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E7%BB%8F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%877%E5%A4%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 审理特点" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="一次开庭：可以一次开庭审结并当庭宣判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%93%E5%B9%B6%E5%BD%93%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="注意：“可以”意味着不强制，实在不行，可以开两次庭或定期宣判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E2%80%9D%E6%84%8F%E5%91%B3%E7%9D%80%E4%B8%8D%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8D%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%BC%80%E4%B8%A4%E6%AC%A1%E5%BA%AD%E6%88%96%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E5%AE%A3%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 审限" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="法定期限：立案之日起 2个月。经院长批准可延长 1个月。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E2%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E7%BB%8F%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%E5%8F%AF%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E1%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【阶段总结】审限规则对比" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E3%80%91%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  普通程序：6个月。院长批可延6个月；还需延的，报上级批。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A6%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E3%80%82%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E6%89%B9%E5%8F%AF%E5%BB%B66%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%9B%E8%BF%98%E9%9C%80%E5%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8A%A5%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%89%B9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  简易程序：3个月。院长批可延1个月。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A3%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E3%80%82%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E6%89%B9%E5%8F%AF%E5%BB%B61%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  小额诉讼程序：2个月。院长批可延1个月。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A2%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E3%80%82%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E6%89%B9%E5%8F%AF%E5%BB%B61%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="6. 一审终审" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心特征：判决、裁定作出即生效，不能上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%8D%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="适用范围：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 实体判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 驳回起诉裁定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 管辖权异议裁定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="注意：不存在“小额诉讼中的不予受理裁定”，因案件未被受理前，尚未确定为小额诉讼程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E2%80%9C%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%AA%E8%A2%AB%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%9A%E6%9C%AA%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%BA%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="7. 程序的转换" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="情形：法院发现不宜适用，或当事人异议成立。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="处理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="不再符合小额诉讼条件：转为适用简易程序其他规定审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%BD%AC%E4%B8%BA%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="连简易程序条件都不符合：裁定转为普通程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9E%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%BD%AC%E4%B8%BA%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【真题案例】提反诉与下落不明的程序转换" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E6%8F%90%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%8B%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="1.  案例一（提反诉）：张三李四6万元借款案，协议适用小额诉讼。审理中李四提出8万元反诉。 -因提出反诉，不得适用小额诉讼。应转为简易程序其他规定或裁定转普通程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%88%E6%8F%90%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B6%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AD%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA8%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%20-%E5%9B%A0%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%E5%BA%94%E8%BD%AC%E4%B8%BA%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E6%88%96%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%BD%AC%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2.  案例二（下落不明）：宋某借款案，适用小额诉讼。3月20日向宋某妻子送达了文书（合法）。4月1日开庭宋某未到，查实其3月25日已下落不明。 -因当事人下落不明，不得适用小额诉讼。应先裁定转换程序（转简易或普通），再因被告经合法传唤不到庭而缺席判决。不能继续用小额诉讼程序审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8B%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%8B%E6%9F%90%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%823%E6%9C%8820%E6%97%A5%E5%90%91%E5%AE%8B%E6%9F%90%E5%A6%BB%E5%AD%90%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%86%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%88%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%89%E3%80%824%E6%9C%881%E6%97%A5%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%8B%E6%9F%90%E6%9C%AA%E5%88%B0%EF%BC%8C%E6%9F%A5%E5%AE%9E%E5%85%B63%E6%9C%8825%E6%97%A5%E5%B7%B2%E4%B8%8B%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E3%80%82%20-%E5%9B%A0%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8B%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%88%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%BD%AC%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E6%88%96%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%9B%A0%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E7%BB%8F%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E8%80%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="8. 裁判文书的简化" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E8.%20%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="简化内容：可省略认定事实和裁判理由。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9C%81%E7%95%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%92%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="文书要素：主要记载当事人基本信息、诉讼请求、判决主文即可。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%A6%81%E7%B4%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E8%AE%B0%E8%BD%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E3%80%81%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%BB%E6%96%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【案例】小额诉讼判决书模型" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="“原告张三诉请被告李四归还借款2万元。本院判决如下：一、被告李四向原告张三归还本金18000元；二、驳回原告其他诉讼请求。本判决为终审判决。” （省略了“本院经审理查明”和“本院认为”部分）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%80%9C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E5%80%9F%E6%AC%BE2%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E3%80%82%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%90%91%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%BD%92%E8%BF%98%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%9118000%E5%85%83%EF%BC%9B%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E3%80%82%E6%9C%AC%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%E2%80%9D%20%EF%BC%88%E7%9C%81%E7%95%A5%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9C%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%9F%A5%E6%98%8E%E2%80%9D%E5%92%8C%E2%80%9C%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%9D%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="五、附：一审终审情形【总结】" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E9%99%84%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E3%80%90%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 最高人民法院的判决、裁定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="2. 调解书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="3. 一般的裁定书。（但不予受理、驳回起诉、管辖权异议这三个裁定例外，可以上诉）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E4%BD%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%81%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="4. 特别程序、督促程序、公示催告程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="5. 小额诉讼程序的实体判决、驳回起诉裁定、管辖权异议裁定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题18 公益诉讼程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9818%20%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、普通民事公益诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 基本概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：对污染环境、损害众多消费者合法权益等损害社会公共利益的行为，由法律规定的机关和有关组织向法院提起的诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E3%80%81%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E4%BC%97%E5%A4%9A%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E8%80%85%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E7%AD%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E5%92%8C%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="原告主体：必须是法律规定的机关和有关组织。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E5%92%8C%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="注意：公民个人不能提起公益诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E6%B0%91%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 起诉条件（与普通程序的对比）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="四个条件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 有明确的被告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 有具体的诉讼请求。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 有社会公共利益受到损害的初步证据。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E5%8F%97%E5%88%B0%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%9A%84%E5%88%9D%E6%AD%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 属于法院主管和受诉法院管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E5%92%8C%E5%8F%97%E8%AF%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="与普通程序对比：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="多了：“初步证据”。（普通程序只要求“具体的事实理由”，不要求提供证据）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%9A%E4%BA%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%88%9D%E6%AD%A5%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E2%80%9C%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="少了：“原告适格”。（因为法律规定的机关和组织提起公益诉讼，其本身就当然适格，无需赘述）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B0%91%E4%BA%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E5%92%8C%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E5%B0%B1%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E9%80%82%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%B5%98%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="级别管辖：中级人民法院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="地域管辖：侵权行为地（含行为发生地与结果发生地）或被告住所地的中院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%90%AB%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%8E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="管辖权竞合：同一损害公共利益行为，多个法院有管辖权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%AB%9E%E5%90%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="处理原则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 原告先后向两个以上法院起诉的，由最先立案的法院管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%85%88%E5%90%8E%E5%90%91%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E5%85%88%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 必要时，由共同上级法院指定管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 告知程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="义务主体：法院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="时间：受理公益诉讼案件后 10日内。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%90%8E%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E10%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="告知对象：行政主管部门。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E9%83%A8%E9%97%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="目的与后续：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8E%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="目的：督促行政机关及时履行职责，维护公共利益。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E5%8F%8A%E6%97%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E8%81%8C%E8%B4%A3%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="后续：行政主管部门依法履职，致使原告诉讼请求全部实现的，原告可以申请撤诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E9%83%A8%E9%97%A8%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E5%B1%A5%E8%81%8C%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%B4%E4%BD%BF%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 法院的释明" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8A%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="情形：法院认为原告提出的诉讼请求不足以保护公共利益。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%E4%BB%A5%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="内容：向原告释明，告知其可以变更或增加停止侵害、修复生态环境等诉讼请求。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E9%87%8A%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%85%B6%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E6%88%96%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E3%80%81%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%80%81%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E7%AD%89%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="性质：释明是告知权利，不侵犯当事人的处分权。最终是否提，由原告决定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8A%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%AF%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BE%B5%E7%8A%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%8F%90%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="6. 其他有资格的机关/组织参加诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%89%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3/%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="规则：一个侵权行为，多个主体有权起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="可在开庭前加入：其他机关/组织，可在开庭前，以共同原告身份申请参加诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3/%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="禁止重复起诉：若在开庭前未申请参加，裁判生效后又另行提起公益诉讼的，法院不予受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%8B%A5%E5%9C%A8%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E6%9C%AA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%88%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【真题案例】A、B两地环保组织管辖冲突" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91A%E3%80%81B%E4%B8%A4%E5%9C%B0%E7%8E%AF%E4%BF%9D%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="甲市A公司排污，污染了乙市B地。A地环保组织向A市中院起诉，受理后，B地环保组织也向B市中院起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E5%B8%82A%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8E%92%E6%B1%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E4%BA%86%E4%B9%99%E5%B8%82B%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%82A%E5%9C%B0%E7%8E%AF%E4%BF%9D%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%90%91A%E5%B8%82%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8CB%E5%9C%B0%E7%8E%AF%E4%BF%9D%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E4%B9%9F%E5%90%91B%E5%B8%82%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法院管辖处理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  A、B两地法院都有管辖权，由最先立案的A市中院管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20A%E3%80%81B%E4%B8%A4%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E5%85%88%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84A%E5%B8%82%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  B市中院应将案件移送给A市中院，或由共同上级法院指定管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20B%E5%B8%82%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99A%E5%B8%82%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E7%94%B1%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="当事人处理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  B地环保组织可在开庭前，申请作为共同原告参加诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20B%E5%9C%B0%E7%8E%AF%E4%BF%9D%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  若未申请，不得另行起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%E8%8B%A5%E6%9C%AA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="7. 和解与调解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="允许性：可以和解、调解。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="特殊程序（必经环节）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E5%BF%85%E7%BB%8F%E7%8E%AF%E8%8A%82%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="公告：达成和解或调解协议后，法院必须将协议内容公告。（目的：接受社会监督）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E6%88%96%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%B0%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="公告后果：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 不损害公共利益：公告期满后，法院依法出具调解书结案。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%E6%BB%A1%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E5%87%BA%E5%85%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%93%E6%A1%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 损害公共利益：法院不予出具调解书，继续审理并作出判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%87%BA%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="禁止因和解撤诉：公益诉讼中，当事人达成和解协议后，原告申请撤诉的，不予准许。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E5%9B%A0%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原理：防止为私利牺牲公共利益，且一旦被告不履约，公共利益又将失去保护。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E4%B8%BA%E7%A7%81%E5%88%A9%E7%89%BA%E7%89%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A6%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E7%BA%A6%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E5%8F%88%E5%B0%86%E5%A4%B1%E5%8E%BB%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="8. 禁止反诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E8.%20%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="规则：公益诉讼中，被告提出反诉的，法院不予受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="原理：公益诉讼原告（如环保组织）本身与被告（如排污企业）无直接利害冲突，不存在被告反诉原告的利益基础。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%8E%AF%E4%BF%9D%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%EF%BC%89%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E4%B8%8E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%8E%92%E6%B1%A1%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%EF%BC%89%E6%97%A0%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="9. 与普通民事诉讼的关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E9.%20%E4%B8%8E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="规则：公益诉讼的受理与裁判，不影响同一侵权行为的受害人依法另行提起普通民事诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="原理：公益诉讼维护的是公共利益，普通诉讼维护的是私人利益，二者互不排斥，可并行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%EF%BC%8C%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E7%A7%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E8%80%85%E4%BA%92%E4%B8%8D%E6%8E%92%E6%96%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【案例】张三养的鱼死了" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%85%BB%E7%9A%84%E9%B1%BC%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="环保协会告某厂污染环境，已提起公益诉讼。下游养殖户张三因该污染行为养的鱼死了。 -张三应另行提起普通民事诉讼，要求赔偿。不能追加为公益诉讼当事人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%8E%AF%E4%BF%9D%E5%8D%8F%E4%BC%9A%E5%91%8A%E6%9F%90%E5%8E%82%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%B2%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8B%E6%B8%B8%E5%85%BB%E6%AE%96%E6%88%B7%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%9B%A0%E8%AF%A5%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%BB%E7%9A%84%E9%B1%BC%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%86%E3%80%82%20-%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、检察机关提起的公益诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 地位与角色" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="身份名称：公益诉讼起诉人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="实质地位：约等于原告。行使原告的诉讼权利，承担原告的诉讼义务，只是名字不同。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A6%E7%AD%89%E4%BA%8E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E5%90%8D%E5%AD%97%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 核心原则：补充性" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="含义：只有在没有法律规定的机关和组织，或者法律规定的机关和组织没有提起诉讼的情况下，检察院才可以提起诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AB%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E5%92%8C%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E5%92%8C%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="目的：防止破坏民事诉讼当事人平等对抗的结构。检察院作为公权力机关，若作为第一序位的起诉人，任何被告都无法与之抗衡。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E7%A0%B4%E5%9D%8F%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%B9%B3%E7%AD%89%E5%AF%B9%E6%8A%97%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E3%80%82%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%AC%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%8C%E8%8B%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%BA%8F%E4%BD%8D%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E9%83%BD%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E4%B9%8B%E6%8A%97%E8%A1%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 保证补充性的措施：诉前公告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="方式一：普通公益诉讼：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="检察院拟提起公益诉讼前，应当进行诉前公告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E6%8B%9F%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="目的：督促法律规定的机关和组织去起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E5%92%8C%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%8E%BB%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="结果：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="公告期满，有机关组织起诉 -检察院不再提起。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%E6%BB%A1%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%20-%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="公告期满，没有机关组织起诉 -检察院当仁不让地提起。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%E6%BB%A1%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%20-%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E5%BD%93%E4%BB%81%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A9%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="方式二：英雄烈士保护：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84%E7%83%88%E5%A3%AB%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="对于侵害英烈姓名、肖像、名誉、荣誉等损害公共利益的行为，检察院也可提起公益诉讼。保证补充性的方式有二：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%8E%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E8%8B%B1%E7%83%88%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D%E3%80%81%E8%82%96%E5%83%8F%E3%80%81%E5%90%8D%E8%AA%89%E3%80%81%E8%8D%A3%E8%AA%89%E7%AD%89%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="1. 诉前公告：公告期满，英烈近亲属没有提起诉讼的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%E6%BB%A1%EF%BC%8C%E8%8B%B1%E7%83%88%E8%BF%91%E4%BA%B2%E5%B1%9E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 直接征求：不经公告，直接征求英烈近亲属意见，他们明确表示不诉的，检察院也可以提。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%BE%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%BE%81%E6%B1%82%E8%8B%B1%E7%83%88%E8%BF%91%E4%BA%B2%E5%B1%9E%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%96%E4%BB%AC%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E4%B8%8D%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%8F%90%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 起诉主体与管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="起诉主体：市级人民检察院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B8%82%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="管辖法院：由侵权行为地或被告住所地的 中级法院管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 二审程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="启动二审的方式：上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="理由：不服一审判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="与刑事对比：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="普通刑诉（抗诉）：体现监督者地位，理由是“认为判决确有错误”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%88%91%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E8%80%85%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%8C%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%A1%AE%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="公益民诉（上诉）：体现当事人地位，理由是“不服”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%8C%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="出庭人员：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%87%BA%E5%BA%AD%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：由提起公益诉讼的检察院派员出席二审法庭（因为其只是作为一方当事人阐述主张，无监督法院的职责）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B4%BE%E5%91%98%E5%87%BA%E5%B8%AD%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B6%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%98%90%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E8%81%8C%E8%B4%A3%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外：基于上下级的领导关系，上级检察院也可以派员指导、支援。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%86%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B4%BE%E5%91%98%E6%8C%87%E5%AF%BC%E3%80%81%E6%94%AF%E6%8F%B4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【真题案例】造纸厂污染环境公益诉讼二审" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E9%80%A0%E7%BA%B8%E5%8E%82%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="市检察院诉某造纸厂环境污染公益诉讼，一审判决造纸厂赔偿，造纸厂不服上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B8%82%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E8%AF%89%E6%9F%90%E9%80%A0%E7%BA%B8%E5%8E%82%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%B1%A1%E6%9F%93%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%80%A0%E7%BA%B8%E5%8E%82%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%A0%E7%BA%B8%E5%8E%82%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  关于出席二审：应由提起公益诉讼的市检察院派员出席。A项说“应当由上级检察院派员”是错误的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E5%87%BA%E5%B8%AD%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BA%94%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%82%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B4%BE%E5%91%98%E5%87%BA%E5%B8%AD%E3%80%82A%E9%A1%B9%E8%AF%B4%E2%80%9C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E6%B4%BE%E5%91%98%E2%80%9D%E6%98%AF%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  关于答辩状：检察院作为原告方，不提交答辩状是放弃权利，不影响二审审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E6%98%AF%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  关于合议庭：本案是二审，不能由人民陪审员参加合议庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  关于审理方式：二审可以不开庭审理。（如果符合条件）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题19 第三人撤销之诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9819%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、基本概念与性质" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E4%B8%8E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="定义：本应作为有独三或无独三的人，因不能归责于本人的事由未参加诉讼，但有证据证明生效的判决、裁定、调解书侵犯其合法权益的，可在知道或应当知道权利受损之日起 6个月 内，向 作出该生效裁判的法院 提起诉讼，请求撤销或改变原生效裁判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AC%E5%BA%94%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%88%96%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%BD%92%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8E%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%BE%B5%E7%8A%AF%E5%85%B6%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%88%96%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E5%8F%97%E6%8D%9F%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E6%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%86%85%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%AF%A5%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%88%96%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="诉的性质：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="是一个 新的诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="属于 形成之诉（变更之诉），旨在撤销或改变已生效的法律文书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A8%E5%9C%A8%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%88%96%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E5%B7%B2%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="审理程序：适用 一审普通程序 审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="所作判决为 一审判决，当事人不服可以 上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%80%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="管辖法院：由 作出该生效裁判的法院 管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%AF%A5%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、起诉与受理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 起诉条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原告是原本应参加诉讼的有独三或无独三。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%98%AF%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%AC%E5%BA%94%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%88%96%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="因不能归责于本人的事由未参加诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%BD%92%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%8E%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="有证据证明生效裁判内容错误，损害其民事权益。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%8C%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="自知道或应当知道权益受损之日起6个月内起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%87%AA%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%88%96%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E5%8F%97%E6%8D%9F%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B76%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E5%86%85%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 不予受理的情形" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="对下列情形提起第三人撤销之诉的，法院 不予受理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="1. 适用非讼程序处理的案件：特别程序、督促程序、公示催告程序、破产程序等。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9A%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%AD%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原理：非讼程序无民事权益纠纷，而三撤和再审本质上是 解决纠纷的诉讼程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%97%A0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E5%92%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E4%B8%8A%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 涉及 身份关系 的内容：婚姻无效、撤销婚姻、解除婚姻关系的判决、裁定、调解书中，涉及身份关系的部分。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%81%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E3%80%81%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="目的：保护原审当事人的 再婚权利，避免因撤销或再审导致重婚。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%A9%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E5%9B%A0%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%88%96%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E9%87%8D%E5%A9%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="注意：离婚判决中的财产分割、子女抚养问题与再婚无关，可以提三撤或再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E3%80%81%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E4%B8%8E%E5%86%8D%E5%A9%9A%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%8F%90%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E6%88%96%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 人数不确定的代表人诉讼中，未参加登记的权利人对生效裁判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8D%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原因：可以 另行起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 公益诉讼中，损害社会公共利益行为的受害人对生效裁判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原因：可以 另行起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【真题案例】代表人诉讼中的再次起诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="工厂排污，法院公告后有70名居民登记并推选代表人诉讼，判赔每人5万。未登记的刘某事后才知晓，认为自己应获赔10万，遂提起三撤。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E6%8E%92%E6%B1%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E5%90%8E%E6%9C%8970%E5%90%8D%E5%B1%85%E6%B0%91%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E5%B9%B6%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%89%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E8%B5%94%E6%AF%8F%E4%BA%BA5%E4%B8%87%E3%80%82%E6%9C%AA%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E4%BA%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%89%8D%E7%9F%A5%E6%99%93%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%BA%94%E8%8E%B7%E8%B5%9410%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%82%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- 法院处理：不予受理。因刘某是人数不确定的代表人诉讼中未登记的权利人，其救济途径是 另行起诉，不能提三撤。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8D%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%AA%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、诉讼程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 开庭与组织" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E4%B8%8E%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="必须组成合议庭 开庭审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="不能适用独任制。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 当事人的诉讼地位" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心分析方法：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 原告：谁起诉，谁做原告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%81%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E5%81%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 被告：原告的诉讼请求 直接涉及 其权利义务的人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%85%B6%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 第三人：原告的诉讼请求 未直接涉及，只是间接可能有影响的人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="具体定位：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="起诉第三人：原告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="原审的原告、被告、有独三：一律为 被告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E3%80%81%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="原审的无独三：分情况讨论。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="承担责任的无独三：判决结果直接涉及其义务，列为 被告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%B6%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="不承担责任的无独三：判决结果对其无直接影响，仍列为 第三人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E6%97%A0%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8D%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="【案例群】当事人地位判断" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E7%BE%A4%E3%80%91%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案例一（基本模型）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%88%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="庄某（原审原告）告乙超市（原审被告）违约，法院判乙超市赔偿。案外人丙厂家（面包生产商）认为判决影响自己，提三撤。乙超市同意丙厂家主张。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BA%84%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%E5%91%8A%E4%B9%99%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E4%B9%99%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%99%E5%8E%82%E5%AE%B6%EF%BC%88%E9%9D%A2%E5%8C%85%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E5%95%86%EF%BC%89%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E3%80%82%E4%B9%99%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E4%B8%99%E5%8E%82%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="- 当事人地位：丙厂家是 原告；原审原告庄某和原审被告乙超市，无论立场如何，都是 被告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%99%E5%8E%82%E5%AE%B6%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%BA%84%E6%9F%90%E5%92%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B9%99%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E8%AE%BA%E7%AB%8B%E5%9C%BA%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案例二（不承担责任的无独三）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="甲（原告）对丙（被告）提代位权诉讼，法院追加乙为第三人（无独三）。诉讼中，甲、丙调解，约定丙将手链交付给甲。丁主张手链是自己的，提三撤。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%99%EF%BC%88%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%E6%8F%90%E4%BB%A3%E4%BD%8D%E6%9D%83%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%BA%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E3%80%81%E4%B8%99%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%99%E5%B0%86%E6%89%8B%E9%93%BE%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E7%BB%99%E7%94%B2%E3%80%82%E4%B8%81%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%89%8B%E9%93%BE%E6%98%AF%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="- 分析：原调解书是“丙将手链给甲”，乙未承担任何责任。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%B0%86%E6%89%8B%E9%93%BE%E7%BB%99%E7%94%B2%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E6%9C%AA%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="- 当事人地位：丁是原告，甲、丙是被告，乙是 第三人（不承担责任的无独三）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%81%E6%98%AF%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E3%80%81%E4%B8%99%E6%98%AF%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案例三（承担责任的无独三）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%88%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案情同上，但原调解书变为约定“乙将手链交付给甲”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E6%83%85%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%8E%9F%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E5%8F%98%E4%B8%BA%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%B0%86%E6%89%8B%E9%93%BE%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E7%BB%99%E7%94%B2%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="- 分析：原调解书中，乙承担了交付手链的义务。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%99%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%BA%86%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E6%89%8B%E9%93%BE%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="- 当事人地位：丁是原告，甲、丙、乙（因承担责任）均为 被告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%81%E6%98%AF%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E3%80%81%E4%B8%99%E3%80%81%E4%B9%99%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%E5%9D%87%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 中止执行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="背景：三撤审理中，原判决已生效并可能进入执行，原告担心造成难以弥补的损害。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%B7%B2%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%8B%85%E5%BF%83%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E9%9A%BE%E4%BB%A5%E5%BC%A5%E8%A1%A5%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="想要中止执行，有两条路可走（二选一）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%B3%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%A4%E6%9D%A1%E8%B7%AF%E5%8F%AF%E8%B5%B0%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%E9%80%89%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 讲道理：以 案外人 身份，向执行法院提出 对执行标的的异议。法院审查异议成立的，裁定中止执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%B2%E9%81%93%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 给钱：提供 担保。法院审查担保符合条件的，裁定中止执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%99%E9%92%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="不能既不讲道理，又不给钱。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%97%A2%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%B2%E9%81%93%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%88%E4%B8%8D%E7%BB%99%E9%92%B1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 判决的结果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原告的请求结构（递进）：①请求撤销错误的原判；②请求确认自己权利并改判给自己。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%EF%BC%88%E9%80%92%E8%BF%9B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E2%91%A0%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%9B%E2%91%A1%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E5%B9%B6%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%99%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="法院的三种处理方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 请求成立 + 权利主张成立：改判。撤销原判错误部分，并将权利改判给起诉的第三人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%20+%20%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E5%B0%86%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%99%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 请求成立 + 权利主张不成立：撤销。只撤销原判的错误部分，不对第三人的权利作出改判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%20+%20%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%8F%AA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AF%B9%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 请求不成立：驳回。判决驳回第三人的全部诉讼请求。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【真题案例】证据伪造，但无法证明侵权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BC%AA%E9%80%A0%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="甲、乙商铺所有权纠纷，判决生效。丙公司提三撤，法院审理查明“原判决中原告提供的证据是伪造的”（原判错了），但“丙公司无法证明原判决侵犯自身合法权益”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E3%80%81%E4%B9%99%E5%95%86%E9%93%BA%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%E4%B8%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8F%90%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%9F%A5%E6%98%8E%E2%80%9C%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%AD%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%98%AF%E4%BC%AA%E9%80%A0%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E9%94%99%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%BE%B5%E7%8A%AF%E8%87%AA%E8%BA%AB%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- 判决：法院应依法 撤销原判决的错误部分。不能改判，也不能直接驳回。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="对第三人撤销之诉的一审判决不服，当事人可以 上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、第三人撤销之诉与再审的关系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 关系总则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%80%BB%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="目的相同：都是为了推翻一份生效裁判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%BD%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="适用原则：二者只能 择一进行。有三撤没再审，有再审没三撤。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8C%E8%80%85%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%A9%E4%B8%80%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E6%B2%A1%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%B2%A1%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 不同主体的路径选择" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心判断方法：你本应在原审中扮演什么角色？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%AC%E5%BA%94%E5%9C%A8%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%AE%E6%BC%94%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="路径分流：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E5%88%86%E6%B5%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="参加过原审的人（原审当事人）：只能申请 再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%BF%87%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="未参加原审的人：假设其参加原审，本应作为：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE%E5%85%B6%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AC%E5%BA%94%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="共同原告/共同被告 -申请 再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A/%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20-%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="有独三/无独三 -提起 第三人撤销之诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89/%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20-%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="【经典遗产案例】不同角色的路径选择" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="张老头去世，张甲（原告）诉张乙（被告）法定继承，法院将遗产（房子归张甲，现金古玩归张乙）分割完毕，判决生效。以下四人欲推翻原判：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%B4%E5%8E%BB%E4%B8%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%89%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%EF%BC%88%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B0%86%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%88%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%BD%92%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%EF%BC%8C%E7%8E%B0%E9%87%91%E5%8F%A4%E7%8E%A9%E5%BD%92%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%EF%BC%89%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E5%AE%8C%E6%AF%95%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E5%9B%9B%E4%BA%BA%E6%AC%B2%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="1.  张乙（原审被告）：参加过原审。-只能申请再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%BF%87%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2.  张丙（张老头的另一个儿子，法定继承人）：未参加原审。若参加，基于法定继承主张权利，应作为 共同原告。-申请再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%84%BF%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%EF%BC%8C%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="3.  王丁（张老头私生子，持遗嘱主张房子归自己）：未参加原审。若参加，基于遗嘱继承主张权利，与原审法定继承法律关系不同，应作为 有独三。-提起三撤。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8E%8B%E4%B8%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%A4%B4%E7%A7%81%E7%94%9F%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%81%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%BD%92%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%EF%BC%8C%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="4.  王叔叔（邻居，主张被分给张乙的字画是自己的）：未参加原审。若参加，基于所有权主张权利，与原审继承关系不同，应作为 有独三。-提起三撤。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8E%8B%E5%8F%94%E5%8F%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E9%82%BB%E5%B1%85%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E8%A2%AB%E5%88%86%E7%BB%99%E5%BC%A0%E4%B9%99%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%97%E7%94%BB%E6%98%AF%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%EF%BC%8C%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. “遭遇战”：三撤与再审相遇时的处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E2%80%9C%E9%81%AD%E9%81%87%E6%88%98%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E4%B8%8E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87%E6%97%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="相遇情景：在第三人撤销之诉审理过程中，法院又裁定对原案进行再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87%E6%83%85%E6%99%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%88%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%AF%B9%E5%8E%9F%E6%A1%88%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="处理原则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：再审优先。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="理由：启动再审意味着案件重新审理，对起诉的第三人而言，是重获机会在原审中以有独三/无独三身份参加诉讼的最佳时机。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%84%8F%E5%91%B3%E7%9D%80%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E8%80%8C%E8%A8%80%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E9%87%8D%E8%8E%B7%E6%9C%BA%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89/%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3%E6%97%B6%E6%9C%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="操作：将第三人的诉讼请求 并入再审程序 一并审理，并终结三撤程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B9%B6%E5%85%A5%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="注意：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="并入适用一审的再审：并进去一审判，没问题。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B9%B6%E5%85%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B9%B6%E8%BF%9B%E5%8E%BB%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="并入适用二审的再审：为保护第三人的上诉权，只能 调解。调解不成，撤销原判，发回重审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B9%B6%E5%85%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="例外：三撤优先。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="情形：有证据证明，原审当事人恶意串通，通过诉讼方式损害第三人合法权益的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%81%B6%E6%84%8F%E4%B8%B2%E9%80%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="理由：原审当事人之间根本无真实纠纷，再审（在他们之间解决）已无意义，应直接在处理他们与第三人之间纠纷的三撤程序中解决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E6%A0%B9%E6%9C%AC%E6%97%A0%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%88%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%96%E4%BB%AC%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%89%E5%B7%B2%E6%97%A0%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E4%BB%96%E4%BB%AC%E4%B8%8E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="操作：先行审理第三人撤销之诉，并裁定 中止再审程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%88%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题22 第二审程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9822%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、二审的启动：上诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 上诉的主体" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则：案件的当事人有权上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="具体有上诉权的人：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原告、被告、有独三：均有上诉权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E3%80%81%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9D%87%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="无独三：分情况讨论。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="一审判决承担责任的无独三：有权上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="一审判决不承担责任的无独三：不能上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="委托代理人：分授权情况讨论。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="特别授权：可以代为上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="一般授权：不能代为上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%A3%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 上诉的实质要求（不需要理由）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="只要当事人 “不服” 一审未生效的判决或三类裁定，即可上诉，无需法定理由。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%9C%AA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%88%96%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 上诉的对象" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="一审判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="三类裁定：不予受理、驳回起诉、管辖权异议裁定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%81%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【系统总结】一审终审的5种情形" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E3%80%91%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%845%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="1.  最高法院的判决、裁定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2.  调解书（签收生效）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%B6%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3.  一般的裁定书（三类可上诉的裁定除外）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4.  非讼程序的裁判：特别程序、督促程序、公示催告程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%9A%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="5.  小额诉讼的实体判决、驳回起诉裁定、管辖权异议裁定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 上诉的形式要求" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="必须提交 书面上诉状。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="口头上诉无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A3%E5%A4%B4%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 上诉的提交与案卷移送" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E5%8D%B7%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="递交对象：上诉状是写给 二审法院 的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%92%E4%BA%A4%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E6%98%AF%E5%86%99%E7%BB%99%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="递交方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%92%E4%BA%A4%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="通过一审法院转交：一审法院不审查，直接将副本给被上诉人，再将全部材料移送二审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%BD%AC%E4%BA%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%B0%86%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%E7%BB%99%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%B0%86%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="直接向二审法院递交：二审法院也不审查，会转给一审法院走完上述移送程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%90%91%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%92%E4%BA%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E4%BC%9A%E8%BD%AC%E7%BB%99%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B0%E5%AE%8C%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="核心考点：一审法院对上诉是否成立 没有审查权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="一审法院的职责：只负责收材料、送达副本、整理移送，不审查上诉是否超期等实体问题。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E8%81%8C%E8%B4%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%B4%9F%E8%B4%A3%E6%94%B6%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E3%80%81%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%E3%80%81%E6%95%B4%E7%90%86%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E8%B6%85%E6%9C%9F%E7%AD%89%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="二审法院的职责：审查上诉是否符合条件，决定是否立案。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E8%81%8C%E8%B4%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【真题案例】超期上诉的处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E8%B6%85%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="景宏公司一审败诉，通过一审法院提交上诉状。一审法院发现其上诉已超期。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%99%AF%E5%AE%8F%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E8%B4%A5%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E3%80%82%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E5%B7%B2%E8%B6%85%E6%9C%9F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  处理：一审法院无权审查，应直接将全部材料 一并移送 给上级法院，由二审法院决定。不能不予接收、不能提醒上级法院、更不能自己裁定驳回。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%B0%86%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%BB%99%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E9%86%92%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E3%80%81%E6%9B%B4%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="6. 二审当事人的诉讼地位" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="确定原则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="上诉人：谁上诉，谁就是上诉人。双方都上诉的，都是上诉人，没有被上诉人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%81%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="被上诉人：对谁提，谁就是被上诉人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E8%B0%81%E6%8F%90%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="复杂情形（技术流解法）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%B5%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 画出一审判决的主文（各项权利义务）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%BB%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E6%96%87%EF%BC%88%E5%90%84%E9%A1%B9%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 画出上诉人的上诉请求。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%BB%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 假设上诉人的上诉请求 完全成立，二审直接按其请求改判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8C%89%E5%85%B6%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 对比改判结果与一审判决，谁的利益受损（有损失），谁就是被上诉人；谁的利益没变化（没损失），就按 原审地位列明（原审原告/被告/第三人）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%81%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E5%8F%97%E6%8D%9F%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%E8%B0%81%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E6%B2%A1%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%88%E6%B2%A1%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%8C%89%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%E5%88%97%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A/%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="【案例群】被上诉人判断" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E7%BE%A4%E3%80%91%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案例一（简单模型）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%88%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="一审：丁告甲乙丙，判甲乙丙连带赔3万（甲2万，乙8千，丙2千）。甲上诉，认为丙赔太少。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%81%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B2%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E7%94%B2%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%99%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E8%B5%943%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B22%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%998%E5%8D%83%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%992%E5%8D%83%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%99%E8%B5%94%E5%A4%AA%E5%B0%91%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="- 分析：假设甲上诉成功，增加丙的赔偿额。-丙利益受损，是 被上诉人；与乙、丁无关，乙是 原审被告，丁是 原审原告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%EF%BC%8C%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E4%B8%99%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E9%A2%9D%E3%80%82-%E4%B8%99%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E5%8F%97%E6%8D%9F%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%E4%B8%8E%E4%B9%99%E3%80%81%E4%B8%81%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%81%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="案例二（中等难度）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%AD%E7%AD%89%E9%9A%BE%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="一审：乙、丙告甲、报社侵权。判：甲赔1万并道歉，报社赔3万并道歉。报社上诉，请求改判：各赔2万，由甲单独道歉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%99%E3%80%81%E4%B8%99%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B2%E3%80%81%E6%8A%A5%E7%A4%BE%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E8%B5%941%E4%B8%87%E5%B9%B6%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%8A%A5%E7%A4%BE%E8%B5%943%E4%B8%87%E5%B9%B6%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89%E3%80%82%E6%8A%A5%E7%A4%BE%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%84%E8%B5%942%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B2%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="- 分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="  1. 赔钱：甲从1万变2万（有损失，被上诉人）；乙、丙总赔偿都是4万（没损失，按原审）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%201.%20%E8%B5%94%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E4%BB%8E1%E4%B8%87%E5%8F%982%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9B%E4%B9%99%E3%80%81%E4%B8%99%E6%80%BB%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF4%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%88%E6%B2%A1%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="  2. 道歉：乙、丙从拿到2份道歉变1份（有损失，被上诉人）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%202.%20%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%99%E3%80%81%E4%B8%99%E4%BB%8E%E6%8B%BF%E5%88%B02%E4%BB%BD%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89%E5%8F%981%E4%BB%BD%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="  综合：报社是上诉人，甲、乙、丙均为 被上诉人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%E7%BB%BC%E5%90%88%EF%BC%9A%E6%8A%A5%E7%A4%BE%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E3%80%81%E4%B9%99%E3%80%81%E4%B8%99%E5%9D%87%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="案例三（高难度，干扰信息）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%98%E9%9A%BE%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="案由：代位权诉讼。原告甲（债权10万），被告丙（次债务人，欠乙15万），乙（无独三）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A3%E4%BD%8D%E6%9D%83%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E7%94%B2%EF%BC%88%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%8310%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%99%EF%BC%88%E6%AC%A1%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%AC%A0%E4%B9%9915%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="一审判：丙向甲支付10万。乙、丙均上诉。丙上诉请求：判甲对乙的债权不成立。乙上诉请求：判丙还我剩余的5万。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%99%E5%90%91%E7%94%B2%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%9810%E4%B8%87%E3%80%82%E4%B9%99%E3%80%81%E4%B8%99%E5%9D%87%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E4%B8%99%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E7%94%B2%E5%AF%B9%E4%B9%99%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%82%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E4%B8%99%E8%BF%98%E6%88%91%E5%89%A9%E4%BD%99%E7%9A%845%E4%B8%87%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="- 分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="  1. 乙能否上诉？ 一审判决“丙向甲付10万”，乙未承担责任。-不承担责任的 无独三不能上诉。“乙上诉”是干扰信息，忽略。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%201.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%99%E8%83%BD%E5%90%A6%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%99%E5%90%91%E7%94%B2%E4%BB%9810%E4%B8%87%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E6%9C%AA%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E3%80%82-%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E2%80%9C%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E2%80%9D%E6%98%AF%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%BD%E7%95%A5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="  2. 丙上诉后，分析被上诉人：假设丙上诉成功，法院判“甲对乙债权不成立”。-甲的债权没了，有损失，是 被上诉人；乙的债务没了，没损失，按 原审无独三 列明。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%202.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%99%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE%E4%B8%99%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B2%E5%AF%B9%E4%B9%99%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82-%E7%94%B2%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E6%B2%A1%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%E4%B9%99%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E6%B2%A1%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%88%97%E6%98%8E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="  结论：丙是上诉人，甲是被上诉人，乙是原审无独三。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%99%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E6%98%AF%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E6%98%AF%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、二审的审理程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 审判组织" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="合议制为原则：由审判员组成合议庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="独任制为例外（同时满足4条件）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E4%B8%BA%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%88%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B34%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 法院级别：中级法院的二审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 案件来源：一审是 简易程序，或对 一审裁定 上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E5%AF%B9%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 案件情况：事实清楚、权利义务关系明确。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%E3%80%81%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 当事人意愿：双方当事人同意。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%84%8F%E6%84%BF%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 审理范围" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="限制一：处分原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：仅限上诉请求范围。未上诉的，说明服判，不审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E9%99%90%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%9C%AA%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E6%9C%8D%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外：一审判决违反法律禁止性规定、损害 国家、社会、第三人利益 的，二审法院应 依职权改判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E3%80%81%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【案例】房屋质量问题" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="朱某告立盛公司，要求赔违约金5万、修缮房屋。一审全支持。立盛公司仅就 违约金 上诉。二审发现房屋质量问题认定证据不足，但双方均未上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%B1%E6%9F%90%E5%91%8A%E7%AB%8B%E7%9B%9B%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%B5%94%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%915%E4%B8%87%E3%80%81%E4%BF%AE%E7%BC%AE%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E3%80%82%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%85%A8%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E3%80%82%E7%AB%8B%E7%9B%9B%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%BB%85%E5%B0%B1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%9D%87%E6%9C%AA%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- 结论：二审 只审违约金，对房屋修缮问题不审不改。此为民诉（处分原则）与刑诉（全面审查）的显著区别。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E5%AE%A1%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E9%87%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E4%BF%AE%E7%BC%AE%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%B9%E3%80%82%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%91%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%EF%BC%89%E7%9A%84%E6%98%BE%E8%91%97%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="限制二：两审终审制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%A4%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：二审只能审 一审已处理过 的问题。否则直接判，就是对该问题一审终审，剥夺上诉权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%A1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%B7%B2%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E8%BF%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%A5%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%89%A5%E5%A4%BA%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="核心处理逻辑：一审没处理的问题，二审只能“调”，不能直接“判”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B2%A1%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E2%80%9C%E8%B0%83%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E2%80%9C%E5%88%A4%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="四种情形处理方式（只准调，不准判）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%9B%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AA%E5%87%86%E8%B0%83%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%86%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 一审遗漏诉讼请求：调解不成，发回重审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E9%81%97%E6%BC%8F%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="原因：一审法院 有错（审漏了）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%A1%E6%BC%8F%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="2. 一审遗漏必须参加诉讼的当事人/有独三：调解不成，发回重审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E9%81%97%E6%BC%8F%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA/%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="原因：一审法院 有错（人漏了）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%BA%E6%BC%8F%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="3. 一审判不离，二审认为应离，涉及财产/子女：调解不成，发回重审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%B8%8D%E7%A6%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%BA%94%E7%A6%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7/%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="原因：一审法院 有错（该离没判离）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%A5%E7%A6%BB%E6%B2%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%A6%BB%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="4. 二审中，原告新增诉讼请求，或被告提出反诉：调解不成，告知另行起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="原因：一审法院 没错（是新产生的请求）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E9%94%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%98%AF%E6%96%B0%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="特殊同意：对于情形3和4，如果 当事人同意 由二审法院一并审理并判决的，二审法院 可以一并裁判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%8E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A23%E5%92%8C4%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【真题案例】遗漏诉请与新增诉请交织" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E9%81%97%E6%BC%8F%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8E%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="齐远告张红离婚案，一审诉请：解除婚姻、子女抚养、住房分割。一审只判了离婚和子女抚养，漏了住房。齐远上诉。二审中，张红新增诉请，要求分割齐远继承的遗产。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%BD%90%E8%BF%9C%E5%91%8A%E5%BC%A0%E7%BA%A2%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E3%80%81%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E3%80%81%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%BF%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E3%80%82%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%8F%AA%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%86%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E5%92%8C%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%BC%8F%E4%BA%86%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%BF%E3%80%82%E9%BD%90%E8%BF%9C%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E7%BA%A2%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E9%BD%90%E8%BF%9C%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E7%9A%84%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- 分析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  1. 住房分割（一审遗漏）：有错，调解不成应 发回重审。当事人同意也不能一并判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%201.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%BF%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E9%81%97%E6%BC%8F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E5%BA%94%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  2. 遗产分割（二审新增）：没错，调解不成 告知另行起诉。若当事人同意，二审 可一并判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%202.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B2%A1%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 审理形式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则：开庭审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="例外：可以不开庭审理（书面审理/径行判决）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86/%E5%BE%84%E8%A1%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="条件：经过阅卷、调查、询问当事人，没有提出新的事实、证据或理由，法院认为 不需要 开庭的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E9%98%85%E5%8D%B7%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%81%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%88%96%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【审理形式对比】" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  一审：必须开庭（无论普通、简易、小额）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E8%AE%BA%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E3%80%81%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E3%80%81%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  二审：原则上开庭，例外可不开庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8A%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%8D%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、二审的结案方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%A1%88%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 裁判（作出二审判决/裁定）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%88%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3/%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="四种裁判方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%9B%E7%A7%8D%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 维持原判：原判认定事实清楚，适用法律正确。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="用 判决/裁定 驳回上诉，维持原判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%A8%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3/%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 依法改判/撤销/变更：原判 认定事实错误 或 适用法律错误。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4/%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80/%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E6%88%96%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="核心逻辑：“有错就改”。因二审法院心中已有“正确答案”，直接改即可，不能发回。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%E5%B0%B1%E6%94%B9%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%83%E4%B8%AD%E5%B7%B2%E6%9C%89%E2%80%9C%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B9%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 可选：改判或发回重审：原判 认定基本事实不清。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4%E6%88%96%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B8%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="二审法院有选择权。认为自己能查清的，就 改判；认为一审更利于查清的，就 发回重审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9C%89%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E8%83%BD%E6%9F%A5%E6%B8%85%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%9B%B4%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%8E%E6%9F%A5%E6%B8%85%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="4. 只能发回重审：原判 严重违反法定程序（如剥夺辩论权、应回避未回避等）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%A5%E9%87%8D%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%89%A5%E5%A4%BA%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E6%9D%83%E3%80%81%E5%BA%94%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E6%9C%AA%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="核心逻辑：案件必须经历两次公正合法审理。一审程序违法，等于只审了一次，必须发回重审凑足两次，维护两审终审制。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%E5%8E%86%E4%B8%A4%E6%AC%A1%E5%85%AC%E6%AD%A3%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E4%BA%8E%E5%8F%AA%E5%AE%A1%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%87%91%E8%B6%B3%E4%B8%A4%E6%AC%A1%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E4%B8%A4%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="关于“发回重审”的细则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E2%80%9C%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%86%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="重审法院组织：一审法院必须 按一审程序另行组成合议庭。-不能独任制、原审人员回避、可有人民陪审员。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%89%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82-%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E3%80%81%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E3%80%81%E5%8F%AF%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="重审判决性质：所作判决为 一审判决，可 再上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%80%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="重审中诉的变更：原告可增加/变更诉请，被告可提反诉，有独三可参加。因重审是一审，一并审理不损害上诉权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%AF%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0/%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%8F%AF%E6%8F%90%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8D%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="原审诉讼行为效力：撤销原判，不撤销当事人的诉讼行为。原来做的自认、放弃管辖异议等，在重审中 依然有效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%8E%9F%E6%9D%A5%E5%81%9A%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E3%80%81%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%9D%E7%84%B6%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="重审判决形式：不能写“维持原判”，必须用 新判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%99%E2%80%9C%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%94%A8%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="发回重审的次数：只准发一次。再次上诉的，二审法院必须依法判决，不能再发回。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%AC%A1%E6%95%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E5%87%86%E5%8F%91%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="几种特殊裁判：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%87%A0%E7%A7%8D%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="案件不符起诉条件：二审发现根本不该受理，裁定撤销原判，驳回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E6%A0%B9%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%8D%E8%AF%A5%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="对“不予受理”裁定上诉后：二审认为一审判错，撤销原裁定，指令一审法院 立案受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E2%80%9D%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%87%E4%BB%A4%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="对“驳回起诉”裁定上诉后：二审认为一审判错，撤销原裁定，指令一审法院 继续审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E2%80%9C%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E2%80%9D%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%87%E4%BB%A4%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 调解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="达成调解协议后：必须 制作调解书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原因：二审调解书送达后，会 视为原一审判决被撤销，有特殊功能。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BC%9A%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E8%A2%AB%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="与一审调解区别：一审调解有四种情况可以不制作调解书，二审 必须制作。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E6%9C%89%E5%9B%9B%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 撤回上诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="性质：上诉人处分自己的上诉权，意味着 服判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%91%B3%E7%9D%80%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%8D%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="效果：法院裁定准予撤回上诉后，一审判决立即生效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%86%E4%BA%88%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【案例】撤上诉后不履行和解协议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E6%92%A4%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="张三一审获赔5000元，不服上诉。二审中双方和解，对方同意赔80万。张三遂撤回上诉。后对方反悔，不履行80万和解协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E8%8E%B7%E8%B5%945000%E5%85%83%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E8%B5%9480%E4%B8%87%E3%80%82%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E9%81%82%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E5%90%8E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C80%E4%B8%87%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="- 分析：撤回上诉的效果是 一审判决生效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="- 张三的救济：只能 申请执行一审生效判决（5000元）。不能执行和解协议，不能重新起诉（一事不再理），不能重新上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%885000%E5%85%83%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E7%90%86%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 撤回起诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="性质：原告处分自己的起诉权，意味着 整个诉讼都不搞了。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%91%B3%E7%9D%80%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%90%9E%E4%BA%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="效果：没有起诉就没有审判。二审法院裁定准予撤回起诉时，应 一并裁定撤销原一审判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%B0%B1%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%86%E4%BA%88%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="限制：二审或再审中撤回起诉后，不得再次起诉。（一审撤诉后可再起诉）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%88%96%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%AF%E5%86%8D%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【真题案例】和解后申请撤回起诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%90%8E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="二审期间，甲乙达成和解协议，向二审法院申请撤回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B2%E4%B9%99%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="- 处理：准予其撤回起诉，并 一并裁定撤销原一审判决。题干中“协议内容与一审认定事实不一致”是干扰信息。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%87%86%E4%BA%88%E5%85%B6%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E9%A2%98%E5%B9%B2%E4%B8%AD%E2%80%9C%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E2%80%9D%E6%98%AF%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题21 审判监督程序（再审程序）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9821%20%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、再审程序总论：两个独立阶段" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%BB%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="核心方法：把再审程序拆解为两个独立的、先后衔接的程序来理解，避免混淆。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8A%8A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%8B%86%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E3%80%81%E5%85%88%E5%90%8E%E8%A1%94%E6%8E%A5%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%9D%A5%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E6%B7%B7%E6%B7%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="1. 再审的启动程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="解决的问题：原生效裁判 是否可能确有错误？是否需要重新审理？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E7%A1%AE%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9F%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="标志性文书：法院认为符合条件的，作出 裁定再审 的裁定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97%E6%80%A7%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 再审的重新审理程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="解决的问题：对案件进行实质性的重新审理，作出新的判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="适用程序：适用原来的一审或二审程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%8E%9F%E6%9D%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%88%96%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="标志性文书：作出 新的判决，在判决中明确是否撤销、改变或维持原判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97%E6%80%A7%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%AD%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E3%80%81%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E6%88%96%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、再审的对象" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="已生效 的判决书、裁定书、调解书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B7%B2%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="判决书的两点特别注意：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%A4%E7%82%B9%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 非讼程序的判决（特别程序、督促程序、公示催告程序）不能申请再审。-原理：非讼程序无民事权益纠纷，而再审是解决纠纷的诉讼程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%88%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%97%A0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%98%AF%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 解除婚姻关系的判决/调解书，仅就身份关系部分不能申请再审。-目的：保护原审当事人的再婚权利。注意：离婚案中财产分割、子女抚养部分 可以 再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3/%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E5%B0%B1%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%86%8D%E5%A9%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%AD%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E3%80%81%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="裁定书：不予受理、驳回起诉 的裁定可以申请再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%81%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="调解书：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="当事人申请：理由只能是 “违反自愿原则”或“违反合法原则”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF%20%E2%80%9C%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E2%80%9D%E6%88%96%E2%80%9C%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="检察院监督：理由只能是 “损害国家利益或社会公共利益”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF%20%E2%80%9C%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E6%88%96%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、再审的诉的分类" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="形成之诉（变更之诉）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="理由：再审请求是撤销或变更原生效判决已确定的法律关系，而非直接要求对方给付或确认一个未定的关系。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%98%AF%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%88%96%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%B7%B2%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E9%9D%9E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E6%88%96%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%AA%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="【辨析案例】" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="欧某与汪某，原审终审判汪某赔6万。欧某申请再审，请求改判赔10万。-该请求旨在“改变”已生效判决所确立的6万元这一权利义务关系，故为 形成之诉。不能因为请求里有“给十万”就认为是给付之诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%AC%A7%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%8E%E6%B1%AA%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%B1%AA%E6%9F%90%E8%B5%946%E4%B8%87%E3%80%82%E6%AC%A7%E6%9F%90%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%94%B9%E5%88%A4%E8%B5%9410%E4%B8%87%E3%80%82-%E8%AF%A5%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%97%A8%E5%9C%A8%E2%80%9C%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E2%80%9D%E5%B7%B2%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%89%80%E7%A1%AE%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%846%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%80%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%95%85%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%89%E2%80%9C%E7%BB%99%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%87%E2%80%9D%E5%B0%B1%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、再审的启动程序（阶段一）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="核心：当事人只能申请，有权 决定 启动再审的主体只有 法院 和 检察院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%92%8C%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="1. 法院启动再审" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="本院启动：院长发现错误，提交 审判委员会 讨论决定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%99%A2%E9%95%BF%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="上级法院启动：上级法院有权提审或指令下级法院再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%E6%88%96%E6%8C%87%E4%BB%A4%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 检察院启动再审" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="启动方式与对象：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="抗诉：上级检察院对下级法院的生效裁判，向 同级 法院提出。（口诀：上抗下，抗诉书同级提）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%A3%E8%AF%80%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E6%8A%97%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%A6%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="检察建议：地方各级检察院对 同级 法院的生效裁判，向该同级法院提出。须报上级检察院备案。（口诀：同级提，报上备）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%B0%E6%96%B9%E5%90%84%E7%BA%A7%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E8%AF%A5%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A1%BB%E6%8A%A5%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E5%A4%87%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%A3%E8%AF%80%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%E6%8F%90%EF%BC%8C%E6%8A%A5%E4%B8%8A%E5%A4%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="效果：检察院的 抗诉，必然启动再审。接受抗诉的法院必须在收到抗诉书之日起 30日内作出再审裁定，没有审查权，不能说不。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E7%84%B6%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%9C%A8%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%A6%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E30%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%B4%E4%B8%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="代价比喻理解法：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%A3%E4%BB%B7%E6%AF%94%E5%96%BB%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="：“检察建议”好比挨打后让对方道个歉，但告诉了自己爸爸（备案），对方不道歉，爸爸（上级检察院）就去找他爸爸（上级法院）理论（抗诉）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E2%80%9D%E5%A5%BD%E6%AF%94%E6%8C%A8%E6%89%93%E5%90%8E%E8%AE%A9%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E9%81%93%E4%B8%AA%E6%AD%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BA%86%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%88%B8%E7%88%B8%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%87%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%8D%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%88%B8%E7%88%B8%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%E5%B0%B1%E5%8E%BB%E6%89%BE%E4%BB%96%E7%88%B8%E7%88%B8%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人向检察院申请监督（申请检察建议/抗诉）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%91%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE/%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="性质特征：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 断后性（前置条件）：必须先找法院。只有在以下三种情况后，才能找检察院：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%AD%E5%90%8E%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%88%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%85%88%E6%89%BE%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E3%80%82%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%89%BE%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="（1）法院 驳回 再审申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%881%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="（2）法院 逾期 未对再审申请作出裁定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E6%9C%AA%E5%AF%B9%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="（3）法院再审后作出的 新判决明显错误。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%883%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%90%8E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%98%8E%E6%98%BE%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="禁止：向法院申请再审的同时，又向检察院申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%88%E5%90%91%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="2. 终局性：检察院作出决定后，当事人 不得再次 向检察院申请，也不得据此再向法院申请再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%90%91%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E6%8D%AE%E6%AD%A4%E5%86%8D%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="总结：当事人推翻生效裁判有 2次 机会。先找（1）法院，不满意/无果后，再找（2）检察院，检察院的处理是最终局。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%9C%89%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E2%E6%AC%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E6%9C%BA%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%82%E5%85%88%E6%89%BE%EF%BC%881%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%BB%A1%E6%84%8F/%E6%97%A0%E6%9E%9C%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E6%89%BE%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 当事人向法院申请再审" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="理由：与检察院抗诉理由相同，共 13种，归纳为 四大类：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E13%E7%A7%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%92%E7%BA%B3%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%9B%E5%A4%A7%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 事实、证据错误。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 法律适用错误。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 程序错误。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 审判人员贪污受贿，徇私舞弊。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E8%B4%AA%E6%B1%A1%E5%8F%97%E8%B4%BF%EF%BC%8C%E5%BE%87%E7%A7%81%E8%88%9E%E5%BC%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="（调解书中请再审理由特殊，见上）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%81%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="管辖法院（向谁申请）:" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88%E5%90%91%E8%B0%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E:%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：向 上一级 法院申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外（可选择原审法院）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 一方当事人人数众多。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%97%E5%A4%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 双方当事人都是公民。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%85%AC%E6%B0%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="目的：方便当事人，将矛盾化解在基层。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E7%9F%9B%E7%9B%BE%E5%8C%96%E8%A7%A3%E5%9C%A8%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="冲突解决：一方找上级，一方找原审时，由 原审法院受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%89%BE%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%89%BE%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="申请期限：裁判生效之日起 6个月内。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E6%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="起算点例外（从知道或应当知道之日起算）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%E7%82%B9%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%8E%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%88%96%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 有 新证据 足以推翻原裁判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%9C%89%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E8%B6%B3%E4%BB%A5%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 原裁判证据是伪造的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%98%AF%E4%BC%AA%E9%80%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 据以作判的法律文书被撤销/变更。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8D%AE%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%A2%AB%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80/%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="4. 审判人员有贪污受贿等行为。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E6%9C%89%E8%B4%AA%E6%B1%A1%E5%8F%97%E8%B4%BF%E7%AD%89%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="申请效果：申请再审 不停止 原裁判的执行。-这还是当事人单方主张，法院未表态。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82-%E8%BF%99%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%95%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9C%AA%E8%A1%A8%E6%80%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="法院的审查程序：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="审查组织：由 审判员组成合议庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="审查对象：仅审查 当事人的再审事由是否成立，不进行实体审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="审查方式：可书面审查、调卷、询问当事人、组织听证。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E5%8D%B7%E3%80%81%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%90%AC%E8%AF%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="禁止事项（因不实体审理）：不开庭、不鉴定、不勘验。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E5%8B%98%E9%AA%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="最高法院特殊规则：若当事人 无正当理由不上诉，且二审未改变对其权利义务的判项，再申请再审，会以 “不具备再审利益” 为由驳回。-防止绕过常规的二审救济，将再审异化为第三审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%8B%A5%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%9C%AA%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%B7%E5%A4%87%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E3%80%82-%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%84%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%BC%82%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%BA%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="五、再审的重新审理程序（阶段二）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 审理法院（谁来审）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88%E8%B0%81%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="法院启动的：谁启动，谁审理（本院启动本院审，上级启动上级提审）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%81%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="检察院抗诉的：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E9%99%A2%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：由 接受抗诉的法院提审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外：因 事实、证据问题 抗诉的，可交下级法院再审，但 该下级法院再审过的除外（防止其屡教不改）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%A0%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E6%8A%97%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BA%A4%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%A5%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E8%BF%87%E7%9A%84%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E5%85%B6%E5%B1%A1%E6%95%99%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%B9%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="当事人申请的（最重点）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%80%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="规则推导（核心技巧）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E6%8E%A8%E5%AF%BC%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="假设：A市原审法院，B为上级法院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9AA%E5%B8%82%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8CB%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="指令规则：上级法院B只能指令它 指得动（其辖区内的下级）且 不低于原审法院级别 的法院再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%87%E4%BB%A4%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2B%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%8C%87%E4%BB%A4%E5%AE%83%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%87%E5%BE%97%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%85%B6%E8%BE%96%E5%8C%BA%E5%86%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8B%E7%BA%A7%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%94%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8E%E4%BA%8E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法条记忆核心：普通申请再审案（原基层审，向中院申请），必须由 中院提审，不能指回基层院。法条依据是“因当事人申请裁定再审的案件，由中级以上法院审理”。（这是整本讲义唯一一处需要你专门记“提审”二字的地方！）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%94%B1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%8C%87%E5%9B%9E%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E9%99%A2%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%A1%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E5%9B%A0%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E6%95%B4%E6%9C%AC%E8%AE%B2%E4%B9%89%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%84%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E4%BD%A0%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E8%AE%B0%E2%80%9C%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%E2%80%9D%E4%BA%8C%E5%AD%97%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="【真题陷阱】再审审理程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B1%E3%80%91%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="原审是A区法院（基层），当事人向甲市中级人民法院申请再审。-因当事人申请裁定再审的，必须由 中院审理（提审）。提审按 二审程序 审理，所作判决为终审判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E6%98%AFA%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%91%E7%94%B2%E5%B8%82%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82-%E5%9B%A0%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%94%B1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%E6%8C%89%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 中止执行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则：法院 决定再审后，应当 裁定中止 原裁判的执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="逻辑：此时法院已表态裁判“可能确有错误”，为避免造成难以弥补的损失，暂停执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B7%B2%E8%A1%A8%E6%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E2%80%9C%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E7%A1%AE%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E9%9A%BE%E4%BB%A5%E5%BC%A5%E8%A1%A5%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%E6%9A%82%E5%81%9C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="例外（可以不中止）：追索“三费”、抚恤金、医疗费、劳动报酬 等案件。（记忆重点：医疗费，常伪装在普通侵权案中考）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%89%E8%B4%B9%E2%80%9D%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E6%81%A4%E9%87%91%E3%80%81%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%A5%E9%85%AC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%AD%89%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E8%B4%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B8%B8%E4%BC%AA%E8%A3%85%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%AD%E8%80%83%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 审理程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="再审无独立程序，适用原来的一审或二审程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%8E%9F%E6%9D%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%88%96%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="确定规则（两个步骤）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 先看“是否提审”：只要现在是 上级法院提审，一律适用 二审程序，判决为终审判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%88%E7%9C%8B%E2%80%9C%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E7%8E%B0%E5%9C%A8%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 再看“原审级别”：没提审的，原来是一审的，按一审程序；原来是二审的，按二审程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E7%9C%8B%E2%80%9C%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B2%A1%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E6%9D%A5%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%9B%E5%8E%9F%E6%9D%A5%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="审判组织：再审必须 另行组成合议庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 再审的范围" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则（再审范围有限）：以 原审范围为限，当事人超出原审范围 增加/变更诉讼请求、提出反诉 的，不属于再审范围，不予审理。不调解，直接告知另诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E4%B8%BA%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%B6%85%E5%87%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0/%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E3%80%81%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8D%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%8F%A6%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="例外（允许增加/变更/反诉）：再审中，案件被 “撤销原判，发回重审”，且在重审中，同时出现以下4种情形之一时，才允许：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%88%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0/%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4/%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E8%A2%AB%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E5%9C%A8%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B4%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 原审 未合法传唤即缺席判决，影响当事人权利的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%E5%8D%B3%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 追加了新的当事人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E4%BA%86%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 标的物灭失或变化，致原诉请 无法实现。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E7%81%AD%E5%A4%B1%E6%88%96%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%B4%E5%8E%9F%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="4. 新诉请/反诉 无法通过另诉解决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E6%96%B0%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7/%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%8F%A6%E8%AF%89%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【阶段总结】增加/变更/反诉规则对比" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E3%80%91%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0/%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4/%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  一审：法庭辩论终结前提出，法院可审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  二审：只能调解，调解不成告知另诉。但若发回重审，可一并审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%8F%A6%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E4%BD%86%E8%8B%A5%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B6%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  再审（原则）：不可。属于再审范围有限原则。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E3%80%82%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="  再审（例外）：案件发回重审 + 出现4种法定情形之一，才可允许。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%88%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%9E%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%A1%20+%20%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B04%E7%A7%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 再审的结案方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%A1%88%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="裁判：作出 新的判决，在其中明确撤销、改变或维持原判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E3%80%81%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E6%88%96%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="调解：可以调解，达成协议，必须 制作调解书。送达后，原判决视为撤销。（与二审调解规则一致）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="撤回起诉:" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E:%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="条件：必须经 对方当事人同意，且不损害“国社他”利益。（一审撤诉一般不需要）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%8D%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E2%80%9C%E5%9B%BD%E7%A4%BE%E4%BB%96%E2%80%9D%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="后果：不得 再次起诉。（一审撤诉后可以再诉）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%92%A4%E8%AF%89%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%86%8D%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="终结再审程序:" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E:%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="情形：当事人在审查/再审中达成和解协议，且 已履行完毕。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5/%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B7%B2%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%AF%95%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="处理：由于纠纷已了，原判决是否有错已无实际意义，法院不审了。再审审查阶段的，终结审查；再审审理阶段的，终结再审程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%8E%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%B7%B2%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%E5%B7%B2%E6%97%A0%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%BA%86%E3%80%82%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%EF%BC%9B%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="六、“一张图”读懂再审全流程（核心模型）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AD%E3%80%81%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%80%E5%BC%A0%E5%9B%BE%E2%80%9D%E8%AF%BB%E6%87%82%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%85%A8%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="此图将再审程序可视化，专克“何时中止、何时撤销”等疑难问题。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%AD%A4%E5%9B%BE%E5%B0%86%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%8F%AF%E8%A7%86%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%93%E5%85%8B%E2%80%9C%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E3%80%81%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E2%80%9D%E7%AD%89%E7%96%91%E9%9A%BE%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="" _mubu_text="" _note="" _mubu_note="" _mubu_images="%5B%7B%22id%22%3A%22d6dp7RlpSI%22%2C%22oh%22%3A653%2C%22ow%22%3A2690%2C%22uri%22%3A%22document_image%2F7506902_96fcce51-af2d-4bc5-cfaa-f9c8f8c2f20b.png%22%2C%22w%22%3A400%7D%5D"/>
        <outline text="线段OA：再审启动阶段。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%BF%E6%AE%B5OA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="线段AB：再审重新审理阶段。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%BF%E6%AE%B5AB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="A点（裁定再审）：此时法院认定“可能确有错误”，应 裁定中止执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EA%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%88%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E7%A1%AE%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="B点（作出新判决）：此时错误已查实，在新判决中 撤销原判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EB%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%88%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E6%96%B0%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E5%B7%B2%E6%9F%A5%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E6%96%B0%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%AD%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="要点精析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A6%81%E7%82%B9%E7%B2%BE%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="OA阶段（启动阶段）：原判有效，且不停止执行。 -标志性表述：当事人申请再审不停止原判执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EOA%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%88%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%8D%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%20-%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97%E6%80%A7%E8%A1%A8%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%8D%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="A点（裁定再审时）：只能中止执行，不能撤销原判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EA%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%88%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="AB阶段（重新审理阶段）：原判仍有效，但已中止执行。 -标志性表述：法院决定再审时，应裁定中止执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EAB%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%88%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E4%BB%8D%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%B7%B2%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%20-%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97%E6%80%A7%E8%A1%A8%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="B点（作出新判决时）：才能撤销原判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EB%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%88%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E6%96%B0%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="整个OB段（再审全程序）：只要没到B点，原生效裁判就 一直有效，只是分阶段看是否在执行中。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AAOB%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%88%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E5%85%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E6%B2%A1%E5%88%B0B%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E5%B0%B1%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E7%9B%B4%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E5%88%86%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E7%9C%8B%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%9C%A8%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="七、小额诉讼程序的再审（特殊规定）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%83%E3%80%81%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%88%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="可以再审：小额诉讼一审终审，但生效裁判有错，可申请再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="申请对象：向 原审法院（即基层法院）申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%B3%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="重新审理组织：必须 组成合议庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="审理程序：由于不存在提审，按 一审程序 重新审理，所作判决为一审判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%8F%90%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="判决效力（能否上诉）：不一律。关键看当事人申请再审的理由：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88%E8%83%BD%E5%90%A6%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E3%80%82%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E7%9C%8B%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="程序不当（不应适用小额程序而适用）：所作新判决，可以上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E5%BA%94%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%80%8C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%80%E4%BD%9C%E6%96%B0%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="实体错误（应适用小额程序，但审理中事实/法律错了）：所作新判决，仍为一审终审，不能上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%BA%94%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%B0%8F%E9%A2%9D%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AD%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E/%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E9%94%99%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%80%E4%BD%9C%E6%96%B0%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8D%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题22 特别程序 知识点总结" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9822%20%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%20%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、特别程序总论" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%BB%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="程序性质：不是诉讼程序（选民资格案除外，其余为“非讼程序”）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E9%80%89%E6%B0%91%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%E6%A1%88%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BD%99%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%9C%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="原则性与禁止性规定（由此“非讼”性质衍生）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%8E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B1%E6%AD%A4%E2%80%9C%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E2%80%9D%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E8%A1%8D%E7%94%9F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="不准讨论诉的分类（非确认、形成、给付之诉）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%86%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E9%9D%9E%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E3%80%81%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E3%80%81%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="不适用辩论原则。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="不适用调解制度。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="不适用人民陪审员制度。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="一审终审：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="判决、裁定送达即生效，不能上诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%8D%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="生效裁判有错，不搞再审、不搞第三人撤销之诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%90%9E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E6%90%9E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="救济途径：当事人/利害关系人向法院提出异议，法院审查后用新裁判撤销原裁判。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA/%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%90%8E%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="审判组织：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则：审判员一人独任审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="例外：选民资格案或重大、疑难案，由审判员组成合议庭审理。（注意，无人民陪审员）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%89%E6%B0%91%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E3%80%81%E7%96%91%E9%9A%BE%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%99%AA%E5%AE%A1%E5%91%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="审限：立案之日起 30天 内审结。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E30%E5%A4%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%86%85%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%93%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、重点特别程序一：宣告失踪/死亡案件中财产代管人变更" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E5%A4%B1%E8%B8%AA/%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%AD%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E4%BB%A3%E7%AE%A1%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="命题点：谁要求变更，决定适用的程序截然不同。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%91%BD%E9%A2%98%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%AA%E7%84%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 原指定代管人：申请变更（“我不干了”）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E7%AE%A1%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E2%80%9C%E6%88%91%E4%B8%8D%E5%B9%B2%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="性质：无实体纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="程序：法院适用 特别程序，撤销其身份并另行指定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%85%B6%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 其他利害关系人：申请变更（“别让他干了，他不行”）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%EF%BC%88%E2%80%9C%E5%88%AB%E8%AE%A9%E4%BB%96%E5%B9%B2%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%96%E4%B8%8D%E8%A1%8C%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="性质：与原代管人有实体纠纷（他还要干）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%A3%E7%AE%A1%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%96%E8%BF%98%E8%A6%81%E5%B9%B2%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="程序：法院告知其以原代管人为被告，提起 诉讼，适用 普通程序审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%A3%E7%AE%A1%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【真题案例】" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法院宣告赵某失踪，指定其妻黄某为代管人。赵母李某有异议想自己当，而黄某则希望改由儿子赵小某当。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E5%A4%B1%E8%B8%AA%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%B6%E5%A6%BB%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%A3%E7%AE%A1%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%E8%B5%B5%E6%AF%8D%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%83%B3%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%BD%93%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E5%88%99%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E6%94%B9%E7%94%B1%E5%84%BF%E5%AD%90%E8%B5%B5%E5%B0%8F%E6%9F%90%E5%BD%93%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- 黄某（原代管人）想变：申请法院 -适用 特别程序 处理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%A3%E7%AE%A1%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E6%83%B3%E5%8F%98%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%20-%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- 李某（利害关系人）想变：应起诉黄某（原代管人） -适用 普通程序 处理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E6%83%B3%E5%8F%98%EF%BC%9A%E5%BA%94%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%A3%E7%AE%A1%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20-%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、重点特别程序二：指定遗产管理人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="立法背景：与《民法典》遗产管理人制度相配套，解决“遗产无人管、有人争、有人跑”的现实难题。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E3%80%8A%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8%E3%80%8B%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E7%9B%B8%E9%85%8D%E5%A5%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E2%80%9C%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E7%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%89%E3%80%81%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E8%B7%91%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E7%8E%B0%E5%AE%9E%E9%9A%BE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="1. 申请主体" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="利害关系人：所有对遗产能主张权利的人，均可申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%AF%B9%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9D%87%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="具体范围：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="继承人（含法定、遗嘱、可酌情分得遗产人等）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%90%AB%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E3%80%81%E5%8F%AF%E9%85%8C%E6%83%85%E5%88%86%E5%BE%97%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="受遗赠人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E9%81%97%E8%B5%A0%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="被继承人的债权人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 管辖法院" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="由被继承人死亡时住所地或者主要遗产所在地的基层法院管辖。（便于后续的遗产继承纠纷）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E6%97%B6%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E4%BE%BF%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E7%9A%84%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 指定原则与变更" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="指定：法院按照 有利于遗产管理 的原则判决指定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%8E%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="变更：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 客观原因（死亡、丧失能力等）无法履职：被指定者本人或利害关系人，可申请另行指定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A2%E8%A7%82%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E3%80%81%E4%B8%A7%E5%A4%B1%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%B1%A5%E8%81%8C%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E8%80%85%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 主观原因（违反职责、严重侵权）：仅利害关系人可申请撤销其资格，并依法指定新管理人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E8%A7%82%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E8%81%8C%E8%B4%A3%E3%80%81%E4%B8%A5%E9%87%8D%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B6%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E6%96%B0%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【案例】遗产管理人的现实意义" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%8E%B0%E5%AE%9E%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="小熊自幼成孤儿，远房姑妈赵某全款买房并登记在小熊名下。小熊死后，无法定继承人。赵某因“尽了较多抚养义务”可适当分遗产，但无人可告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%B0%8F%E7%86%8A%E8%87%AA%E5%B9%BC%E6%88%90%E5%AD%A4%E5%84%BF%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9C%E6%88%BF%E5%A7%91%E5%A6%88%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E5%85%A8%E6%AC%BE%E4%B9%B0%E6%88%BF%E5%B9%B6%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E5%9C%A8%E5%B0%8F%E7%86%8A%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%8B%E3%80%82%E5%B0%8F%E7%86%8A%E6%AD%BB%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E5%9B%A0%E2%80%9C%E5%B0%BD%E4%BA%86%E8%BE%83%E5%A4%9A%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E2%80%9D%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%82%E5%BD%93%E5%88%86%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E5%91%8A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- 解决路径：赵某作为利害关系人 -申请法院指定遗产管理人 -法院指定当地民政局为管理人 -赵某可向民政局主张分配遗产 -若对分配不满，可起诉民政局（此为 民事诉讼，非行政诉讼）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%20-%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%20-%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%B0%E6%B0%91%E6%94%BF%E5%B1%80%E4%B8%BA%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%20-%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AF%E5%90%91%E6%B0%91%E6%94%BF%E5%B1%80%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%20-%E8%8B%A5%E5%AF%B9%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E4%B8%8D%E6%BB%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%B0%91%E6%94%BF%E5%B1%80%EF%BC%88%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%9D%9E%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="【真题案例】遗嘱执行人担任管理人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="老张去世，有公证遗嘱指定朋友李四为遗嘱执行人。继承人张甲质疑遗嘱真实性，申请法院指定遗产管理人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%81%E5%BC%A0%E5%8E%BB%E4%B8%96%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%8B%E5%8F%8B%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%BA%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%A0%E7%94%B2%E8%B4%A8%E7%96%91%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- 法院做法正确：公证遗嘱内容可被推翻的除外，推定为真。有遗嘱执行人，就由其担任遗产管理人，应判决指定李四。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%8F%AF%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%E7%9A%84%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%82%E6%9C%89%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E7%94%B1%E5%85%B6%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- 债权人维权：债权人应以遗产管理人李四为被告提起民事诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%B4%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%A5%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="- 管理人失职：李四失火烧房，造成损失。 -实体上，他要承担民事赔偿；程序上，利害关系人可申请法院撤销其管理人资格。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E5%A4%B1%E8%81%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%A4%B1%E7%81%AB%E7%83%A7%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E3%80%82%20-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%96%E8%A6%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%85%B6%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、重点特别程序三：确认调解协议效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%9A%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="适用对象：经人民调解委员会调解达成的协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="1. 申请程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="主体：双方当事人共同申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="时间：调解协议生效之日起 30天内。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E30%E5%A4%A9%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="管辖：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 法院邀请调解的：向作出邀请的法院申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%82%80%E8%AF%B7%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E9%82%80%E8%AF%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 调解组织自行调解的：向当事人住所地、标的物所在地、调解组织所在地的基层法院申请。若纠纷本身应属中院管辖，则找前述地点的 中院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E5%BA%94%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E6%89%BE%E5%89%8D%E8%BF%B0%E5%9C%B0%E7%82%B9%E7%9A%84%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 不予受理的情形（重点两项）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E4%B8%A4%E9%A1%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 涉及身份关系（如婚姻、亲子、收养关系的有效/无效/解除）- 涉公序良俗，不适用。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E3%80%81%E4%BA%B2%E5%AD%90%E3%80%81%E6%94%B6%E5%85%BB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88/%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88/%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%EF%BC%89-%20%E6%B6%89%E5%85%AC%E5%BA%8F%E8%89%AF%E4%BF%97%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 涉及物权、知识产权确权 - 属对世权，影响大，不适用。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E3%80%81%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E4%BA%A7%E6%9D%83%E7%A1%AE%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20-%20%E5%B1%9E%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 法院的处理与救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="肯定性裁定（裁定确认效力）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%82%AF%E5%AE%9A%E6%80%A7%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%88%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="性质：可强制执行。若错了会影响当事人权益。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E9%94%99%E4%BA%86%E4%BC%9A%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="救济途径：当事人或利害关系人可向作出裁定的法院提出异议。（非再审/三撤）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E9%9D%9E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1/%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="当事人：收到裁定后 15天 内提异议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%8E%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E15%E5%A4%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%86%85%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="利害关系人：知道或应当知道权益受损后 6个月 内提异议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%88%96%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E5%8F%97%E6%8D%9F%E5%90%8E%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E6%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%86%85%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="否定性裁定（裁定驳回申请）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%A6%E5%AE%9A%E6%80%A7%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%88%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="性质：法院否认了调解协议效力，没干任何事，不影响当事人实体利益。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%A6%E8%AE%A4%E4%BA%86%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E5%B9%B2%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E4%BA%8B%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="处理：不必给救济。当事人应另行寻求纠纷解决方式：和解、调解、仲裁、起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BF%85%E7%BB%99%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E5%AF%BB%E6%B1%82%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%81%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%81%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="五、重点特别程序四：实现担保物权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="立法背景：为配合《物权法》对担保物权的规定，提供了一个不经诉讼即可获得执行依据的非讼程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BA%E9%85%8D%E5%90%88%E3%80%8A%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E6%B3%95%E3%80%8B%E5%AF%B9%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%8D%E7%BB%8F%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%97%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="1. 申请主体" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="担保物权人：抵押权人、质押权人、留置权人等。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8A%B5%E6%8A%BC%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%B4%A8%E6%8A%BC%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="其他有权人：主要指出质人、债务人等。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E6%8C%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%87%BA%E8%B4%A8%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【案例】：欠2万修车款，就值10万的车被老板留置。老板不着急，你（车主）反而着急车贬值。此时你就是“其他有权人”，可主动申请拍卖车辆。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%AC%A02%E4%B8%87%E4%BF%AE%E8%BD%A6%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E5%80%BC10%E4%B8%87%E7%9A%84%E8%BD%A6%E8%A2%AB%E8%80%81%E6%9D%BF%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E3%80%82%E8%80%81%E6%9D%BF%E4%B8%8D%E7%9D%80%E6%80%A5%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%A0%EF%BC%88%E8%BD%A6%E4%B8%BB%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%8D%E8%80%8C%E7%9D%80%E6%80%A5%E8%BD%A6%E8%B4%AC%E5%80%BC%E3%80%82%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E4%BD%A0%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%8B%8D%E5%8D%96%E8%BD%A6%E8%BE%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 管辖与审判组织" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="管辖法院：担保财产所在地或担保物权登记地的基层法院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="注意：该案一律由基层法院管辖，不存在中院管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%A5%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E7%94%B1%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="审判组织：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则：审判员一人独任审查。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="例外（组成合议庭）：财产标的额超过基层法院级别管辖标准的，视为重大疑难案件，由审判员组成合议庭审查。（注意，只是借用“级辖标准”来判断是否组成合议庭）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%88%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E7%96%91%E9%9A%BE%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E5%80%9F%E7%94%A8%E2%80%9C%E7%BA%A7%E8%BE%96%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E2%80%9D%E6%9D%A5%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 法院的处理与救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="肯定性裁定（裁定准许拍卖、变卖）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%82%AF%E5%AE%9A%E6%80%A7%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%88%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E6%8B%8D%E5%8D%96%E3%80%81%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="性质：可强制执行。若错了影响实体权利，必须给救济。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E9%94%99%E4%BA%86%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%99%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="救济途径：向作出裁定的法院提出异议。（非再审/三撤）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E9%9D%9E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1/%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="当事人：收到裁定后 15天 内提异议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%8E%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E15%E5%A4%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%86%85%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="利害关系人：知道或应当知道后 6个月 内提异议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%88%96%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E5%90%8E%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E6%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%86%85%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="否定性裁定（裁定驳回申请）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%A6%E5%AE%9A%E6%80%A7%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%88%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="性质：法院认为双方存在实体纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="处理：案件退出非讼程序。当事人应设法解决实体纠纷：和解、调解、仲裁、起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%94%E8%AE%BE%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%81%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%81%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="与仲裁协议的衔接：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%94%E6%8E%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="若当事人之间有有效仲裁协议，受理实现担保物权申请时不受影响（因此时无纠纷）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%8B%A5%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%97%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="一旦被裁定驳回，证明存在实质纠纷，则该仲裁协议生效，当事人只能去仲裁，不能去起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A6%E8%A2%AB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E8%AF%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%8E%BB%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题23 督促程序（支付令程序）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9823%20%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、程序概要与流程" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%A6%82%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="俗称：支付令程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BF%97%E7%A7%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="适用场景：债权人与债务人之间 没有实质纠纷，债务人只是 认账但不还钱。没必要走复杂的诉讼，直接通过此程序快速实现债权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8E%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%A4%E8%B4%A6%E4%BD%86%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%98%E9%92%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%B2%A1%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E8%B5%B0%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E6%AD%A4%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="基本流程：债权人申请 -法院审查并发出支付令 -债务人收到后15天内。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%20-%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%20-%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%90%8E15%E5%A4%A9%E5%86%85%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="还钱：程序结束。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%98%E9%92%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="提书面异议：法院审查异议成立 -终结督促程序，支付令失效 -转入诉讼（或仲裁）解决纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%20-%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%20-%E8%BD%AC%E5%85%A5%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%88%E6%88%96%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%89%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="既不还钱，也不提异议：15天后，支付令产生 强制执行效力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A2%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%98%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A15%E5%A4%A9%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="【关键辨析】支付令的两个效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%90%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%E3%80%91%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="法律效力（发生时间）：支付令 作出之日 起即发生。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E8%B5%B7%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="内容：督促债务人在15天内还钱或提异议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A815%E5%A4%A9%E5%86%85%E8%BF%98%E9%92%B1%E6%88%96%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="强制执行效力（发生时间）：债务人收到支付令后 15天届满，且未还钱、未提异议时产生。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%90%8E%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E15%E5%A4%A9%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E6%9C%AA%E8%BF%98%E9%92%B1%E3%80%81%E6%9C%AA%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%B6%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="内容：债权人可凭此支付令申请法院强制执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E5%87%AD%E6%AD%A4%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、程序要点" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%A6%81%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 申请支付令的条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 标的：请求给付的只能是 金钱 或 有价证券（如汇票、本票、支票、股票、债券等）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%91%E9%92%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E6%88%96%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B7%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%B1%87%E7%A5%A8%E3%80%81%E6%9C%AC%E7%A5%A8%E3%80%81%E6%94%AF%E7%A5%A8%E3%80%81%E8%82%A1%E7%A5%A8%E3%80%81%E5%80%BA%E5%88%B8%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 状态：请求给付的金钱或有价证券已 到期 且 数额确定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E9%87%91%E9%92%B1%E6%88%96%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B7%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B8%E5%B7%B2%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%B0%E6%9C%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E4%B8%94%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%B0%E9%A2%9D%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 债权人义务：债权人 没有对待给付义务。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%AF%B9%E5%BE%85%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【案例】 合同约定“你给我货，我给你钱”。你没给货，就不能申请支付令要钱，因为你的义务没履行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E4%BD%A0%E7%BB%99%E6%88%91%E8%B4%A7%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E7%BB%99%E4%BD%A0%E9%92%B1%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%E4%BD%A0%E6%B2%A1%E7%BB%99%E8%B4%A7%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E8%A6%81%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E6%B2%A1%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 送达：支付令 能够送达 债务人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="允许的送达方式：直接送达、留置送达。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E7%9A%84%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E3%80%81%E7%95%99%E7%BD%AE%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="禁止的送达方式：公告送达。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E7%9A%84%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="原理：必须确保债务人切实收到支付令，知晓其有提出异议的权利。公告送达无法实现此目的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%87%E5%AE%9E%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%EF%BC%8C%E7%9F%A5%E6%99%93%E5%85%B6%E6%9C%89%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E3%80%82%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%AD%A4%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="5. 非保全状态：债权人没有向法院申请 诉前保全。（因为诉前保全要求30天内起诉或仲裁，与督促程序冲突）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%8230%E5%A4%A9%E5%86%85%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%88%96%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 支付令与担保人的关系（一句话：没关系）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E4%B8%8E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%A5%E8%AF%9D%EF%BC%9A%E6%B2%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心原则：支付令跟担保人没有关系。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E8%B7%9F%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="1. 对担保人无约束力：债权人申请对债务人发出支付令，该支付令 对担保人不产生任何约束力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%AF%B9%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 不得对担保人发支付令：债权人 不能申请法院向担保人直接发出支付令。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%AF%B9%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%91%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%91%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原理：担保关系依附于主债权债务关系，不满足督促程序要求的“权利义务关系明确”这一前提。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BE%9D%E9%99%84%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%BB%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E2%80%9D%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%80%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="【真题案例】 大牛公司欠小羊公司钱，灰太狼公司担保。小羊公司申请对大牛公司发出支付令。-该支付令只约束大牛公司，对担保人灰太狼公司没有约束力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%9B%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%AC%A0%E5%B0%8F%E7%BE%8A%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%8C%E7%81%B0%E5%A4%AA%E7%8B%BC%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E3%80%82%E5%B0%8F%E7%BE%8A%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%AF%B9%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%9B%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E3%80%82-%E8%AF%A5%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%9B%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E7%81%B0%E5%A4%AA%E7%8B%BC%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="级别管辖：基层法院。（无论标的额多大）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E8%AE%BA%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%9A%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="地域管辖：债务人住所地 的基层法院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 法院的审查与处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E4%B8%8E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="符合条件的：15天内发出支付令。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E15%E5%A4%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%85%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="不符合条件的：裁定 驳回申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 支付令异议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="提出时间：债务人收到支付令之日起 15天内。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E15%E5%A4%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%85%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="形式要求：必须 书面提出。口头异议无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E3%80%82%E5%8F%A3%E5%A4%B4%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="内容要求：必须是 对债务本身的实体异议。以下情况 不构成有效异议，不影响支付令效力：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="（1）声称 无偿还能力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%881%EF%BC%89%E5%A3%B0%E7%A7%B0%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E5%81%BF%E8%BF%98%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="（2）要求 延缓履行期限。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BB%B6%E7%BC%93%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="（3）要求 变更履行方式（如以物抵债）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%883%EF%BC%89%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E4%BB%A5%E7%89%A9%E6%8A%B5%E5%80%BA%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="法院审查标准：形式审查。只看你提没提书面异议，是不是对债务本身有异议。只要有，异议就成立。不对债权债务进行实体审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%8F%AA%E7%9C%8B%E4%BD%A0%E6%8F%90%E6%B2%A1%E6%8F%90%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E5%AF%B9%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E6%9C%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E5%B0%B1%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%AF%B9%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="异议成立后的效果（两步走）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%A4%E6%AD%A5%E8%B5%B0%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 终结程序：裁定 终结督促程序，已发出的支付令 自行失效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%B2%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 程序转换：案件 转入诉讼程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BD%AC%E5%85%A5%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="例外：若 申请方（债权人）不同意起诉，则不转入。-体现了对原告（债权人）处分权的尊重。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%8B%A5%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%88%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8D%E8%BD%AC%E5%85%A5%E3%80%82-%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%E4%BA%86%E5%AF%B9%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%88%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E5%A4%84%E5%88%86%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%8A%E9%87%8D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="6. 终结督促程序的其他情形" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="情形一：债务人起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="支付令发出后，债权人（申请人）不管起诉谁（债务人/担保人），都说明他认为有纠纷了。 法院应裁定终结督促程序，支付令失效，双方通过已启动的诉讼解决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8D%E7%AE%A1%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%B0%81%EF%BC%88%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA/%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E4%BB%96%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%BA%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%B7%B2%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="情形二：无法送达。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%BA%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院发出支付令后，30天内无法送达债务人的，应裁定终结督促程序，支付令失效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E30%E5%A4%A9%E5%86%85%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="情形三：债权人撤回申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="在债务人收到支付令前，债权人撤回申请的，法院应裁定终结督促程序，支付令失效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9C%A8%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="7. 起诉行为对支付令效力的影响【总结】" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E3%80%90%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="债权人起诉（不论告谁）：意味着纠纷产生。-终结督促程序，支付令失效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%BA%E5%91%8A%E8%B0%81%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E6%84%8F%E5%91%B3%E7%9D%80%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E3%80%82-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="债务人起诉：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="向其他法院起诉：不影响支付令效力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%91%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="向作出支付令的法院起诉：视为提出书面异议。-终结督促程序，支付令失效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%91%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82-%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="8. 支付令与仲裁协议的联动" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E8.%20%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E4%B8%8E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%81%94%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="申请环节：即使债权债务合同中存在有效的 仲裁协议，债权人仍可向法院申请支付令。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%8E%AF%E8%8A%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8D%B3%E4%BD%BF%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="理由：申请支付令的前提是债权人认为“无纠纷”，且督促程序不解决纠纷。仲裁协议作为纠纷解决条款，此时不发挥作用。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E6%98%AF%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%9C%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%82%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%91%E6%8C%A5%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="异议成立后：一旦债务人提出有效书面异议，就证明双方存在实质纠纷，督促程序终结。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A6%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="此时仲裁协议生效：存在仲裁协议就不能去诉讼，当事人只能 根据仲裁协议申请仲裁 来解决该债权债务纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E6%9D%A5%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E8%AF%A5%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题24 公示催告程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9824%20%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、程序流程与基本原理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%8E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 核心场景模拟" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="权利人票据（如支票、汇票）遗失、被盗或灭失，通过法院公告的方式寻找票据或利害关系人，最终目的是要么解决票据权利归属纠纷，要么重新获得票据权利。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%94%AF%E7%A5%A8%E3%80%81%E6%B1%87%E7%A5%A8%EF%BC%89%E9%81%97%E5%A4%B1%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E7%9B%97%E6%88%96%E7%81%AD%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%AF%BB%E6%89%BE%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E6%88%96%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%88%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E5%BD%92%E5%B1%9E%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%88%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%97%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 三步走流程演示" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%E8%B5%B0%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E6%BC%94%E7%A4%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 第一步：止付与冻结（止损）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E6%AD%A2%E4%BB%98%E4%B8%8E%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%88%E6%AD%A2%E6%8D%9F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="申请人：向法院申请公示催告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院行动：受理后立即向付款人（银行） 发出止付通知。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A8%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%98%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%AD%A2%E4%BB%98%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法律效果：公示催告期间，转让该票据的行为无效。相当于冻结了票据上的权利，确保票据安全。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BD%AC%E8%AE%A9%E8%AF%A5%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E7%9B%B8%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8E%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%E4%BA%86%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%9D%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 第二步：公告寻找（找票找人）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E5%AF%BB%E6%89%BE%EF%BC%88%E6%89%BE%E7%A5%A8%E6%89%BE%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院行动：在受理后 3天 内发出公告，催促利害关系人申报权利。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A8%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E3%E5%A4%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%86%85%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%82%AC%E4%BF%83%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="等待结果：公告期满，出现两种可能。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%E6%BB%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 第三步：程序终结（两种结果）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="结果一：有人申报权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="法院通知申请人查验票据。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9F%A5%E9%AA%8C%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="票据不一致：驳回申报，程序继续。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%EF%BC%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="票据一致：说明双方对该票据的权利归属产生了纠纷。公示催告程序（作为非讼程序）不解决纠纷，法院裁定终结公示催告程序。申请人或申报人可另行通过诉讼解决票据权利纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%A5%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E5%BD%92%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%86%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="结果二：无人申报（或申报均被驳回）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%EF%BC%88%E6%88%96%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E5%9D%87%E8%A2%AB%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="说明“申请人是票据权利人”这件事没有争议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%AF%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E2%80%9D%E8%BF%99%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="申请人向法院申请作出除权判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="除权判决宣告：遗失的票据无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%9A%E9%81%97%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="申请人可凭除权判决向付款人（银行）要求付款，银行不付的，可起诉银行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E5%87%AD%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%90%91%E4%BB%98%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E4%BB%98%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%98%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、主要考点梳理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E6%A2%B3%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 适用条件" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="适用对象：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 按规定可以背书转让的票据（如汇票、本票、支票）遗失、灭失、被盗。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%8C%89%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%83%8C%E4%B9%A6%E8%BD%AC%E8%AE%A9%E7%9A%84%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%B1%87%E7%A5%A8%E3%80%81%E6%9C%AC%E7%A5%A8%E3%80%81%E6%94%AF%E7%A5%A8%EF%BC%89%E9%81%97%E5%A4%B1%E3%80%81%E7%81%AD%E5%A4%B1%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E7%9B%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 法律规定可以申请公示催告的其他事项。 -注意：这是一个兜底条款，应对未来可能出现的新的交易工具，不能说“仅适用于票据”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%20-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%9C%E5%BA%95%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%AF%B9%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%B4%E2%80%9C%E4%BB%85%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="申请主体：票据的最后合法持有人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%8C%81%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="管辖法院：向票据支付地的基层法院申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 止付通知与公告" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%AD%A2%E4%BB%98%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="止付通知：法院决定受理的同时，通知付款人（银行）停止支付。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%AD%A2%E4%BB%98%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%BB%98%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="公告时间：受理后 3天 内发出。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E3%E5%A4%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%86%85%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="法律效果：公示催告期间，转让票据权利的行为无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E8%BD%AC%E8%AE%A9%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 申报权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="申报时间：依法理应在公示催告期间内申报，但司法解释实际放宽到 “在除权判决作出前” 均可申报。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E7%90%86%E5%BA%94%E5%9C%A8%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%86%85%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E6%94%BE%E5%AE%BD%E5%88%B0%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E5%9C%A8%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%89%8D%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%9D%87%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="申报成立后的处理：法院通知申请人查验票据。若票据一致，证明存在实体权利纠纷，法院应裁定终结公示催告程序，并告知双方可另行通过诉讼解决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%9F%A5%E9%AA%8C%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 除权判决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="启动方式：必须依申请。公示催告期间届满无人申报或申报被驳回，申请人向法院申请，法院不能依职权作出。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BE%9D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E6%88%96%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E8%A2%AB%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="审判组织：由审判员组成合议庭审查作出。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【体系对比】公示催告的审判组织" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E3%80%91%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  公示催告阶段：审判员一人独任制。（只是贴公告，简单）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%91%98%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E8%B4%B4%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  除权判决阶段：合议制。（宣告票据无效，事关重大，需慎重）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8B%E5%85%B3%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E6%85%8E%E9%87%8D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="判决效力：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 宣告遗失的票据无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E9%81%97%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 申请人可凭此判决要求付款人（银行）付款。银行不付，可起诉银行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E5%87%AD%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E4%BB%98%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%98%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%98%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="性质辨析：除权判决 不能直接作为强制执行的根据去执行银行。它相当于法院补发了一张“支票”，你只能去“提现”，不给你才能再去告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%BB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%E5%AE%83%E7%9B%B8%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A1%A5%E5%8F%91%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E5%BC%A0%E2%80%9C%E6%94%AF%E7%A5%A8%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%A0%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%8E%BB%E2%80%9C%E6%8F%90%E7%8E%B0%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%BB%99%E4%BD%A0%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E5%8E%BB%E5%91%8A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="诉的分类辨析：公示催告程序是非讼程序，其判决不属于确权判决、给付判决或形成判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%88%96%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 对未申报权利人的救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E5%AF%B9%E6%9C%AA%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="情形：利害关系人因正当理由（如根本不知道此事）未能在除权判决前申报权利的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E5%9B%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%A0%B9%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%8D%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%AD%A4%E4%BA%8B%EF%BC%89%E6%9C%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%89%8D%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="救济途径：可以向作出除权判决的法院起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%91%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="时间限制：自知道或者应当知道判决公告之日起 1年 内。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E1%E5%B9%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%86%85%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="【真题案例】票据被他人申请公示催告后已除权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E8%A2%AB%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E5%90%8E%E5%B7%B2%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="乙公司是合法持票人，付款时发现票据已被丙公司申请公示催告，且除权判决已出。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%98%AF%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%8C%81%E7%A5%A8%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%98%E6%AC%BE%E6%97%B6%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E5%B7%B2%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%B7%B2%E5%87%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="  救济方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="    1.  程序法上：乙公司可向作出除权判决的法院起诉丙公司。（不能申请再审或三撤，因非讼程序不适用）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%201.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%8F%AF%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%88%96%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="    2.  实体法上（票据法）：乙公司可基于买卖合同向甲公司行使票据追索权，要求其通过其他方式支付货款。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%202.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%88%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%8F%AF%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%90%91%E7%94%B2%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%BD%E7%B4%A2%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%85%B6%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E8%B4%A7%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、所有非讼程序的终极相同套路【总结】" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E5%A5%97%E8%B7%AF%E3%80%90%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="将所有“非讼程序”用一根线穿起来，可用于快速排除干扰项。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B0%86%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E2%80%9C%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E2%80%9D%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B9%E7%BA%BF%E7%A9%BF%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E9%A1%B9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="1. 第一根线：去诉讼化" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B9%E7%BA%BF%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%BB%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8C%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="特别程序、督促程序、公示催告程序均 不是诉讼程序，不解决实体民事权利义务纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%9D%87%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="解题必杀技：只要在选项中看到下列解决纠纷的词汇，该选项必错，可直接排除！" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E5%BF%85%E6%9D%80%E6%8A%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E5%9C%A8%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E4%B8%AD%E7%9C%8B%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E6%B1%87%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E5%BF%85%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%EF%BC%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院组织辩论" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院组织调解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院开庭审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="要求提供证据证明权利" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="要求承担证明责任" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="搞第三人撤销之诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%90%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="搞再审" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%90%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="讨论数的分类（如确认之诉、给付之诉）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E3%80%81%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 第二根线：固定模板化流程" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%A0%B9%E7%BA%BF%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E5%8C%96%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="第一步：申请。有人向法院提出申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="第二步：刑事审查。法院只作形式审查，核心判断：这事儿到底有没有纠纷？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AA%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%99%E4%BA%8B%E5%84%BF%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E6%9C%89%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="情况A：法院判断“没纠纷”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5A%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E2%80%9C%E6%B2%A1%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="按申请人意愿作出相应文书（确认裁定、拍卖裁定、支付令、除权判决），案结事了。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8C%89%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%84%8F%E6%84%BF%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%88%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E6%8B%8D%E5%8D%96%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E3%80%81%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E7%BB%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="情况B：法院判断“有纠纷”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5B%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E2%80%9C%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="直接把本程序终结，告诉你们：“我这不处理纠纷，你们另请高明（通过和解、调解、仲裁、诉讼等方式解决）。”" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8A%8A%E6%9C%AC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%89%E4%BD%A0%E4%BB%AC%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E6%88%91%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%A0%E4%BB%AC%E5%8F%A6%E8%AF%B7%E9%AB%98%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%88%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%81%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="【对照检验】三种程序的“有/无纠纷”逻辑" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E5%AF%B9%E7%85%A7%E6%A3%80%E9%AA%8C%E3%80%91%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E6%9C%89/%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E2%80%9D%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="督促程序：债务人15天内没提书面异议 -无纠纷 -支付令可强制执行；提了异议 -有纠纷 -终结，转诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9D%A3%E4%BF%83%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA15%E5%A4%A9%E5%86%85%E6%B2%A1%E6%8F%90%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%20-%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%20-%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%9B%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%86%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%20-%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%20-%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%8C%E8%BD%AC%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="公示催告程序：公告期满无人申报 -无纠纷 -作出除权判决；有人申报成立 -有纠纷 -终结，告知另诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E5%82%AC%E5%91%8A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E6%9C%9F%E6%BB%A1%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%20-%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%20-%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E9%99%A4%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%9B%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%20-%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%20-%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%8C%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%8F%A6%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="确认调解协议/实现担保物权：法院审查认为符合条件 -无纠纷 -作出肯定性裁定；审查认为条件不符 -有纠纷 -裁定驳回，告知另寻途径解决纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE/%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%20-%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%20-%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%82%AF%E5%AE%9A%E6%80%A7%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9B%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%20-%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%20-%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%8F%A6%E5%AF%BB%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题25 执行程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9825%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="执行程序总览与框架" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%BB%E8%A7%88%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="执行程序内容繁多，可划分为四大板块：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%B9%81%E5%A4%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%88%92%E5%88%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%9B%9B%E5%A4%A7%E6%9D%BF%E5%9D%97%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="1. 执行开始：解决执行如何启动、由谁管辖的问题。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E3%80%81%E7%94%B1%E8%B0%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="2. 执行阻却：解决执行暂时或永久停下来的问题（执行担保、执行和解）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%98%BB%E5%8D%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9A%82%E6%97%B6%E6%88%96%E6%B0%B8%E4%B9%85%E5%81%9C%E4%B8%8B%E6%9D%A5%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E3%80%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="3. 执行救济：解决当事人/案外人认为执行错了如何纠正的问题（执行行为异议、案外人异议）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA/%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%94%99%E4%BA%86%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%81%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="4. 特殊执行措施：解决特殊主体（如到期债权）或特殊标的物如何执行的问题。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%88%B0%E6%9C%9F%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%89%E6%88%96%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
      <outline text="一、执行开始" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 执行根据" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="执行必须以生效法律文书为根据，主要包括：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%BA%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="法院制作：民事判决/裁定/调解书、支付令、刑事裁判中的财产部分。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3/%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A/%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%81%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E3%80%81%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="其他机关制作：仲裁裁决书、具有强制执行效力的公证债权文书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%81%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="法院承认执行：法院制作的承认并执行外国法院判决/裁定、外国仲裁机构裁决的裁定书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E5%B9%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3/%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 执行启动方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则：申请执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="例外：移送执行（法院依职权主动执行），适用于：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%9A%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="具有给付赡养、抚养、抚育费内容的法律文书（保护弱势群体）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E8%82%B2%E8%B4%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%88%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E5%BC%B1%E5%8A%BF%E7%BE%A4%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="民事制裁决定书（如罚款决定）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E5%88%B6%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="刑事附带民事判决/裁定/调解书（保护被害人）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E9%99%84%E5%B8%A6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3/%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A/%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%88%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E8%A2%AB%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="环保公益诉讼及检察机关提起的公益诉讼（维护公共利益）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8E%AF%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 申请执行的时效" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="期间：2年。属于执行时效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E2%E5%B9%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="效力：可中止、中断。时效届满了当事人仍可申请，法院应受理，除非被执行人提出时效抗辩（法院不主动适用）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E3%80%81%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E4%BA%86%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%8D%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%A4%E9%9D%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="起算点：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="文书确定履行期间的：履行期间届满之日起算。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="文书分期履行的：最后一期履行期间届满之日起算。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E6%9C%9F%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%B1%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%BB%A1%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="文书未确定履行期间的：文书生效之日起算。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="规定不作为义务的：义务人违反不作为义务之日起算。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 执行管辖【重点】" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%90%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="管辖法院的确定：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 诉讼程序作出的文书（民事判决/裁定/调解书、刑事财产部分）：由一审法院或同级的被执行财产所在地法院执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3/%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A/%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%81%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 非讼程序作出的文书（确认调解协议裁定、实现担保物权裁定、支付令）：由作出该文书的法院或同级的被执行财产所在地法院执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%AF%A5%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 其他机构作出的文书（仲裁裁决、公证债权文书）：由被执行人住所地法院或被执行财产所在地法院执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="核心性质：执行管辖是 法定的，不存在协议管辖和应诉管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 执行管辖与诉讼管辖的区别【核心对比】" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%E3%80%90%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="| 对比项 | 诉讼程序 | 执行程序 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 后立案法院无管辖权 | 裁定移送管辖 | 裁定撤销案件 |
| 当事人提管辖权异议 | 在提交答辩状期间提出 | 在收到执行通知之日起10天内提出 |
| 管辖权异议成立 | 裁定移送管辖 | 裁定撤销案件 |
| 对管辖权异议裁定不服 | 向上级法院上诉 | 向上一级法院申请复议 |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%97%A0%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3Cb%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3Cb%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%9C%A8%3Cb%3E%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/b%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%9C%A8%3Cb%3E%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B710%E5%A4%A9%3C/b%3E%E5%86%85%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3Cb%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3Cb%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%224%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%AF%B9%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%90%91%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%90%91%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="6. 执行通知" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="执行员收到申请或移交后，10天内发出执行通知。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%91%98%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%88%96%E7%A7%BB%E4%BA%A4%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E10%E5%A4%A9%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="可立即采取强制措施：采取措施不以先发通知为前置程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%A5%E5%85%88%E5%8F%91%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%B8%BA%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、执行阻却" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%98%BB%E5%8D%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（一）执行担保" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 适用场景" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="被执行人暂时无力清偿，希望暂缓执行，并由案外人提供担保，取得申请人同意。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%9A%82%E6%97%B6%E6%97%A0%E5%8A%9B%E6%B8%85%E5%81%BF%EF%BC%8C%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E7%94%B1%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 核心流程与考点" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%8E%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="启动：被执行人申请，案外人提供担保（问笔录：是否愿意、担保范围、期限），经申请人同意，法院决定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%88%E9%97%AE%E7%AC%94%E5%BD%95%EF%BC%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%84%BF%E6%84%8F%E3%80%81%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E3%80%81%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="暂缓执行期与担保期间：法院决定后，产生一个暂缓执行期间（一般与担保期限一致）。暂缓期届满后，才开始计算担保期间。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%8E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E4%B8%8E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%9C%9F%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="恢复执行的条件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 在暂缓执行期间内，被执行人或担保人转移、隐匿、变卖、毁损担保财产。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E3%80%81%E9%9A%90%E5%8C%BF%E3%80%81%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%96%E3%80%81%E6%AF%81%E6%8D%9F%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 暂缓执行期间届满，被执行人仍不履行义务。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="恢复执行的效果（三大考点）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 直接执行：恢复执行后，法院直接裁定执行担保财产或者保证人的财产。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 无需追加：不需要先将担保人变更、追加为被执行人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%88%E5%B0%86%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E3%80%81%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 无先诉抗辩：不需要考虑担保人的先诉抗辩权或其他抗辩权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E5%85%88%E8%AF%89%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E8%99%91%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%85%88%E8%AF%89%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%E6%9D%83%E6%88%96%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="担保人责任限制：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="范围有限：以担保人约定的担保范围为限。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E4%B8%BA%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="期限有限：仅在担保期间内承担责任。期满，担保人免责。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E3%80%82%E6%9C%9F%E6%BB%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="追偿：担保人承担责任后，可向债务人追偿，需另行起诉，与本案执行无关。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%BD%E5%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%90%91%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%BD%E5%81%BF%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="【真题案例】炒股担保案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E7%82%92%E8%82%A1%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="廖某申请执行黄某10万，黄某之友李某用自有汽车作担保，经廖某同意，法院暂缓执行6个月。期满，黄某仍无力清偿。-廖某可申请恢复执行，直接将李某的汽车交法院拍卖，不用办实现担保物权，李某也不享有让黄某先赔的先诉抗辩权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BB%96%E6%9F%90%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%9010%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%8B%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E7%94%A8%E8%87%AA%E6%9C%89%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E4%BD%9C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%E5%BB%96%E6%9F%90%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C6%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E3%80%82%E6%9C%9F%E6%BB%A1%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E4%BB%8D%E6%97%A0%E5%8A%9B%E6%B8%85%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82-%E5%BB%96%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%B0%86%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E7%9A%84%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E4%BA%A4%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8B%8D%E5%8D%96%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%A8%E5%8A%9E%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%8E%E6%9F%90%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E8%AE%A9%E9%BB%84%E6%9F%90%E5%85%88%E8%B5%94%E7%9A%84%E5%85%88%E8%AF%89%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）执行和解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心定性与逻辑：根据司法解释，可将执行和解协议理解为一份普通的民事合同。几乎所有相关结论都可由此推导。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%AE%9A%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%B0%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%87%A0%E4%B9%8E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%E9%83%BD%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B1%E6%AD%A4%E6%8E%A8%E5%AF%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="1. 达成和解后的程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="申请人可申请解除对相关财产的查封、扣押、冻结。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E5%AF%B9%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%E3%80%81%E6%89%A3%E6%8A%BC%E3%80%81%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院应裁定中止执行，等待和解协议履行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="履行结果与救济：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 履行完毕：法院应裁定执行终结。若存在迟延履行或瑕疵履行并造成损失，当事人可另行起诉赔偿。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%AF%95%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9F%E5%BB%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%96%E7%91%95%E7%96%B5%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%B9%B6%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 拒不履行：申请执行人可在以下两条路中择一行使：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%A4%E6%9D%A1%E8%B7%AF%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%A9%E4%B8%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="申请恢复执行原生效法律文书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="就履行和解协议向执行法院提起诉讼（给付之诉）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B0%B1%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%91%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="【真题案例】劣质玉石抵债案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E5%8A%A3%E8%B4%A8%E7%8E%89%E7%9F%B3%E6%8A%B5%E5%80%BA%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="甲申请执行乙，双方达成以祖传玉石抵债的和解协议，乙当场交付，案件执行终结。后甲发现该玉石有强放射性，致其生病。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B9%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E4%BB%A5%E7%A5%96%E4%BC%A0%E7%8E%89%E7%9F%B3%E6%8A%B5%E5%80%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%99%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%BA%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E3%80%82%E5%90%8E%E7%94%B2%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E8%AF%A5%E7%8E%89%E7%9F%B3%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%BA%E6%94%BE%E5%B0%84%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%B4%E5%85%B6%E7%94%9F%E7%97%85%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="-   救济途径：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="    1.  另行起诉赔偿：可向执行法院起诉，要求乙赔偿瑕疵履行造成的损失。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%201.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E5%90%91%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E4%B9%99%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E7%91%95%E7%96%B5%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="    2.  请求撤销协议：受欺诈可起诉请求撤销和解协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%202.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%E5%8F%AF%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="-   不可为之事：不能申请恢复对原判决的执行（因为和解协议已履行完毕，案件已终结）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E5%AF%B9%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%B7%B2%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%AF%95%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 和解协议的本质及衍生诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E5%8F%8A%E8%A1%8D%E7%94%9F%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="本质：普通民事合同。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="由此衍生的三类诉讼（均由执行法院管辖）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B1%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8D%E7%94%9F%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%88%E5%9D%87%E7%94%B1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 给付之诉：义务人拒不履行，权利人起诉要求履行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 确认之诉：当事人或利害关系人起诉，请求确认和解协议无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 形成之诉：当事人或利害关系人起诉，请求撤销和解协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 执行和解中的担保（区别于“执行担保”）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%E4%BA%8E%E2%80%9C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="核心规则：为和解协议提供的担保，是普通民事担保，不能直接强制执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="救济途径：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="不能：在恢复执行原判决后，直接裁定执行担保人的财产。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="只能：申请人若要追求担保人责任，须就担保关系另行起诉，或符合条件时申请实现担保物权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E8%8B%A5%E8%A6%81%E8%BF%BD%E6%B1%82%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E9%A1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B0%B1%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E6%97%B6%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="例外：除非担保人明确承诺愿意接受直接强制执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%99%A4%E9%9D%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA%E6%84%BF%E6%84%8F%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="【真题案例】案外人担保和解协议案" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%91%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="刘某申请执行陈某100万，双方达成90万和解，案外人赵某作为连带保证人签字。后陈某违约。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%99%88%E6%9F%90100%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%9090%E4%B8%87%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E5%AD%97%E3%80%82%E5%90%8E%E9%99%88%E6%9F%90%E8%BF%9D%E7%BA%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="-   刘某可以：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="    1.  申请恢复执行原100万判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%201.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F100%E4%B8%87%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="    2.  起诉陈某，要求履行90万的和解协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%202.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E9%99%88%E6%9F%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C90%E4%B8%87%E7%9A%84%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="    3.  起诉赵某，要求其承担担保责任。（普通担保，不能直接执行）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%203.%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%85%B6%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="-   刘某不能：直接申请法院对赵某强制执行。因为这是执行和解中的担保，非执行担保。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%98%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E8%B5%B5%E6%9F%90%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%8C%E9%9D%9E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（三）执行回转" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%9B%9E%E8%BD%AC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="情形：执行完毕后，据以执行的原生效法律文书被撤销或变更。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%AF%95%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%8D%AE%E4%BB%A5%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%A2%AB%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%88%96%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="处理：法院作出裁定，责令取得财产的人返还财产，拒不返还的，强制执行。此即“执行错了，弄回来”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%AD%A4%E5%8D%B3%E2%80%9C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%94%99%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%84%E5%9B%9E%E6%9D%A5%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、执行救济与案外人救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="执行救济总览" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E6%80%BB%E8%A7%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="执行救济是指在执行过程中，当事人或案外人认为法院的执行行为或执行结果侵害了其合法权益，法律提供的纠正和补救途径。主要分为两种：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E6%98%AF%E6%8C%87%E5%9C%A8%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%88%96%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%BE%B5%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%86%E5%85%B6%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%92%8C%E8%A1%A5%E6%95%91%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%E3%80%82%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E5%88%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="1. 对执行行为的异议：挑战的是法院执行行为的合法性。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%91%E6%88%98%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 案外人对执行标的的异议：挑战的是对特定财产执行的正当性（主张实体权利）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%91%E6%88%98%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E5%AF%B9%E7%89%B9%E5%AE%9A%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（一）对执行行为的异议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 基本概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="提出主体：当事人（申请人、被执行人）或利害关系人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="事由：认为法院的执行行为违反法律规定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="本质：对法院执行程序的挑战，不涉及实体权利义务的归属。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%8C%91%E6%88%98%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%92%E5%B1%9E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 典型示例" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%85%B8%E5%9E%8B%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院执行了被执行人及其所扶养家属生活必需的居住用房/生活用品。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%86%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%B6%E6%89%80%E6%89%B6%E5%85%BB%E5%AE%B6%E5%B1%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E5%BF%85%E9%9C%80%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E4%BD%8F%E7%94%A8%E6%88%BF/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E7%94%A8%E5%93%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院委托的评估机构评估程序违法或结论错误。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%84%E4%BC%B0%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E8%AF%84%E4%BC%B0%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院组织的拍卖程序存在恶意串通、恶意抬价等违法情形。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%8D%E5%8D%96%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%81%B6%E6%84%8F%E4%B8%B2%E9%80%9A%E3%80%81%E6%81%B6%E6%84%8F%E6%8A%AC%E4%BB%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%89%E8%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 审查与救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="审查：法院对书面异议进行审查。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="理由成立：裁定撤销或改正原执行行为。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%88%96%E6%94%B9%E6%AD%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="理由不成立：裁定驳回异议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="后续救济：当事人、利害关系人对裁定不服的，可以自裁定送达之日起10日内向上一级法院申请复议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E10%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E5%90%91%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（二）案外人对执行标的的异议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心特性：案外人主张的是实体权利，认为执行的标的物“是我的”。这必然产生实体纠纷，而执行程序不解决纠纷，所以其后续救济必然导入诉讼或再审程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E2%80%9C%E6%98%AF%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%E8%BF%99%E5%BF%85%E7%84%B6%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E5%85%B6%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E5%BF%85%E7%84%B6%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="1. 基本概念" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="提出主体：案外人（当事人之外的第三人）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="事由：对执行标的物主张足以排除强制执行的实体权利（如所有权）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E8%B6%B3%E4%BB%A5%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="审查与初步处理：法院审查。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%9D%E6%AD%A5%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="异议成立：裁定中止对该标的物的执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%A5%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="异议不成立：裁定驳回。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 异议后的终局救济路径（核心逻辑）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="核心原理：案外人异议被支持或驳回后，实体纠纷并未解决。如何最终解决，取决于一个关键判断：原生效判决/裁定本身是否错了？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A2%AB%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%88%96%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%B9%B6%E6%9C%AA%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%96%E5%86%B3%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3/%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E9%94%99%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="路径一（原判有错 -申请再审）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%20-%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="适用场景：案外人主张权利，认为作为执行根据的原生效法律文书本身是错的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E6%98%AF%E9%94%99%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="成因与案例模型：张三起诉李四，争议的本身就是这套房子所有权，法院判决房子归张三，并据此执行。 -此时，执行房子的根源在于那个判房子的判决。王五要维权，必须推翻那份判决，因此要通过再审程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%88%90%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E8%BF%99%E5%A5%97%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%BD%92%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E6%8D%AE%E6%AD%A4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%20-%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B9%E6%BA%90%E5%9C%A8%E4%BA%8E%E9%82%A3%E4%B8%AA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E8%A6%81%E7%BB%B4%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%E9%82%A3%E4%BB%BD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E8%A6%81%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="路径二（与原判无关 -另行起诉/执行异议之诉）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%20-%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89/%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="适用场景：原生效法律文书没错，但在执行过程中执行了不该执行的财产。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E6%B2%A1%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9C%A8%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%8D%E8%AF%A5%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="成因与案例模型：张三起诉李四，要的是100万欠款，法院判李四还钱。执行时，因李四没钱，法院查封了李四名下的一套房子准备拍卖。 -此时，执行房子的根源是欠钱的判决，而这份判决本身没错。王五要维权，不需要推翻那个判钱的判决，只需要证明房子是自己的即可。这是一个全新的实体争议，应通过另行起诉（执行异议之诉） 解决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%88%90%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E100%E4%B8%87%E6%AC%A0%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E8%BF%98%E9%92%B1%E3%80%82%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%B2%A1%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%E4%BA%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A5%97%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E6%8B%8D%E5%8D%96%E3%80%82%20-%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B9%E6%BA%90%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%AC%A0%E9%92%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E8%BF%99%E4%BB%BD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E6%B2%A1%E9%94%99%E3%80%82%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E8%A6%81%E7%BB%B4%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%E9%82%A3%E4%B8%AA%E5%88%A4%E9%92%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%E6%98%AF%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E3%80%82%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%A8%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 执行异议之诉（路径二的展开）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E4%BA%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%95%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="适用前提：案外人异议被支持（中止执行）或被驳回后，当事人不服，且属于 “与原判无关” 的情形。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A2%AB%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%E6%88%96%E8%A2%AB%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="诉讼类型与当事人：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="申请人执行异议之诉：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="启动方：申请执行人 张三（在法院中止执行后）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="当事人：原告是张三，被告是案外人王五。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%98%AF%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="被执行人李四的立场：不反对的，列为无独三；反对的，列为共同被告。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%9A%84%E7%AB%8B%E5%9C%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9B%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="诉讼请求：请求法院判决准许执行该标的物（实质是确认王五的权利不成立）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%A5%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AF%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="案外人执行异议之诉：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="启动方：案外人 王五（在法院驳回其异议后）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9C%A8%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%85%B6%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="当事人：原告是王五，被告是申请执行人张三。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%98%AF%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="被执行人李四的立场：同上。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%9A%84%E7%AB%8B%E5%9C%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="诉讼请求：请求法院判决停止对该标的物的执行（实质是确认自己的实体权利成立）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%A5%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AF%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="注意：两类执行异议之诉，均需由案外人王五就其“对该标的物享有足以排除执行的权利”这一事实，承担证明责任。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%A4%E7%B1%BB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%9D%87%E9%9C%80%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%B0%B1%E5%85%B6%E2%80%9C%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%A5%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E8%B6%B3%E4%BB%A5%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E2%80%9D%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="案外人救济的制度化模型（重点解析）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E5%8C%96%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%88%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心目标：在一个案件中，当案外人面临判决侵犯其权利、执行侵犯其权利的双重困境时，如何理清第三人撤销之诉、案外人对执行标的的异议、再审、执行异议之诉这四个制度的适用关系。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E9%9D%A2%E4%B8%B4%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%BE%B5%E7%8A%AF%E5%85%B6%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E3%80%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BE%B5%E7%8A%AF%E5%85%B6%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8C%E9%87%8D%E5%9B%B0%E5%A2%83%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%90%86%E6%B8%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%99%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="1. 两个基本模型的判断（这是所有分析的前提）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E7%9A%84%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="模型一：判的和执行的不一样（判钱，执行房）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%92%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B7%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="特点：原判决不涉及争议标的物，只是作为金钱债权的执行依据。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E9%87%91%E9%92%B1%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="结论：与三撤、再审无关！案外人只能走“案外人对执行标的的异议 -执行异议之诉”这条路。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%81%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E8%B5%B0%E2%80%9C%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%20-%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E2%80%9D%E8%BF%99%E6%9D%A1%E8%B7%AF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="模型二：判的和执行的一样（判房，执行房）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%92%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B7%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="特点：原判决直接对争议标的物的权属作出了认定，并据此执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%B1%9E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E4%BA%86%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E6%8D%AE%E6%AD%A4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="结论：这是所有制度交织在一起，可能产生“三撤”、“标的异议”、“再审”的唯一复杂模型。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%87%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E2%80%9D%E3%80%81%E2%80%9C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E2%80%9D%E3%80%81%E2%80%9C%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 模型二的解题方法：“掐头去尾”法（与司法解释第301条对应）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%BA%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E6%8E%90%E5%A4%B4%E5%8E%BB%E5%B0%BE%E2%80%9D%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E7%AC%AC301%E6%9D%A1%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原理：在模型二下，最终推翻原判决的路径只能是三撤或再审，且二者只能择一行使（留三撤不留再审，留再审不留三撤）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%8C%E8%80%85%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%8B%A9%E4%B8%80%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%95%99%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E4%B8%8D%E7%95%99%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E7%95%99%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E4%B8%8D%E7%95%99%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="操作步骤：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 在草稿纸上从左到右写下：三撤 -案外人对执行标的的异议 -再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9C%A8%E8%8D%89%E7%A8%BF%E7%BA%B8%E4%B8%8A%E4%BB%8E%E5%B7%A6%E5%88%B0%E5%8F%B3%E5%86%99%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%20-%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%20-%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 看题目问的是哪条路，对应“掐头”还是“去尾”：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9C%8B%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E9%97%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E5%93%AA%E6%9D%A1%E8%B7%AF%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E2%80%9C%E6%8E%90%E5%A4%B4%E2%80%9D%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E5%8E%BB%E5%B0%BE%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="走“再审”之路（掐头）：“三撤”被掐掉，路径为：案外人提出执行标的异议 -被驳回/中止后 -只能申请再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B0%E2%80%9C%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E2%80%9D%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF%EF%BC%88%E6%8E%90%E5%A4%B4%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E2%80%9D%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%90%E6%8E%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%20-%E8%A2%AB%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E/%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E5%90%8E%20-%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="走“三撤”之路（去尾）：“再审”被掐掉，路径为：案外人提三撤 -在三撤中可提标的异议求中止执行 -无论异议结果如何，最终都是继续打三撤官司，不能申请再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B0%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E2%80%9D%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%BB%E5%B0%BE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E2%80%9D%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%90%E6%8E%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%20-%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%AF%E6%8F%90%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%20-%E6%97%A0%E8%AE%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E6%89%93%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E5%AE%98%E5%8F%B8%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="【案例群与解题应用】" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E3%80%90%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E7%BE%A4%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="例1（模型一示范）：判陈某还张某20万（判钱），执行时查封了古董花瓶（执行瓶）。案外人安某主张花瓶是自己的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B1%EF%BC%88%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BA%E8%8C%83%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E9%99%88%E6%9F%90%E8%BF%98%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%9020%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%E4%BA%86%E5%8F%A4%E8%91%A3%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AE%89%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%E6%98%AF%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="- 判断：判钱，执行瓶 -模型一。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%93%B6%20-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="- 结论：跟三撤、再审无关。安某只能提案外人对执行标的的异议，异议被处理后，衍生诉讼是执行异议之诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B7%9F%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E3%80%81%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%E3%80%82%E5%AE%89%E6%9F%90%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A2%AB%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A1%8D%E7%94%9F%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="" _mubu_text="" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="例2（模型二“去尾”示范）：判花瓶归张某（判瓶），执行花瓶（执行瓶）。安某主张花瓶是自己的，直接提起了三撤。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B2%EF%BC%88%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%BA%8C%E2%80%9C%E5%8E%BB%E5%B0%BE%E2%80%9D%E7%A4%BA%E8%8C%83%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%E5%BD%92%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%E5%AE%89%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%E6%98%AF%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="- 判断：判瓶，执行瓶 -模型二。安某选了三撤（留头），就要“去尾”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%93%B6%20-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%BA%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%AE%89%E6%9F%90%E9%80%89%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%EF%BC%88%E7%95%99%E5%A4%B4%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E8%A6%81%E2%80%9C%E5%8E%BB%E5%B0%BE%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="- 结论：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="  A. 可在三撤中提供担保或提案外人对执行标的的异议来中止执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20A.%20%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%A5%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="  B. 提出标的异议被驳回后，不能再申请再审，应继续把三撤官司打完。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20B.%20%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A2%AB%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E6%8A%8A%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E5%AE%98%E5%8F%B8%E6%89%93%E5%AE%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="" _mubu_text="" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="例3（模型二“掐头”示范）：判花瓶归张某（判瓶），执行花瓶（执行瓶）。安某主张权利，提出了案外人对执行标的的异议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B3%EF%BC%88%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%BA%8C%E2%80%9C%E6%8E%90%E5%A4%B4%E2%80%9D%E7%A4%BA%E8%8C%83%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%E5%BD%92%E5%BC%A0%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%E5%AE%89%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E4%BA%86%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="- 判断：判瓶，执行瓶 -模型二。安某提案外人异议，要想到达这一步，头（三撤）已经被掐掉了。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%93%B6%20-%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%BA%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%AE%89%E6%9F%90%E6%8F%90%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%83%B3%E5%88%B0%E8%BE%BE%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%B4%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%EF%BC%89%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%90%E6%8E%89%E4%BA%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="- 结论：安某的异议被驳回后，只能申请再审。不能提起执行异议之诉，也不能再提三撤。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E-%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%89%E6%9F%90%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A2%AB%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="执行和解与执行担保【补充考点】" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E3%80%90%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E3%80%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 执行担保" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="流程：被执行人申请，案外人提供担保，经申请人同意，法院可决定暂缓执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="恢复执行：暂缓执行期间内转移/毁损担保财产，或暂缓期满后仍不履行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB/%E6%AF%81%E6%8D%9F%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%9C%9F%E6%BB%A1%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%8D%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="效力：恢复执行后，法院可直接裁定执行担保财产或保证人的财产。无需追加为被执行人，也无需考虑先诉抗辩权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%88%96%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%80%83%E8%99%91%E5%85%88%E8%AF%89%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="与“执行和解中的担保”区分：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E2%80%9C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E2%80%9D%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="执行担保：担保对象是生效判决确定的义务。可直接强制执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%8F%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="和解中的担保：担保对象是和解协议（普通民事合同）。不能直接强制执行，权利人只能就担保纠纷另行起诉担保人，除非担保人明确承诺接受直接强制执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%B0%B1%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%A4%E9%9D%9E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 执行和解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="效果：达成和解协议后，法院中止执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="履行完毕：法院终结执行。如有迟延/瑕疵履行造成损失，可另行起诉赔偿。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%AF%95%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%A6%82%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%9F%E5%BB%B6/%E7%91%95%E7%96%B5%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="拒不履行：申请执行人可择一救济：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%A9%E4%B8%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 申请恢复执行原生效法律文书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 就履行和解协议向执行法院提起诉讼（给付之诉）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B0%B1%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%91%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="衍生诉讼：因执行和解协议本质是普通民事合同，还可衍生出确认和解协议无效、请求撤销和解协议的诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A1%8D%E7%94%9F%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%A0%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AF%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E5%8F%AF%E8%A1%8D%E7%94%9F%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="执行程序知识点总结" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="一、 执行开始" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 执行的启动方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="申请执行（原则）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="申请条件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 明确的权利义务主体。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 明确的给付内容。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="申请时效：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="期间：2年（可中止、中断）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A2%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E3%80%81%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="法院适用：不得依职权主动适用时效，只有义务人主张时效抗辩时才审查。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%E6%97%B6%E6%89%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="起算点：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="1. 法律文书规定履行期限的：从履行期限届满之日起算。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="2. 规定分期履行的：从最后一期履行期限届满之日起算。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%88%86%E6%9C%9F%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%9F%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="3. 未规定履行期限的：从法律文书生效之日起算。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%9C%AA%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="4. 要求履行不作为义务的：从义务人违反不作为义务之日起算。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%E7%AE%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="移送执行（例外）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%88%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="情形（共4类）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E5%85%B14%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 具有给付赡养费、抚养费、抚育费内容的法律文书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%98%E8%B5%A1%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E5%85%BB%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%81%E6%8A%9A%E8%82%B2%E8%B4%B9%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 刑事附带民事的判决、裁定、调解书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E9%99%84%E5%B8%A6%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="3. 民事制裁决定书（如罚款决定书，无申请人）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E5%88%B6%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="4. 环保公益诉讼、检察机关提起的公益诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E7%8E%AF%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%81%E6%A3%80%E5%AF%9F%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 执行的管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="确定管辖法院的规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="法院作出的文书（判决、裁定、调解书等）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="由一审法院或与之同级的被执行财产所在地法院执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%E4%B8%8E%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="非讼程序文书（确认调解协议、实现担保物权、支付令等）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%88%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%81%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E3%80%81%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E4%BB%A4%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="由作出该文书的法院或与之同级的被执行财产所在地法院执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%AF%A5%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%E4%B8%8E%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="其他机构制作的文书（仲裁裁决、公证债权文书）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E8%AF%81%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="管辖法院：被执行人住所地或被执行财产所在地法院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%88%96%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="特别提醒：执行仲裁裁决由中级法院管辖（除了国内仲裁的保全找基层法院）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E6%8F%90%E9%86%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E9%99%A4%E4%BA%86%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%89%BE%E5%9F%BA%E5%B1%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="诉讼管辖与执行管辖的区别与联系" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%B8%8E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%E4%B8%8E%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="共同点：共同管辖与选择管辖的规则相同；由最先立案的法院管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%9B%E7%94%B1%E6%9C%80%E5%85%88%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="不同点（关键）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%88%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 后立案法院的处理：诉讼中是移送管辖，执行中是撤销案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%8B%E6%A1%88%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 管辖权异议的提出时间：诉讼中在提交答辩状期间，执行中在收到执行通知之日起10日内。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E7%8A%B6%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B710%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="3. 异议成立后的处理：诉讼中是移送管辖，执行中是撤销案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="4. 对管辖权异议裁定的救济：诉讼中是上诉，执行中是上级复议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%AF%B9%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="特别强调：执行管辖是法定的，不存在协议管辖、应诉管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E5%BC%BA%E8%B0%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%81%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="二、 执行阻却（导致执行程序暂停或结束的制度）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%98%BB%E5%8D%B4%EF%BC%88%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%9A%82%E5%81%9C%E6%88%96%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E7%9A%84%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 执行担保" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="程序：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 被执行人提出担保请求。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 担保人（如王五）明确担保范围（如100万本息）和期限（如1年）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82100%E4%B8%87%E6%9C%AC%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%89%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%821%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 经申请执行人同意。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%BB%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="4. 法院决定暂缓执行，暂缓执行期限与担保期限一致。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E4%B8%8E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="担保期间的计算：从暂缓执行期限届满之日起计算。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="恢复执行的情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 在暂缓执行期间，债务人或担保人转移、隐匿、变卖、毁损担保财产。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%9C%A8%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E3%80%81%E9%9A%90%E5%8C%BF%E3%80%81%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%96%E3%80%81%E6%AF%81%E6%8D%9F%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 暂缓执行期限届满后，债务人仍不履行义务。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%9A%82%E7%BC%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%B1%8A%E6%BB%A1%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%8D%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="恢复执行后的措施：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="直接执行担保财产或裁定执行担保人的财产。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%88%96%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="无需追加担保人为被执行人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="无需考虑担保人的先诉抗辩权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%80%83%E8%99%91%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%85%88%E8%AF%89%E6%8A%97%E8%BE%A9%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="担保责任的限制：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="范围限制：以承诺的担保范围为限。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E4%B8%BA%E9%99%90%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="期间限制：只在担保期间内承担责任，逾期则免责。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E5%9C%A8%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%86%85%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E5%88%99%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="担保人追偿：担保人承担责任后，可另行起诉向被执行人追偿。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%BD%E5%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%90%91%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%BD%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 执行和解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="核心原则：执行中禁止法院调解，但当事人可自行达成和解协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法律后果：达成和解后，法院应裁定中止执行，等待协议履行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="和解后的两种结局：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E7%BB%93%E5%B1%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="结局一：和解协议履行完毕" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E5%B1%80%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%AF%95%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="法院裁定执行终结。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="若存在迟延履行、瑕疵履行造成损失的，权利人可另行起诉赔偿。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%8B%A5%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%9F%E5%BB%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%81%E7%91%95%E7%96%B5%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="结局二：义务人拒不履行和解协议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E5%B1%80%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="权利人可二选一：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BA%8C%E9%80%89%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="1. 申请恢复对原生效法律文书的执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E5%AF%B9%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="2. 就执行和解协议提起诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%B0%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
              <outline text="衍生的其他诉讼：因和解协议被视为普通民事合同，当事人或利害关系人还可提起：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A1%8D%E7%94%9F%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%A0%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E8%A2%AB%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%98%E5%8F%AF%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 起诉请求确认和解协议无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 起诉请求撤销和解协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="和解协议的管辖：以上所有与执行和解相关的诉讼，均由执行法院管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%8E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%9D%87%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="和解协议中的担保：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="性质：普通民事担保。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="执行：恢复执行后，不能直接执行担保财产/人，除非担保人明确承诺接受强制执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7/%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%A4%E9%9D%9E%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="救济：权利人需就担保纠纷另行起诉，或符合条件时申请实现担保物权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E9%9C%80%E5%B0%B1%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E6%97%B6%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="三、 执行救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 两种异议的比较" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%AF%94%E8%BE%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="| 比较项 | 对执行行为的异议 | 案外人对执行标的的异议 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 提出主体 | 当事人、利害关系人（均可） | 案外人 |
| 核心区别 | 仅认为法院执行行为/程序违法，无实体权利主张 | 对执行标的主张实体权利 |
| 救济方式理由 | 不解决实体纠纷，故在执行程序内解决 | 产生实体纠纷，故需通过诉讼程序解决 |
| 最终救济手段 | 上级复议 | 原判有错→申请再审与原判无关→执行异议之诉 |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%AF%94%E8%BE%83%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%9D%87%E5%8F%AF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3Cb%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA/%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%3Cb%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%95%85%E5%9C%A8%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%86%85%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%95%85%E9%9C%80%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%224%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E6%89%8B%E6%AE%B5%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%E2%86%92%3Cb%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/b%3E%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%E2%86%92%3Cb%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 案外人救济模型分析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="核心分析思路：先看案外人对什么主张权利（如：房子），再看执行案件的“判”与“执行”是否相同。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%88%E7%9C%8B%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E7%9C%8B%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E5%88%A4%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%8E%E2%80%9C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E2%80%9D%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="模型一：判钱执行房（判的与执行的不一样）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E9%92%B1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="特征：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="原判：判还钱100万（判钱）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E8%BF%98%E9%92%B1100%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="执行：因没钱而执行房子（执行房）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%A0%E6%B2%A1%E9%92%B1%E8%80%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="案外人（王五）的救济路径：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="能否提三撤/再审？：不能。只想保住房，不想推翻还钱的判决，判决与我无关。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%83%BD%E5%90%A6%E6%8F%90%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4/%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%8F%AA%E6%83%B3%E4%BF%9D%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%83%B3%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%E8%BF%98%E9%92%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%8E%E6%88%91%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="只能提案外人对执行标的的异议：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="异议成立 → 裁定中止对房屋的执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="异议驳回 → 裁定驳回后，因“判钱执行房”（原判无关），必须走执行异议之诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E2%80%9C%E5%88%A4%E9%92%B1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%BF%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E8%B5%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                    <outline text="中止后：由申请执行人（张三） 起诉案外人（王五），为申请人执行异议之诉（属消极确认之诉）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%B1%9E%E6%B6%88%E6%9E%81%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                    <outline text="驳回后：由案外人（王五） 起诉申请执行人（张三），为案外人执行异议之诉（属积极确认之诉）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%90%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%B1%9E%E7%A7%AF%E6%9E%81%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  </outline>
                </outline>
              </outline>
              <outline text="证明责任：由案外人（王五） 就“对执行标的有足以排除执行的民事权益”承担证明责任。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%B0%B1%E2%80%9C%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E8%B6%B3%E4%BB%A5%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%9D%83%E7%9B%8A%E2%80%9D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="模型二：判房执行房（判的与执行的一样）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E6%88%BF%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="特征：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="原判：判房子归张三所有（判房）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%BD%92%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="执行：执行该房屋（执行房，侵犯王五权利）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%A5%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%EF%BC%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%B5%E7%8A%AF%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="案外人（王五）的救济路径（两条路可走其一）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%A4%E6%9D%A1%E8%B7%AF%E5%8F%AF%E8%B5%B0%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="路径一：直接提第三人撤销之诉" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8F%90%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="目的：撤销原错误判决（判房那个判决）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8E%9F%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E6%88%BF%E9%82%A3%E4%B8%AA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="若想中止执行，可在三撤中提案外人对执行标的的异议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%8B%A5%E6%83%B3%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%89%E6%92%A4%E4%B8%AD%E6%8F%90%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="注意：此时不能再申请再审，避免程序冲突。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="路径二：提案外人对执行标的的异议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E6%8F%90%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="异议成立 → 中止对房屋的执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="异议驳回 → 裁定驳回后，因“判房执行房”（原判有错），必须申请再审。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E2%80%9C%E5%88%A4%E6%88%BF%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%BF%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E6%9C%89%E9%94%99%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="注意：这条路不能再提第三人撤销之诉或执行异议之诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%99%E6%9D%A1%E8%B7%AF%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E6%8F%90%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E6%88%96%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="四、 特殊执行措施" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%20%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 执行中变更、追加被执行人" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E3%80%81%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="基本原理：根据实体法规定，谁对被执行债务应承担责任，就追加谁。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%81%E5%AF%B9%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E5%BA%94%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E8%B0%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="常见情形举例：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%BE%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="自然人死亡/宣告死亡 → 追加遗产管理人、继承人等（在遗产范围内）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1/%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%88%E5%9C%A8%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%86%85%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="法人/非法人组织合并/分立 → 追加合并/分立后的组织。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA/%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6/%E5%88%86%E7%AB%8B%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6/%E5%88%86%E7%AB%8B%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="个人独资企业不能偿债 → 追加出资人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%8B%AC%E8%B5%84%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%81%BF%E5%80%BA%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="（重点）合伙企业不能偿债：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%EF%BC%88%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%81%BF%E5%80%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="→ 追加普通合伙人（无条件）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%86%92%20%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="→ 追加未足额出资/抽逃出资的有限合伙人（在未出资/抽逃范围内）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E2%86%92%20%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E8%B6%B3%E9%A2%9D%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84/%E6%8A%BD%E9%80%83%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AA%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84/%E6%8A%BD%E9%80%83%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%86%85%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="法人不能偿债 → 追加未足额出资/抽逃出资的股东（在未出资/抽逃范围内）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%81%BF%E5%80%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E8%B6%B3%E9%A2%9D%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84/%E6%8A%BD%E9%80%83%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84%E7%9A%84%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AA%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84/%E6%8A%BD%E9%80%83%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%86%85%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="一人公司不能偿债 → 股东不能证明财产独立，可追加股东对公司债务承担连带责任。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%81%BF%E5%80%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="对追加/变更裁定的救济（核心逻辑）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0/%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="核心判断标准：被追加人的责任确定，是否仅凭“身份”即可，还是需要额外解决“实体条件”？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E4%BB%85%E5%87%AD%E2%80%9C%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E2%80%9D%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E2%80%9C%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="情形一：仅凭“身份”即担责" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E5%87%AD%E2%80%9C%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E2%80%9D%E5%8D%B3%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="逻辑：只看你有没有这个身份（如：普通合伙人、合并分立后的新法人、个人独资企业出资人），无需解决实体争议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E7%9C%8B%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%89%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%86%E7%AB%8B%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B0%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%8B%AC%E8%B5%84%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="救济：对裁定不服，向上级法院申请复议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="情形二：需要“身份”+“实体条件”才担责" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E2%80%9C%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E2%80%9D+%E2%80%9C%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E2%80%9D%E6%89%8D%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="逻辑：不仅要看身份（如：有限合伙人、股东），还必须确认是否满足“未足额出资/抽逃出资/财产混同”等实体条件，这产生了实体争议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%85%E8%A6%81%E7%9C%8B%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%E2%80%9C%E6%9C%AA%E8%B6%B3%E9%A2%9D%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84/%E6%8A%BD%E9%80%83%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84/%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%B7%B7%E5%90%8C%E2%80%9D%E7%AD%89%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%86%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="救济：对裁定不服，另行起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="合伙企业案例精讲：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E7%B2%BE%E8%AE%B2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="追加普通合伙人→ 凭身份即担责 → 上级复议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E2%86%92%20%E5%87%AD%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%8D%B3%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="追加未足额出资/抽逃出资的有限合伙人 → 凭身份+实体条件才担责 → 另行起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E8%B6%B3%E9%A2%9D%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84/%E6%8A%BD%E9%80%83%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%87%AD%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD+%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E6%89%8D%E6%8B%85%E8%B4%A3%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 执行中的分配制度（三大制度）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="（1）参与分配" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%881%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="适用对象：除法人之外的自然人或非法人组织。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%99%A4%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="适用前提：被执行人财产不能清偿所有债务。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%B8%85%E5%81%BF%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="核心原则：平等保护，按比例清偿。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B9%B3%E7%AD%89%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%E6%B8%85%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="优先受偿权：不丧失，可直接参加分配并主张优先受偿。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%E5%8F%97%E5%81%BF%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%A7%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E5%B9%B6%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%E5%8F%97%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="分配程序：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 制作方案：法院制作财产分配方案。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 送达：送达所有债权人及债务人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="3. 无异议：按方案分配。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%89%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="4. 有人提异议（如甲）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%94%B2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="法院将甲的异议送交其他未提异议的人（乙、丙、丁、张三）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B0%86%E7%94%B2%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E9%80%81%E4%BA%A4%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%AA%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%99%E3%80%81%E4%B8%99%E3%80%81%E4%B8%81%E3%80%81%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="无人反对：按甲的异议修改方案后分配。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%89%E7%94%B2%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%E5%90%8E%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="有人反对（如丁）：告知异议人（甲）以反对人（丁）为被告，提起分配方案异议之诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%81%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B2%EF%BC%89%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%81%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="（2）执行转破产" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%BD%AC%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="适用对象：企业法人（资不抵债，符合破产条件）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%B5%84%E4%B8%8D%E6%8A%B5%E5%80%BA%EF%BC%8C%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="启动条件：经申请执行人之一或被执行人同意。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="操作流程：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="执行法院（A区）裁定中止执行，将案件移送债务人住所地法院（B区）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88A%E5%8C%BA%EF%BC%89%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88B%E5%8C%BA%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="两种结果：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="转成功（B区法院受理破产）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BD%AC%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%EF%BC%88B%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="A区法院已采取的保全措施应解除。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B7%B2%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="B区法院宣告破产后，A区法院裁定终结执行，由B区法院按破产程序分配。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EB%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8CA%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1B%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8C%89%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="转失败（B区法院不受理）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BD%AC%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%EF%BC%88B%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="A区法院应恢复执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3EA%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="分配规则：按查封、扣押、冻结的先后顺序清偿（“先到先得”）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%89%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%E3%80%81%E6%89%A3%E6%8A%BC%E3%80%81%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%E7%9A%84%E5%85%88%E5%90%8E%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%E6%B8%85%E5%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E2%80%9C%E5%85%88%E5%88%B0%E5%85%88%E5%BE%97%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="制度意义理解：通过“先到先得”的规则，让排序靠后、分不到钱的债权人主动同意“转破产”，从而激活破产程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E2%80%9C%E5%85%88%E5%88%B0%E5%85%88%E5%BE%97%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A9%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F%E9%9D%A0%E5%90%8E%E3%80%81%E5%88%86%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E9%92%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E2%80%9C%E8%BD%AC%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8E%E8%80%8C%E6%BF%80%E6%B4%BB%E7%A0%B4%E4%BA%A7%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="（3）执行竞合" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%883%EF%BC%89%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%AB%9E%E5%90%88%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="适用前提：被执行人财产足以清偿所有债务，但债权人都盯上某一无法足额清偿所有人的特定标的物。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E8%B6%B3%E4%BB%A5%E6%B8%85%E5%81%BF%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%BD%E7%9B%AF%E4%B8%8A%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%B6%B3%E9%A2%9D%E6%B8%85%E5%81%BF%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E5%AE%9A%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="分配规则（三句话）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%A5%E8%AF%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 物权对抗债权：基于所有权、担保物权等享有的债权，优先于普通金钱债权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E5%AF%B9%E6%8A%97%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E3%80%81%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E7%AD%89%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%89%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%E4%BA%8E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E9%87%91%E9%92%B1%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 登记的对抗没登记的：查封、扣押、冻结的登记是对抗要件，非生效要件。没办理登记的，不得对抗已办理登记的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E6%8A%97%E6%B2%A1%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%E3%80%81%E6%89%A3%E6%8A%BC%E3%80%81%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%8A%97%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%9D%9E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%E6%B2%A1%E5%8A%9E%E7%90%86%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%AF%B9%E6%8A%97%E5%B7%B2%E5%8A%9E%E7%90%86%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="3. 先下手为强：首封优先于轮候查封，按查封的先后顺序受偿。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%88%E4%B8%8B%E6%89%8B%E4%B8%BA%E5%BC%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%A6%96%E5%B0%81%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%E4%BA%8E%E8%BD%AE%E5%80%99%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%E7%9A%84%E5%85%88%E5%90%8E%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%E5%8F%97%E5%81%BF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 对被执行人到期债权的执行（代位申请执行）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%AF%B9%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%B0%E6%9C%9F%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%A3%E4%BD%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="程序：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 申请执行人或被执行人提出申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 法院向第三人（如王五）发出履行到期债务的通知。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%91%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%88%B0%E6%9C%9F%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="通知的效力及第三人的应对：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E5%8F%8A%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%94%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="禁止向被执行人清偿：王五收到通知后，不得向李四偿债，否则构成妨害执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E5%90%91%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%B8%85%E5%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%90%91%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%81%BF%E5%80%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E5%A6%A8%E5%AE%B3%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="违反后果：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="程序上：可罚款、拘留；构成犯罪的追究刑事责任。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%81%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%EF%BC%9B%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E7%8A%AF%E7%BD%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%BD%E7%A9%B6%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="实体上：导致财产无法追回的，王五在无法追回的范围内与被执行人承担连带清偿责任。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%BF%BD%E5%9B%9E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E5%9C%A8%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%BF%BD%E5%9B%9E%E7%9A%84%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%86%85%E4%B8%8E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9E%E5%B8%A6%E6%B8%85%E5%81%BF%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="第三人（王五）的三种选择：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 主动履行：15天内向申请执行人（张三）履行债务。程序结束。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A15%E5%A4%A9%E5%86%85%E5%90%91%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E3%80%82%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 提出异议：15天内提出异议，法院对异议不审查，且不得对王五强制执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A15%E5%A4%A9%E5%86%85%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%AF%B9%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="不构成异议的情形：A. 提出与申请人无直接债权债务关系。B. 只提出无履行能力、要求延缓或变更履行方式。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9AA.%20%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%8E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A0%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%82B.%20%E5%8F%AA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%97%A0%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%81%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%BB%B6%E7%BC%93%E6%88%96%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="对生效文书确定的债权提异议：不予支持。如需推翻，应通过再审、撤裁等法定程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E3%80%82%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E6%8E%A8%E7%BF%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%86%8D%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E6%92%A4%E8%A3%81%E7%AD%89%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="3. 既不履行也不提异议：15天后，法院可裁定对王五强制执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A15%E5%A4%A9%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%AF%B9%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="禁止再代位：执行王五时，不得再执行王五的债务人（如赵六），代位申请执行只能代位一次。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E5%86%8D%E4%BB%A3%E4%BD%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%86%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E8%B5%B5%E5%85%AD%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A3%E4%BD%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%A3%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="4. 对共有物的执行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B1%E6%9C%89%E7%89%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="能否查封：可以（因为其中有被执行人的份额）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%83%BD%E5%90%A6%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%89%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%BD%E9%A2%9D%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="核心问题：析产分割（确定各自的份额）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9E%90%E4%BA%A7%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%84%E8%87%AA%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%BD%E9%A2%9D%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="析产方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9E%90%E4%BA%A7%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 协议分割：共有人（李四、王五）之间协议，但须经申请执行人（张三）同意后方有效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%B1%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E9%A1%BB%E7%BB%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%8E%E6%96%B9%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 诉讼分割：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="共有人（李四、王五）可提起，但积极性不高。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B1%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%AF%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E7%A7%AF%E6%9E%81%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%8D%E9%AB%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="申请执行人（张三）有积极性，可代位提起析产诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E6%9C%89%E7%A7%AF%E6%9E%81%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%A3%E4%BD%8D%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E6%9E%90%E4%BA%A7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="执行状态：析产诉讼期间，执行应中止，等待审理结果。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9E%90%E4%BA%A7%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="管辖补充：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="不由执行法院管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="按物权纠纷（共有纠纷）确定管辖：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%89%E7%89%A9%E6%9D%83%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%88%E5%85%B1%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%89%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 共有物中有不动产的 → 不动产所在地法院专属管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%85%B1%E6%9C%89%E7%89%A9%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="2. 共有的全是动产 → 被告住所地法院管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%85%B1%E6%9C%89%E7%9A%84%E5%85%A8%E6%98%AF%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%A7%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="5. 对特定物的执行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E5%AF%B9%E7%89%B9%E5%AE%9A%E7%89%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="核心规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 必须执行原物：不能执行其他财产或等价值的钱。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8E%9F%E7%89%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%88%96%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC%E7%9A%84%E9%92%B1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 原物毁损灭失（含法律上执行不能）的处理：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%89%A9%E6%AF%81%E6%8D%9F%E7%81%AD%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%88%E5%90%AB%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E4%B8%8A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%89%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="折价赔偿（这是实体纠纷，执行程序不解决）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8A%98%E4%BB%B7%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="解决方案：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="协商一致：双方就折价赔偿金额达成协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%B0%B1%E6%8A%98%E4%BB%B7%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E9%87%91%E9%A2%9D%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="协商不成：法院裁定终结执行，并告知当事人就折价赔偿问题另行起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8D%8F%E5%95%86%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E5%91%8A%E7%9F%A5%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%B0%B1%E6%8A%98%E4%BB%B7%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="案例提示：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="名画撕毁案：画已不存在，应终结执行，当事人自行就赔偿纠纷另诉。法院不能直接裁定赔偿金额。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8D%E7%94%BB%E6%92%95%E6%AF%81%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%BB%E5%B7%B2%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%B0%B1%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%8F%A6%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E9%87%91%E9%A2%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="古董花瓶执行和解案：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A4%E8%91%A3%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="达成“赔60万”的和解协议后，义务人反悔。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E2%80%9C%E8%B5%9460%E4%B8%87%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="因原物（花瓶）已碎，不能恢复对“交付原物”这一原判决的执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%A0%E5%8E%9F%E7%89%A9%EF%BC%88%E8%8A%B1%E7%93%B6%EF%BC%89%E5%B7%B2%E7%A2%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E5%AF%B9%E2%80%9C%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E5%8E%9F%E7%89%A9%E2%80%9D%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="权利人唯一的救济途径是：就执行和解协议另行起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="6. 对保留所有权买卖合同标的物的执行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E6.%20%E5%AF%B9%E4%BF%9D%E7%95%99%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="基础模型：张三（卖方，保留所有权）将手表以10万元卖给李四（买方，已付4万，占有手表）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%96%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E4%BF%9D%E7%95%99%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%89%E5%B0%86%E6%89%8B%E8%A1%A8%E4%BB%A510%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E5%8D%96%E7%BB%99%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%B0%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%B2%E4%BB%984%E4%B8%87%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%A0%E6%9C%89%E6%89%8B%E8%A1%A8%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="情形一：卖方的债权人（王五）申请执行张三" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E5%8D%96%E6%96%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="能否查封手表：能（李四书面确认该财产属于张三所有）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%83%BD%E5%90%A6%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%E6%89%8B%E8%A1%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%88%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%A5%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="买受人（李四）的救济：李四想继续要手表，可直接向法院支付剩余价款（6万元），法院收款后应解除查封。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%B0%E5%8F%97%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E6%83%B3%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E8%A6%81%E6%89%8B%E8%A1%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E5%89%A9%E4%BD%99%E4%BB%B7%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%886%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%94%B6%E6%AC%BE%E5%90%8E%E5%BA%94%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="情形二：买方的债权人（赵六）申请执行李四" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%B0%E6%96%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E8%B5%B5%E5%85%AD%EF%BC%89%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="能否查封手表：能（该手表为被执行人李四占有）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%83%BD%E5%90%A6%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%81%E6%89%8B%E8%A1%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%A5%E6%89%8B%E8%A1%A8%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E5%8D%A0%E6%9C%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="出卖人（张三）的救济：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%87%BA%E5%8D%96%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="1. 想要钱（剩余价款）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%B3%E8%A6%81%E9%92%B1%EF%BC%88%E5%89%A9%E4%BD%99%E4%BB%B7%E6%AC%BE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="保留所有权已登记：具有对抗效力，可从手表变价款中优先受偿剩余价款。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BF%9D%E7%95%99%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E5%B7%B2%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%AF%B9%E6%8A%97%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%8E%E6%89%8B%E8%A1%A8%E5%8F%98%E4%BB%B7%E6%AC%BE%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%E5%8F%97%E5%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%89%A9%E4%BD%99%E4%BB%B7%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="保留所有权未登记：不能优先受偿，只能主张普通债权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BF%9D%E7%95%99%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E6%9C%AA%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%E5%8F%97%E5%81%BF%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
                <outline text="2. 想要回手表（主张取回）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%B3%E8%A6%81%E5%9B%9E%E6%89%8B%E8%A1%A8%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%8F%96%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="途径：提出案外人对执行标的的异议（张三作为案外人，对手表这一执行标的主张所有权）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%8B%E8%A1%A8%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%80%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="后续程序（与前述救济模型融合）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E5%89%8D%E8%BF%B0%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                    <outline text="该案的裁判基础是“判钱执行手表”（与“判钱执行房”模型一样），属于“原判无关”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%A5%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E5%88%A4%E9%92%B1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%89%8B%E8%A1%A8%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E2%80%9C%E5%88%A4%E9%92%B1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%88%BF%E2%80%9D%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B7%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E2%80%9C%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%A4%E6%97%A0%E5%85%B3%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                    <outline text="异议被驳回后，张三可提起案外人执行异议之诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E8%A2%AB%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%8F%AF%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  </outline>
                </outline>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="7. 对赔礼道歉、恢复名誉等判决的执行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E7.%20%E5%AF%B9%E8%B5%94%E7%A4%BC%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89%E3%80%81%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E5%90%8D%E8%AA%89%E7%AD%89%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="执行措施：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 替代履行：法院将判决书主要内容在媒体上公告，费用由被执行人承担，拒不承担的强制执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9B%BF%E4%BB%A3%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B0%86%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%9C%A8%E5%AA%92%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%E7%94%B1%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%EF%BC%8C%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 迟延履行责任：赔礼道歉属行为义务，迟延履行的，应支付迟延履行金。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9F%E5%BB%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%B5%94%E7%A4%BC%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89%E5%B1%9E%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9F%E5%BB%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9F%E5%BB%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E9%87%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 妨害执行的处罚：有能力履行而拒不履行，构成妨害执行，可采取罚款、拘留措施，构成犯罪的追究刑事责任。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A6%A8%E5%AE%B3%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%BD%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E8%80%8C%E6%8B%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E5%A6%A8%E5%AE%B3%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E9%87%87%E5%8F%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%81%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%EF%BC%8C%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E7%8A%AF%E7%BD%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%BD%E7%A9%B6%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="8. 强制支付迟延履行期间债务利息/迟延履行金" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E8.%20%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E8%BF%9F%E5%BB%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E5%88%A9%E6%81%AF/%E8%BF%9F%E5%BB%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E9%87%91%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="适用前提：义务人在生效法律文书确定的履行期限内未履行义务。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%85%E6%9C%AA%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="种类：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A7%8D%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 迟延履行金钱义务：加倍计算迟延履行期间的债务利息。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9F%E5%BB%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E9%87%91%E9%92%B1%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%8D%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%BF%9F%E5%BB%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E5%88%A9%E6%81%AF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 迟延履行行为义务：支付迟延履行金。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9F%E5%BB%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9F%E5%BB%B6%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E9%87%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="计算标准：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="造成损失的：双倍补偿损失。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8C%E5%80%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%A1%A5%E5%81%BF%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="未造成损失的：由法院酌情确定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AA%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%85%8C%E6%83%85%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题26 涉外民事诉讼程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9826%20%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、 涉外民事诉讼的基本原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%20%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 适用我国民事诉讼法原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B3%95%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="只要在中国境内进行民事诉讼，必须适用中国民事诉讼法。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%A2%83%E5%86%85%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B3%95%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 遵守国际条约原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%81%B5%E5%AE%88%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E6%9D%A1%E7%BA%A6%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="3. 使用我国通用语言文字原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="对法院的要求：法官主持庭审、发布诉讼文书（判决书等），必须使用中国通用语言文字。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E4%B8%BB%E6%8C%81%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%88%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="对国外当事人的保障：当事人如果看不懂、听不明白，要求提供翻译的，法院可以提供。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E7%9C%8B%E4%B8%8D%E6%87%82%E3%80%81%E5%90%AC%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E7%99%BD%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="翻译费用：由提出要求的当事人自行承担。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91%E8%B4%B9%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="重点注意：翻译件上不得加盖人民法院印章，否则等同于以外文发布判决书，不被允许。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%8A%A0%E7%9B%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8D%B0%E7%AB%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E7%AD%89%E5%90%8C%E4%BA%8E%E4%BB%A5%E5%A4%96%E6%96%87%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%A2%AB%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 委托中国律师代理诉讼原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心要义：外国人、无国籍人、外国企业组织在我国起诉应诉，如需委托律师，只能委托中国律师。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E6%97%A0%E5%9B%BD%E7%B1%8D%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%9C%A8%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="禁止的对象：仅禁止外国律师的律师身份。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E7%9A%84%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="不禁止的对象：外国人以非律师身份担任代理人；外国律师以非律师身份担任代理人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%A5%E9%9D%9E%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9B%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E4%BB%A5%E9%9D%9E%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="案例深化 (金某与全某案)：全某（外国人）可委托其配偶金某（外国人）为非律师代理人，不允许外国律师以律师身份参与。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E6%B7%B1%E5%8C%96%20(%E9%87%91%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%A8%E6%9F%90%E6%A1%88)%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%A8%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%AF%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E5%85%B6%E9%85%8D%E5%81%B6%E9%87%91%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%9E%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E4%BB%A5%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%88%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、 涉外民事诉讼的管辖 (核心重点)" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%20%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%20(%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9)%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="首要解决问题：案件应归中国法院管，还是外国法院管。归中国哪个具体法院管，按国内管辖规则确定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A6%96%E8%A6%81%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%92%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AE%A1%E3%80%82%E5%BD%92%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="1. 专属管辖 (绝对排他，不讨论平行诉讼)" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%20(%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E6%8E%92%E4%BB%96%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC)%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="违反后果：外国法院违反我国专属管辖作出的判决、裁定，我国法院不予承认和执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%81%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E5%92%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="三类情形（“3+1-2”为新增）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%89%E7%B1%BB%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E2%80%9C3+1-2%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%BA%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="（传统重点）中外合资、合作、勘探合同纠纷：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BC%A0%E7%BB%9F%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%96%E5%90%88%E8%B5%84%E3%80%81%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C%E3%80%81%E5%8B%98%E6%8E%A2%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="主体：仅限于该企业内部的中方和外方股东之间的纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E9%99%90%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%A5%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%96%E6%96%B9%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="案例辨析：中外合资企业“丙公司”的内部股东甲（中）与乙（外）之间的出资纠纷，由其专属管辖。若“丙公司”与外部公司“丁公司”的合同纠纷，不在此列。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%96%E5%90%88%E8%B5%84%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E7%94%B2%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8E%E4%B9%99%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%84%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%99%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%8E%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%81%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%9C%A8%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="（新增1）境内设立组织的内部纠纷：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E1%EF%BC%89%E5%A2%83%E5%86%85%E8%AE%BE%E7%AB%8B%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="适用范围：在中国境内设立的法人或其他组织，其设立、解散、清算以及该组织作出的决议效力等纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%A2%83%E5%86%85%E8%AE%BE%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%BE%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%95%A3%E3%80%81%E6%B8%85%E7%AE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E8%AF%A5%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%B3%E8%AE%AE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%89%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="立法缘由：中国境内的组织，其存续、清算涉及中国税款、劳动者工资、消费者赔偿等问题，外国法院无权干涉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%BC%98%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%A2%83%E5%86%85%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E5%AD%98%E7%BB%AD%E3%80%81%E6%B8%85%E7%AE%97%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%A8%8E%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%81%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E8%80%85%E5%B7%A5%E8%B5%84%E3%80%81%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E8%80%85%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF%E7%AD%89%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%E5%B9%B2%E6%B6%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="（新增2）中国授予的知识产权效力纠纷：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E2%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%8E%88%E4%BA%88%E7%9A%84%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E4%BA%A7%E6%9D%83%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="适用范围：与在中国领域内审查授予的知识产权的有效性有关的纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E5%86%85%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E6%8E%88%E4%BA%88%E7%9A%84%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E4%BA%A7%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="立法缘由：中国知识产权局授予的权利，其有效无效只能由中国法院判定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E7%BC%98%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E4%BA%A7%E6%9D%83%E5%B1%80%E6%8E%88%E4%BA%88%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 协议管辖 (尊重当事人书面选择)" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%20(%E5%B0%8A%E9%87%8D%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9)%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="协议选择中国法院管辖：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="唯一要求：书面协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="不要求：不要求纠纷与中国有实际联系。只要当事人信得过中国法院，中国法院就受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%BF%A1%E5%BE%97%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B0%B1%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="协议选择外国法院管辖（排他管辖协议）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E6%8E%92%E4%BB%96%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="按约管辖：不违反专属管辖、不涉及中国主权/安全/公共利益的，当事人有排他管辖协议的，应去外国法院，中国法院不受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%89%E7%BA%A6%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%BB%E6%9D%83/%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%92%E4%BB%96%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%8E%BB%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="核心概念辨析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="“排他”的理解（不读言下之意）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E6%8E%92%E4%BB%96%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E8%AF%BB%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8B%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="协议原文：“因本合同纠纷，可由美国法院管辖。” → 是排他管辖协议。理由：协议明确选择了管辖法院，未提及他国法院有管辖权，即视为排他。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%8E%9F%E6%96%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%9B%A0%E6%9C%AC%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B1%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E2%80%9D%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8E%92%E4%BB%96%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E4%BA%86%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AA%E6%8F%90%E5%8F%8A%E4%BB%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%8E%92%E4%BB%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="文化背景解释：法律解释上，不对外国人适用“言下之意”，一切以书面明确表达为准。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AF%B9%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E2%80%9C%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8B%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%8F%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%88%87%E4%BB%A5%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E4%B8%BA%E5%87%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="“不对称管辖协议”的效力：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AF%B9%E7%A7%B0%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="定义：协议约定只约束一方，另一方不受约束（如：甲方诉乙方，由美国法院管；但乙方诉甲方，可不受此限）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%AA%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%9B%E4%BD%86%E4%B9%99%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%89%E7%94%B2%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E6%AD%A4%E9%99%90%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="效力：有效，因其是当事人真实意思表示。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E5%85%B6%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="生效前提：必须由当事人明确、具体地约定。不允许通过推定、解读的方式得出不对称的意思。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E3%80%81%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E5%9C%B0%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E6%8E%A8%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%BE%97%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%AF%B9%E7%A7%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案例辨析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                  <outline text="1. 协议约定：“甲方起诉乙方，应由美国法院管辖。” → 普通排他协议（未明确授权乙方可去其他法院，对双方都约束）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B2%E6%96%B9%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E7%94%B1%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E2%80%9D%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%8E%92%E4%BB%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E4%B9%99%E6%96%B9%E5%8F%AF%E5%8E%BB%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E9%83%BD%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                  <outline text="2. 协议约定：“甲方起诉乙方，由美国法院管辖。而乙方起诉甲方，可不受前款约束/可向其他有管辖权的法院起诉。” → 有效的不对称管辖协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B2%E6%96%B9%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%99%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%E8%80%8C%E4%B9%99%E6%96%B9%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%94%B2%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E5%89%8D%E6%AC%BE%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F/%E5%8F%AF%E5%90%91%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E2%80%9D%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%AF%B9%E7%A7%B0%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                </outline>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 牵连管辖 (沾边就管)" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E7%89%B5%E8%BF%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%20(%E6%B2%BE%E8%BE%B9%E5%B0%B1%E7%AE%A1)%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="适用条件：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 纠纷是除身份关系外的诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%98%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%99%A4%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 被告在中国境内没有住所。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%A2%83%E5%86%85%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="连接点：只要合同签订地、履行地、诉讼标的物所在地、可供扣押财产所在地、侵权行为地、代表机构住所地中，任一地点在中国，该地法院即可管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E5%8F%AF%E4%BE%9B%E6%89%A3%E6%8A%BC%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%BB%E4%B8%80%E5%9C%B0%E7%82%B9%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E5%9C%B0%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="兜底条款：涉外民事纠纷与中国存在其他适当联系的，也可由人民法院管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%9C%E5%BA%95%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E9%80%82%E5%BD%93%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 应诉管辖 (默示协议管辖)" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%20(%E9%BB%98%E7%A4%BA%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96)%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="构成要件：当事人未提管辖权异议，并应诉答辩或提起反诉，即视为承认中国法院有管辖权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AA%E6%8F%90%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E6%88%96%E6%8F%90%E8%B5%B7%E5%8F%8D%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 平行诉讼 (管辖权重叠时的处理)" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%20(%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E6%97%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86)%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心概念：一个案件，中国法院和外国法院都有管辖权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="先决审查（三种情况不讨论平行诉讼）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%88%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 专属管辖不讨论：属于中国法院专属管辖的，不存在平行诉讼问题。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 协议管辖不讨论：当事人订立了有效排他管辖协议的，不存在平行诉讼问题。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%A2%E7%AB%8B%E4%BA%86%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E6%8E%92%E4%BB%96%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 主权/安全/公共利益不讨论：涉及前述事项的，不存在平行诉讼问题。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E6%9D%83/%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%89%8D%E8%BF%B0%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="平行诉讼的处理原则（司法主权+方便当事人）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%BB%E6%9D%83+%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="原则一：保障国家司法主权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%BB%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="只要中国法院有管辖权，当事人来起诉就应当受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%A5%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E5%B0%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="外国法院是否先受理，不影响中国法院依法受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%85%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E6%B3%95%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="原则二：尽可能方便当事人 (受理后)" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%BD%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%20(%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E)%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="A. 不方便法院原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EA.%20%E4%B8%8D%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="适用情形：当事人提出管辖权异议，主张中国法院审理案件明显不方便，而外国法院审理明显更方便。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%8E%E6%98%BE%E4%B8%8D%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%8E%E6%98%BE%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="法院操作：可裁定驳回起诉，方便当事人去外国法院诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8E%BB%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="启动主体：必须依当事人申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BE%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="B. 先受理法院规则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EB.%20%E5%85%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="适用情形：中外法院差不多方便，当事人书面申请，主张外国法院已先受理，为免两头应诉不便。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B7%AE%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%9A%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B7%B2%E5%85%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%8D%E4%B8%A4%E5%A4%B4%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%8D%E4%BE%BF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="法院操作：可裁定诉讼中止。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="启动主体：必须依当事人书面申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BE%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="兜底保障：当事人去外国法院后发现“不靠谱”（如该受理不受理、无故拖延、不合理审限内未审结），重返中国法院起诉或申请恢复审理的，中国法院应予受理或恢复审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%9C%E5%BA%95%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8E%BB%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8D%E9%9D%A0%E8%B0%B1%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E8%AF%A5%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E3%80%81%E6%97%A0%E6%95%85%E6%8B%96%E5%BB%B6%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%E5%86%85%E6%9C%AA%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E9%87%8D%E8%BF%94%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E6%88%96%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E6%88%96%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、 期间 (特殊规定)" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%20%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%20(%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A)%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="两大特殊规则（重点区分适用对象） ：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%A4%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%89%20%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 特殊期间（30天）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8830%E5%A4%A9%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="适用对象：在中国境内没有住所的当事人。（只看住所，不看国籍）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%A2%83%E5%86%85%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AA%E7%9C%8B%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%9C%8B%E5%9B%BD%E7%B1%8D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="三大期间：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="答辩期：收到副本起30天。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%E8%B5%B730%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="上诉期：对判决裁定上诉期为30天。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%BA30%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="对上诉状的答辩期：收到上诉状副本后30天。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E7%9A%84%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%A9%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%8A%B6%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%E5%90%8E30%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="延期：可申请延期，是否准许，由法院决定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BB%B6%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%BB%B6%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%87%86%E8%AE%B8%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 不受审限限制：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="适用对象：所有涉外民事案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="内容：不受一审、二审审限的限制。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%E7%9A%84%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="案例辨析 (张三太郎与李四)：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%20(%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%AA%E9%83%8E%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B)%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="住中国的日本人张三太郎：在中国有住所，适用国内15天上诉期。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BD%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%AA%E9%83%8E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%9C%89%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%8515%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="住日本的中国人李四：在中国无住所，适用涉外30天上诉期。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BD%8F%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%97%A0%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%9630%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="综合案例 (中国人张三与住京的美国人珍妮)：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BB%BC%E5%90%88%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%20(%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8E%E4%BD%8F%E4%BA%AC%E7%9A%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E7%8F%8D%E5%A6%AE)%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="送达方式：相同（因在中国均有住所，用国内送达规则）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%9D%87%E6%9C%89%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="上诉期：相同（同上，适用国内15天期）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%8515%E5%A4%A9%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="审限：不受一审、二审审限限制（因是涉外民事案件）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%A1%E5%AE%A1%E9%99%90%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E6%98%AF%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、 送达 (特殊规定)" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%20%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%20(%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A)%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="（新增重点1）向境内独资企业送达：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B91%EF%BC%89%E5%90%91%E5%A2%83%E5%86%85%E7%8B%AC%E8%B5%84%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="规则：可向受送达人在中国境内设立的独资企业送达。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E5%90%91%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%A2%83%E5%86%85%E8%AE%BE%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8B%AC%E8%B5%84%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="原理：独资企业老板是唯一股东，向其送达可视为已有效送达给境外的股东。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%8B%AC%E8%B5%84%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E8%80%81%E6%9D%BF%E6%98%AF%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E5%85%B6%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E5%8F%AF%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%B7%B2%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E7%BB%99%E5%A2%83%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="排除对象：合资企业不可。因其有多个老板，向其送达不能保证受送达人必然知晓。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E8%B5%84%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E5%85%B6%E6%9C%89%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E8%80%81%E6%9D%BF%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E5%85%B6%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E5%BF%85%E7%84%B6%E7%9F%A5%E6%99%93%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="（新增重点2）向共同被告关联组织送达：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B92%EF%BC%89%E5%90%91%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="规则：受送达人为外国人，担任中国法人的法定代表人/主要负责人，且与该法人为共同被告的，向该法人送达。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA/%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E8%B4%9F%E8%B4%A3%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%A5%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E8%AF%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="立法考量：作为共同被告，说明涉诉原因多是公司公事，向其公司送达不会泄露其个人隐私（如离婚等私事）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E8%80%83%E9%87%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E6%B6%89%E8%AF%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%E5%A4%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%85%AC%E4%BA%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E5%85%B6%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%90%E7%A7%81%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E7%AD%89%E7%A7%81%E4%BA%8B%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="五、 涉外的调查取证" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%20%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E5%8F%96%E8%AF%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 通过使领馆：法院可委托中国驻外使领馆，向具有中国国籍的当事人或证人调查取证。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%BD%BF%E9%A2%86%E9%A6%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AF%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%A9%BB%E5%A4%96%E4%BD%BF%E9%A2%86%E9%A6%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%9B%BD%E7%B1%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%AF%81%E4%BA%BA%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E5%8F%96%E8%AF%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="2. 通过即时通讯工具：经双方当事人同意。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%8D%B3%E6%97%B6%E9%80%9A%E8%AE%AF%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="3. 当事人同意的其他方式。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="六、 司法协助 (重点: 对外国裁判的承认与执行)" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AD%E3%80%81%20%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%8D%8F%E5%8A%A9%20(%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9:%20%E5%AF%B9%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C)%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 申请承认与执行的途径" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="外国法院判决/裁定：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3/%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="途径一：当事人直接向中国有管辖权的中院申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%E4%B8%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%91%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="途径二：由外国法院依据条约或互惠关系，向中国法院申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%E4%BA%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%E6%9D%A1%E7%BA%A6%E6%88%96%E4%BA%92%E6%83%A0%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%91%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="外国仲裁机构裁决：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="唯一途径：由当事人直接向中国有管辖权的法院申请。（即：只能由当事人申请，外国法院不能出面申请）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%91%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%B3%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%87%BA%E9%9D%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 不予承认和执行的情形" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E5%92%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="管辖权缺失：外国法院对案件无管辖权（如违反中国专属管辖、排他协议管辖、无实际联系）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%BC%BA%E5%A4%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%97%A0%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%81%E6%8E%92%E4%BB%96%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%81%E6%97%A0%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="程序不当：被申请人未得到合法传唤，或虽传唤但未能合理陈述辩论，或无诉讼行为能力人未获适当代理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AA%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%99%BD%E4%BC%A0%E5%94%A4%E4%BD%86%E6%9C%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E9%99%88%E8%BF%B0%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E6%97%A0%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%AA%E8%8E%B7%E9%80%82%E5%BD%93%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="存在欺诈：判决/裁定系欺诈方式取得。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3/%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%B3%BB%E6%AC%BA%E8%AF%88%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="司法冲突：我国法院已就同一纠纷作出判决或已承认第三国法院的判决。避免出现两份冲突的法律文书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%B7%B2%E5%B0%B1%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%88%96%E5%B7%B2%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E4%B8%A4%E4%BB%BD%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="公共秩序保留：违反中国法律基本原则或损害国家主权、安全、公共利益。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E7%A7%A9%E5%BA%8F%E4%BF%9D%E7%95%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E6%88%96%E6%8D%9F%E5%AE%B3%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%BB%E6%9D%83%E3%80%81%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E3%80%81%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 我国正在进行的诉讼如何处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="规则（诉讼中止）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="当国内法院（A区法院）正在审理的案件，与申请承认的外国法院判决所涉纠纷属于同一纠纷时。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88A%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E6%89%80%E6%B6%89%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%97%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="A区法院应裁定诉讼中止，等待中院审查是否承认外国判决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EA%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="中院裁定承认外国判决 → A区法院驳回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%20%E2%86%92%20A%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="中院裁定不予承认 → A区法院恢复审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20A%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 对承认与执行裁定的救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="方式：向上级法院申请复议一次。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="路径：因这类裁定一般由中院作出，故向上级高院申请复议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%A0%E8%BF%99%E7%B1%BB%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%95%85%E5%90%91%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%8D%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题27 仲裁概述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9827%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、 仲裁概述" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 仲裁的概念与性质" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E4%B8%8E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：当事人达成协议，将财产纠纷提交给仲裁机构，由其通过仲裁方式解决纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%85%B6%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="性质：社会救济。仲裁机构是社会力量（民间组织/群众组织），行使的是社会权力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E6%98%AF%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%88%E6%B0%91%E9%97%B4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87/%E7%BE%A4%E4%BC%97%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="仲裁机构名称：某某仲裁委员会（如广州仲裁委）、某某国际仲裁院（如深圳国际仲裁院）等，均为社会力量。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%9D%87%E4%B8%BA%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="机构设立：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E8%AE%BE%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="必有之地：直辖市（北上津渝）、各省省会、较大的市（如深圳、大连等）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E6%9C%89%E4%B9%8B%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%9B%B4%E8%BE%96%E5%B8%82%EF%BC%88%E5%8C%97%E4%B8%8A%E6%B4%A5%E6%B8%9D%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E5%90%84%E7%9C%81%E7%9C%81%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E8%BE%83%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%82%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E3%80%81%E5%A4%A7%E8%BF%9E%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="最低层级：设区的市（地级市）。区、县级没有仲裁机构。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%8E%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%BE%E5%8C%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%82%EF%BC%88%E5%9C%B0%E7%BA%A7%E5%B8%82%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%8C%BA%E3%80%81%E5%8E%BF%E7%BA%A7%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="产生方式：由市政府牵头，联合商会、行业协会、专家等组成。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%E5%B8%82%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E7%89%B5%E5%A4%B4%EF%BC%8C%E8%81%94%E5%90%88%E5%95%86%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A%E5%8D%8F%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%81%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E7%AD%89%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 选择仲裁的原因（仲裁相较于诉讼的优势）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9B%B8%E8%BE%83%E4%BA%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%98%E5%8A%BF%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="专业性更强：当事人可选择特定行业领域的专家、大佬担任仲裁员，裁决更懂行业规则与交易习惯（如建筑工程、玉石买卖）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%9B%B4%E5%BC%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E7%89%B9%E5%AE%9A%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E3%80%81%E5%A4%A7%E4%BD%AC%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%EF%BC%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E6%9B%B4%E6%87%82%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E4%B9%A0%E6%83%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E3%80%81%E7%8E%89%E7%9F%B3%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="效率更高：实行一裁终局，裁决作出即生效，无上诉救济。相比诉讼“两审终审”可能经历的漫长周期，能更快定分止争，节省时间与人力成本。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E6%9B%B4%E9%AB%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%9E%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%A3%81%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%8D%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E3%80%82%E7%9B%B8%E6%AF%94%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%A4%E5%AE%A1%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E2%80%9D%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E7%BB%8F%E5%8E%86%E7%9A%84%E6%BC%AB%E9%95%BF%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%8C%E8%83%BD%E6%9B%B4%E5%BF%AB%E5%AE%9A%E5%88%86%E6%AD%A2%E4%BA%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%8A%82%E7%9C%81%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%BA%E5%8A%9B%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="保密性更强：仲裁以不公开为原则。外界无法查询到企业在仲裁机构的案件和裁决结果，有利于维护当事人的商业声誉（诉讼则原则上要求公开审判，以接受监督）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BF%9D%E5%AF%86%E6%80%A7%E6%9B%B4%E5%BC%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E4%B8%BA%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%A4%96%E7%95%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E5%88%B0%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%92%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%8E%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E5%A3%B0%E8%AA%89%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%88%99%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8A%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 仲裁vs.诉讼的深度对比 (花了钱的不同体验感)" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81vs.%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%20(%E8%8A%B1%E4%BA%86%E9%92%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C%E6%84%9F)%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="经费来源：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%8F%E8%B4%B9%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院：国家财政拨款。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E8%B4%A2%E6%94%BF%E6%8B%A8%E6%AC%BE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="仲裁机构：自收自支，主要来源于当事人缴纳的仲裁费。因此，仲裁费通常比诉讼费更贵。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%E6%94%B6%E8%87%AA%E6%94%AF%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%BC%B4%E7%BA%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%B4%B9%E9%80%9A%E5%B8%B8%E6%AF%94%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E8%B4%B9%E6%9B%B4%E8%B4%B5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="当事人主导性对比 (核心考点)" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%AF%BC%E6%80%A7%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%20(%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9)%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="| 对比项 | 诉讼 (法院) | 仲裁 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1. 机构选择 | 法定管辖，当事人无选择权 | 当事人自由约定，不受地域限制（如广州纠纷可选北京仲裁委） |
| 2. 合议/独任选择 | 法律明文规定，当事人无选择权 | 当事人自由约定（出钱多就请3人合议，想省钱就独任） |
| 3. 仲裁员/法官选择 | 法院依职权安排，当事人无选择权 | 当事人自己选（各自选一名边裁，共同选/委托主任指定一名首席仲裁员） |
| 4. 审理方式 | 一审必须开庭 | 原则开庭，但当事人可协议不开庭（书面审理） |
| 5. 公开审理 | 原则公开（国家审判权，接受监督） | 原则不公开，但当事人可协议公开 |
| 6. 裁决书/判决书 | 必须详细写明认定事实、判决理由 | 当事人协议可以不写事实和理由 |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%20(%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2)%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E1.%20%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A0%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E2.%20%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE/%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%98%8E%E6%96%87%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A0%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%87%BA%E9%92%B1%E5%A4%9A%E5%B0%B1%E8%AF%B73%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%83%B3%E7%9C%81%E9%92%B1%E5%B0%B1%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E3.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98/%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BE%9D%E8%81%8C%E6%9D%83%E5%AE%89%E6%8E%92%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A0%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E9%80%89%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%90%84%E8%87%AA%E9%80%89%E4%B8%80%E5%90%8D%E8%BE%B9%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E9%80%89/%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%B8%BB%E4%BB%BB%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%90%8D%E9%A6%96%E5%B8%AD%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%224%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E4.%20%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%3Cb%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%3C/b%3E%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%3Cb%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8D%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%225%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E5.%20%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3Cb%3E%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3Cb%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%3Cb%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%226%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E6.%20%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6/%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%3C/b%3E%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E5%86%99%E6%98%8E%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3Cb%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%99%3C/b%3E%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%92%8C%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="服务态度（价值导向）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%80%81%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC%E5%AF%BC%E5%90%91%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="法院：面若冰霜，职责所在。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%9D%A2%E8%8B%A5%E5%86%B0%E9%9C%9C%EF%BC%8C%E8%81%8C%E8%B4%A3%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="仲裁机构：如春天般温暖，视当事人为“财神爷”，提供优质服务，以期当事人下次再来。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%A9%E8%88%AC%E6%B8%A9%E6%9A%96%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%9C%E8%B4%A2%E7%A5%9E%E7%88%B7%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E4%BC%98%E8%B4%A8%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E6%9C%9F%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8B%E6%AC%A1%E5%86%8D%E6%9D%A5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="核心结论：在仲裁中，从要不要仲裁、去哪仲裁、谁来裁到怎么裁，一切由当事人自己说了算。正因如此，必须 “愿赌服输” ，接受一裁终局，裁了就没有救济。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8E%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%81%E5%8E%BB%E5%93%AA%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%81%E8%B0%81%E6%9D%A5%E8%A3%81%E5%88%B0%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%88%87%E7%94%B1%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E8%AF%B4%E4%BA%86%E7%AE%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E6%AD%A3%E5%9B%A0%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E6%84%BF%E8%B5%8C%E6%9C%8D%E8%BE%93%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%A3%81%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A3%81%E4%BA%86%E5%B0%B1%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、 仲裁的适用范围" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="可以仲裁：仅限于财产纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E9%99%90%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="不能仲裁：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="身份关系纠纷：婚姻、收养、监护、扶养、继承等。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A9%9A%E5%A7%BB%E3%80%81%E6%94%B6%E5%85%BB%E3%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%8A%A4%E3%80%81%E6%89%B6%E5%85%BB%E3%80%81%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E7%AD%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="另行规定的纠纷：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%A6%E8%A1%8C%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="劳动纠纷 → 适用《劳动争议调解仲裁法》，由劳动争议仲裁委处理（非本节所讲民商事仲裁）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E3%80%8A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%B3%95%E3%80%8B%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AC%E8%8A%82%E6%89%80%E8%AE%B2%E6%B0%91%E5%95%86%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="农村土地承包经营纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%9C%E6%9D%91%E5%9C%9F%E5%9C%B0%E6%89%BF%E5%8C%85%E7%BB%8F%E8%90%A5%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="体育仲裁。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="案例辨析：劳动合同中约定“由广州仲裁委仲裁” → 无效。劳动纠纷不能依《仲裁法》进行民商事仲裁。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B1%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E2%80%9D%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BE%9D%E3%80%8A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%B3%95%E3%80%8B%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%B0%91%E5%95%86%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、 仲裁的原则与基本制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8E%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 仲裁原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="自愿原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="根据事实，符合法律，公平合理原则" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%EF%BC%8C%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%AC%E5%B9%B3%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="独立仲裁原则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="含义：以仲裁庭（3人合议庭/1人独任庭）为单位独立。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AB%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%883%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD/1%E4%BA%BA%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%BA%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="与法院独立的区别：法院是以法院整体为单位独立（审委会决定，合议庭必须执行）；仲裁中，案件必须在仲裁庭内部解决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%95%B4%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9B%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="僵局处理：仲裁庭形不成多数意见时，不能报仲裁委员会讨论决定，应直接按首席仲裁员的意见作出裁决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%83%B5%E5%B1%80%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8A%A5%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A6%96%E5%B8%AD%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（新增1）诚信原则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E1%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="规则：仲裁庭发现当事人单方捏造事实、恶意串通进行虚假仲裁的，应裁决驳回其仲裁申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%95%E6%96%B9%E6%8D%8F%E9%80%A0%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%81%E6%81%B6%E6%84%8F%E4%B8%B2%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%99%9A%E5%81%87%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="注意：仅虚假仲裁本身不构成妨害诉讼/执行，不能由法院罚款拘留；不构成《刑法》中的“虚假诉讼罪”（因未妨害司法秩序）。但若当事人持虚假仲裁裁决申请法院强制执行，则可能涉嫌犯罪。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%85%E8%99%9A%E5%81%87%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E5%A6%A8%E5%AE%B3%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC/%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%BD%9A%E6%AC%BE%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%EF%BC%9B%E4%B8%8D%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%E3%80%8A%E5%88%91%E6%B3%95%E3%80%8B%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E8%99%9A%E5%81%87%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%BD%AA%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E6%9C%AA%E5%A6%A8%E5%AE%B3%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E7%A7%A9%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%E4%BD%86%E8%8B%A5%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%81%E8%99%9A%E5%81%87%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%B6%89%E5%AB%8C%E7%8A%AF%E7%BD%AA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="（新增2）在线仲裁与线下仲裁效力同等原则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E2%EF%BC%89%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="规则：只要一方当事人未明确表示不同意，仲裁活动可通过信息网络在线进行，且与线下仲裁具有同等法律效力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%89%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="与在线诉讼的区别：在线诉讼原则上要求各方当事人同意。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8A%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 基本制度" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 协议仲裁制度：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E1.%20%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="仲裁机构（民间组织）的管辖权及裁决的约束力，唯一来源于双方当事人的书面仲裁协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%EF%BC%88%E6%B0%91%E9%97%B4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%EF%BC%89%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E5%8F%8A%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8E%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="没有仲裁协议，就没有仲裁。申请仲裁必须以存在书面仲裁协议为前提。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E4%BB%A5%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%BA%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 或裁或审制度：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E2.%20%E6%88%96%E8%A3%81%E6%88%96%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="有效仲裁协议排斥法院的司法管辖权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8E%92%E6%96%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院受理前发现有效仲裁协议 → 不予受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="法院受理后，另一方首次开庭前提出仲裁协议 → 驳回起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 一裁终局制度：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E3.%20%E4%B8%80%E8%A3%81%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="仲裁裁决一经作出即为终局裁决，立即生效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E7%BB%8F%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%8D%B3%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人就同一纠纷，不能再申请仲裁，也不能再向法院起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%B0%B1%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题28 仲裁协议" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9828%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、 仲裁协议的形式与内容" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%8E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 形式要求：书面形式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则：仲裁协议必须以书面形式订立，口头协议无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%A5%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E8%AE%A2%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%A3%E5%A4%B4%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="具体体现：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="合同中的仲裁条款：买卖合同中约定“发生纠纷，由广州仲裁委仲裁”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="单独的仲裁协议书：单独达成的协议，“双方因某某合同纠纷，一致同意提交广州仲裁委仲裁”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E2%80%9C%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%9B%A0%E6%9F%90%E6%9F%90%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="其他可以备查的书面形式。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%A4%87%E6%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 内容三要素" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%89%E8%A6%81%E7%B4%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="1. 请求仲裁的意思表示" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E1.%20%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="必须明确、肯定地表达通过仲裁解决纠纷的意愿。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E3%80%81%E8%82%AF%E5%AE%9A%E5%9C%B0%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E6%84%BF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="2. 仲裁事项" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E2.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="必须具有可仲裁性（限于财产纠纷）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E9%99%90%E4%BA%8E%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="案例辨析（无效情形）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="约定“遗产继承纠纷”提交仲裁 → 无效（身份关系不可仲裁）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E2%80%9D%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="劳动合同中约定“劳动纠纷”提交仲裁 → 无效（劳动争议需找劳动仲裁委，非民商事仲裁）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E2%80%9D%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E9%9C%80%E6%89%BE%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%EF%BC%8C%E9%9D%9E%E6%B0%91%E5%95%86%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="3. 选定的仲裁机构（核心重点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E3.%20%E9%80%89%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="要求：约定的仲裁机构必须明确、具体、唯一。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E3%80%81%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E3%80%81%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="具体规则与案例：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="A. 约定机构必须存在：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EA.%20%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="案例：约定“甲县仲裁委”、“东城区仲裁委” → 无效。理由：仲裁机构最低设在设区的市，区、县没有仲裁机构。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B2%E5%8E%BF%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E2%80%9D%E3%80%81%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%9C%E5%9F%8E%E5%8C%BA%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E2%80%9D%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%8E%E8%AE%BE%E5%9C%A8%E8%AE%BE%E5%8C%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%82%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%BA%E3%80%81%E5%8E%BF%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="B. 名称不准确但能确定：有效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EB.%20%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%86%E7%A1%AE%E4%BD%86%E8%83%BD%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="案例：约定“广州市仲裁委员会”，虽然多一个“市”字，但能确定指向“广州仲裁委员会”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E5%B8%82%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E8%99%BD%E7%84%B6%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E2%80%9C%E5%B8%82%E2%80%9D%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E8%83%BD%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E2%80%9C%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案例：中国国际经济贸易仲裁委员会（贸仲），曾用名、简称、华南分会等，只要能确定是它，就有效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E%E8%B4%B8%E6%98%93%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%88%E8%B4%B8%E4%BB%B2%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%9B%BE%E7%94%A8%E5%90%8D%E3%80%81%E7%AE%80%E7%A7%B0%E3%80%81%E5%8D%8E%E5%8D%97%E5%88%86%E4%BC%9A%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E8%83%BD%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%83%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案例：原“深圳仲裁委”与“贸仲华南分会”合并后改为“深圳国际仲裁院”，当事人约定以上任一旧称，只要能指向现在这个机构，均有效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E2%80%9C%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%8E%E2%80%9C%E8%B4%B8%E4%BB%B2%E5%8D%8E%E5%8D%97%E5%88%86%E4%BC%9A%E2%80%9D%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%90%8E%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%9C%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E9%99%A2%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E4%BB%BB%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A7%E7%A7%B0%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E8%83%BD%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%9D%87%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="C. 约定两个以上仲裁机构：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EC.%20%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="处理：当事人可以协议选择其中一个；不能达成一致的，仲裁协议无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%EF%BC%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案例：约定“由广州仲裁委或长沙仲裁委仲裁”，需双方再选，选不出则无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B1%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E6%88%96%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%86%8D%E9%80%89%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%88%99%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="D. 约定某地仲裁机构，且该地不止一个：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3ED.%20%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E6%9F%90%E5%9C%B0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E8%AF%A5%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%8D%E6%AD%A2%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="处理：等同于约定两个以上机构。当事人协议选择一个；选不出则无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%AD%89%E5%90%8C%E4%BA%8E%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E3%80%82%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%EF%BC%9B%E9%80%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%88%99%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案例：约定“由位于北京的仲裁机构仲裁”（北京有北仲、贸仲、海仲），需双方再选，选不出则无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B1%E4%BD%8D%E4%BA%8E%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E6%9C%89%E5%8C%97%E4%BB%B2%E3%80%81%E8%B4%B8%E4%BB%B2%E3%80%81%E6%B5%B7%E4%BB%B2%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%86%8D%E9%80%89%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E5%88%99%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
              <outline text="E. 或裁或审条款" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3EE.%20%E6%88%96%E8%A3%81%E6%88%96%E5%AE%A1%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="规则：约定“既可以仲裁，也可以向法院起诉”，该条款无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E6%97%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="例外：一方持此无效协议申请仲裁，另一方在仲裁庭首次开庭前未提异议的，视为该仲裁协议有效，仲裁庭可继续仲裁。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%8C%81%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AA%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%A5%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E5%8F%AF%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
                <outline text="案例：约定“由广州仲裁委仲裁，或者由白云区法院管辖”，此约定本质无效。若对方不反对，则补正有效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E7%94%B1%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E7%94%B1%E7%99%BD%E4%BA%91%E5%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A4%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%E8%8B%A5%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E8%A1%A5%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、 仲裁协议的效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 对法院的效力（排斥司法管辖）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%AF%B9%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88%E6%8E%92%E6%96%A5%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心规则：存在有效仲裁协议，法院不受理起诉（或裁或审）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%88%E6%88%96%E8%A3%81%E6%88%96%E5%AE%A1%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="具体处理方式（重点）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%88%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="| 情形 | 法院发现时间 | 当事人行为 | 法院处理结果 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 情形一 | 受理前发现 | / | 裁定不予受理 |
| 情形二 | 受理后发现 | 被告在首次开庭前提交仲裁协议 | 裁定驳回起诉 |
| 情形三 | 受理后发现 | 法院审查发现仲裁协议无效（如：约定“东城区仲裁委”） | 继续审理（因排除不了法院管辖） |
| 情形四 | 受理后 | 被告在首次开庭时（或后） 才提交仲裁协议 | 继续审理（视为放弃仲裁协议） |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%80%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%89%8D%3C/b%3E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E/%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%BA%8C%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%3C/b%3E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%9C%A8%3Cb%3E%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%3C/b%3E%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%89%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%3C/b%3E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3Cb%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%9C%E5%9F%8E%E5%8C%BA%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%86%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%224%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E5%9B%9B%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%E5%90%8E%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%9C%A8%3Cb%3E%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%88%E6%88%96%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%89%3C/b%3E%20%E6%89%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="关键时间节点：被告提交仲裁协议对抗法院管辖的最后期限是 “首次开庭前” 。敲法槌宣布开庭即为“首次开庭时”，此时再提交已无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%AF%B9%E6%8A%97%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E6%98%AF%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E2%80%9C%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E3%80%82%E6%95%B2%E6%B3%95%E6%A7%8C%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%8D%B3%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%9C%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E6%97%B6%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E5%86%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E5%B7%B2%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 仲裁条款效力的独立性" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="定义：仲裁条款的效力独立于合同主体而存在。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E8%80%8C%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="结论：合同不成立、未生效、被撤销、无效，不会当然导致其中的仲裁条款不成立、未生效、无效。仲裁条款单独判断。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%81%E6%9C%AA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E3%80%81%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%81%E6%9C%AA%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E3%80%81%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 仲裁协议效力的相对性及其扩张" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E6%80%A7%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%B6%E6%89%A9%E5%BC%A0%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="基础原则（相对性）：仲裁协议只约束签字方。考试核心思路：只看纠纷的双方当事人之间有没有仲裁协议。有，则仲裁；无，则诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%8F%AA%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E7%AD%BE%E5%AD%97%E6%96%B9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E7%9C%8B%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E6%9C%89%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%E6%9C%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%9B%E6%97%A0%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="效力扩张（三种法定例外）：非签字方也可能受仲裁协议约束。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E6%89%A9%E5%BC%A0%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E9%9D%9E%E7%AD%BE%E5%AD%97%E6%96%B9%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%97%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 当事人合并/分立：效力及于继受人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6/%E5%88%86%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E5%8F%8A%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%A7%E5%8F%97%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="示例：甲（有仲裁协议）与丙合并成丁，丁与乙的纠纷受原仲裁协议约束。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22italic%22%3E%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%99%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E6%88%90%E4%B8%81%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%81%E4%B8%8E%E4%B9%99%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%8F%97%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 当事人死亡：效力及于承继仲裁事项权利的继承人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E5%8F%8A%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%89%BF%E7%BB%A7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="示例：张三（有仲裁协议）死亡，其子张小三与李四的纠纷受原仲裁协议约束。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22italic%22%3E%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E5%AD%90%E5%BC%A0%E5%B0%8F%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%8F%97%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 债权/债务转让：效力及于受让人，但有两条例外（此时仲裁协议对受让人无效）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83/%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E8%BD%AC%E8%AE%A9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E5%8F%8A%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E8%AE%A9%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%A4%E6%9D%A1%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%AF%B9%E5%8F%97%E8%AE%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="例外一：受让时，受让人明确反对该仲裁协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%97%E8%AE%A9%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E8%AE%A9%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%A5%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="例外二：存在单独的仲裁协议书，且受让人在受让时不知道该协议的存在。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E5%8F%97%E8%AE%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%8F%97%E8%AE%A9%E6%97%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E7%9F%A5%E9%81%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%A5%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="融合考点分析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="考点一：仲裁协议与代位权诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8E%E4%BB%A3%E4%BD%8D%E6%9D%83%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案例：债权人张三（无仲裁协议）诉相对人王五（债务人为李四，李四与王五有仲裁协议）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%80%BA%E6%9D%83%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%89%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%BA%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%88%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%BA%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%8E%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="主管原则：张三与王五之间无仲裁协议，法院不能驳回起诉，应继续审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8E%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E6%97%A0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="中止例外：若债务人李四与相对人王五，在代位权诉讼首次开庭前，依他们之间的仲裁协议申请了仲裁，则代位权诉讼可中止，等待仲裁结果。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%8B%A5%E5%80%BA%E5%8A%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%8E%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%8E%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%BA%E7%8E%8B%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%A3%E4%BD%8D%E6%9D%83%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%9D%E4%BB%96%E4%BB%AC%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%86%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E4%BB%A3%E4%BD%8D%E6%9D%83%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="考点二：仲裁协议与股东代表诉讼" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8E%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="案例：小股东丁（无仲裁协议）代表公司A（与相对人刘记集团有仲裁协议）诉刘记集团。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%8F%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E4%B8%81%EF%BC%88%E6%97%A0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8A%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8E%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%98%E8%AE%B0%E9%9B%86%E5%9B%A2%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%89%E8%AF%89%E5%88%98%E8%AE%B0%E9%9B%86%E5%9B%A2%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="主管判定：坚持相对性。股东丁与刘记集团之间无仲裁协议，该案属于法院主管，应去法院起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9D%9A%E6%8C%81%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E6%80%A7%E3%80%82%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E4%B8%81%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%98%E8%AE%B0%E9%9B%86%E5%9B%A2%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E6%A1%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%8E%BB%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="管辖判定：法律无特殊规定，适用原告就被告的一般地域管辖原则（本案为被告住所地）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%88%A4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E6%97%A0%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%91%8A%E5%B0%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、 仲裁协议效力的确认" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 确认机构及顺序（存在竞争）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E5%8F%8A%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%AB%9E%E4%BA%89%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="有权机关：仲裁机构/仲裁庭 或 人民法院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84/%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E6%88%96%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="确认顺序（解决冲突）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 一方找法院，一方找仲裁机构 → 法院优先。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%89%BE%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%89%BE%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 仲裁机构先于法院接受申请并已作出决定 → 法院不再受理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%88%E4%BA%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B7%B2%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E5%8F%97%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 向法院申请的管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="级别管辖：中级法院（“看见仲裁找中院”原则，除国内仲裁保全外）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E2%80%9C%E7%9C%8B%E8%A7%81%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%89%BE%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E2%80%9D%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%A4%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="地域管辖（四个连接点）：申请人住所地、被申请人住所地、仲裁协议签订地、约定的仲裁机构所在地。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9C%B0%E5%9F%9F%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%AD%BE%E8%AE%A2%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 提出异议的时间" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="最后期限：仲裁庭的首次开庭前。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="法律后果" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="逾期不提：之后无论是主张仲裁协议无效，还是不存在，都不被支持。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%97%A0%E8%AE%BA%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%A0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E8%A2%AB%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="视为有效/存在：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88/%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 一方持无效仲裁协议申请仲裁，另一方首次开庭前不提异议 → 视为仲裁协议有效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E6%8C%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 一方在没有仲裁协议时申请仲裁，另一方首次开庭前不提异议，经仲裁庭说明并记录在案 → 视为当事人之间存在仲裁协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E5%9C%A8%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%B6%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%8D%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%8F%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E5%B9%B6%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E5%9C%A8%E6%A1%88%20%E2%86%92%20%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="终极效力：视为存在/有效后，不得再就同一纠纷以仲裁协议效力为由，申请撤销或不予执行裁决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8/%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E5%86%8D%E5%B0%B1%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E4%BB%A5%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%88%96%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 程序性质的辨析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="当事人向法院申请确认仲裁协议效力，这是一个非讼的司法审查程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="它不是“诉”，因此不属于确认之诉。因为它不解决实体权利义务纠纷。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%83%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E8%AF%89%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E3%80%82%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%83%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 实务拓展：主合同仲裁协议对补充协议的效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E5%AE%9E%E5%8A%A1%E6%8B%93%E5%B1%95%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BB%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%AF%B9%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="判断标准及案例解析：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E5%8F%8A%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="真补充协议（依附性）：内容是对主合同已约定事项的补充、解释、变更（如：对施工合同的工程款支付方式的补充约定）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9C%9F%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%88%E4%BE%9D%E9%99%84%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E6%98%AF%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%BB%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B7%B2%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E3%80%81%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E3%80%81%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%BD%E5%B7%A5%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E6%AC%BE%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="结论：主合同的仲裁条款约束该补充协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BB%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%A5%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="假补充协议（独立性）：虽然是“补充协议”之名，但合同内容是与主合同完全独立的另一法律关系（如：施工合同履行中，又签“补充协议”约定买猪肉、买蔬菜）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%81%87%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%88%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%99%BD%E7%84%B6%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E2%80%9D%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%BB%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%BD%E5%B7%A5%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%88%E7%AD%BE%E2%80%9C%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E2%80%9D%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%B0%E7%8C%AA%E8%82%89%E3%80%81%E4%B9%B0%E8%94%AC%E8%8F%9C%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="结论：主合同仲裁条款不当然约束该补充协议。纠纷解决方式按补充协议自身约定，没有约定则诉讼。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BB%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%AF%A5%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%8C%89%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E8%87%AA%E8%BA%AB%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E5%88%99%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题29 仲裁程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9829%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、 仲裁保全与证据保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 仲裁中的保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="申请路径：当事人 → 向仲裁机构申请 → 仲裁机构必须提交给法院 → 由法院裁定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%91%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="裁决主体：仲裁机构无权直接裁定保全，必须由法院裁定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E7%94%B1%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 申请仲裁前的保全" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="规则适用：直接适用《民事诉讼法》中诉前财产/行为保全和诉前证据保全的规则。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E3%80%8A%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E6%B3%95%E3%80%8B%E4%B8%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%92%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E5%89%8D%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="财产/行为保全管辖：向被保全财产所在地、被申请人住所地或对案件有管辖权的法院申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="证据保全管辖：向证据所在地、被申请人住所地及对案件有管辖权的法院申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%81%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%8F%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%9C%89%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%9D%83%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、 仲裁庭的组成" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 组成形式（独任制 vs. 合议制）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%88%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%20vs.%20%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="确定方式：由当事人约定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="未约定的处理：在仲裁规则规定期限内未约定的，由仲裁委主任确定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%AA%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%86%85%E6%9C%AA%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E4%B8%BB%E4%BB%BB%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 仲裁员的产生" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="合议庭（3名仲裁员）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%883%E5%90%8D%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="边裁（2名）：双方当事人各自选定或各自委托主任指定一名。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BE%B9%E8%A3%81%EF%BC%882%E5%90%8D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%84%E8%87%AA%E9%80%89%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%84%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%B8%BB%E4%BB%BB%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E5%90%8D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="首席仲裁员（1名）：三种产生方式（重要性递增）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A6%96%E5%B8%AD%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%EF%BC%881%E5%90%8D%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E6%80%A7%E9%80%92%E5%A2%9E%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 双方当事人共同选定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E9%80%89%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 双方当事人共同委托主任指定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%B8%BB%E4%BB%BB%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="3. 双方当事人各自选定的边裁共同选定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%84%E8%87%AA%E9%80%89%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BE%B9%E8%A3%81%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E9%80%89%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
                <outline text="   实践技巧*：当事人共同选定首席往往很难达成一致，故多采用委托边裁或主任的方式。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7*%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E9%80%89%E5%AE%9A%E9%A6%96%E5%B8%AD%E5%BE%80%E5%BE%80%E5%BE%88%E9%9A%BE%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%EF%BC%8C%E6%95%85%E5%A4%9A%E9%87%87%E7%94%A8%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E8%BE%B9%E8%A3%81%E6%88%96%E4%B8%BB%E4%BB%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="独任庭（1名仲裁员）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%8B%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%881%E5%90%8D%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="由双方当事人共同选定或共同委托主任指定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B1%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E9%80%89%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%A7%94%E6%89%98%E4%B8%BB%E4%BB%BB%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="兜底规则：当事人在规定期限内未选定的，由主任指定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%9C%E5%BA%95%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90%E5%86%85%E6%9C%AA%E9%80%89%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BB%BB%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 仲裁员的回避" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="回避理由：（参照法定情形，从略）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%82%E7%85%A7%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%8E%E7%95%A5%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="回避方式：自行回避、当事人申请回避。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="决定权限（核心重点）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="普通仲裁员 → 由仲裁委主任决定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E4%B8%BB%E4%BB%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="主任担任仲裁员 → 由仲裁委集体决定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BB%BB%E6%8B%85%E4%BB%BB%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E9%9B%86%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="回避的法律后果：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 重新选定/指定：回避后空缺的仲裁员，按照原产生程序重新选定或指定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E9%80%89%E5%AE%9A/%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%90%8E%E7%A9%BA%E7%BC%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%E5%8E%9F%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E9%80%89%E5%AE%9A%E6%88%96%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 程序效力：已进行的仲裁程序是否重新进行，由仲裁庭决定。当事人可申请，但决定权在仲裁庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B7%B2%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%83%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="案例辨析（首席仲裁员苏某回避案）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%88%E9%A6%96%E5%B8%AD%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%E8%8B%8F%E6%9F%90%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E6%A1%88%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="回避决定：苏某是首席仲裁员（非主任），其回避应由主任决定，非集体决定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%8B%8F%E6%9F%90%E6%98%AF%E9%A6%96%E5%B8%AD%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%EF%BC%88%E9%9D%9E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BB%BB%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E5%9B%9E%E9%81%BF%E5%BA%94%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BB%BB%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%9D%9E%E9%9B%86%E4%BD%93%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="庭的组成：只需换掉苏某，无需重新组成合议庭。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E9%9C%80%E6%8D%A2%E6%8E%89%E8%8B%8F%E6%9F%90%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="程序走向：已进行的程序是否重新进行，由仲裁庭决定，非应当继续或重新进行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%B5%B0%E5%90%91%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%B7%B2%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E9%9D%9E%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E6%88%96%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、 仲裁的审理方式" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 开庭审理 vs. 书面审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%20vs.%20%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则：开庭审理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="例外：当事人协议不开庭的，可进行书面审理（完全取决于当事人约定）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8D%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E5%8F%96%E5%86%B3%E4%BA%8E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 公开审理 vs. 不公开审理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%20vs.%20%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则：不公开审理（保护商业秘密和声誉）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%A1%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E5%92%8C%E5%A3%B0%E8%AA%89%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="例外：当事人协议公开的，可以公开。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="绝对禁止公开：涉及国家秘密的，即使当事人协议，也绝对不能公开。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E4%BD%BF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 仲裁庭的调查取证与鉴定权" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E5%8F%96%E8%AF%81%E4%B8%8E%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="仲裁庭有权自行调查收集证据。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="仲裁庭有权自行决定鉴定。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E6%9C%89%E6%9D%83%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E9%89%B4%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 送达方式的特殊性" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E7%9A%84%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%80%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="仲裁文件可按照当事人约定的合理方式送达。无约定或约定不明的，按仲裁规则确定的方式送达。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%AF%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E3%80%82%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E6%88%96%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E9%80%81%E8%BE%BE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、 仲裁中的撤回申请与缺席裁决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8E%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="撤回申请：申请人经书面通知，无正当理由不到庭或未经许可中途退庭，按撤回仲裁申请处理。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%8F%E4%B9%A6%E9%9D%A2%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%AD%E6%88%96%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E8%AE%B8%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%AD%E9%80%94%E9%80%80%E5%BA%AD%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8C%89%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        <outline text="缺席裁决：被申请人有上述情形的，缺席裁决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
      </outline>
      <outline text="五、 仲裁中的和解与调解（重点与难点）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%8E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%88%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E4%B8%8E%E9%9A%BE%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 仲裁中的和解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="结案方式（二选一）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E6%A1%88%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%E9%80%89%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 制作裁决书：申请仲裁庭依据和解协议制作裁决书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 撤回申请：申请人自愿撤回仲裁申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="与诉讼的重大区别（核心考点）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%EF%BC%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%80%83%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="仲裁：可以依据和解/调解协议制作裁决书（因裁决书与调解书都是一裁终局，且都不公开，无制度障碍）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3/%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%A0%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%8E%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E8%A3%81%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E9%9A%9C%E7%A2%8D%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="诉讼：原则上不允许依据和解/调解协议制作判决书。仅有两条例外：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3/%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E5%88%A4%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%A4%E6%9D%A1%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="1. 无民事行为能力人的离婚案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%97%A0%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%A6%BB%E5%A9%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="2. 涉外民事案件。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%B0%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="撤回申请后反悔或不履行的处理（三方对比）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%E6%88%96%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%E6%96%B9%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="情形：在仲裁中达成和解，撤回申请后反悔，或对方不履行和解协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%AD%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%8C%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%A5%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="救济途径：只能根据原仲裁协议再次申请仲裁。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="不得起诉：因为纠纷未经实体裁决，原仲裁协议仍然有效，排斥法院管辖。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%BB%8D%E7%84%B6%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%92%E6%96%A5%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="| 对比情形 | 核心原则 | 可申请仲裁的依据 | 能否起诉 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 1. 仲裁和解撤回后又反悔 | 纠纷未经实体裁决，原协议有效 | 原仲裁协议 | 不能起诉 |
| 2. 仲裁裁决被法院撤销 | 纠纷已经实体裁决，原协议失效 | 需重新达成仲裁协议 | 可以起诉 |
| 3. 仲裁裁决被不予执行 | 纠纷已经实体裁决，原协议失效 | 需重新达成仲裁协议 | 可以起诉 |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E8%83%BD%E5%90%A6%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E1.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E6%92%A4%E5%9B%9E%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%88%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3Cb%3E%E6%9C%AA%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%3C/b%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E2.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E8%A2%AB%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3Cb%3E%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E9%9C%80%3Cb%3E%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/b%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E3.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%3Cb%3E%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E9%9C%80%3Cb%3E%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%3C/b%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 仲裁中的调解" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="启动：裁决作出前，仲裁庭可先行调解；当事人自愿调解的，应当调解。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E5%8F%AF%E5%85%88%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9B%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="结案方式：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%93%E6%A1%88%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 制作调解书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 制作裁决书：根据调解协议的结果制作裁决书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="六、 仲裁的裁决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%85%AD%E3%80%81%20%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 裁决的作出机制" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="原则：少数服从多数（按多数仲裁员意见作出）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%B0%91%E6%95%B0%E6%9C%8D%E4%BB%8E%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E6%8C%89%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%B0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="例外：形不成多数意见（如三人各持己见）时，按首席仲裁员的意见作出裁决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%84%E6%8C%81%E5%B7%B1%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%89%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A6%96%E5%B8%AD%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="注意：多数意见优先，只有在不能形成多数时，首席才有最终决定权。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E9%A6%96%E5%B8%AD%E6%89%8D%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%9D%83%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 先行裁决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E5%85%88%E8%A1%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="条件：案件部分事实已经查清。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E6%9F%A5%E6%B8%85%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="目的：为防止全案拖延，可对该部分先行裁决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BA%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E5%85%A8%E6%A1%88%E6%8B%96%E5%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%A5%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%85%88%E8%A1%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 裁决书的内容与签名" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%8E%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="内容简化（当事人权利）：当事人协议不写明争议事实和裁决理由的，可以不写。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%88%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%83%E5%88%A9%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%99%E6%98%8E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E5%92%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="签名规则：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="裁决书需由仲裁员签名，并加盖仲裁机构印章。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E9%9C%80%E7%94%B1%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E5%8A%A0%E7%9B%96%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8D%B0%E7%AB%A0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="持不同意见的仲裁员，可以签名，也可不签名。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E6%8C%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%8D%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="   推论*：裁决书上最终签名的仲裁员人数可能是1人（首席）、2人（多数意见）或3人（一致意见）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%20%20%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%8E%A8%E8%AE%BA*%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%B0%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF1%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E9%A6%96%E5%B8%AD%EF%BC%89%E3%80%812%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%89%E6%88%963%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 裁决书的补正" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A5%E6%AD%A3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="适用范围：文字错误、计算错误或已裁决但漏写的事项。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E3%80%81%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E6%88%96%E5%B7%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%BD%86%E6%BC%8F%E5%86%99%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="程序：可补正。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E8%A1%A5%E6%AD%A3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 裁决的生效与效力" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="生效时间：作出之日起生效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E8%B5%B7%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="终局效力（一裁终局）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E8%A3%81%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="当事人就同一纠纷，不能再申请仲裁。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%B0%B1%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="当事人就同一纠纷，不能再向法院起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%B0%B1%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="裁决具有强制执行力。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
    <outline text="专题30 司法与仲裁" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9830%20%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
      <outline text="一、 司法对仲裁的支持——仲裁裁决的执行" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%20%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 执行管辖" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="申请执行仲裁裁决的管辖法院：被执行人住所地或被执行财产所在地的中级人民法院。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%88%96%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%B4%A2%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="原则：“看见仲裁找中院”（除国内仲裁的保全/证据保全外）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E7%9C%8B%E8%A7%81%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%89%BE%E4%B8%AD%E9%99%A2%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%88%E9%99%A4%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8/%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%A8%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 与撤销程序冲突的处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%8E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="问题：一方申请执行，另一方申请撤销，怎么办？" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B9%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%EF%BC%8C%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E5%8A%9E%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="处理：法院应裁定中止执行，等待撤销程序的结果。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="裁决被撤销 → 终结执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E8%A2%AB%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%20%E2%86%92%20%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="驳回撤销申请 → 恢复执行。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="二、 司法对仲裁的监督（一）——仲裁裁决的撤销" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%20%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 撤销程序的启动" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="| 项目 | 内容 |
| --- | --- |
| 申请主体 | 当事人（仲裁的双方当事人） |
| 申请时限 | 收到裁决书之日起 3个月内（2025年修订） |
| 管辖法院 | 仲裁机构所在地的 中级人民法院 |" _mubu_text="%3Cdiv%20class=%22table-container%22%3E%3Ctable%20class=%22auto-table%22%20border=%221%22%20cellspacing=%220%22%20style=%22border-collapse:%20collapse;%22%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%220%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3Cth%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22column-select-btn%22%20data-col=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%97%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%3C/span%3E%3C/th%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/thead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%221%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%222%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%97%B6%E9%99%90%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%20%3Cb%3E3%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E5%86%85%3C/b%3E%EF%BC%882025%E5%B9%B4%E4%BF%AE%E8%AE%A2%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class=%22row-select-btn%22%20data-row=%223%22%20title=%22%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3C/div%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%3Cb%3E%E7%AE%A1%E8%BE%96%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3Ctd%20tabindex=%220%22%20contenteditable=%22false%22%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22edit-area%22%20contenteditable=%22true%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%B0%E7%9A%84%20%3Cb%3E%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/b%3E%3C/span%3E%3C/td%3E%3C/tr%3E%3C/tbody%3E%3C/table%3E%3C/div%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 撤销的法定情形（六大情形，三大类）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%A7%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="核心原则：有限纠错。为了维护仲裁的效率与一裁终局原则，法院只审查程序与道德问题，不审查实体错误。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%80%E8%A3%81%E7%BB%88%E5%B1%80%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%AA%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8E%E9%81%93%E5%BE%B7%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="三大类情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E7%B1%BB%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 程序错误：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="（一）没有仲裁协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="（二）裁决的事项不属于仲裁协议范围或仲裁委无权仲裁。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E6%88%96%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%A7%94%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%83%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="（三）仲裁庭的组成或仲裁程序违反法定程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E6%88%96%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%BF%9D%E5%8F%8D%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="2. 证据问题：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="（四）裁决所依据的证据是伪造的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E6%89%80%E4%BE%9D%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E6%98%AF%E4%BC%AA%E9%80%A0%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="（五）对方当事人隐瞒了足以影响公正裁决的证据。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%9A%90%E7%9E%92%E4%BA%86%E8%B6%B3%E4%BB%A5%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%85%AC%E6%AD%A3%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 仲裁员不端（人品问题）：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%E4%B8%8D%E7%AB%AF%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%BA%E5%93%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="（六）仲裁员在仲裁该案时有索贿受贿、徇私舞弊、枉法裁决行为。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AD%EF%BC%89%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%AF%A5%E6%A1%88%E6%97%B6%E6%9C%89%E7%B4%A2%E8%B4%BF%E5%8F%97%E8%B4%BF%E3%80%81%E5%BE%87%E7%A7%81%E8%88%9E%E5%BC%8A%E3%80%81%E6%9E%89%E6%B3%95%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
          </outline>
          <outline text="绝对禁止的申请理由：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="认定事实错误 ×" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%C3%97%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="适用法律错误 ×" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%C3%97%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 法院的审查与处理" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E4%B8%8E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="审查组织：法院应当组成 合议庭 审查。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%94%E5%BD%93%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="辨析：此“合议庭审查”是独立的司法审查程序，不叫“普通程序”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%AD%A4%E2%80%9C%E5%90%88%E8%AE%AE%E5%BA%AD%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E2%80%9D%E6%98%AF%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AB%E2%80%9C%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="处理结果：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 无情形/不成立：裁定驳回申请。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%97%A0%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2/%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 有（四）（五）情形（伪造、隐瞒证据）：可通知仲裁庭重新仲裁，并中止撤销程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9B%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%94%EF%BC%89%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E4%BC%AA%E9%80%A0%E3%80%81%E9%9A%90%E7%9E%92%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A2%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
              <outline text="后果一：仲裁庭同意重新仲裁 → 终结撤销程序。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
              <outline text="后果二：仲裁庭拒绝重新仲裁 → 恢复撤销程序，裁定撤销。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8E%E6%9E%9C%E4%BA%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%20%E2%86%92%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            </outline>
            <outline text="3. 有其他情形或违背公共利益：裁定撤销仲裁裁决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%96%E8%BF%9D%E8%83%8C%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="4. 撤销后的救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E4.%20%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="基础原理：裁决被撤销，说明纠纷已经过实体裁决，因此原仲裁协议失效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E8%A2%AB%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="当事人的路：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%B7%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 向法院起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 重新达成仲裁协议，再申请仲裁。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="5. 程序性质辨析" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E5.%20%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E8%BE%A8%E6%9E%90%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="申请撤销仲裁裁决，是一个特殊的司法审查程序，不是“诉”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E8%AF%89%E2%80%9D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="因此，不能说它是“形成之诉”或“变更之诉”。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%B4%E5%AE%83%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E2%80%9D%E6%88%96%E2%80%9C%E5%8F%98%E6%9B%B4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AF%89%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="三、 司法对仲裁的监督（二）——不予执行仲裁裁决" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%20%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%91%E7%9D%A3%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 不予执行的法定情形" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9A%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="情形同撤销：也是那六大情形、三大类（程序错、伪/瞒证据、仲裁员不端）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E5%90%8C%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E9%82%A3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%A7%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E3%80%81%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E7%B1%BB%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%88%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E9%94%99%E3%80%81%E4%BC%AA/%E7%9E%92%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%81%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%91%98%E4%B8%8D%E7%AB%AF%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="申请主体：执行程序中的被执行人。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 不予支持的绝对情形（双重否定表肯定，必须执行）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%B9%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%8C%E9%87%8D%E5%90%A6%E5%AE%9A%E8%A1%A8%E8%82%AF%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="情形一：请求不予执行仲裁调解书，或根据和解协议制作的裁决书。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%80%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A6%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="理由：这都是当事人自己签字认可的，不能反悔。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%99%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%AD%BE%E5%AD%97%E8%AE%A4%E5%8F%AF%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%8D%E6%82%94%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="情形二：在仲裁庭首次开庭前未对仲裁协议效力提异议，事后以此为由申请不予执行的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%BA%8C%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%BA%AD%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%9C%AA%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%82%E8%AE%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8B%E5%90%8E%E4%BB%A5%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="理由：视为已承认仲裁协议效力或存在仲裁协议。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A7%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%B7%B2%E6%89%BF%E8%AE%A4%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E6%88%96%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
          <outline text="情形三：申请撤销仲裁裁决被驳回后，又在执行程序中以同一理由申请不予执行的。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E8%A2%AB%E9%A9%B3%E5%9B%9E%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%88%E5%9C%A8%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="理由：同一理由只准用一次，禁止反复。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E5%8F%AA%E5%87%86%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%EF%BC%8C%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E5%8F%8D%E5%A4%8D%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="3. 不予执行后的救济" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%95%91%E6%B5%8E%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="基础原理：裁决被不予执行，同样说明纠纷已经过实体裁决，原仲裁协议失效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E6%A0%B7%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="当事人的路：（同撤销后）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%B7%AF%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%EF%BC%88%E5%90%8C%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 向法院起诉。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E5%90%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 重新达成仲裁协议，再申请仲裁。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%90%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="四、 司法审查的报核程序" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%20%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%A5%E6%A0%B8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="1. 需要报核的裁定（“打仲裁机构的脸”时）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%8A%A5%E6%A0%B8%E7%9A%84%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%88%E2%80%9C%E6%89%93%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E7%9A%84%E8%84%B8%E2%80%9D%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="中级法院拟作出以下裁定前，必须向上级报核：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%8B%9F%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%90%91%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E6%8A%A5%E6%A0%B8%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 确认仲裁协议无效。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 撤销仲裁裁决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="3. 不予执行仲裁裁决。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E3.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="2. 报核的层级" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E6%8A%A5%E6%A0%B8%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
          <outline text="一般原则：报高级人民法院核准。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%E6%8A%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%A0%B8%E5%87%86%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          <outline text="必须报最高院核准的特殊情形：" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%8A%A5%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B8%E5%87%86%E7%9A%84%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%83%85%E5%BD%A2%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
            <outline text="1. 涉外、涉港澳台案件（影响大）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E1.%20%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E3%80%81%E6%B6%89%E6%B8%AF%E6%BE%B3%E5%8F%B0%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
            <outline text="2. 以违背社会公共利益为由撤销或不予执行的（裁量空间大，需统一尺度）。" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E2.%20%E4%BB%A5%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%20class=%22bold%22%3E%E8%BF%9D%E8%83%8C%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%3C/span%3E%3Cspan%3E%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%88%96%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%88%E8%A3%81%E9%87%8F%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%80%E5%B0%BA%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note=""/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
      <outline text="五、 纠纷解决路径核心总结（仲裁与诉讼的衔接）" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%20%E7%BA%A0%E7%BA%B7%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%89%E8%AE%BC%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%94%E6%8E%A5%EF%BC%89%3C/span%3E" _note="" _mubu_note="">
        <outline text="| 情形 | 核心区别 | 能否起诉 | 能否再仲裁 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 仲裁和解撤回申请后反悔 | 纠纷未经实体裁决，原协议有效 | 不能 | 依原仲裁协议申请 |
| 仲裁裁决被撤销 | 纠纷已经实体裁决，原协议失效 | 可以 | 需 重新达成 仲裁协议 |
